<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="PSA" style="id">- Selee Old Testament</book>
  <para style="toc3">Sin</para>
  <para style="toc2">Sinu</para>
  <para style="toc1">Sinu Kukũ</para>
  <para style="mt1">SINU</para>
  <para style="imt">ODIKI OTUO</para>
  <para style="im">Kukũ ko mmle nle Sinu ku Ɔlaa ɔpɛ kukũ di Kɔkpana Klekle kukũ kamɛ. Akũ bakpanatɛ ate ate niayɔ obe baawola sinu nwu ku sɛlaa ɔpɛ ɔta se mmle di obe kpinwu nintɔbafe ni kamɛ. Sinu ku sɛlaa ɔpɛ ɔta se mmle di Israel batii lafũ baablako ɔkpɛ di kasumu lɛma kamɛ nɛ. Nni kamaa baayɔ sĩ baakyakaa di Yaa ɔlaa akũ lɛma kamɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yaa sɛlaa se mmle lɛsɛ di akyuu kpinwu kamɛ: sewo nle katansa ku kasumu diɛta ni Yaa; ɔlaa ɔpɛ diɛta lɛkyakaako ku batii onyu ku didiki; lekoto otikiti di sikpile ɔyɔ ɔkyɛ ku sɛfa ɔpɛ di Yaa lɛyɔɔ owii suoto; ku letoko naanfi ɔkaalɛ ɔta balo. Sɛlaa ɔpɛ ɔta wɔ mmle, otii onwii mblako sĩ ɔkpɛ anta suoto ku kale kamuu. Sinu sewo ndiki otii otu kamɛ lɛkpanko nintuo, di obe wɔ di sɛbamba kafɔɔ n-yɛ siɛta ni Yaa batii bamuu abiesaa ku situ lɛma kamɛ lɛkpanko.</para>
  <para style="ip">Yesu lablako Sinu nwu ɔkpɛ. Batii ba niakpana ni Kanya Ninii Fɔle Akũ nwu lediki nle mmle beetuo. Nioso Sinu kukũ nwu ntookple kukũ ko niefũ ni kɔya di Yaa batii mblako ni kasumu ɔkpɛ diayɔ ni di kasɔ kakyekɔ.</para>
  <para style="iot">Kukũ Nwu Kamɛ Sɛlaa</para>
  <para style="io1">Bɛɛsɛ Sinu kɔlafa afosi anɔɔ nwu di akyuu ee akũ anɔɔ kanya fɛ mmle:</para>
  <para style="io2">Kukũ Kasale: Sinu: <char style="ior">1-41</char></para>
  <para style="io2">Kukũ Nyɔɔfa: Sinu: <char style="ior">42-72 </char></para>
  <para style="io2">Kukũ Tiɛfa: Sinu: <char style="ior">73-89</char></para>
  <para style="io2">Kukũ Naafa: Sinu: <char style="ior">90-106</char></para>
  <para style="io2">Kukũ Nɔɔnle: Sinu: <char style="ior">107-150</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="PSA 1" />
  <para style="ms">Kukũ Kasale</para>
  <para style="mr">Sinu 1-41</para>
  <para style="cl">Onu 1</para>
  <para style="s1">Suoto Lɛyɔɔ Nwaa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 1:1" />Suoto siyɔɔ otii wɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:1">ninankyɛ ni di bakpiletɛ kɔkà kanya</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 1:1">ee ayila ni di bakpileblatɛ osuku</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:1">ee asiɛ ni di batii bamantɛ kasiɛkɔ.<verse eid="PSA 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 1:2" />Kafɔɔ annya ni suoto lɛyɔɔ di Saate nwu kufiofa suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:2">ambu ni disi di kufiofa nɔɔ suoto kakũ ku kakyɛ.<verse eid="PSA 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 1:3" />Ate fɛle kowoso ko bɛɛsɔ ni di situkle ɔlɔɔkɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:3">kuntika ni abi di obe nikũ kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 1:3">di afata nikũ ninyɔɔ nii.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:3">Lɛsaa lele ɛɛbla, ninlɛ nintɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 1:4" />Diete nkpo dita bakpiletɛ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:4">Bate fɛle sɛsɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:4">di kɔfɛɛfɔ nfɛ kunsifiko nii.<verse eid="PSA 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 1:5" />Nioso bakpiletɛ dilɔbafuo oyila di lɛkanko nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:5">ee bakpileblatɛ basiɛ di batininitɛ dikudi kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 1:6" />Diekye Saate nwu n-ye batii tinini osuku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 1:6">kafɔɔ bakpiletɛ osuku nnwu kubayu.<verse eid="PSA 1:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="PSA 2" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 2</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔka Wɔ Di Yaa Lediki Nii</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 2:1" />Obe oso di nnle nwu kokũ kanwumbe nkpo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:1">di batii nwu kokpee asi baawo kasakasa?<verse eid="PSA 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 2:2" />Kasɔ ka mmle baka ntoololaa suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:2">kanyabayilatɛ kafɔɔ ntɔɔlɛɛ bawo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 2:2">di Saate nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:2">ku Nnwɔ Ɛɛpɛ ni Ɔfɔɔ nɔɔ suoto.<verse eid="PSA 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 2:3" />Boobuɛ alɛ, "Bita bufefee anyɛnɛ lɛma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:3">buofuki sɛkpɛnkyɛ lɛma buyu.”<verse eid="PSA 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 2:4" />Otii wɔ ninsi ni di lekpomii di osi kɔma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:4">Saate nwu kɔma ma.<verse eid="PSA 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 2:5" />Ni ansĩ ɔlaa anta ma di ɔblɔ nɔɔ kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:5">an-yɛkɛsa ma kafɔɔ di ɔblɔ yakayaka nɔɔ kamɛ alɛ,<verse eid="PSA 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 2:6" />"Ntoose Ɔka nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:6">di Sion, kabokotee nii klekle nwu suoto.”<verse eid="PSA 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 2:7" />Kamayie Saate nwu kanya ɔlaa lɛkya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 2:7">Aatɔkɔ mi alɛ, "Obisuɔtɔbi nii fale;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:7">miɛ ntookple fɔ Kote.<verse eid="PSA 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 2:8" />Kaalɛ mi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:8">ni kamayɔ nnle nwu mbla atesaa lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:8">kasɔ nwu nyɛntɛlekɔ nwu male fɔ kale.<verse eid="PSA 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 2:9" />Fabanaanfi ma ku abɔɔsaa kayofo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:9">fambibiɛ ma kɔkyɛɛkyɛɛ fɛle kɔtɛ dibukii.”<verse eid="PSA 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 2:10" />Nioso, aye baka, bibe anu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:10">bilolaa binyu, aye kasɔ nwu kanyabayilatɛ.<verse eid="PSA 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 2:11" />Bisumu Saate nwu ku lɛyɛkɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:11">biɛnya suoto lɛyɔɔ ku ditũtũkũ.<verse eid="PSA 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 2:12" />Biwakosa suoto kasɔ bita Obisuɔtɔbi nwu, se diele nkpo abanya ɔblɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:12">anwɔɔsa ye di osuku lee,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 2:12">diekye ɔblɔ nɔɔ ninklɛ kuɔwa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 2:12">Suoto siyɔɔ batii ba bamuu nintaniko nwɔ ni.<verse eid="PSA 2:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="PSA 3" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 3</para>
  <para style="s1">Olesɛ Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Diɛta Lɛkyakaako</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu. Di obe wɔ aatoso ni di obisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ Absalom Ɔkyɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 3:1" />O Saate, balo nii mpɔ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:1">Batii kpinwu lɛtaka bayɛ di suoto nii!<verse eid="PSA 3:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 3:2" />Batii kpinwu kɔkakatɛ di suoto nii alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:2">"Yaa dilɔbadiki nwɔ.” <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ</char><verse eid="PSA 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 3:3" />O Saate, kafɔɔ afɔ ninle kubidifunsaa niɛmana mi diekyi ni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:3">afɔ nietika mi dibu di suoto ni fɛɛtakatɛsa disi nii katoo nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 3:4" />Lewi lɛlɛɛ Saate nwu osie kanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:4">ni eetuna ɛɛtɛɛ di kabokotee klekle nɔɔ nwu nɛ. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ</char><verse eid="PSA 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 3:5" />Lɛklɛ lete lɛkyɔsĩi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:5">lekple lɛsɛnkɛ, diekye Saate nwu lemufũ mi akle.<verse eid="PSA 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 3:6" />Namayɛkɛ batii nkpe nkpe nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:6">niɛtaka bɛɛmana mi beekyi nii.<verse eid="PSA 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 3:7" />O Saate, taka!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:7">O Yaa nii, diki mi!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 3:7">Pɛ balo nii bamuu di atokosi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:7">faafefee bakpiletɛ nwu anyɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 3:8" />Saate nfũ di didiki nkye.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 3:8">Ta lɛyɔɔ owii lɛfɔ diwa di batii lɛfɔ suoto. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ</char><verse eid="PSA 3:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="PSA 4" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 4</para>
  <para style="s1">Kɔtɔɔfɔ Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Diɛta Ni Lɛkyakaako</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu. Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ. Basa nwu ku sikũ sanku.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 4:1" />O Yaa nii tininitɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:1">tuna fatɛɛ, nse lɛlɛɛ fɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 4:1">Tɛɛ lɛkyakaako di nimiina nii kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:1">nyɛɛ nyaami, faanu mi ɔlaa ɔpɛ.<verse eid="PSA 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 4:2" />O batii, ɔmɛmbe bibakpee dibu nii sinunsɔ minaase?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:2">Ɔmɛmbe bibabɔmbɔ sɛlaakuu, mintikanko sɛlaa ku afunu kafɔɔ minaase? <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ</char><verse eid="PSA 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 4:3" />Kafɔɔ bitofo bilɛ Saate nwu lediki Yaa batii ɛɛta suoto nɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:3">Saate nwu kamanu, nse lɛlɛɛ nwɔ.<verse eid="PSA 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 4:4" />Di ɔblɔ lee ɔnya kamɛ, bitambla okpile;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:4">nse bite di atensaa lee suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:4">bibuo di situ lee kamɛ bielo kanana. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ</char><verse eid="PSA 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 4:5" />Bita oleɔta wɔ niesiɛko ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:5">bietika disi kafɔɔ di Saate nwu suoto.<verse eid="PSA 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 4:6" />Batii kpinwu kɔkaalɛ alɛ, "Owe nimafuo wo dibiene lewo otuo?"</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:6">O Saate, ta lɛkpa nwu di anu lɛfɔ dikpa dikpete wo.<verse eid="PSA 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 4:7" />Afɔ niɛyɔ suoto lɛyɔɔ kplɛ feekpee di otu nii kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:7">dilenke obe wɔ di atitabi ku nta fɔle lɛma lapɔ nii.<verse eid="PSA 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 4:8" />Atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ kamaklɛnte nkyɔsĩi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:8">O Saate, diekye lete lɛfɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 4:8">nintɛɛ nsiɛ di kanyu nwaa kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 4:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="PSA 5" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 5</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Diɛta Ni Kanyu</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu. Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ. Bayɔ kakyukyoe bafɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 5:1" />O Saate, kyɔɔ sɛlaa nii kotoko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:1">nu atunni nii.<verse eid="PSA 5:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 5:2" />Ɔka nii ku Yaa nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:2">nu kaku nii faakyakaakoe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:2">diekye afɔ kɔpɛ ɔlaa nta.<verse eid="PSA 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 5:3" />O Saate, fannu mi sɛlɔ ku olesɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:3">olesɛ nin-yɔ sɛlaa nii ntɛ fɔ di anu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:3">nsiɛ kafɔɔ ntoonyu fɔ osuku.<verse eid="PSA 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 5:4" />Faale Yaa wɔ nintuna ni di okpile suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:4">bakpiletɛ dilɔbafuo osiɛ di ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 5:5" />Batii ba ninkanta ni dilɔbafuo oyila di anu lɛfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:5">feekyidi batii ba bamuu nimbla ni asaa kpile.<verse eid="PSA 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 5:6" />Fanwɔɔsa batii ba ninlaa nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:6">Saate lekyidi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:6">batii ba nin-wii ni ntɔ ku balaatɛ.<verse eid="PSA 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 5:7" />Kafɔɔ ami, di sibualɛ lɛpɔ lɛfɔ oso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:7">kamawa leyo lɛfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:7">di dibu kamɛ mawakasɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:7">nkyɔɔ anu Olekatakɔ klekle lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 5:8" />O Saate, kpaa mi di ɔsaabla tinini lɛfɔ nwu kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:8">ta balo nii oso-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:8">bla osuku lɛfɔ kuoyila di anu nii.<verse eid="PSA 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 5:9" />Nwaako ɔlaa diesi ma kaanya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:9">kawɔɔsa leyii situ lɛma kamɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:9">Owolonwo lɛma nle ɔkya wɔ nietikiti nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:9">bɔɔkyɔnkyɔ batii ku ɔkplalomii lɛma.<verse eid="PSA 5:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 5:10" />O Yaa, lo ma lɛpɔɔ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:10">Ta asibu lɛma nwu awa di mma bamu suoto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:10">Diɛ ma nnɛɛ ta sikpile lɛma kpinwu oso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:10">diekye bɛɛtaka beeyila fɔ di suoto.<verse eid="PSA 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 5:11" />Kafɔɔ ta batii ba bamuu niɛtaniko fɔ ni banya suoto lɛyɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:11">ta ma basa lɛpɔ sinu obe lele.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 5:11">Yɔ kanyu lɛfɔ nwu fafukuti fatĩi ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:11">alɛ mba nimbɔmbɔ fɔ ni leyooto kanya suoto lɛyɔɔ kaamɛ lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 5:12" />O Saate, diekye nwaako, fan-wii batininitɛ lɛyɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 5:12">fankpee sibualɛ kɔba fankyisa ma fɛ kubidifunsaa.<verse eid="PSA 5:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="PSA 6" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 6</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Diɛta Ni Lɛkyakaa Di Dibuo Obe Kamɛ</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu. Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ. Basa nwu ku sikũ sanku. Basa nwu di <char style="tl">seminit</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dite fɛle onu lɛsambi lewo dile</char></note> sɛlɔ kanya.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 6:1" />O Saate, tansĩ ɔlaa faatɛɛ di ɔblɔ lɛfɔ ɔnya kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:1">ee fananfi mi kootoko di ɔblɔ lɛblɔfiɛ lɛfɔ yakayaka kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 6:2" />Saate, nyɛɛ nyaami, diekye nte kpiɛkpiɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:2">O Saate, kya mi ɔfiɛ, diekye akufi nii konu dibuo.<verse eid="PSA 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 6:3" />Ɔkla nii nsi di dibuo kamɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:3">Ɔmɛmbe, O Saate, ɔmɛmbe?<verse eid="PSA 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 6:4" />O Saate, munikĩi faadiki mi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:4">fũ mi nkpa, ta lɛbɔmbɔ lɛfɔ le ninaa ni kaloo oso.<verse eid="PSA 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 6:5" />Otii kuonwii ninyuma fɔ nse atookpi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:5">Owe nintansa fɔ di ɔkya kamɛ?<verse eid="PSA 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 6:6" />Ditoobuo mi ku atunni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:6">kakyɛ kamuu atensaa nii mbuu ku kaku</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:6">mbuusa katenkɔ nii kafɔɔ ku nnumɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 6:7" />Sɛnyaami ntɔɔta anu nii ntɔɔbla tutufuu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:7">oloosintɛ anya nwaa ta bakyiditɛ nii bamuu oso.<verse eid="PSA 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 6:8" />Aye ba bamuu nimbla ni sikpile, bikyɛ mi di ɔlɔɔkɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:8">diekye Saate nwu ntoonu mi kaku.<verse eid="PSA 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 6:9" />Saate nwu ntoonu kaku nii owi kɛɛta ni nyaami ɔnya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:9">Saate nwu nfũ ɔlaa ɔpɛ ɔta nii.<verse eid="PSA 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 6:10" />Sinunsɔ kamakpɛ balo nii bamuu ku nnɛɛ lefee;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 6:10">babapɛ mankple kpata ku sinunsɔ.<verse eid="PSA 6:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="PSA 7" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 7</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Diɛta Ni Lɛka Tinini</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid <char style="tl">sigaion</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dite fɛle onu lɛsambi lewo dile</char></note>. Aasa nwu aata Saate nwu ta Kus, Benyamin otii nwu oso.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 7:1" />O Saate, Yaa nii, afɔ lɛtaniko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:1">fũ mi, faadiki mi kafɔɔ fakyeko batikankotɛ nii bamuu nnɛɛ,<verse eid="PSA 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 7:2" />nse diele nkpo bababɛbɛɛ mi fɛle kyata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:2">mambibiɛ mi kɔkyɛɛkɔkyɛɛ di kuonwii nnaa abafũ mi nii.<verse eid="PSA 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 7:3" />O Saate, Yaa nii, nse lɛbla nle mmle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:3">di okpile owo nsi di nnɛɛ nii-<verse eid="PSA 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 7:4" />nse lɛbla okpile di munko nnwɔ ninsi ni ku atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:4">ee leyu kyiditɛ nii lɛsaa ninaankaatɛ ni yi-<verse eid="PSA 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 7:5" />ni ta lo nii nwu atikankoe aamufũ mi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:5">tɔɔ ananafu mi akaasa kaasɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:5">aatɛɛ nte di kudu kamɛ. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ</char><verse eid="PSA 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 7:6" />O Saate, taka di ɔblɔ lɛfɔ kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:6">taka di balo nii ɔblɔ yakayaka suoto.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:6">Yaa nii, sɛnkɛ; faaka lɛka.<verse eid="PSA 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 7:7" />Ta batii dikudi nwu bamana fɔ bakyi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:7">Le sɛka di suoto lɛma diekye ni osi;<verse eid="PSA 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 7:8" />ta Saate akanko batii nwu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:8">O Saate, kanko mi di ɔsaabla tinini nii kanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:8">di mmle ninambla ni okpile kanya, O Afɔ wɔ Ninlenke ni.<verse eid="PSA 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 7:9" />O Yaa, tininitɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:9">wɔ ninnyu ni asibu ku situ kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 7:9">ta bakpiletɛ kudu okpee nwu kuloo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:9">faata batininitɛ kafɔɔ bawɛ kunutoko.<verse eid="PSA 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 7:10" />Kubidifunsaa nii ninle Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:10">nnwɔ ninfũ ni mba situ niɛkpa ni.<verse eid="PSA 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 7:11" />Yaa nle kantɛ tininitɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:11">Yaa wɔ nindiki ni ɔblɔ yakayaka nɔɔ antuo ni dii biala.<verse eid="PSA 7:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 7:12" />Nse otii owo diekyisa nkpa nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:12">Yaa kamalɔɔfɔ kapamii nɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:12">ambonsa kɔtaa nɔɔ anlolaa anklee.<verse eid="PSA 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 7:13" />Atoololaa difu akpɛsaa nɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:13">eelolaa ɔtɔ kɔtaa nɔɔ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 7:14" />Otii wɔ ninlaka ni sikpile lɛmɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:14">alaka ni kafɔɔ kubuɛ lɛmɛ nlofo sɛlaa ku afunu.<verse eid="PSA 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 7:15" />Otii wɔ niekutu ni dibiɔ, eetĩi nini</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:15">nkpa ambuo di dibiɔ le eekutu nii.<verse eid="PSA 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 7:16" />Kubuɛ ko eekpee ni nkple kunwa nnwɔɔ omu nɔɔ suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:16">kudu nɔɔ nwu nkple kumatika di nnwɔɔ omu nɔɔ nsintɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 7:17" />Kamapɛ Saate nwu sɛfa ta ɔsaabla tinini nɔɔ oso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 7:17">masa kafɔɔ onu ntansa Saate wɔ Ninlenke ni leyooto.<verse eid="PSA 7:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="PSA 8" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 8</para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa Lɛkpa Ku Otii Kayilakɔ</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu. Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ. Asa nwu di <char style="tl">gitit.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dite fɛle onu lɛsambi lewo dile</char></note> sɛlɔ kanya.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 8:1" />O Saate, Saate loo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:1">lɛ di leyooto lɛfɔ lemuɔ di kasɔ kamuu suoto nkpo!</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 8:1" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 8:1">Fɛɛtɛ lɛkpa lɛfɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:1">diɛtaka katoo dilenke osi.<verse eid="PSA 8:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 8:2" />Babisɔ ku babifɔɔle anyasibi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:2">fɛɛta katansa kodie,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 8:2">ta balo lɛfɔ oso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:2">alɛ faamaasa kyiditɛ nwu ku totatɛ kanya.<verse eid="PSA 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 8:3" />Nse lenyu osi lɛfɔ nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:3">anɛɛbi lɛfɔ ɔkpɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 8:3">kɔwɛntɛ ku awɛntrɛbi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:3">ya fɛɛyɔ feetika ni di abaninya,<verse eid="PSA 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 8:4" />obe ninle otii alɛ foobu nwɔ disi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:4">otii obisuɔtɔbi nwu foonyu nwɔ disi nkpo?<verse eid="PSA 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 8:5" />Fɛɛbla nwɔ ɛɛwakasɔ kɛɛkɛ alenke Yaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:5">ni fɛɛyɔ lɛkpa ku dibu kafɔɔ feetũkunsa nwɔ fɛ lɛkakoto nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 8:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 8:6" />Fɛɛbla nwɔ tunletɛ di nnɛɛ lɛfɔ sɛkpɛ kanya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:6">fɛɛyɔ lɛsaa biala feekpee di nkpaa nɔɔ kalɔ:<verse eid="PSA 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 8:7" />bafoso ku banankyue bamuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:7">ku lepoo kamɛ babɔkɛɛ,<verse eid="PSA 8:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 8:8" />bakansiɛ kɔɔfɛɛfɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:8">ku kɔkpaku di lekpo kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:8">ku asaa ya amuu ninfia ni ntu di lekpo kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 8:9" />O Saate, Saate loo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 8:9">lɛ di leyooto lɛfɔ lemuɔ di kasɔ kamuu suoto nkpo!<verse eid="PSA 8:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="PSA 9" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 9</para>
  <para style="s1">Sɛfa Ɔpɛ Ɔta Yaa Di Lɛka Tinini Nɔɔ Suoto</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu. Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ. Basa nwu di "Obisuɔtɔbi nwu Kukpi" sɛlɔ kanya.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 9:1" />O Saate, kamatansa fɔ, ku otu nii omuu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:1">kamabuɛ sɛkpɛ lɛfɔ se simuu niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ.<verse eid="PSA 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 9:2" />Kamanya suoto lɛyɔɔ mpɔ di kamɛ lɛfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:2">O Afɔ wɔ Ninlenke ni; kamanya suoto lɛyɔɔ mpɔ di kamɛ lɛfɔ, kamasa sinu ntansa fɔ leyooto.<verse eid="PSA 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 9:3" />Balo nii lakple nkpaamaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:3">baanɔɔ ni baawɔɔ di anu lɛfɔ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 9:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 9:4" />Diekye fatoodiki ɔsaabla biene nii ku lɛkyɛ nii feetuo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:4">fatoosiɛ di lɛkakpomii lɛfɔ fɔɔka lɛka tinini.<verse eid="PSA 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 9:5" />Fatoosĩ ɔlaa fɛɛta nnle nwu, fɛɛwɔɔsa bakpiletɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:5">fatɔɔyɛɛsa ayooto lɛma dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="PSA 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 9:6" />Kawɔɔ ka ninaa ni kase ntɔɔwa di balo nwu suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:6">fatoobiɛ sekpoo lɛma nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:6">bia diidii blɔbasinyuma ma.<verse eid="PSA 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 9:7" />Saate nwu kole sɛka dinaa ni kaloo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:7">atoose lɛkakpomii nɔɔ ɛɛta lɛkanko.<verse eid="PSA 9:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 9:8" />Abakanko kayi di ɔsaabla tinini kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:8">abaklee batii nwu ku lɛka tinini.<verse eid="PSA 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 9:9" />Saate nwu ninle katanikokɔ ɛɛta batii ba beenyinka ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:9">kamaa kakpɛkɔ siene di dibuo obe kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 9:10" />Batii ba nin-ye ni leyooto lɛfɔ matika fɔ disi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:10">diekye afɔ, Saate, diidii fadiyee batii ba ninwolaa fɔ nii.<verse eid="PSA 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 9:11" />Bisa katansa sinu bita Saate nwu ninsi ni di Sion,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:11">bibuɛ asaa ya ɛɛbla ni di nnle kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 9:12" />Diekye otii wɔ nin-wii ni ntɔ ankyisa ni nnyuma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:12">an-yee kafɔɔ mba diobuo ni kaku.<verse eid="PSA 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 9:13" />O Saate, nyu mmle di balo nii ntikanko mi ni!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:13">Nyɛɛ nyaami, faatakatɛsa mi fakyeko kukpi n-yoko,<verse eid="PSA 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 9:14" />alɛ kabuɛ katansa lɛfɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:14">di Sion Obisankobi n-yoko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:14">nfa kafɔɔ kamanya suoto lɛyɔɔ di didiki lɛfɔ kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 9:15" />Nnle nwu ntɔɔkpa beebuo di dibiɔ le beekutu bɛɛtɛ ni kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:15">asawu ya bɛɛkyɔɔ ni di lewofa kamɛ ntoomufũ nkpaa lɛma.<verse eid="PSA 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 9:16" />Baye Saate nwu di lɛka nɔɔ tinini kanya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:16">batii kpile nnɛɛ lɛma ɔkpɛ ntɔɔbla dikyĩ di mma bamu suoto. <char style="qs">Higgaion.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ee</char><char style="fqa" closed="false">Disi obu; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dite fɛle onu lɛsambi lewo dile</char></note><char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ</char><verse eid="PSA 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 9:17" />Batii kpile kamakple mansifi ɔkya kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:17">nnle be mmuu nieyee ni Yaa.<verse eid="PSA 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 9:18" />Kafɔɔ diele obe lele babayee bapiitɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:18">ee mba diobuo ni osuku onyu dilɔbayu diidii.<verse eid="PSA 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 9:19" />O Saate, taka, tanta kuonwii lalenkee.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:19">ta bakanko nnle nwu di anu lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 9:20" />O Saate, kpee ma difu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 9:20">ta nnle batofo alɛ batii ko bale. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ</char><verse eid="PSA 9:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="PSA 10" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 10</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Diɛta Ni Lɛka Tinini</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 10:1" />O Saate, obe oso fayɛ kaakyonkɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:1">Obe oso feewofasa suoto di ɔlaa otũ obe kamɛ?<verse eid="PSA 10:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 10:2" />Otii kpile ntikanko batii ba ninaa ni osie ku suoto katoo ɔtakatɛsa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:2">mma bamu sikũ se bɛɛkyɔɔ ni di lewofa kamɛ simufũ ma.<verse eid="PSA 10:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 10:3" />Diekye otii kpile nkanta di nle ɛɛtɛ ni di otu nɔɔ kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:3">antansa sepokyoa baletɛ, ankyidi kafɔɔ Saate nwu.<verse eid="PSA 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 10:4" />Otii kpile nwu nkanta, ansinwolaa nwɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:4">disibu nɔɔ nimuu ninle alɛ, Yaa nnaa.<verse eid="PSA 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 10:5" />Sɛsaabla nɔɔ nlɛ ɔkyɛ sintɔɔ obe lele;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:5">ɛɛtakatɛ suoto katoo, afiofa lɛfɔ kafɔɔ lekyo di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:5">annyu balo nɔɔ bamuu nyakatãa.<verse eid="PSA 10:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 10:6" />Ambuɛ antɔkɔ suoto alɛ, "Lɛsalɛsaa dilaafuo mi otũkunsa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:6">manya suoto lɛyɔɔ obe lele, diidii kafɔɔ namawɛ ɔlaa.”<verse eid="PSA 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 10:7" />Lɛkpaani ku sɛlaa ku afunu ku afunaa leyii nwɔ kanya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:7">kubuɛ ku sikpile nsi di ɔkplalomii nɔɔ kalɔ.<verse eid="PSA 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 10:8" />Ammaa ansiɛ di nkpayotũ ɔlɔɔkɔ ansoko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:8">antɛ kala anlo batii ba ninambla ni okpile kuonwii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:8">antoonyunyu batii ba abakpɛ ni di lewofa kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 10:9" />Ammaa ante ansoko fɛle kyata;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:9">ante ansoko alɛ oomufũ mba ninaa ni lɛkyakaako;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:9">amufũ mba ninaa ni lɛkyakaako anwududusa ma anaakpee di okũ nɔɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 10:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 10:10" />Ambibiɛ batii ba ɛɛkpɛko nii, manloo ɔnyɛɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:10">an-yɔ osie nɔɔ anyinka ma antɛ kaasɔ.<verse eid="PSA 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 10:11" />Ambuɛ antɔkɔ suoto alɛ, "Yaa ntooyee;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:11">antĩi anu nɔɔ, annya kafɔɔ diidii.”<verse eid="PSA 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 10:12" />Saate, taka! O Yaa takatɛ kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ katoo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:12">Tan-yee mba ninaa ni lɛkyakaako.<verse eid="PSA 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 10:13" />Lɛ oso di otii kpile nsĩ Yaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:13">Lɛ oso ambuɛ antɔkɔ suoto alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:13">"Ɔlɔbalɛɛ mi lɛka"?<verse eid="PSA 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 10:14" />O Yaa, kafɔɔ afɔ, fɔɔnya mba bookpee ni kubuɛ beebuo ni sɛnyaami;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:14">foonyu falɛ fookpee nwu nnɛɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 10:14">Mba boonyika ni lɛyɔ suoto lɛma beekpee fɔ ninnɛɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:14">afɔ ninle bakuɛbi kyakaakotɛ.<verse eid="PSA 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 10:15" />Fee kpiletɛ ku kpileblatɛ nwu nnɛɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:15">wolaa sikpile se ɔɔbla ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:15">dilaase di obe wɔ abadiɛ ni simuu ɔbla.<verse eid="PSA 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 10:16" />Saate nwu ninle Ɔka dinaa ni kaloo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:16">nnle kamawɔɔ di kasɔ nɔɔ suoto.<verse eid="PSA 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 10:17" />O Saate, nu, batii ba bɛɛwakosa ni kasɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:17">nu kaku lɛma, faakpee ma osie,<verse eid="PSA 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 10:18" />kpɛ fata bakuɛbi ku batii ba bɔɔtafaa ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 10:18">alɛ otii kuonwii di kasɔ ka mmle suoto dilasinle ni lɛyɛkɛ diidii.<verse eid="PSA 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="PSA 11" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 11</para>
  <para style="s1">Anu Otika Di Saate Nwu Suoto</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu. Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 11:1" />Saate nwu kamɛ lɛtaniko.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:1">Lɛ nfɛ fabatɔkɔ mi falɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:1">"Flɛlɛtɛ fɛle kansiɛ fasifi kobokote lɛfɔ osi.<verse eid="PSA 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 11:2" />Diekye nyu, batii kpile nwu lɛnaanfi ataa lɛma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:2">bɛɛyɔ akplɔ lɛma beetika di sikũ suoto</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 11:2">di ditunu kamɛ alɛ bɔɔtaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:2">batii ba di situ lɛma kamɛ lɛkpa ni.<verse eid="PSA 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 11:3" />Nse bɛɛlalaasa asɔse nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:3">obe di batininitɛ mafuo ɔbla?"<verse eid="PSA 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 11:4" />Saate nwu nsi di olekatakɔ nɔɔ klekle kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:4">Saate nwu nsi di osi lɛkakpomii nɔɔ suoto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 11:4">Onyu batii babisuɔtɔbi nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:4">anu nɔɔ kololaa ma aanyu.<verse eid="PSA 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 11:5" />Saate nwu nsɔ batii tinini aanyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:5">kafɔɔ batii kpile ku mba nimbɔmbɔ ni amumu ɔbla mma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:5">ɔkla nɔɔ lekyidi ma.<verse eid="PSA 11:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 11:6" />Abata atɔkɔnii bembe ku afuɔ kpankpa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:6">nnɔɔ fɛle kanto ankpete di batii kpile suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:6">kɔfɛɛfɔ filale ni male opũ lɛma.<verse eid="PSA 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 11:7" />Diekye Saate nwu mbla asaa tinini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:7">ambɔmbɔ lɛka tinini;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 11:7">batii ba ninte ni tinini kamanya anu nɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 11:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="PSA 12" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 12</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Diɛta Ni Lɛkyakaako</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu. Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ. Basa nwu di <char style="tl">seminit</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dite fɛle onu lɛsambi lewo dile</char></note> sɛlɔ kanya.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 12:1" />Saate, kyakaako, diekye Yaa batii nsinnaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:1">onukwale batii ntɔɔyɛ di batii kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 12:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 12:2" />Otii biala nfɛ kɔlaa antɔkɔ owo nɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:2">ɔnyamɛnɛfɛ lɛma lɛbla kakyɔnkyɔ.<verse eid="PSA 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 12:3" />Saate nwu awɔɔsa banyamɛnɛfɛtɛ bamuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:3">ku ɔkplalomii biala ninkanta ni<verse eid="PSA 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 12:4" />kumbuɛ ni alɛ, "Sɛkplalomii loo bubayɔ munlenkee;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:4">awo nimba anyasibi loo- owe ninle saate loo?"<verse eid="PSA 12:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 12:5" />Saate alɛ "Ta mmle boomiina ni mba ninaa ni kanya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:5">ku bapiitɛ atũnni oso yi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 12:5">nfɛ kamataka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:5">ninfũ ma nkpa di mba nikɔbla ma ni amumu nnɛɛ.”<verse eid="PSA 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 12:6" />Saate nwu sɛlaa se eebuɛ ɛɛtɛ ni diele sɛlaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:6">site fɛle koto futuutu bɛɛnyinakĩisa ni di ɔtɔ kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:6">beefoto kũ ni sikuɛnsĩ simu.<verse eid="PSA 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 12:7" />O Saate, afɔ nimafũ wo nkpa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:7">faadiki wo di batii nwu nkpo okle nnɛɛ dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="PSA 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 12:8" />Batii kpile kokyi kakɔ biala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 12:8">di obe wɔ di sikpile kɔtaka ni katoo di batii kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 12:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="PSA 13" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 13</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Diɛta Ni Lɛkyakaako</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu. Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 13:1" />O Saate ɔmɛmbe? Fabayee mi dinaa ni kaloo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:1">Fabawofasa anu lɛfɔ di suoto nii faanase di ɔmɛmbe kamɛ?<verse eid="PSA 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 13:2" />Ɔmɛmbe kamabu disi nnaase?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:2">Di dii biala kowi ni sɛnyaami di otu nii kamɛ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:2">Ɔmɛmbe di lo nii kamanwɔtɔ mi anse?<verse eid="PSA 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 13:3" />O Saate, Yaa nii, nyu mi faatuna fatɛɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:3">Ta anu nii akpa, se diele nkpo kamate di kukpi kamɛ;<verse eid="PSA 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 13:4" />lo nii kamabuɛ alɛ, "Ntoolenkee nwɔ,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:4">bakyiditɛ nii kafɔɔ kamapɔ nse lɛpɛ kaasɔ.<verse eid="PSA 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 13:5" />Kafɔɔ ami, letika disi di lɛbɔmbɔ lɛfɔ le ninaa ni kaloo suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:5">otu nii nnya suoto lɛyɔɔ di didiki lɛfɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 13:6" />Kamasa onu nta Saate nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 13:6">diekye ɛɛbla abiene ɛɛtɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 13:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="PSA 14" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 14</para>
  <para style="s1">Batii Amumu Ɔbla</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu. Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ.</para>
  <para style="r">(Ps 53)</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 14:1" />Batii ba di asi nnaa ni mbuɛ di otu lɛma kamɛ alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:1">"Yaa kuonwii nnaa.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 14:1">Batɔɔlalaa, ablasaa lɛma nle ayududusaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:1">kuonwii lɛma nnaa ambla ni dibiene.<verse eid="PSA 14:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 14:2" />Saate nwu nkpe di osi ɔɔnya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:2">batii babisuɔtɔbi nwu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 14:2">alɛ oonyu nse otii owo konu kasɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:2">owo oowolaa ni Yaa.<verse eid="PSA 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 14:3" />Bamuu ntooyu osuku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:3">bamuu lɛma batɔɔlalaa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 14:3">kuonwii nnaa ɔɔbla ni dibiene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:3">bia onwii pɛ nnaa.<verse eid="PSA 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 14:4" />Ni bakpileblatɛ dilaatekete lɛsaa diidii-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:4">mba ninwee ni batii nii fɛ mmle di batii nle ni bloblo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:4">manansumu ni kafɔɔ Saate nwu?<verse eid="PSA 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 14:5" />Nfa di difu kplɛ kamapɛ ma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:5">diekye Yaa nsiko ana ya nimbla ni asaa tinini.<verse eid="PSA 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 14:6" />Aye bakpileblatɛ biɔkpɔkpɔtɔsa bapiitɛ sisuku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:6">kafɔɔ katanikokɔ lɛma ninle Saate nwu nfũ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 14:7" />O, didiki nwu ninle ni Israel lele kamakye Sion ninwa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:7">Nse Saate nwu lekplesa batii nɔɔ kayilakɔ ɛɛta yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 14:7">ni Yakob kamapɔ, Israel kafɔɔ kamanya suoto lɛyɔɔ!<verse eid="PSA 14:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="PSA 15" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 15</para>
  <para style="s1">Lɛsaa Le Di Yaa Kobie Nii</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 15:1" />Saate, owe nimasiɛ di olekatakɔ lɛfɔ kamɛ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:1">Owe nimasiɛ di kabokotee lɛfɔ klekle nwu?<verse eid="PSA 15:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 15:2" />Otii wɔ di ole kuonwii nnaa ni di lɛkyɛmbi nɔɔ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:2">ambla ni kafɔɔ asaa tinini,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 15:2">nnwɔ nimbuɛ ni onukwale ankyeko ni otu nɔɔ kamɛ<verse eid="PSA 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 15:3" />anan-yɔ ɔkplalomii nɔɔ kafɔɔ alalaasa ni batii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:3">ammbla kafɔɔ owo nɔɔ okpile</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 15:3">ankpee kafɔɔ otii wo nɔɔ sinunsɔ,<verse eid="PSA 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 15:4" />otii wɔ ninkyidi ni kpiletɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:4">kafɔɔ ambu ni batii ba ninyɛkɛ ni Saate nwu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 15:4">ambla ni di ntam nɔɔ kanya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:4">kuntɛ ninwɛ nwɔ osie,<verse eid="PSA 15:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 15:5" />otii wɔ ninfɛnsa ni koto ananfũ lɛsaa aatikasa ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:5">ananfũ ni ditunu kamɛ lɛsaa, aayɔ lɛbɛ aata ni lɛpɔɔkpitɛ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 15:5" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 15:5">Otii wɔ nimbla ni asaa ya mmle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 15:5">dilɔbatũkũ diidii.<verse eid="PSA 15:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="PSA 16" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 16</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Di Anu Otika Di Yaa Suoto</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid <char style="tl">miktam</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dite fɛle onu lɛsambi lewo dile</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 16:1" />Oo Yaa, lolaa mi fatĩtĩi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 16:1">diekye afɔ lɛtaniko.<verse eid="PSA 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 16:2" />Latɔkɔ Saate nwu nlɛ, "Saate nii ninle afɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:2">afɔ kamaa, lɛsaa biene kuninwii nsinnaa mi.”<verse eid="PSA 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 16:3" />Baklekletɛ ba ninkpe ni di kasɔ nwu suoto yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:3">bale dibu bale ba kamɛ di suoto lɛyɔɔ nii nimuu nsi ni.<verse eid="PSA 16:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 16:4" />Batii ba nintikanko ni bayaa bamba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:4">dibuo mataka katoo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 16:4">nɔmakpete oleɔta ntɔ lɛma nwu kaasɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:4">ee mbɛ kanya nlɛɛ ayooto lɛma.<verse eid="PSA 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 16:5" />Saate, afɔ ninle mi kalekɔ ku opũ nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:5">afɔ ninkle mi nkpa.<verse eid="PSA 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 16:6" />Amɛ nwu lefe di lɛba nwaa ɛɛtɛɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:6">nwaako atesaa nwu lebuo mi anu.<verse eid="PSA 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 16:7" />Kamatansa Saate nwu, nnwɔ ninkakatɛ antɛɛ nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:7">bia kakyɛ, otu nii ntuo mi asaa.<verse eid="PSA 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 16:8" />Lɛyɔ Saate nwu lese di anu nii obe lele.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:8">Ta akpe mi ni di oletanɛɛkyɛ oso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:8">nɔmatũkũ.<verse eid="PSA 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 16:9" />Nioso otu nii kɔnya suoto lɛyɔɔ, ɔkplalomii nii kafɔɔ kɔpɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:9">suoto nii kafɔɔ nsi di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ,<verse eid="PSA 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 16:10" />diekye flɔbadiɛ mi di ɔkya kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:10">ee fata Klekletɛ lɛfɔ nwu anya kawɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 16:11" />Fatɔɔtɛɛ letofo nkpa osuku nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:11">fabata suoto lɛyɔɔ n-yii mi kamɛ di anu lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 16:11">ku lɛpɔ le ninaa ni kaloo di oletanɛɛkyɛ lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 16:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="PSA 17" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 17</para>
  <para style="s1">Otii Wɔ Ninan-ye Nwu Ni Ole Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 17:1" />O Saate, nu lekoto otikiti tinini nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:1">nu kaku nii owi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:1">Kyɔɔ ɔlaa ɔpɛ nii kotoko-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:1">diele sɛlaa ku afunu anyasibi kuokye.<verse eid="PSA 17:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 17:2" />Ta ɔlaa nii obudisa kukye ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:2">ta anu lɛfɔ anya lɛsaa le ninlɛ ni.<verse eid="PSA 17:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 17:3" />Kuntɛ feewolaa otu nii kamɛ, feenyunyu mi kamɛ kafɔɔ ku kakyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:3">kuntɛ fɛɛsɔ mi feenyu yi, flɔbanya lɛsalɛsaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:3">lebuɛ letika difuɔ nlɛ kanya nii dilɔbabla okpile.<verse eid="PSA 17:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 17:4" />Di batii sɛsaabla kanya yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:4">di anyasibi lɛfɔ ɔlaa kanya yi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:4">lɛblasa suoto nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:4">di amumubablatɛ sisuku.<verse eid="PSA 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 17:5" />Nkpaa nii didiki lɛmufũ sisuku lɛfɔ sikle kpinkpĩ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:5">nkpaa ni diɛfɛntɛ.<verse eid="PSA 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 17:6" />O Yaa, kɔlɛɛ fɔ, diekye fabatuna fantɛɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:6">kyɔɔ ɔlaa nii kotoko faanu ɔlaa ɔpɛ nii.<verse eid="PSA 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 17:7" />Diki lɛbɔmbɔ lɛfɔ kplɛ le niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ fatuo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:7">afɔ wɔ nin-yɔ ni koletanɛɛ lɛfɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:7">fanfũ ni batii ba niɛtaniko fɔ ni di balo lɛma nnɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 17:8" />Titĩi mi fɛ kunyunta di ninu lɛfɔ kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:8">wofasa mi di afoko lɛfɔ kunyii kamɛ<verse eid="PSA 17:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 17:9" />diɛ batii kpile ba nikodieko mi ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:9">diɛ balo yakayaka nii ba niɛmana mi beekyi ni nnɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 17:10" />Man-nya nyaami di situ lɛma kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:10">nnya lɛma kafɔɔ mbuɛ sɛkantalaa.<verse eid="PSA 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 17:11" />Batootikanko nnafukpaa nii, nunua batɔɔmana mi beekyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:11">anu lɛma ntika di suoto nii, alɛ bɔɔpɛ mi kaasɔ.<verse eid="PSA 17:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 17:12" />Bate fɛle kyata wɔ di kɔka nkle ni ate ni kalà,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:12">fɛle kyata kplɛ wɔ nikɔnaayu ni di lewofa kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 17:13" />O Saate, taka, dieko ma, faatɛ ma kaasɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:13">fũ mi di batii kpile nnɛɛ ku kapamii lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 17:14" />O Saate, yɔ kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ fadiki mi di batii ba mmle nnɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:14">di batii ba nintɔɔwɛ ni lele ma di nkpa kaayi ka mmle.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 17:14" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 17:14">Ta nfutu lɛma diyii ku asaa ya fesiisa fɛɛtɛ ma ni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:14">ta babisuɔtɔbi lɛma bawɛ asaa balenkeesa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:14">baabu asaa batɛ babi lɛma.<verse eid="PSA 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 17:15" />Kafɔɔ ami- kamanya fɔ anu di ɔsaabla tinini kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 17:15">nse lɛsɛnkɛ, manya letembi lɛfɔ nwu suoto n-yɔɔ mi.<verse eid="PSA 17:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="PSA 18" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 18</para>
  <para style="s1">Dawid Lelenkee Onu</para>
  <para style="d">Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ. Saate kpɛmblatɛ Dawid. Aasa onu nwu sɛlaa aata Saate nwu di obe wɔ di Saate ladiki nwɔ ni di balo lo nɔɔ bamuu ku Saul nnɛɛ. Aabuɛ alɛ:</para>
  <para style="r">(2 Sam 22.1–51)</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 18:1" />O Saate, osie nii, mbɔmbɔ fɔ.<verse eid="PSA 18:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 18:2" />Saate nwu ninle mi difuɔnkpaa, kɔba nii ku dikitɛ nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:2">Yaa nii ninle mi difuɔnkpaa, nnwɔɔ nintaniko nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:2">Nnwɔɔ ninle mi kubidifunsaa ku didiki nii lɛkya ku sientɛ nii.<verse eid="PSA 18:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 18:3" />Lɛlɛɛ Saate nwu, nnwɔ di katansa lesiɛko nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:3">ni eediki mi di balo nii nnɛɛ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 18:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 18:4" />Kukpi sikũ lemimini mi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:4">ntu siene ninlalasa ni asaa lekpee mi difu.<verse eid="PSA 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 18:5" />Ɔkya sikũ lemimini mi siekyi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:5">kukpi sikũ lediekoe.<verse eid="PSA 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 18:6" />Di nimiina nii kamɛ lalɛɛ Saate nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:6">lawi lalɛɛ Yaa nlɛ akyakaakoe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:6">Aanu mi sɛlɔ di olekatakɔ nɔɔ kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:6">lɛfaa nii lakyɛ ɔkyɛ nɔɔ, diabuo di atoko nɔɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 18:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 18:7" />Kasɔ lakpanko suoto, kaatũkũ kafɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:7">abokote nyilakɔ kafɔɔ latũkũ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:7">aakpanko suoto diekye ɔblɔ lafiɛ nwɔ.<verse eid="PSA 18:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 18:8" />Kɔyɔ ladie di anwunfie nɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:8">ɔtɔ wɔ ninfiɛ ni asaa ladie di kanya nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:8">atɔkɔnii bembe ladie aakye ka kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 18:9" />Aabonsa osi, aasoo aawa kasɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:9">ditunu alokonkyɛ lawɛ di nkpaasɔ nɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 18:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 18:10" />Aasiɛ di Kerubim suoto aaflɛlɛtɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:10">kɔfɛɛfɔ lafɛ nwɔ kuasifoko fɛle mmle di kansiɛ nflɛlɛtɛ nii.<verse eid="PSA 18:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 18:11" />Aayɔ ditunu akpanta aatĩi suoto fɛle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:11">kanto ditunu alokonkyɛ di kolo.<verse eid="PSA 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 18:12" />Di lɛkpa nwu di anu nɔɔ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:12">atubɔkanii ku atɔkɔnii ladie aakye alokonkyɛ kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 18:13" />Saate nwu ladiki kanya di osi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:13">ni di Nnwɔ Niɛtaka Katoo Alenke ni sɛlɔ ladie nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 18:14" />Aataa kɔtaa nɔɔ aasamiisa balo nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:14">aata ɔtɔ lamumuna kuakpɔkpɔtɔsa ma.<verse eid="PSA 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 18:15" />Lekpo kalɔ sisuku ladie siate</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:15">kayi ka mmle asɔse kafɔɔ late temple,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:15">O Saate, di ɔlaa lɛfɔ osĩ ɔta kanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:15">di anwunfie lɛfɔ ninwuna hɛɛhɛɛ kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 18:16" />Aakyɔɔ kɔnɛɛ kuakye katoo kuabamufũ mi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:16">aananfi mi aadiki di ntu kpinwu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 18:17" />Aadiki mi aakyeko balo nii siene nnɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:17">ku bakyiditɛ nii nnɛɛ, diekye baawɛ osie baalenkee mi.<verse eid="PSA 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 18:18" />Baadieko mi di dii le di ɔlaa latũ mi nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:18">kafɔɔ Saate nwu niale mi kamaayilatɛ.<verse eid="PSA 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 18:19" />Aakpaa mi aawako lɛba le niɛblɛfɛ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:19">aadiki mi, diekye ɔsaabla nii labuo nwɔ anu.<verse eid="PSA 18:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 18:20" />Saate nwu lɛbla dibiene ɛɛtɛɛ di ɔsaabla tinini nii kanya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:20">eediki mi ɛɛtɛɛ letota ta mmle di nnɛɛ nii leklekle ni oso.<verse eid="PSA 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 18:21" />Diekye lelolaa nkyɛ di Saate nwu sisuku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:21">ntabla okpile nkyi di Yaa nii kamaa.<verse eid="PSA 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 18:22" />Afiofa nɔɔ amuu nte di anu nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:22">nindiɛ ɔkyɛ di sisuku nɔɔ suoto.<verse eid="PSA 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 18:23" />Aanyako mi ɔlaa kuonwii di anu nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:23">lɛblasa suoto nii di sikpile ɔbla suoto.<verse eid="PSA 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 18:24" />Saate nwu lɛtɛɛ koto ta ɔsaabla tinini oso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:24">ta mmle di nnɛɛ ni leklele ni di anu nɔɔ oso.<verse eid="PSA 18:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 18:25" />Mba ninle ni onukwale fandiki onukwale lɛfɔ fantuo ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:25">mba suoto di ole nnaa nii, faatuo falɛ banaa ole kuonwii,<verse eid="PSA 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 18:26" />suoto lɛfɔ lɛkpa kɔmɛ di mba suoto niɛkpa ni kɔmɛ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:26">kafɔɔ feetuo nkpa biene mba ninante ni tinini.<verse eid="PSA 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 18:27" />Afɔ nindiki batii ba niɛwakosa ni suoto kasɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:27">kafɔɔ fanwakosa mba nintakatɛsa ni suoto katoo kasɔ.<verse eid="PSA 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 18:28" />O Saate, afɔ ninta alɛ kandiɛ nii ninnii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:28">Yaa nii lemunikĩisa ditunu nii ɛɛbla lɛkpa.<verse eid="PSA 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 18:29" />Ku lɛkyakaako lɛfɔ mafuo bakpɛtɛ dikudi olenkee;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:29">ku Yaa nii lɛkyakaako mafuo oyoyiɛ oyefe.<verse eid="PSA 18:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 18:30" />Yaa nnwɔɔ, osuku nɔɔ lewo nimu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:30">Saate nwu ɔlaa lɛkpa kamɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:30">Kubidifunsaa ale ata</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:30">batii ba bamuu niɛtaniko nwɔ nii.<verse eid="PSA 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 18:31" />Diekye owe ninle Yaa di Saate nwu kamaa?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:31">Owe kafɔɔ ninle Difuɔnkpaa nwu alenkee Yaa loo?<verse eid="PSA 18:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 18:32" />Yaa wɔ niminisa mi ni akpɛsaa ku osie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:32">anta osuku nii kafɔɔ nkpa ni kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 18:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 18:33" />Ɛɛbla nkpaa nii fɛle kafɛ̀ nle;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:33">ɛɛyɔ mi eese di katakalekɔ ka ninlɛ nii.<verse eid="PSA 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 18:34" />Eetuo nnɛɛ nii kakpɛ ɔkpɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:34">alɛ nnɛɛ nii kafuo abɔɔsaa kɔtaa obonsa.<verse eid="PSA 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 18:35" />Fɛɛyɔ kubidifunsaa lɛfɔ lelenkee fɛɛtɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:35">koletanɛɛ lɛfɔ kafɔɔ lemufũ mi kukle;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:35">afɔ niɛtɛɛ lɛtaka katoo.<verse eid="PSA 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 18:36" />Fɛɛblɛfɛɛsa lɛba fɛɛta nkpaa nii kasekɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:36">mmle di nkpaa nii dilaafɛntɛ nii.<verse eid="PSA 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 18:37" />Lati balo nii lalaawɛ ma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:37">ntakple nkpaamaa dialaase di obe wɔ lawɔɔsa ma nii.<verse eid="PSA 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 18:38" />Labibiɛ ma di mmle manasinfuo ni ɔtaka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:38">baanɔɔ di nkpaa nii kalɔ.<verse eid="PSA 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 18:39" />Faayɔ osie faaminisa mi faata kakpɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:39">faata mba nin-yɛ ni di suoto nii lakpee asi kaasɔ di nkpaatũ nii.<verse eid="PSA 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 18:40" />Faata balo nii lamunikĩisa mmaa lɛma baatɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:40">ni lawɔɔsa bakyiditɛ nii nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 18:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 18:41" />Baawi kaku alɛ bakyakaako ma, kafɔɔ kuonwii ditawɛ abafũ ma nii-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:41">baalɛɛ Saate nwu, kafɔɔ atakpee ma kanya.<verse eid="PSA 18:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 18:42" />Latutufu ma fɛ kudu di kɔfɛɛfɔ kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:42">lanyɛɛnɛ ma lawii di akpaka fɛle kɔtɛ.<verse eid="PSA 18:42" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 18:43" />Fatoodiki mi di batii ba nindieko mi ni nnɛɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:43">fɛɛyɔ mi fɛɛbla nnle disi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:43">batii ba ninan-ye ni, nfɛ ninsi kaalɔ nii.<verse eid="PSA 18:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 18:44" />Nse beenu onu ɔlaa nii, mankyɔɔ mi atoko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:44">bafɔɔ nwakasɔ di anu nii.<verse eid="PSA 18:44" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 18:45" />Bamuu lɛma situ kobiɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:45">beekye nwofakɔ lɛma bɔɔwa ku ditũtũkũ.<verse eid="PSA 18:45" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 18:46" />Saate nwu nkpe nkpa! Bitansa Difuɔnkpaa nii nwu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:46">Katoo ɔtakatɛ ninle Dikitɛ nii Yaa lele!<verse eid="PSA 18:46" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 18:47" />Ale Yaa wɔ nimbla ankyisa ni atɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:47">nnwɔ ninwakosa ni nnle kasɔ di kalɔ nii,<verse eid="PSA 18:47" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 18:48" />nnwɔ nindiki mi ni di balo nii nnɛɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 18:48">Fantakatɛsa mi katoo fanlenkee bakyiditɛ nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:48">fandiki mi fankyeko amumu batii nnɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 18:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 18:49" />O Saate, nioso kamatansa fɔ di nnle kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:49">kamasa sinu ntansa leyooto lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 18:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 18:50" />Anta ɔka nɔɔ lelenkee kplɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:50">ambla sifutulɛ nɔɔ se ninaa ni kaloo anta nnwɔ ɛɛpɛ ni ɔfɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 18:50">ambla anta Dawid ku banantii nɔɔ dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="PSA 18:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="PSA 19" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 19</para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa Lɛkpa Di Kayi Ɔbla Suoto</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu. Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 19:1" />Osi kodiki Yaa lɛkpa ambuɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:1">kolo koyie lɛkya di nnɛɛ nɔɔ ɔkpɛ ɔbla suoto.<verse eid="PSA 19:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 19:2" />Dii biala ndiki ɔlaa nɔɔ kumbuɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:2">kakyɛ biala ndiki lɛsaatofo nɔɔ antuo.<verse eid="PSA 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 19:3" />Lɛkakatɛ ee ɔlaa kuonwii diedie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:3">baanu ma ni sɛlɔ.<verse eid="PSA 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 19:4" />Kafɔɔ sɛlɔ lɛma ndie sindu kasɔ kamuu suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:4">sɛlaa lɛma kafɔɔ ndu kayi nsekɔ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 19:4" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 19:4">Ɛɛpɛ akpanta di osi ɛɛta kufĩ,<verse eid="PSA 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 19:5" />fɛle ɔkafɔɔsa nikodie ankye leyo nɔɔ anwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:5">fɛle osuɔtɔ siene wɔ niɛyɔ suoto lɛyɔɔ abatoso ni otoso nɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 19:6" />Nintaka ninkye osi kayɛntɛkɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:6">ninkyi ninfe kayɛntɛkɔ bamba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:6">lɛsalɛsaa ninwofa di difila nini kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 19:7" />Saate nwu kufiofa lewo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:7">kunkpee ninwuna ɔnyɛɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 19:7">Disi otika nkpe di Saate nwu sɛlaa suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:7">sinta abisɔnsaa bablatɛ ntofo lɛsaa.<verse eid="PSA 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 19:8" />Saate nwu asaa otuo nlɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:8">anta otu suoto lɛyɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 19:8">Saate afiofa kamɛ lɛkpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:8">anta anu nkpa.<verse eid="PSA 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 19:9" />Saate nwu lɛyɛkɛ lɛbla klekle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:9">ninwɛ dinaa ni kaloo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 19:9">Saate nwu mbla asaa di osuku kanya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:9">amuu kafɔɔ lɛbla tinini.<verse eid="PSA 19:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 19:10" />Siefũ kɔya silenke koto sɛɛle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:10">silenke ni bia koto sɛɛle nwaa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 19:10">siɛmɛnɛmɛnɛ silenke bablɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:10">silenke ni bablɔ kaflɛ.<verse eid="PSA 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 19:11" />Nsĩ ninsĩ ɔlaa kunta kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:11">letota kplɛ nsi ninsĩ omufũ oklee kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 19:12" />Owe nimafuo ɔtanlolaa ɔbla nɔɔ otofo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:12">Yɔ sikpile nii se niewofa ni fakyɛ mi.<verse eid="PSA 19:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 19:13" />Blasa kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ kafɔɔ fakyeko sikpile se ɛɛtɛ fiɛ ɛɛbla ni suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:13">tanta sĩ sialenkee mi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 19:13">Ni ole kuonwii dilɔbawɛ mi di suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:13">ni madie di sikpile kplɛ ɔbla kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 19:14" />Ta kanya nii sɛlaa ku otu nii kamɛ obuo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:14">dibuo anu di anu lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 19:14">O Saate, Difuɔnkpaa nii ku Dikitɛ nii.<verse eid="PSA 19:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="PSA 20" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 20</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Kuɔta Ni Lelenkee</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu. Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 20:1" />Saate nwu atũna ata fɔ di obe wɔ fasi ni di nimiina kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:1">Yakob Yaa leyooto nwu ditĩi fɔ.<verse eid="PSA 20:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 20:2" />Aata lɛkyakaako dikye kakleklekɔ nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:2">aata fɔ osie kukye Sion.<verse eid="PSA 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 20:3" />Aanyuma oleɔta lɛfɔ omuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:3">aafũ kafɔɔ ofiɛ asaaɔta lɛfɔ. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ</char><verse eid="PSA 20:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 20:4" />Aata fɔ otu lɛfɔ kamɛ dibiesaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:4">aata disibu lɛfɔ nimuu kafɔɔ diwa kaanya.<verse eid="PSA 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 20:5" />Bubanya suoto lɛyɔɔ nse feelenkee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:5">muntakatɛsa baflankaa loo katoo kafɔɔ di Yaa loo leyooto kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 20:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 20:6" />Nunua nfɛ n-ye nlɛ Saate nwu ndiki nnwɔ ɛɛpɛ ni ɔfɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:6">annu nwɔ ɔlaa di osi klekle nɔɔ nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:6">ku koletanɛɛ nɔɔ nwu osie didiki.<verse eid="PSA 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 20:7" />Batii bawo nkanta di bakeke ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni, bawo kafɔɔ di bapɔnkɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:7">kafɔɔ awo munkanta di Saate nwu, Yaa loo leyooto kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 20:8" />Babanɔɔ mampɛ kaasɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:8">kafɔɔ awo bubataka munyila kpinkpĩ.<verse eid="PSA 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 20:9" />O Saate, diki ɔka nwu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 20:9">Tuna fata wo, nse buɔlɛɛ fɔ!<verse eid="PSA 20:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="PSA 21" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 21</para>
  <para style="s1">Katansa Diɛta Ni Lelenkee</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu. Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 21:1" />O Saate, ɔka nwu nnya suoto lɛyɔɔ di osie lɛfɔ kamɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:1">Mmle ɔɔnya ni suoto lɛyɔɔ kplɛ di lelenkee le fɛɛtɔɔ ni suoto!<verse eid="PSA 21:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 21:2" />Fɛɛbla otu nɔɔ dibiesaa fɛɛtɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:2">faasĩ nle di kanya nɔɔ lebuɛ ni ɔbla. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ</char><verse eid="PSA 21:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 21:3" />Fɛɛkyakako nwɔ ku lɛyɔɔ owii biene</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:3">ni feetũkunsa nwɔ kafɔɔ koto sɛɛle nwaa lɛkakoto diisi nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 21:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 21:4" />Aakaalɛ fɔ alɛ tɔɔ nkpa, ni faatɔɔ-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:4">ayi kpinwu ya ninaa ni kaloo nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 21:5" />Diafe ni di lelenkee le faatɔɔ ni kamɛ, dibu nɔɔ lɛtaka katoo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:5">sɛlɛ ku sɛka fɛɛyɔ fɛɛtɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 21:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 21:6" />Nwaako fatɔtɔɔ lɛyɔɔ le ninaa ni kaloo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:6">fɛɛtɔɔ ɛɛpɔ ku suoto lɛyɔɔ di anu lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 21:7" />Diekye ɔka nwu ntika disi di Saate nwu suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:7">diefe ni di Nnwɔ Niɛtaka Katoo Alenke ni lɛbɔmbɔ le ninaa ni kaloo kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:7">ɔlɔbatũkũ.<verse eid="PSA 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 21:8" />Kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ mamufũ balo lɛfɔ bamuu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:8">koletanɛɛ lɛfɔ mamufũ bakyiditɛ lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 21:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 21:9" />Di obe wɔ fabadie ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:9">fababla ma fɛle ɔtɔ bembe.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 21:9">Saate nwu mamɛ ma di ɔblɔ nɔɔ kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:9">ɔtɔ nɔɔ kafɔɔ mawɔɔsa ma.<verse eid="PSA 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 21:10" />Fabawɔɔsa banatii lɛma di kasɔ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:10">ku babi lɛma di batii kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 21:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 21:11" />Kuntɛ boobu disi kpile di suoto lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:11">beenyu kafɔɔ alɛ boole sikpile yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:11">blɔbafuo ɔbla;<verse eid="PSA 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 21:12" />diekye fabata ma mankple nkpaamaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:12">nse fɛɛnanfi kɔtaa fese di anu lɛma.<verse eid="PSA 21:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 21:13" />O Saate, takatɛ suoto ku osie lɛfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 21:13">bubasa sinu muntansa osie lɛfɔ nwu kafɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 21:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="PSA 22" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 22</para>
  <para style="s1">Dibuo Kaku Owi Ku Katansa Onu</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu. Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ. Basa nwu di "Kolesɛtũ kafɛ" sɛlɔ kanya.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 22:1" />Yaa nii, Yaa nii, obe oso feediɛ mi nnɛɛ nkpo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:1">Obe oso feekyo ku odiki nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:1">fɛɛtɛ feekyo di atunni nii sɛlɔ?<verse eid="PSA 22:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 22:2" />O Yaa nii, lɛfaa lɛlɛɛ fɔ ku kakũ, kafɔɔ faatuna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:2">kakyɛ kafɔɔ, ninlokanana.<verse eid="PSA 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 22:3" />Kafɔɔ fasi di lɛkakpomii fɛ Klekletɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:3">afɔ ninle Israel katansa.<verse eid="PSA 22:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 22:4" />Afɔ suoto di bawa loo latika asi lɛma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:4">baatika fɔ disi, ni faadiki ma nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 22:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 22:5" />Baawi baalɛɛ fɔ ni faadiki ma nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:5">afɔ baatika disi ni ninnɛɛ ditafee ma nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 22:6" />Kafɔɔ ami yi, kunnwɔɔ nle, diele otii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:6">batii kɔma mi, nindie kafɔɔ lɛsalɛsaa di okpoo anu.<verse eid="PSA 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 22:7" />Mba bamuu ninnyɛɛ nii mma mi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:7">mantufa mi, matũkunsa asi lɛma mabuɛ alɛ:<verse eid="PSA 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 22:8" />"Eetika disi di Saate nwu suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:8">ta Saate nwu afũ nwɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 22:8">Tɔɔ adiki nwɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:8">diekye suoto n-yɔɔ nwɔ di kamɛ nɔɔ.”<verse eid="PSA 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 22:9" />Kafɔɔ afɔ niadiki mi di olofofɔtɔ kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:9">afɔ niata latika fɔ disi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:9">bia di yaami lɛnyɛɛ suoto.<verse eid="PSA 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 22:10" />Diayɔ ni di kalofokɔ baayɔ mi baatika fɔ di suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:10">diayɔ ni di yaami kafutu kamɛ fale Yaa nii.<verse eid="PSA 22:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 22:11" />Tankyo mi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:11">diekye dibuɛkpee ntɔɔtɛɛtɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:11">kuonwii kafɔɔ nnaa abakyakaako mi nii.<verse eid="PSA 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 22:12" />Banankyue-suɔtɔ kpinwu lɛmana mi beekyi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:12">Basan banankyue-suɔtɔ siene lekpee lɛkpankyila beekyi mi.<verse eid="PSA 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 22:13" />Bɛɛbɛ nnya lɛma foo di suoto nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:13">fɛle bakyata ba nikokumii mambɛbɛɛ ni sina lɛma.<verse eid="PSA 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 22:14" />Bɛɛnyɛɛnɛ mi beewii fɛle ntu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:14">akufi nii amuu kafɔɔ lɛkpakpaa di nkyakɔ nɔɔ suoto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 22:14">Otu nii ntookple sɛtɔ̀;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:14">kutɔɔnyinakĩi kuodie kaamɛ nii.<verse eid="PSA 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 22:15" />Owolonwo nii lekoso fɛle dibukii kakyɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:15">ɔkplalomii nii kafɔɔ nka di kanyatoo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:15">fɛɛyɔ mi fɛɛtɛ di kukpi kudu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 22:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 22:16" />Baweewee lɛmana mi beekyi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:16">batii kpile dikudi lekpee lɛkpankyila beekyi mi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:16">beedufu nnɛɛ nii ku nkpaa nii.<verse eid="PSA 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 22:17" />Mafuo akufi nii amuu ɔka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:17">batii kafɔɔ nnyu mi tunwii nyakatãa.<verse eid="PSA 22:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 22:18" />Baasɛ abula nii bawo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:18">baawii atrebi kafɔɔ di akpeele nii suoto.<verse eid="PSA 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 22:19" />O Saate, kafɔɔ afɔ yi, tankyo mi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:19">O osie nii, wa wla fabakyakaako mi.<verse eid="PSA 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 22:20" />Diki nkpa nii fakyeko kapamii kanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:20">nkpa nii be niefũ ni kɔya di baweewee osie kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 22:21" />Diki mi fakyeko bakyata kanya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:21">fũ mi di batrɔmu akya kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 22:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 22:22" />Malɛɛ leyooto lɛfɔ nta babiloo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:22">matansa fɔ di batii dikudi kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 22:23" />Aye ba ninyɛkɛ ni Saate nwu, bitansa nwɔ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:23">Aye Yakob banantii bamuu, bitɔɔ dibu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:23">Aye Israel banantii bamuu biyɛkɛ nwɔ!<verse eid="PSA 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 22:24" />Diekye aafeesa nnɛɛ ee aakyisa anu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:24">di nnwɔ diobuo, oonnu ni ninyinyi suoto;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 22:24">aawofasa anu nɔɔ di suoto nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:24">kafɔɔ atoonu nwɔ kaku owi diɛta ni lɛkyakaako.<verse eid="PSA 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 22:25" />Afɔ kamɛ di katansa nii di batii dikudi kplɛ nwu kamɛ lekye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:25">mba ninyɛkɛ fɔ ni anu kamata asaaɔta ya labuɛ latɛ nii.<verse eid="PSA 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 22:26" />Bapiitɛ male mammiɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:26">mba nikowolaa ni Saate nwu matansa nwɔ-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:26">situ lee sisiɛ nkpa dinaa ni kaloo!<verse eid="PSA 22:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 22:27" />Kasɔ nyɛntɛlekɔ mmuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:27">manyuma mamunikĩi manwa Saate nwu nfũ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 22:27">nnle nwu nfaabi mmuu batii kafɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:27">mawa kasɔ di anu nɔɔ,<verse eid="PSA 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 22:28" />diekye Saate nwu kale ninle sɛka kalekɔ nwu nkpo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:28">ni oole sɛka di nnle nwu suoto nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 22:29" />Basaawɛntɛ bamuu kaasɔ suoto male, mansumu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:29">batii ba bamuu niesifi ni kudu kamɛ-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:29">mba ninamafuo ni suoto lɛma nkpa ofũ mapɛ akunkyi di anu nɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 22:30" />Kayi kaamaa babi masumu nwɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:30">babatɔkɔ ana ya nikɔwa ni Saate nwu suoto ɔlaa.<verse eid="PSA 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 22:31" />Bababuɛ ɔsaabla tinini nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:31">mantɔkɔ batii ba manadilofo ni-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 22:31">diekye nnwɔɔ niɛbla nya nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 22:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="PSA 23" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 23</para>
  <para style="s1">Saate Nwu, Bafosokpatɛ Nwaa Loo</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 23:1" />Saate nwu ninle mi kpatɛ, lɛsalɛsaa dilɔbafĩ mi.<verse eid="PSA 23:1" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 23:2" />Antɛɛ nklɛ nte di sɛfa bokoboko kaweekɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 23:2">ankpaa mi ankyɛnko katu ka ninte ni kloklo kotoko<verse eid="PSA 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 23:3" />ankple ankpee ninwuna nii ɔnyɛɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 23:3">Anleko mi katũ di ɔsaabla tinini sisuku suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:3">ta leyooto nɔɔ oso.<verse eid="PSA 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 23:4" />Bia kuntɛ nkyɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:4">nfe di kɔwɛ di kukpi ditunu kamɛ yi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 23:4">namayɛkɛ okpile kuonwii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:4">diekye afɔ fasiko mi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 23:4">owoso lɛfɔ ku ɔkyɛnwoso lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:4">nkpee mi kɔnɛɛ kaafutu.<verse eid="PSA 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 23:5" />Feetũ opunu di katũ nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:5">di balo nii anu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 23:5">Feefifia disi nii ku nnɔnyi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:5">opũ nii leyii kuɔwaalɛ.<verse eid="PSA 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 23:6" />Nwaako, dibiene ku lɛbɔmbɔ nimatikanko mi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:6">di nkpa nii ayi amuu kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 23:6">ni masiɛ di Saate nwu leyo kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 23:6">obe lele.<verse eid="PSA 23:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="PSA 24" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 24</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔka Kplɛ Nwu</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 24:1" />Kasɔ ku asaa ya amuu nin-yɛ ka ni di suoto nle Saate nwu ale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:1">kayi kamuu ku mba ninsi ka ni di suoto;<verse eid="PSA 24:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 24:2" />diekye nnwɔɔ niabla nya di lekpo suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:2">ni aayɔ nya aase di ntu suoto nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 24:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 24:3" />Owe nimakata Saate nwu kobokote?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:3">Owe nimayila di kakleklekɔ nɔɔ nwu?<verse eid="PSA 24:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 24:4" />Otii wɔ di nnɛɛ nɔɔ leklekle ni di otu nɔɔ kamɛ lɛkpa ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:4">nnwɔ ninayɔ ɔkla nɔɔ atika ni di afiɔ suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:4">ee aka ni atam di asaa ya ninle ni sɛlaa ku afunu.<verse eid="PSA 24:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 24:5" />Nnwɔɔ nimafũ lɛyɔɔ ankyeko Saate nwu nfũ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:5">ku lɛbɛ ankyeko Yaa, dikitɛ nɔɔ nfũ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 24:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 24:6" />Nkpo ninle ana ya ninwolaa nwɔ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:6">manwolaa ni Yakob Yaa anu nɛ. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ</char><verse eid="PSA 24:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 24:7" />O aye n-yoko, bitakatɛsa asi lee katoo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:7">aye bakofo akloo, bitaka biyila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:7">alɛ dibu Ɔka nwu kabuo kaamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 24:8" />Owe ninle dibu Ɔka nwu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:8">Saate nwu sientɛ ku sekambi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:8">Saate nwu ku sɛkambi di kakpɛ kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 24:9" />O aye n-yoko, bitakatɛsa asi lee katoo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:9">aye bakofo akloo, bitaka biyila,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:9">alɛ dibu Ɔka nwu kabuo kaamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 24:10" />Owe di dibu Ɔka wɔ mmle nle?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:10">Saate wɔ Ninlenke nii-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 24:10">nnwɔɔ ninle dibu Ɔka nwu nɛ. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ</char><verse eid="PSA 24:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="PSA 25" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 25</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Diɛta Ni Osuku Otuo Ku Otii Onyu</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 25:1" />O Saate, afɔ lɛtakatɛsa ɔkla nii lɛkyɔɔ;<verse eid="PSA 25:1" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 25:2" />O Yaa nii, afɔ letika disi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 25:2">Tanta sinunsɔ lakpɛ mi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:2">ee faata suoto siyɔɔ balo nii di suoto nii.<verse eid="PSA 25:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 25:3" />Otii lele nikonyu fɔ osuku yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:3">sinunsɔ dilɔbakpɛ nwɔ diidii</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 25:3">kafɔɔ ta sinunsɔ sikpɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:3">mba ninambla ni asaa di osuku kanya.<verse eid="PSA 25:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 25:4" />O Saate, tuo mi sisuku lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:4">faatɛɛ ntofo nfenkɔ lɛfɔ;<verse eid="PSA 25:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 25:5" />leko mi katũ di onukwale lɛfɔ, faatuo mi asaa kafɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:5">diekye afɔ ninle Yaa Dikitɛ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:5">osuku nii onyu kafɔɔ nsi kaamɛ lɛfɔ dii kufĩ kumu.<verse eid="PSA 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 25:6" />O Saate, nyuma sifutulɛ ku lɛbɔmbɔ kplɛ lɛfɔ nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:6">diekye akpe bia okofobee.<verse eid="PSA 25:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 25:7" />Tannyuma sekosopo nii obe sikpile</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:7">ku otokopĩ nii;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 25:7">nyuma mi, ta lɛbɔmbɔ lɛfɔ oso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:7">O Saate, diekye fakpe sifutulɛ.<verse eid="PSA 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 25:8" />Saate nwu nlɛ, ambla asaa di osuku kanya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:8">nkpo oso antuo bakpileblatɛ sisuku nɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 25:9" />Ankpaa mba niɛwakosa ni suoto kasɔ di lɛsaa le ninlɛ ni suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:9">antuo ma kafɔɔ osuku nɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 25:10" />Saate nwu sisuku simuu nle lɛbɔmbɔ ku onukwale</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:10">kuɔta mba niemufũ kanya ninii nɔɔ abiesaa bakle nii.<verse eid="PSA 25:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 25:11" />O Saate, ta leyooto lɛfɔ oso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:11">yɔ sikpile nii fakyɛ mi, kuntɛ sipɔ.<verse eid="PSA 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 25:12" />Owe nfɛ ninle otii wɔ ninyɛkɛ ni Saate nwu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:12">Nnwɔɔ nimatuo nwɔ osuku wɔ eediki ɛɛtɔɔ nii.<verse eid="PSA 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 25:13" />Abasiɛ nkpa nɔɔ di lɛlɛ kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:13">banantii nɔɔ kafɔɔ male kasɔ nwu atesaa.<verse eid="PSA 25:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 25:14" />Saate nwu ndiki ofutulaa nɔɔ anta mba ninyɛkɛ nwɔ nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:14">anta ma mantofo kanya ninii nɔɔ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 25:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 25:15" />Anu nii ntika di Saate nwu suoto obe lele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:15">diekye nnwɔɔ lete nimadiki nkpaa nii di dikyĩ kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 25:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 25:16" />Munikĩi fanyu mi, faale mi sibualɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:16">diekye kuonwii nnaa mi, diobuo mi kafɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 25:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 25:17" />Otu nii kamɛ dibuo ntɔpɔ diɛkyakaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:17">diki mi di ninyinyi nii nwu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 25:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 25:18" />Nyu dibuo nii ku ninyinyi nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:18">faayɔ sikpile nii simuu kafɔɔ fakyɛ mi.<verse eid="PSA 25:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 25:19" />Nyu mmle di balo nii ntɔɔkpɛ bɛɛkyakaa ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:19">ku mmle beekyidi mi ni yakayaka!<verse eid="PSA 25:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 25:20" />Nyu nkpa nii disi faadiki mi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:20">tanta sinunsɔ lakpɛ mi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:20">diekye afɔ nintaniko.<verse eid="PSA 25:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 25:21" />Ta lɛpɔɔ ɔtanlo ku ɔsaabla tinini kulolaa mi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:21">diekye osuku onyu nii ntika di suoto lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 25:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 25:22" />O Yaa, diki Israel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 25:22">fakyeko dibuo lɛma nimuu kamɛ!<verse eid="PSA 25:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="PSA 26" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 26</para>
  <para style="s1">Otii Biene Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 26:1" />O Saate, tɛɛ lɛbɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:1">diekye ntoosiɛ nkpa be di ole kuonwii nnaa nii;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 26:1">layɔ anu nii latika di Saate nwu suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:1">ninaankpankpa ni.<verse eid="PSA 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 26:2" />O Saate, sɔ mi fanyu, faawolaa mi kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:2">nyu otu nii ku disibu nii kamɛ fanyu;<verse eid="PSA 26:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 26:3" />diekye lɛbɔmbɔ lɛfɔ nte mi di anu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:3">nkyɛ kafɔɔ di onukwale lɛfɔ kamɛ obe lele.<verse eid="PSA 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 26:4" />Ninsiɛ di balaatɛ kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:4">ee munko bakyɔnkyɔtɛ bukyɛ;<verse eid="PSA 26:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 26:5" />lekyidi bakpileblatɛ dikudi nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:5">lesĩ kafɔɔ osiɛ ku bakpiletɛ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 26:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 26:6" />Lefoto nnɛɛ nii di okpile ɔtambla kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:6">O Saate, nkyɛ nkyi kafɔɔ di olekatakɔ lɛfɔ,<verse eid="PSA 26:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 26:7" />nyie katansa lɛfɔ lɛkya osie kanya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:7">mbuɛ kafɔɔ sɛsaabla lɛfɔ simuu se niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ.<verse eid="PSA 26:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 26:8" />O Saate, mbɔmbɔ leyo le fasi nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:8">lɛba le di lɛkpa lɛfɔ nsiɛ nii.<verse eid="PSA 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 26:9" />Tandiki ɔkla nii fakyakaa ku bakpileblatɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:9">ee nkpa nii ku batii ba nin-wii ni ntɔ suoto,<verse eid="PSA 26:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 26:10" />di asaa kpile ɔbla nsi ni ninnɛɛ kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:10">di ditunu kamɛ asaa ofũ leyii ni nletanɛɛ lɛma kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 26:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 26:11" />Kafɔɔ ami nsi nkpa be di ole kuonwii nnaa nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:11">nyɛɛ nyaami, faadiki mi kafɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 26:12" />Nkpaa nii n-yɛ di kasɔ ka niɛkyɛkyɛ ni suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 26:12">batii dikudi kplɛ kamɛ matansa Saate nwu.<verse eid="PSA 26:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="PSA 27" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 27</para>
  <para style="s1">Katansa Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 27:1" />Saate nwu ninle lɛkpa nii ku didiki nii-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:1">owe kamayɛkɛ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 27:1">Saate nwu ninle nkpa nii katanikokɔ-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:1">owe nfɛ kayɛkɛ?<verse eid="PSA 27:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 27:2" />Nse batii kpile ledieko mi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:2">alɛ boowee mi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 27:2">nse balo nii ku bakyiditɛ nii lɛtaka di suoto nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:2">babatuula mannɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 27:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 27:3" />Kuntɛ bakpɛtɛ lɛmana mi beekyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:3">otu nii dilɔbayɛkɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 27:3">kuntɛ kakpɛ ledieko mi yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:3">mianwu nfɛ bia kamawɛ sɛkambi nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 27:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 27:4" />Lɛsaa ninwii kɔkaalɛ Saate nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:4">nni ninle nle komiɛ ni nɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 27:4">alɛ kasiɛ di Saate nwu leyo kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:4">di nkpa nii ayi amuu kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 27:4">alɛ kanya Saate nwu sɛlɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:4">alɛ kawolaa nwɔ di olekatakɔ nɔɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 27:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 27:5" />Diekye di nimiinayi kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:5">abalolaa mi annyu di kasiɛkɔ nɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 27:5">abayɔ mi anwofasa di lɛkpaayo nɔɔ kawofakɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:5">an-yɔ mi antika di difuɔnkpaa takale suoto.<verse eid="PSA 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 27:6" />Ni disi ni mataka katoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:6">ninlenkee balo ba niɛmana mi beekyi nii;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 27:6">di lɛkpaayo nɔɔ kamɛ mata oleɔta ku suoto lɛyɔɔ kudu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:6">masa sinu ku sɛlɔ mɛnɛmɛnɛ nta Saate nwu.<verse eid="PSA 27:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 27:7" />O Saate, nu mi sɛlɔ nse lɛlɛɛ fɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:7">nyɛɛ nyaami faatuna fatɛɛ kafɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 27:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 27:8" />Otu nii mbuɛ di suoto lɛfɔ alɛ, "Wolaa anu nɔɔ!"</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:8">Saate, anu lɛfɔ mawolaa.<verse eid="PSA 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 27:9" />Tanwofasa anu lɛfɔ di suoto nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:9">tantososa kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ ku ɔblɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:9">afɔ ninle mi kyakaakotɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 27:9">Tansĩ mi ee faadiɛ mi nnɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:9">O Yaa Dikitɛ nii.<verse eid="PSA 27:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 27:10" />Kuntɛ teemi ku yaami lediɛ mi nnɛɛ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:10">Saate nwu kamafũ mi.<verse eid="PSA 27:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 27:11" />O Saate, tuo mi osuku lɛfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:11">lekomi katũ di nkpaa osuku tinini suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:11">ta balo nii oso.<verse eid="PSA 27:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 27:12" />Tan-yɔ mi faata bakyiditɛ nii dibiesaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:12">diekye balaatɛ kamaabayilatɛ lɛtaka di suoto nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:12">boonwuna amumu madiki.<verse eid="PSA 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 27:13" />Anu nii lekple atika alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:13">manya Saate nwu dibiene</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:13">di nkpa basiɛtɛ kasɔ suoto.<verse eid="PSA 27:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 27:14" />Soko Saate nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:14">wɛ osie, faanya otu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 27:14">faasoko Saate nwu.<verse eid="PSA 27:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="PSA 28" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 28</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Diɛta Ni Lɛkyakaako</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 28:1" />O Saate, Difuɔnkpaa nii, afɔ kɔlɛɛ nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:1">tansĩ mi kotoko ɔkyɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 28:1">Diekye nse feelo kanana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:1">kamate fɛle batii ba nintoosifi ni dibiɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 28:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 28:2" />Nu mi kaku faanyɛɛ nyaami</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:2">di obe wɔ kɔlɛɛ fɔ nkaalɛ ni lɛkyakaako,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 28:2">di obe wɔ lɛtakatɛsa ni nnɛɛ nii katoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:2">lɛkyɔɔ ni Kakleklekɔ kaamɛ Kaakleklekɔ Lɛba lɛfɔ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 28:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 28:3" />Tan-yɔ mi faakpɔtɔɔsa ku bakpiletɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:3">ku mba nikole ni sikpile suoto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 28:3">mankakatɛko ni bawo lɛma ku sɛlɔ buɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:3">kafɔɔ beesiisa ni amumu ɔbla di situ lɛma kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 28:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 28:4" />Ta ma sɛsaabla lɛma koto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:4">ku ɔkpɛ kpile lɛma nwu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 28:4">ta ma koto di lɛsaa le di nnɛɛ lɛma lɛbla ni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:4">faakplesa nle niesiɛko ma ni fawako suoto lɛma.<verse eid="PSA 28:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 28:5" />Diekye blɔɔyɔ dibu bata Saate nwu sɛkpɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:5">ku nle di nnɛɛ nɔɔ lɛbla nii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 28:5">ababɛbɛɛ ma antɛ kaasɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:5">ɔlɔbasinta ma bakple bataka kafɔɔ diidii.<verse eid="PSA 28:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 28:6" />Baatansa Saate nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:6">diekye atoonu mi kaku, ɛɛnyɛɛ nyaami.<verse eid="PSA 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 28:7" />Saate nwu ninle mi osie ku kubidifunsaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:7">otu nii letika nwɔ disi, ni ɛɛkyakaakoe nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 28:7">Otu nii nnya suoto lɛyɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:7">mayɔ sinu kafɔɔ mpɛ nwɔ sɛfa.<verse eid="PSA 28:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 28:8" />Saate nwu ninle batii nɔɔ osie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:8">katanikokɔ didiki ɛɛta nnwɔ ɛɛpɛ ni ɔfɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 28:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 28:9" />Diki batii lɛfɔ, faawii atesaa lɛfɔ lɛyɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 28:9">le kpatɛ lɛma, faaklee ma dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="PSA 28:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 28" />
  <chapter number="29" style="c" sid="PSA 29" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 29</para>
  <para style="s1">Saate Nwu Sɛlɔ Di Afɛɛfɔ Siene Kamɛ</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 29:1" />O Yaa babisuɔtɔbi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6.2</char><char style="ft" closed="false">anwuna awo aale aate fɛ Yaa babisuɔtɔbi</char></note>, biyɔ bita Saate nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:1">biyɔ dibu ku osie bita Saate nwu.<verse eid="PSA 29:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 29:2" />Biyɔ dibu le niesiɛko ni Saate nwu bita leyooto nɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:2">Bisumu Saate nwu di sɛlɛ di leklekle nɔɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 29:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 29:3" />Saate nwu sɛlɔ kodie di ntu nwu osi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:3">Yaa lɛkpa nwu kodie fɛ kanto dikpududuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:3">Saate nwu sɛlɔ kodie fɛ kanto dikpududuu di lɛkpo osi.<verse eid="PSA 29:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 29:4" />Saate nwu sɛlɔ nkpe osie;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:4">Saate nwu sɛlɔ nkpe dibu.<verse eid="PSA 29:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 29:5" />Saate nwu sɛlɔ nfefee sedar awoso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:5">Saate nwu nfefee Lebanon sedar awoso kukuikukuii.<verse eid="PSA 29:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 29:6" />Anta Lebanon nyeyefe fɛle lɛnankyuebi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:6">Sirion kobokote nte fɛle kɔkɔ dibi.<verse eid="PSA 29:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 29:7" />Saate nwu sɛlɔ nkplalaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:7">ku ɔplalaa amunaa.<verse eid="PSA 29:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 29:8" />Saate nwu sɛlɔ ntũkunsa ɔfaafuu nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:8">Saate nwu ntũkunsa Kades Ɔfaafuu nwu.<verse eid="PSA 29:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 29:9" />Saate nwu sɛlɔ mmumunikĩisa awoso kplɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:9">anta kafɔɔ apoo nte foee.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 29:9">Di olekatakɔ nɔɔ kafɔɔ batii bamuu nfaa alɛ, “Dibu!”<verse eid="PSA 29:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 29:10" />Saate nwu nsiɛ di lɛkakpomii suoto di ntu be nieyii ni osi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:10">Beese Saate nwu sɛka fɛ Ɔka dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="PSA 29:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 29:11" />Saate nwu nta batii nɔɔ osie;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 29:11">Saate nwu nwii batii nɔɔ lɛyɔɔ ku atoko ɔkyɛ ole.<verse eid="PSA 29:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 29" />
  <chapter number="30" style="c" sid="PSA 30" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 30</para>
  <para style="s1">Sɛfa Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu. Kuɔta ni olekatakɔ okleklesa.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 30:1" />O Saate, matakatɛsa fɔ katoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:1">diekye afɔ niadiki mi di dibiɔ kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:1">ni fananta kafɔɔ suoto siyɔɔ balo nii di suoto nii nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 30:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 30:2" />O Saate, Yaa nii, lalɛɛ fɔ nlɛ kyakaakoe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:2">ni faakya mi ofiɛ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 30:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 30:3" />O Saate, faadiki mi faakyeko ɔkya kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:3">faafũ mi nkpa alɛ ntabuo di dibiɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 30:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 30:4" />Bisa sinu bita Saate nwu, aye ba ninle ni baklekletɛ nɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:4">bitansa leyooto klekle nɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 30:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 30:5" />Diekye ɔblɔ nɔɔ ninklɛ ku ɔyɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:5">kafɔɔ sibualɛ nɔɔ nkpe diesifi ni nkpa mmuu kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 30:5">kaku owi nfuo ɔwɛ ku kakyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:5">kafɔɔ suoto lɛyɔɔ nwa ku olesɛ.<verse eid="PSA 30:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 30:6" />Obe wɔ di asaa lalɛ mi ni ɔkyɛ, labuɛ nlɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:6">"Namakpankpa diidii.”<verse eid="PSA 30:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 30:7" />O Saate, obe wɔ faale mi ni sibualɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:7">faata kobokote nii layila kpinkpĩ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 30:7">kafɔɔ obe wɔ faawofasa ni anu lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:7">lɛyɛkɛ lapɛ mi.<verse eid="PSA 30:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 30:8" />O Saate, afɔ lalɛɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:8">Saate nwu lawi lakpee nlɛ anyɛɛ nyaami:<verse eid="PSA 30:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 30:9" />"Lɛmɛmbiene ninsi di kawɔɔ nii kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:9">di ami dibiɔ osifi kamɛ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 30:9">Kudu nimatansa fɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:9">Kubayie onukwale lɛfɔ lɛkya?<verse eid="PSA 30:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 30:10" />O Saate, nu, faanyɛɛ nyaami kafɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:10">O Saate, le kyakakotɛ nii.”<verse eid="PSA 30:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 30:11" />Faamunikĩisa kaku nii owi faabla katũ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:11">faadiki kaku dibula nii di suoto, ni faayɔ suoto lɛyɔɔ faanyukũsɛɛ nɛ,<verse eid="PSA 30:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 30:12" />alɛ otu nii kasa sinu anta fɔ alɛ kulaalo kanana.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 30:12">O Saate, Yaa nii, kamapɛ fɔ sɛfa dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="PSA 30:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 30" />
  <chapter number="31" style="c" sid="PSA 31" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 31</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Di Disi Otika Di Yaa Suoto</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu. Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 31:1" />O Saate, afɔ lɛtaniko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:1">tanta sinunsɔ lakpɛ mi diidii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:1">diki mi di ɔsaabla tinini lɛfɔ nwu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 31:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 31:2" />Munikĩisa kotoko lɛfɔ fakyɔɔ mi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:2">wa wla fabadiki mi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:2">le katanikokɔ nii difuɔnkpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:2">kɔba siene ko nimadiki mi nii.<verse eid="PSA 31:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 31:3" />Di afɔ ninle mi ni difuɔnkpaa ku kɔba oso yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:3">ta leyooto lɛfɔ oso, le katũ faakpaa mi.<verse eid="PSA 31:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 31:4" />Diki mi di okũ wɔ bɛɛkyɔɔ mi ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:4">diekye afɔ ninle mi katanikokɔ.<verse eid="PSA 31:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 31:5" />Nnɛɛ lɛfɔ lɛyɔ ninwuna nii lekpee;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:5">O Saate, onukwaletɛ Yaa, diki mi.<verse eid="PSA 31:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 31:6" />Lekyidi batii ba nintikanko ni afiɔ ya ninaa ni ɔnyɛɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:6">Saate nwu letika disi nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 31:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 31:7" />Manya suoto lɛyɔɔ, mpɔ kafɔɔ di lɛbɔmbɔ lɛfɔ kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:7">diekye faanya dibuo nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:7">faatofo kafɔɔ ɔkla nii ninyinyi.<verse eid="PSA 31:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 31:8" />Fatayɔ mi fakpee di balo nii nnɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:8">kafɔɔ fɛɛyɔ nkpaa nii feese di kablɛfɛɛkɔ.<verse eid="PSA 31:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 31:9" />O Saate, nyɛɛ nyaami, diekye nsi di nimiina kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:9">anu nii nte tutufuu ku kaku owi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:9">ɔkla nii ku suoto nii kafɔɔ lebuo nyaami.<verse eid="PSA 31:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 31:10" />Dibuo ntoofũ nkpa nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:10">alɛɛ nii kafɔɔ ku atũuni;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:10">osie nii kɔwakasɔ ta dibuo nii oso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:10">akufi nii kafɔɔ ntookpiɛkpiɛ.<verse eid="PSA 31:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 31:11" />Ta balo nii bamuu oso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:11">ninsindie lɛsalɛsaa di bawo nii anu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:11">nle lɛyɛkɛsaa lɛta basiɛwo nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:11">mba ninyɛɛ ni di lɛkpaka ntoso mi.<verse eid="PSA 31:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 31:12" />Batooyee mi fɛle okpi ntookpi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:12">ntɔɔbla fɛle dibukii biɛle.<verse eid="PSA 31:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 31:13" />Diekye konu batii kpinwu anwununuu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:13">difu nkpe di kakɔ biala;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:13">bookũ kanwumbe di suoto nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:13">bookpee asi baawo kafɔɔ alɛ babalo mi.<verse eid="PSA 31:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 31:14" />O Saate, kafɔɔ afɔ letika disi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:14">lebuɛ nlɛ, "Afɔ ninle Yaa nii.”<verse eid="PSA 31:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 31:15" />Obe nii nsi di nnɛɛ lɛfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:15">diki mi fakyeko balo nii nnɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:15">ku batii ba nintikankoe ni.<verse eid="PSA 31:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 31:16" />Ta anu lɛfɔ lɛkpa dikpete kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:16">diki mi ta lɛbɔmbɔ lɛfɔ nwu ninaa ni kaloo kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 31:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 31:17" />O Saate, tanta sinunsɔ lakpɛ mi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:17">diekye ntoowi lɛlɛɛ fɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:17">kafɔɔ ta sinunsɔ sikpɛ bakpiletɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:17">baate kloklo di ɔkya kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 31:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 31:18" />Ta sɛlaa ku afunu anyasibi lɛma alo kanana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:18">diekye ku suoto katoo ɔtakatɛsa ku lɛsaa tambu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:18">mankakatɛ lɛkanta kanya di batininitɛ suoto.<verse eid="PSA 31:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 31:19" />Mmle di dibiene lɛfɔ ɔbla lemuɔ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:19">nle fɛɛyɔ fɛɛta ni batii ba ninyɛkɛ fɔ ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:19">nle feediki feetuo ni batii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:19">ba niɛtaniko fɔ ni.<verse eid="PSA 31:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 31:20" />Kasiɛkɔ nwu di anu lɛfɔ feewofasa ma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:20">di batii asibu kpile suoto;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:20">feelolaa ma fakle di kasiɛkɔ lɛfɔ kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:20">di sɛkplalomii se nintɛ ni batii kolo suoto.<verse eid="PSA 31:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 31:21" />Baatansa Saate nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:21">diekye eediki lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ le niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ eetuo mi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:21">di obe wɔ lasiɛ ni di okpoo wɔ di balo ladieko mi nii.<verse eid="PSA 31:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 31:22" />Di difu lapɛ mi nii, labuɛ nlɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:22">"Batɔɔblasa mi di anu lɛfɔ!"</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 31:22">Kafɔɔ faanu mi kaku, faanyɛɛ nyaami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:22">obe wɔ lalɛɛ fɔ nlɛ kyakaakoe nii.<verse eid="PSA 31:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 31:23" />Bibɔmbɔ Saate nwu, aye baklekletɛ nɔɔ bamuu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:23">Saate nwu nnyu banukwaletɛ disi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:23">kafɔɔ anta batii ba nintakatɛsa ni suoto katoo koto osie kanya.<verse eid="PSA 31:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 31:24" />Biwɛ osie, biɛwɛ kafɔɔ otu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 31:24">bamuu lee ba ninkpe ni osuku onyu di Saate nwu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 31:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 31" />
  <chapter number="32" style="c" sid="PSA 32" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 32</para>
  <para style="s1">Sikpile Odiki Obuɛ Ku Ɔyɔ Ɔkyɛ</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu. <char style="tl">maskil.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dite fɛle onu lɛsambi lewo dile</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 32:1" />Suoto siyɔɔ otii wɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:1">bɛɛyɔ ɔtanlolaa ɔbla nɔɔ bɛɛkyɛ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:1">nnwɔ sikpile beetĩi nii.<verse eid="PSA 32:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 32:2" />Suoto siyɔɔ otii wɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:2">sikpile di Saate nwu diebu atɛ nwɔ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:2">ku otii wɔ ninwuna kamɛ di sɛlaa ku afunu diesi ni.<verse eid="PSA 32:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 32:3" />Nse lelo kanana yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:3">akufi nii ninwɛ osie</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:3">ta dii nimu atũnni nii oso.<verse eid="PSA 32:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 32:4" />Diekye kakũ ku kakyɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:4">kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ lawɛ osie di suoto nii;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 32:4">osie nii lawakasɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:4">fɛ kabiene kufĩ kpankpa kamɛ. nsi. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ</char><verse eid="PSA 32:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 32:5" />Ni labuɛ sikpile nii latɔkɔ fɔ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:5">ntatĩtĩi ɔsaabla kpile nii kafɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 32:5">Labuɛ nlɛ, "Kamadiki ɔtanlolaa ɔbla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:5">nii mbuɛ ntɔkɔ Saate nwu"-</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 32:5">ni faayɔ sikpile nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:5">lɛpɔɔ okpi faakyɛ mi nɛ. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ</char><verse eid="PSA 32:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 32:6" />Nioso ta otii biala ninle ni Yaa otii apɛ ɔlaa ata fɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:6">di obe wɔ abanya fɔ ni;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 32:6">nwaako nse ntu kplɛ nwu leyii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:6">alɛ dilaadu nwɔ ni.<verse eid="PSA 32:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 32:7" />Afɔ ninle kawofakɔ nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:7">fabanyu mi di dibuo kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:7">fammana mi fankyi kafɔɔ ku didiki sinu. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ</char><verse eid="PSA 32:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 32:8" />Matuo fɔ asaa, nintuo fɔ kafɔɔ osuku wɔ fabakyɛ ni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:8">kamaka fɔ, nnyu fɔ kafɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 32:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 32:9" />Tante fɛle pɔnkɔ ee bɔkɛɛ wɔ nintuka ni atoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:9">anaa ni lɛsɔnu</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 32:9">kafɔɔ lɛbɔɔsaa ku okũ dikpeni man-yɔ mankpa nwɔ nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:9">nse diele nkpo blɔbakaa fɔ.<verse eid="PSA 32:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 32:10" />Bakpiletɛ dibuo mpɔ kpinwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:10">kafɔɔ Saate nwu lɛbɔmbɔ le ninaa ni kaloo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:10">mmana otii wɔ nintika nwɔ disi.<verse eid="PSA 32:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 32:11" />Binya suoto lɛyɔɔ di Saate nwu kamɛ, biɛpɔ, aye ba ninte ni tinini;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 32:11">aye ba bamuu di situ kamɛ lɛkpa ni, bisa sinu!<verse eid="PSA 32:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 32" />
  <chapter number="33" style="c" sid="PSA 33" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 33</para>
  <para style="s1">Katansa Onu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 33:1" />Aye batininitɛ, bisa suoto lɛyɔɔ sinu bita Saate nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:1">diesiɛko alɛ mba nimbla ni asaa di osuku kanya lɛtansa nwɔ.<verse eid="PSA 33:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 33:2" />Bitansa Saate nwu ku sanku;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:2">biyɔ ekũ lefosi kyitaa bisa sinu bitɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 33:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 33:3" />Bisa onu fɔle bitɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:3">bifɛ sanku nwu ninumbe kanya, biɛfaa ku suoto lɛyɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 33:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 33:4" />Diekye Saate nwu ɔlaa nkpe, nwaako kafɔɔ kule;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:4">anle anukwale di asaa amuu ambla nii.<verse eid="PSA 33:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 33:5" />Saate nwu mbɔmbɔ ɔsaabla tinini ku lɛkakanko biene;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:5">lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ le ninaa ni kaloo leyii kasɔ.<verse eid="PSA 33:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 33:6" />Saate nwu ɔlaa kanya baabla osi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:6">kanya nɔɔ owiidi aayɔ aabla osi asaa.<verse eid="PSA 33:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 33:7" />Ansiisa lekpo ntu nwu di dikuuku<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">33.7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">ansiisa lekpo ntu nwu ambla ditufu</char></note> kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:7">an-yɔ kakyofokɔ nwu antɛ di asaa ntɛkɔ.<verse eid="PSA 33:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 33:8" />Bita kasɔ kamuu kayɛkɛ Saate nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:8">bita batii di kayi kamuu batɔɔ dibu.<verse eid="PSA 33:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 33:9" />Diekye aakakatɛ, ni aadie nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:9">aadiki kanya, ni aayila kpinkpĩ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 33:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 33:10" />Saate nwu nlalaasa nnle asibu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:10">ankpɔkpɔtɔsa nle di batii nwu lɛtɛ ni bɔɔbla ni.<verse eid="PSA 33:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 33:11" />Kafɔɔ Saate disibu nni ninyila kpinkpĩ obe lele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:11">otu nɔɔ dibiesaa nte ninta ana amuu.<verse eid="PSA 33:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 33:12" />Suoto siyɔɔ kale ka di Yaa lɛma ninle ni Saate nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:12">batii ba eediki ɛɛta ni atesaa nɔɔ ole.<verse eid="PSA 33:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 33:13" />Saate nwu nnyu ankyeko osi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:13">aanya batii bamuu;<verse eid="PSA 33:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 33:14" />di kasiɛkɔ nɔɔ aanyu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:14">batii ba bamuu ninsi ni kaasɔ suoto-<verse eid="PSA 33:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 33:15" />nnwɔ niɛbla ni bamuu situ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:15">antofo ni lɛsaa biala bɔɔbla nii.<verse eid="PSA 33:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 33:16" />Ɔka kuonwii ninlenkee ta bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ lɛpɔ oso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:16">kpɛtɛ kuonwii ninfe ta osie kplɛ nɔɔ oso.<verse eid="PSA 33:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 33:17" />Pɔnkɔ diele lɛsalɛsaa ɛɛta didiki osuku onyu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:17">nu akpe osie kplɛ omuu yi, anfuo didiki ɔta.<verse eid="PSA 33:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 33:18" />Kafɔɔ Saate nwu anu ntika di batii ba ninyɛkɛ nwɔ ni suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:18">di batii ba di osuku onyu lɛma nsi ni di lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ le ninaa ni kaloo kamɛ,<verse eid="PSA 33:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 33:19" />alɛ abadiki ma ankyeko kukpi kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:19">anta ma manwɛ nkpa di kɔka obe kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 33:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 33:20" />Busi buonyu osuku munta Saate nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:20">nnwɔɔ ninle kyakaakotɛ loo ku kubidifunsaa loo nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 33:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 33:21" />Nnwɔɔ kamɛ di situ loo nnya suoto lɛyɔɔ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:21">diekye buotika disi di leyooto nɔɔ klekle nwu suoto.<verse eid="PSA 33:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 33:22" />O Saate, ta lɛbɔmbɔ lɛfɔ nwu ninaa ni kaloo ditika wo di suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 33:22">ta mmle buɔyɔ osuku onyu loo buotika ni di suoto lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 33:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 33" />
  <chapter number="34" style="c" sid="PSA 34" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 34</para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa Ɔtansa Di Dibiene Nɔɔ Ɔbla Suoto</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu. Di obe wɔ aakũ aabla ni fɛle fiibuotɛ di Abimelek anu, aatososɔɔ ni, aasifi ni nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 34:1" />Kamatansa Saate nwu obe biala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:1">katansa nɔɔ matika di anyasibi nii obe lele.<verse eid="PSA 34:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 34:2" />Ɔkla nii makanta di Saate nwu kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:2">bita batii ba diobuo ni banu, baanya suoto lɛyɔɔ kafɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 34:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 34:3" />Bitakatɛsa Saate nwu katoo ku ami;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:3">bita busi buɔtakatɛsa leyooto nɔɔ katoo.<verse eid="PSA 34:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 34:4" />Lalɛɛ Saate nwu, ni aatuna mi nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:4">aadiki mi aakyeko lɛyɛkɛ nii nimuu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 34:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 34:5" />Batii ba nintika nwɔ ni disi nle lɛkpa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:5">blɔbakpee anu lɛma kaasɔ ku sinunsɔ diidii.<verse eid="PSA 34:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 34:6" />Piitɛ wɔ mmle lalɛɛ, ni di Saate nwu lanu aatɔɔ nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:6">aadiki nwɔ aakyeko amiina nɔɔ amuu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 34:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 34:7" />Saate nwu tɔkyɛntɛ nkpee kɔba ankyisa mba ninyɛkɛ nwɔ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:7">andiki ma kafɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 34:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 34:8" />Bitɛɛtɛɛ nwɔ bietofo bilɛ Saate nwu nlɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:8">suoto siyɔɔ otii wɔ nintaniko nwɔ ni.<verse eid="PSA 34:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 34:9" />Batii klekle nɔɔ, biyɛkɛ Saate nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:9">diekye lɛsalɛsaa ninfĩ batii ba ninyɛkɛ nwɔ nii.<verse eid="PSA 34:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 34:10" />Kɔka mafuo bakyata oklee mambla kpiɛkpiɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:10">kafɔɔ batii ba ninwolaa ni Saate nwu yi, lɛsaa biene kuninwii ninfĩ ma.<verse eid="PSA 34:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 34:11" />Babi nii, biwa, bikyɔɔ mi atoko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:11">kamatuo ye mmle man-yɛkɛ ni Saate nwu.<verse eid="PSA 34:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 34:12" />Olele lee nimbɔmbɔ nkpa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:12">oomiɛ kafɔɔ alɛ anya ayi biene kpinwu yi,<verse eid="PSA 34:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 34:13" />ni blasa ɔkplalomii lɛfɔ di okpile suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:13">anyasibi lɛfɔ kafɔɔ di sɛlaa ku afunu lɛkakatɛ suoto.<verse eid="PSA 34:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 34:14" />Kpukuti di okpile suoto, faabla dibiene;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:14">wolaa atoko ɔkyɛ ole, faatikanko nwu.<verse eid="PSA 34:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 34:15" />Saate nwu anu ntika di batininitɛ suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:15">atoko nɔɔ kafɔɔ nte kaayi ɛɛta kaku lɛma;<verse eid="PSA 34:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 34:16" />Saate nwu anu n-yɛ di batii ba nimbla ni sikpile suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:16">alɛ ɔɔyɛɛsa ayooto lɛma di kasɔ nwu suoto.<verse eid="PSA 34:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 34:17" />Batininitɛ nwi kaku, Saate nwu nnu anta ma kafɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:17">andiki ma ankyeko amiina lɛma amuu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 34:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 34:18" />Saate nwu lɛtɛɛtɛɛ batii ba di situ lebiɛ ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:18">anfũ kafɔɔ batii ba di anwuna kodie ni.<verse eid="PSA 34:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 34:19" />Otii tinini kafuo osiɛ di amiina kpinwu kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:19">kafɔɔ Saate nwu ndiki nwɔ ankyeko amuu kamɛ;<verse eid="PSA 34:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 34:20" />annyu akufi nɔɔ amuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:20">kuninwii nini dilɔbafee.<verse eid="PSA 34:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 34:21" />Sikpile kamalo bakpiletɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:21">babalo batii tinini bakyiditɛ lɛpɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 34:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 34:22" />Saate nwu ndiki bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 34:22">blɔbalo mba nintaniko nwɔ ni kuonwii lɛpɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 34:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 34" />
  <chapter number="35" style="c" sid="PSA 35" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 35</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Diɛta Ni Lɛkyakaako</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 35:1" />O Saate, dieko mba nikodieko mi ni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:1">kpɛko mba nikɔkpɛko mi ni.<verse eid="PSA 35:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 35:2" />Yɔ kubidifunsaa ku akpakyaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:2">faataka fawa fabafũ mi.<verse eid="PSA 35:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 35:3" />Nanfi lɛkplɔ ku ɔkyɔɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:3">di mba nintikankoe ni suoto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 35:3">Tɔkɔ ɔkla nii falɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:3">"Ami ninle fɔ didiki.”<verse eid="PSA 35:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 35:4" />Ta sinunsɔ sikpɛ mba nintikanko mi ni nkpa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:4">baanunsɔ kafɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 35:4">ta batii ba nikomiɛ mi ni kawɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:4">nnɛɛ difee ma baakple nkpaamaa.<verse eid="PSA 35:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 35:5" />Ta ma bate fɛle sɛsɔ di kɔfɛɛfɔ anu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:5">di Saate nwu tɔkyɛntɛ kotososa ma ansifiko ni;<verse eid="PSA 35:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 35:6" />ta osuku lɛma kuwɔfɔ kuɔkplɔkplɔ kafɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:6">di Saate nwu tɔkyɛntɛ letoso atikanko ma ni.<verse eid="PSA 35:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 35:7" />Diekye bɛɛkyɔɔ mi okũ ninambla ni lɛsalɛsaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:7">beekutu dibiɔ kafɔɔ bɛɛtɛ mi ninambla ni lɛsalɛsaa,<verse eid="PSA 35:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 35:8" />ta kawɔɔ kafua ma-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:8">faata okũ wɔ beewofasa ni kumufũ ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:8">ta ma bakpa babuo di dibiɔ lɛma nwu baawɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 35:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 35:9" />Ni ɔkla nii manya suoto lɛyɔɔ di Saate nwu kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:9">ampɔ kafɔɔ di didiki nɔɔ nwu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 35:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 35:10" />Suoto nii simuu mabuɛ alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:10">"O Saate, owe ninte fɛle afɔ?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 35:10">Afɔ nindiki bapiitɛ fankyeko batii ba ninkpe ni osie balenke ma ni nnɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:10">bapiitɛ ku mba diefĩ ni di mba nintafaa ma ni nnɛɛ.”<verse eid="PSA 35:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 35:11" />Balaatɛ kamaabayilatɛ ntɔɔtaka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:11">bɔɔkaalɛ mi sɛlaa se ninan-ye nwu ni ole kuonwii.<verse eid="PSA 35:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 35:12" />Bɛɛyɔ dikpile bɔɔtɛɛ dibiene koto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:12">beediɛ ɔkla nii kyɛlete kafɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 35:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 35:13" />Kafɔɔ di obe wɔ baatoofiɛ nii, laklee kaku dibula</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:13">lawakosa suoto nii kasɔ kafɔɔ ku kanya onii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 35:13">Nse ɔlaa ɔpɛ nii lekple kuɔwa ɔkyɛ nii kunaanwa kaanya yi,<verse eid="PSA 35:13" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 35:14" />nkyɛ nkyi ntoowi kaku</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:14">fɛ bia siɛwo nii ee obiloo suɔtɔbi kowi nta.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 35:14">Nwakosa disi nii kasɔ ku sɛnyaami</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:14">fɛ bia yaami kowi nta.<verse eid="PSA 35:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 35:15" />Kafɔɔ obe wɔ latuula nii, baasi baanya suoto lɛyɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:15">bakyiditɛ nii lasi kanya di suoto nii di obe wɔ ntatofo nwu ni ole.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:15">Bɔɔkpɔnɔfɔsa mi, monoodiɛ nii.<verse eid="PSA 35:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 35:16" />Bɔɔma nyakatãa fɛle mba ninan-ye ni Yaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:16">boowee anyɛɛ lɛma mankpee mi.<verse eid="PSA 35:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 35:17" />O Saate, ɔmɛmbe fabakyi fannyu mi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:17">Fũ mi nkpa fakyeko amumu lɛma nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:17">nkpa finle nii nwu fakyeko bakyata ba mmle nnɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 35:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 35:18" />Kamapɛ fɔ sɛfa di kasikɔ kplɛ nwu kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:18">di batii dikudi kamɛ kamatansa fɔ.<verse eid="PSA 35:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 35:19" />Tanta mba nikɔnya ni suoto lɛyɔɔ di suoto nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:19">bale ni balo nii, ninambla ni lɛsalɛsaa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 35:19">tanta mba niekyidi mi ni kasakasa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:19">lanyu mi kunu nyakatãa.<verse eid="PSA 35:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 35:20" />Diele atoko ɔkyɛ ole kanya mankakatɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:20">kafɔɔ sɛlaa ku afunu lɛnyabudi suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:20">di batii ba ninsi ni kloklo di kasɔ nwu suoto.<verse eid="PSA 35:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 35:21" />Mambɛ nnya manyu mi tuwĩi mambuɛ alɛ, "Ɛhɛ̃ɛ! ɛhɛ̃ɛ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:21">Butɔɔnya ku anu loo amu.”<verse eid="PSA 35:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 35:22" />O Saate, fatɔɔnya nle mmle; tammaasa kanya.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:22">O Saate, tankyo mi.<verse eid="PSA 35:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 35:23" />Sɛnkɛ, faataka fakpɛ fatɛɛ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:23">Yaa nii ku Saate nii, ka lɛka fatɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 35:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 35:24" />O Saate, Yaa nii, tɛɛ lɛbɛ di ɔsaabla tinini lɛfɔ kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:24">tanta suoto layɔɔ ma di suoto nii.<verse eid="PSA 35:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 35:25" />Tanta baabuɛ alɛ, "Ɛhɛ̃ɛ, nkpo buomiɛ nɛ!"</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:25">ee baabuɛ alɛ, "Butɔɔmɛ nwɔ.”<verse eid="PSA 35:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 35:26" />Ta batii ba bamuu nikɔnya ni suoto lɛyɔɔ di dibuo nii kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:26">sinunsɔ sikpɛ ma, baakpɔkpɔtɔ kafɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 35:26">ta mba ninkanta ni di suoto nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:26">sinunsɔ simana ma sikyi baanunsɔ kafɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 35:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 35:27" />Ta batii ba diɛyɔɔ ni kafutu di lɛbɛ nii ole suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:27">bayiisa suoto lɛyɔɔ kudu, baapɔ kafɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 35:27">ta babuɛ obe lele alɛ, "Batakatɛsa Saate nwu katoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:27">nnwɔ nimiɛ ni kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ lɛ̀lɛ.”<verse eid="PSA 35:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 35:28" />Ɔkplalomii nii makakatɛ di ɔsaabla tinini lɛfɔ suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 35:28">ku katansa lɛfɔ di dii nimu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 35:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 35" />
  <chapter number="36" style="c" sid="PSA 36" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 36</para>
  <para style="s1">Batii Amumu Ole</para>
  <para style="d">Saate nwu kpɛmblatɛ Dawid onu. Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 36:1" />Ɔlaa nsi di otu nii kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:1">di kpiletɛ sikpile ole suoto:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 36:1">Yaa lɛyɛkɛ diele lɛsaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:1">di anu nɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 36:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 36:2" />Diekye antakatɛsa suoto katoo di anu nɔɔ amu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:2">osie kanya alɛ aatofo ee akyidi okpile nɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 36:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 36:3" />Kanya nɔɔ sɛlaa nle amumu ku kakyɔnkyɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:3">atoodiɛ ninumbe ku dibiene ɔbla.<verse eid="PSA 36:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 36:4" />Bia di atensaa nɔɔ suoto antoobu disi kpile;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:4">an-yɔ suoto nɔɔ ankpee di sikpile ole kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:4">annsĩ kafɔɔ lɛsaa le ninle ni dikpilesaa.<verse eid="PSA 36:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 36:5" />O Saate, lɛbɔmbɔ lɛfɔ ndu osi nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:5">onukwale lɛfɔ ndu kolo.<verse eid="PSA 36:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 36:6" />Ɔsaabla tinini lɛfɔ nte fɛle abokote kplɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:6">lɛkanko lɛfɔ fɛle lekpo kakyofolekɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 36:6">O Saate, fanfũ batii ku babɔkɛɛ nkpa.<verse eid="PSA 36:6" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 36:7" />Mmle di lɛbɔmbɔ lɛfɔ le ninaa ni kaloo lefũ ni kɔya!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 36:7">Banɔɔfo ku bibisɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:7">nwɛ katanikokɔ di afoko lɛfɔ oyududu.<verse eid="PSA 36:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 36:8" />Mankonko di leyo lɛfɔ alesaa lɛpɔ nwu suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:8">fanta ma ntu di suoto lɛyɔɔ okle lɛfɔ nwu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 36:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 36:9" />Diekye ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ di nkpa kataakɔ nkpe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:9">di lɛkpa lɛfɔ kamɛ buɔnya lɛkpa.<verse eid="PSA 36:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 36:10" />Ta lɛbɔmbɔ lɛfɔ nwu dikple diwɛ dita mba nin-ye fɔ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:10">ɔsaabla tinini lɛfɔ kuta mba situ kamɛ niɛkpa ni.<verse eid="PSA 36:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 36:11" />Tanta mba nintakatɛsa ni suoto katoo lananafu mi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:11">ee bakpiletɛ kɔnɛɛ kutososa mi.<verse eid="PSA 36:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 36:12" />Nyu mmle di sikpile bablatɛ lɛnɔɔ bate ni-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 36:12">beefuki ma bɛɛtɛ, boloofuo ɔtaka!<verse eid="PSA 36:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 36" />
  <chapter number="37" style="c" sid="PSA 37" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 37</para>
  <para style="s1">Bakpiletɛ Ku Babienetɛ Kalookɔ</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 37:1" />Tanta diabuo fɔ suoto ta batii kpile oso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:1">ee anu lasɛɛ fɔ di mba nikole ni sikpile suoto;<verse eid="PSA 37:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 37:2" />diekye bate fɛle sɛfa, nunua babakyako ɔyɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:2">bate fɛle sɛfa kɔnle, nunua babakpi mansifi.<verse eid="PSA 37:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 37:3" />Tika disi di Saate nwu suoto, faabla kafɔɔ dibiene;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:3">siɛ di kasɔ nwu suoto, fanya suoto lɛyɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 37:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 37:4" />Ta suoto siyɔɔ fɔ di Saate nwu kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:4">ni abata fɔ otu lɛfɔ kamɛ dibiesaa.<verse eid="PSA 37:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 37:5" />Yɔ osuku lɛfɔ fakpee di Saate nwu nnɛɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:5">tika nwɔ disi, ni ababla nle mmle kafɔɔ:<verse eid="PSA 37:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 37:6" />Abata ɔsaabla tinini lɛfɔ nkpa fɛle kolesɛtũ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:6">lɛbɛ lɛfɔ mate fɛle kakũ kufĩ.<verse eid="PSA 37:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 37:7" />Lo kanana di Saate nwu anu, faatɛ suoto fasoko nwɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:7">tanta diabuo fɔ suoto nse asaa kɔlɛ ɔkyɛ anta batii di sisuku lɛma suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:7">nse bɔɔbla nya di asibu kpile lɛma nwu suoto.<verse eid="PSA 37:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 37:8" />Diɛ anu ɔkatu, faadiɛ kafɔɔ ɔblɔ ɔnya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:8">tanta diabuo fɔ suoto- okpile ɔbla kamɛ ko dibakpaa fɔ ninkpee.<verse eid="PSA 37:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 37:9" />Diekye babawɔɔsa batii kpile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:9">kafɔɔ mba nikonyu ni Saate nwu osuku kamale kasɔ nwu atesaa.<verse eid="PSA 37:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 37:10" />Diebu kɛɛkɛɛ ko, bakpiletɛ nwu dilɔbasinwɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:10">kuntɛ foowolaa ma, flɔbasinnya ma.<verse eid="PSA 37:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 37:11" />Kafɔɔ batii buɛɛ kamale kasɔ nwu atesaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:11">mansiɛ di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kplɛ kamɛ kafɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 37:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 37:12" />Bakpiletɛ nkpee asi baawo di batininitɛ suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:12">manwee anyɛɛ lɛma mankpee ma kafɔɔ;<verse eid="PSA 37:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 37:13" />kafɔɔ Saate nwu mma bakpiletɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:13">diekye aye alɛ dii lɛma kɔwa.<verse eid="PSA 37:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 37:14" />Bakpiletɛ nwu nnanfi kapamii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:14">mambonsa kafɔɔ kɔtaa</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 37:14">manwakosa bapiitɛ ku mba diefĩ ni kasɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:14">manlo mba di sisuku lɛma nte ni tinini.<verse eid="PSA 37:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 37:15" />Kafɔɔ mpamii lɛma kamatofo di mma bamu situ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:15">manfefee kafɔɔ ataa lɛma nwu.<verse eid="PSA 37:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 37:16" />Kɛɛkɛɛ wɔ ninkpe ni tininitɛ nlɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:16">dilenke lɛsaawɛ le ninkpe ni bakpiletɛ kpinwu;<verse eid="PSA 37:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 37:17" />diekye babafefe bakpiletɛ osie nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:17">kafɔɔ Saate nwu mmufũ batininitɛ anklee.<verse eid="PSA 37:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 37:18" />Saate nwu n-ye mba ninnaa ni ole kuonwii ayi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:18">atesaa lɛma kafɔɔ kamawɛ dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="PSA 37:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 37:19" />Blɔbayɔɔ di obe kpile kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:19">babawɛ alesaa kpinwu di kɔka ɔkpɛbee kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 37:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 37:20" />Kafɔɔ bakpiletɛ kamawɔɔ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:20">Saate nwu balo kamate fɛle sɛfa bokoboko sɛlɛ di afe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:20">babayɛ-man-yɛ fɛle kɔyɔ.<verse eid="PSA 37:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 37:21" />Bakpiletɛ nfɛnsa asaa kafɔɔ mansinkplesa baata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:21">kafɔɔ batininitɛ nta asaa ku suoto lɛyɔɔ;<verse eid="PSA 37:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 37:22" />batii ba di Saate nwu lewii ni lɛyɔɔ kamale kasɔ nwu atesaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:22">kafɔɔ babawɔɔsa mba ɛɛkpaani nii.<verse eid="PSA 37:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 37:23" />Nse suoto lɛyɔɔ Saate nwu di otii lɛkyɛmbi kamɛ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:23">anta nkpaa nɔɔ nyila kpinkpĩ;<verse eid="PSA 37:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 37:24" />kuntɛ eetuula, ɔlɔbanɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:24">diekye Saate nwu mmufũ nwɔ ku kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 37:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 37:25" />Lale obisɔ kafɔɔ nunua ntoobe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:25">kafɔɔ ninnya diidii alɛ beediɛ tininitɛ nnɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:25">ee babi lɛma kɔnyanyi alesaa.<verse eid="PSA 37:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 37:26" />Manta asaa obe lele, manfɛnsa manta batii kafɔɔ ku otu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:26">babawii babi lɛma lɛyɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 37:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 37:27" />Diɛ sikpile ɔbla, faabla dibiene;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:27">ni fabasiɛ di kasɔ nwu suoto dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="PSA 37:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 37:28" />Diekye Saate nwu mbɔmbɔ ɔlaa wɔ ninte ni nkpo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:28">nioso ɔlɔbadiɛ banukwaletɛ nɔɔ nnɛɛ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 37:28" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 37:28">Babalolaa ma mannyu dinaa ni kaloo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:28">kafɔɔ babawɔɔsa bakpiletɛ babi;<verse eid="PSA 37:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 37:29" />batininitɛ kamale kasɔ nwu atesaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:29">mansiɛ ninka suoto dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="PSA 37:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 37:30" />Otii tinini kanya mbuɛ ninumbe ɔlaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:30">ɔkplalomii nɔɔ kafɔɔ nkakatɛ ɔlaa wɔ ninte ni nkpo.<verse eid="PSA 37:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 37:31" />Yaa nɔɔ kufiofa nwu nsi di otu nɔɔ kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:31">nkpaa nɔɔ ninfɛntɛ.<verse eid="PSA 37:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 37:32" />Bakpiletɛ nte mansoko batininitɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:32">mamiɛ alɛ boolo ma;<verse eid="PSA 37:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 37:33" />kafɔɔ Saate nwu dilɔbadiɛ ma ata osie lɛma nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:33">ee ata ma balo ma lɛpɔɔ nse bɛɛkpaa ma kakankɔ.<verse eid="PSA 37:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 37:34" />Soko Saate nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:34">faakyɛ di osuku nɔɔ kafɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 37:34">Ni abatakatɛsa fɔ katoo anta fanle kasɔ nwu atesaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:34">fabanya nse batɔɔwɔɔsa bakpiletɛ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 37:34" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 37:35" />Ntɔɔnya kpiletɛ ku amumu otii nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:35">ɔɔlɛ ni fɛle kowoso kɔnle di okpoo nikũ kɔtɛ suoto,<verse eid="PSA 37:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 37:36" />kafɔɔ kanunua abafe, ɔlɔbasinwɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:36">kuntɛ lewolaa nwɔ yi, namasinnyɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 37:36" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 37:37" />Tɛ otii wɔ ninaa ni ole kuonwii nsũ, faanyu tininitɛ nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:37">diekye dii kaamaa malɛ ninta atoko ɔkyɛ ole otii nwu.<verse eid="PSA 37:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 37:38" />Kafɔɔ babawɔɔsa bakpileblatɛ bamuu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:38">babawɔɔsa bakpiletɛ dii kaamaa nwu.<verse eid="PSA 37:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 37:39" />Batininitɛ didiki nkye Saate nwu nfũ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:39">nnwɔɔ ninle katanikokɔ di dibuo obe kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 37:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 37:40" />Saate nwu nkyakaako ma, andiki ma kafɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:40">andiki ma ankyeko bakpiletɛ nnɛɛ, anfũ ma nkpa kafɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 37:40">diekye mantaniko nwɔ.<verse eid="PSA 37:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 37" />
  <chapter number="38" style="c" sid="PSA 38" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 38</para>
  <para style="s1">Otii Wɔ Diobuo Ni Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu. Ɔlaa ɔyɔ ɔtɛ di anu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 38:1" />O Saate, tansĩ ɔlaa faatɛɛ di ɔblɔ lɛfɔ kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:1">ee faananfi mi kootoko di lɛblɔfiɛ lɛfɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 38:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 38:2" />Diekye kɔtaa lɛfɔ ntootofo mi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:2">kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ kafɔɔ ntoosoo kutika mi di suoto.<verse eid="PSA 38:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 38:3" />Ta lɛblɔfiɛ lɛfɔ oso, suoto osie nsinnaa mi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:3">akufi nii nnaa osiɛ ta sikpile nii oso.<verse eid="PSA 38:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 38:4" />Sikpile nii nlenke mi nnɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:4">fɛle atoo ya niesii ni onutũ ku otuka.<verse eid="PSA 38:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 38:5" />Nkɔ nii ntoobuu diokpete</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:5">ta sibuu nii sikpile oso.<verse eid="PSA 38:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 38:6" />Bɛɛwakosa mi kasɔ bɛɛtɛ mi kafɔɔ kaasɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:6">nkyɛ kowi nkyi dii kufĩ kumu.<verse eid="PSA 38:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 38:7" />Kamaa nii lefila ku ninyinyi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:7">osie kuonwii diesinsi di suoto nii kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 38:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 38:8" />Ɔnyɛɛ ntooloo mi, ntoobibiɛ kafɔɔ wɔkyɔwɔkyɔ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:8">ntuuni ta dibuo di otu nii kamɛ oso.<verse eid="PSA 38:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 38:9" />O Saate, abiesaa nii amuu nte temple di anu lɛfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:9">atuunii nii diele fɔ lewofasaa.<verse eid="PSA 38:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 38:10" />Otu nii kɔpɛ, ɔnyɛɛ koloo mi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:10">bia anu nii dilosinya nwaa.<verse eid="PSA 38:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 38:11" />Basiɛwo nii ku baklopo nii ntoosĩ mi ta nkɔ nii oso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:11">bawo nii nfɛ nsi fanfa.<verse eid="PSA 38:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 38:12" />Mba nkomiɛ ni kukpi nii lɛkyɔɔ sikũ lɛma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:12">mba nimabla mi ni dikpile nkakatɛ di kawɔɔ nii suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:12">bookũ kakyɔnkyɔ kanwumbe dii kufĩ kumu.<verse eid="PSA 38:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 38:13" />Nte fɛle tokotĩitɛ wɔ ninoonu nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:13">fɛle omumu wɔ ninoofuo ni kanya nɔɔ ɔbɛ;<verse eid="PSA 38:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 38:14" />Ntookple fɛle otii wɔ ninannu nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:14">nnwɔ kanya ninanfuo ni ɔlaa kanya odiki.<verse eid="PSA 38:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 38:15" />O Saate, nsoko fɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:15">O Saate Yaa nii kamatuna.<verse eid="PSA 38:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 38:16" />Diekye labuɛ nlɛ, "Tanta suoto layɔɔ ma</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 38:16">ee baatakatɛsa suoto lɛma katoo di suoto nii nse kɔkpaa nii lɛfɛntɛ.”<verse eid="PSA 38:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 38:17" />Diekye nfɛ komiɛ ɔnɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:17">ninyinyi nii kafɔɔ lekple dikle mi.<verse eid="PSA 38:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 38:18" />Ntoodiki ɔtanlolaa ɔbla nii lebuɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:18">okpile nii ɔbla lebuo mi suoto.<verse eid="PSA 38:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 38:19" />Mba ninle ni balo nii siene mpɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:19">batii ba niekyidi mi ni kasakasa leloolo.<verse eid="PSA 38:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 38:20" />Mba niɛyɔ dikpile bɛɛtɛɛ ni dibiene nii koto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:20">mbudi mi kanya nse ntikanko dibiene osuku.<verse eid="PSA 38:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 38:21" />O Saate, tandiɛ mi nnɛɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:21">O Yaa nii, tankyo mi.<verse eid="PSA 38:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 38:22" />Wa wla fabakyakaako mi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 38:22">O Saate, Dikitɛ nii.<verse eid="PSA 38:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 38" />
  <chapter number="39" style="c" sid="PSA 39" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 39</para>
  <para style="s1">Otii Wɔ Diobuo Ni Sikpile Odiki Obuɛ</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu. Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ. Yedutum onu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 39:1" />Labuɛ nlɛ, "Kamanyu sisuku nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:1">mblasa ɔkplalomii nii kafɔɔ di okpile suoto;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 39:1">kamakpee klɔklɔ di kanya nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:1">di obe wɔ di bakpiletɛ nwu n-yɛ ni di anu nii.”<verse eid="PSA 39:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 39:2" />Kafɔɔ di obe wɔ lalokanana lasiɛ ni kloklo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:2">ntatoobuɛ ni bia ɔlaa biene kuonwii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:2">dibuo nii lataka katoo.<verse eid="PSA 39:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 39:3" />Otu nii lafila kaamɛ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:3">obe wɔ kobu nwu ni disi kafɔɔ, nkpo di ɔtɔ nwu kofiɛ nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:3">ninfɛ lakakatɛ ku ɔkplalomii nii nlɛ:<verse eid="PSA 39:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 39:4" />"O Saate, tuo mi nkpa nii kalookɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:4">ku ayi nii lɛpɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:4">faatɛɛ ntofo mmle di nkpa nii lɛbla ni kakuu.<verse eid="PSA 39:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 39:5" />Fɛɛbla ayi nii fɛ kɔnɛɛtakala lɛblɛfɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:5">alɛɛ nii lɛpɔ diele lɛsalɛsaa di anu lɛfɔ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:5">Otii biala nkpa nte fɛle owiidi. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ</char><verse eid="PSA 39:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 39:6" />Otii kunyii ko ale akyɛ oofe ankple ni:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:6">Akyɛ oofenfe, kafɔɔ kasakasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:6">ansiisa lɛsaawɛ antɛ, anan-ye owe nimawɛ nya nii.<verse eid="PSA 39:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 39:7" />"Kafɔɔ nunua, Saate, be nfɛ ninnyu osuku nta?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:7">Osuku onyu nii nsi di kamɛ lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 39:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 39:8" />Diki mi fakyeko ɔtanlolaa ɔbla nii omuu kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:8">tantɛɛ lakple lɛmansaa lata mba ninan-ye ni lɛsaa.<verse eid="PSA 39:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 39:9" />Lalokanana; namabɛ kanya nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:9">diekye afɔ ninle nwɔ niɛbla ni nle mmle.<verse eid="PSA 39:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 39:10" />Tekete dibuo lɛfɔ nwu di suoto nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:10">lɛkɔlɛkɔlɛ lɛfɔ nwu ntoolenkee mi nnɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 39:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 39:11" />Fansĩ ɔlaa, fannaanfi kafɔɔ batii kootoko ta sikpile lɛma oso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:11">fanlalasa lɛsaawɛ lɛma fɛle dikudikudi-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:11">kafɔɔ owiidi di otii biala nle. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ</char><verse eid="PSA 39:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 39:12" />"O Saate, nu ɔlaa ɔpɛ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:12">kyɔɔ kaku owi nii atoko diɛta ni lɛkyakaako;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:12">tanle tokotĩitɛ di owi nii suoto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 39:12">Diekye nsi ku afɔ fɛ ɔfɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:12">ɔfɔɔ, fɛ mmle di bate nii bamuu lale nii.<verse eid="PSA 39:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 39:13" />Kyisa anu di suoto nii, alɛ kakple nwɛ suoto lɛyɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 39:13">fiɛ ninsifi alɛ nsinnaa ni kafɔɔ.”<verse eid="PSA 39:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 39" />
  <chapter number="40" style="c" sid="PSA 40" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 40</para>
  <para style="s1">Katansa Onu</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu. Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 40:1" />Latɛ suoto lasoko Saate nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:1">aakyi aanyu mi, ni aanu kaku nii kafɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 40:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 40:2" />Aadiki mi aakyeko dibiɔ kplɔkplɔ kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:2">aakyeko apatapata ku dibuo kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:2">aayɔ nkpaa nii aase di difuɔnkpaa suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:2">aatɛɛ kafɔɔ lɛba nwaa layila.<verse eid="PSA 40:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 40:3" />Aayɔ onu fɔle aakpee di kanya nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:3">Yaa loo katansa onu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:3">Batii kpinwu kamanya manyɛkɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:3">man-yɔ anu lɛma mantika di Saate nwu suoto.<verse eid="PSA 40:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 40:4" />Suoto siyɔɔ otii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:4">wɔ niɛyɔ Saate nwu ɛɛbla ni anu ditikasaa nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:4">anantikanko ni mba nintakatɛsa ni suoto katoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:4">mamunikĩi mansifi ni balaatɛ afiɔ nfũ.<verse eid="PSA 40:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 40:5" />O Saate, Yaa nii, asaa kpinwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:5">ninle n-ya niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ fɛɛbla nii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:5">Asaa ya fɛɛbla fɛɛta wo nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:5">kuonwii dilaafuo nya ɔka ɔta fɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:5">nse nlɛ kɔkakatɛ ndiki nya mbuɛ kafɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:5">abasii ɔpɔ kabuɛ nii.<verse eid="PSA 40:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 40:6" />Fammbɔmbɔ oleɔta ku asaaɔta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:6">kafɔɔ feetikiti mi atoko;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:6">floomiɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:6">ofiɛ asaaɔta ku sikpile asaaɔta.<verse eid="PSA 40:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 40:7" />Ninfɛ labuɛ nlɛ, "Nyɛɛ, ntɔɔwa-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:7">bɛɛkpana beekyeko suoto nii di kukũ nwu kamɛ alɛ,<verse eid="PSA 40:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 40:8" />O Yaa nii, komiɛ nlɛ mbla dibiesaa lɛfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:8">kufiofa lɛfɔ nsi di otu nii kamɛ.”<verse eid="PSA 40:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 40:9" />N-yie ɔsaabla tinini lɛkya di kasiisakɔ kplɛ nwu kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:9">nimmaasa anyasibi nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:9">O Saate, fɛ mmle faye nii.<verse eid="PSA 40:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 40:10" />Ninwofasa ɔsaabla tinini lɛfɔ di otu nii kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:10">nkakatɛ di onukwale ku didiki lɛfɔ suoto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:10">Nin-yɔ lɛbɔmbɔ ku onukwale lɛfɔ nkookaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:10">kasiisakɔ kplɛ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 40:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 40:11" />O Saate, tansĩ mi nyaami lɛfɔ ɔnya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:11">ta lɛbɔmbɔ lɛfɔ ku onukwale lɛfɔ anyu mi obe lele.<verse eid="PSA 40:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 40:12" />Diekye sɛlaa se ninɔmafuo ni ɔka lɛmana mi siekyi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:12">sikpile nii ntoolenkee mi nnɛɛ, nioso noosinya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:12">Sipɔ silenke disi nii sinwini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:12">otu nii kafɔɔ kɔkpa kaamɛ nii.<verse eid="PSA 40:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 40:13" />O Saate, lekoto diki mi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:13">O Saate, wa wla fabakyakako mi.<verse eid="PSA 40:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 40:14" />Ta bakpee batii ba bamuu nikomiɛ alɛ boolo mi ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:14">sinunsɔ, baakpɔkpɔtɔ kafɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:14">ta mba bamuu nikomiɛ mi ni kawɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:14">bakple nkpaamaa ku sinunsɔ.<verse eid="PSA 40:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 40:15" />Ta mba nimbuɛ matɔkɔ mi ni alɛ, "Ɛhɛ̃ɛ! Ɛhɛ̃ɛ!"</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:15">nnɛɛ difee ma ta sinunsɔ lɛma simu oso.<verse eid="PSA 40:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 40:16" />Kafɔɔ ta mba ninwolaa fɔ ni bamuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:16">banya suoto lɛyɔɔ, baapɔ di kamɛ lɛfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:16">ta mba nimbɔmbɔ ni didiki lɛfɔ babuɛ obe lele alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:16">"Batakatɛsa Saate nwu katoo!"<verse eid="PSA 40:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 40:17" />Kafɔɔ ami diefĩ mi, dipii kafɔɔ nkle mi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:17">ta Saate nwu abu disi di suoto nii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 40:17">Afɔ ninle kyakaakotɛ nii ku dikitɛ nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 40:17">O Yaa nii, tankyɛkyɛlɛ.<verse eid="PSA 40:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 40" />
  <chapter number="41" style="c" sid="PSA 41" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 41</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Di Ɔfiɛ Kamɛ</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu. Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 41:1" />Suoto siyɔɔ otii wɔ niɛyɔ nwu ni ole di bapiitɛ suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:1">Saate nwu ndiki nwɔ di dibuo obe kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 41:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 41:2" />Saate nwu makpee kɔba ankyisa nwɔ annyu nkpa nɔɔ disi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:2">abawii nwɔ lɛyɔɔ di kasɔ nwu suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:2">ɔlɔbadiɛ nwɔ ata bakyiditɛ nɔɔ dibiesaa.<verse eid="PSA 41:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 41:3" />Saate nwu makpee nwɔ osie di ofiɛ atensaa nɔɔ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:3">anyɔɔsa nwɔ ofiɛ di ofiɛ ɔkla nɔɔ suoto.<verse eid="PSA 41:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 41:4" />Labuɛ nlɛ, "O Saate, nyɛɛ nyaami;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:4">yɔɔsɛɛ ofiɛ, diekye lɛbla okpile di suoto lɛfɔ.”<verse eid="PSA 41:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 41:5" />Balo nii kubuɛ sɛlaa kpile di suoto nii alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:5">"Ɔmɛmbe abakpi di leyooto nɔɔ n-wɔɔ?"<verse eid="PSA 41:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 41:6" />Nse otii owo lɛwa ɛɛbanyɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:6">ankakatɛ di sɛlaa ku afunu kanya, ansiisa kafɔɔ sɛlaa kpile di otu nɔɔ kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:6">nse atoodie eesifi, ɛɛkyɛ oobuɛ nwu ankyakasa.<verse eid="PSA 41:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 41:7" />Balo nii bamuu n-si manwununuu di suoto nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:7">boomiɛ dikpile mantɛɛ, mambuɛ alɛ,<verse eid="PSA 41:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 41:8" />"Ofiɛ kpile ntoomufũ nwɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:8">ɔlɔbasintaka diidii di lɛbale ate nii.”<verse eid="PSA 41:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 41:9" />Bia siɛwo nii nwaa, nnwɔ letika ni disi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:9">munko nnwɔ nikole munta ni baawo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:9">ntɔɔtaka ayɛ mi di suoto.<verse eid="PSA 41:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 41:10" />O Saate, kafɔɔ afɔ nyɛɛ nyaami;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:10">takatɛsa mi, alɛ kata ma koto.<verse eid="PSA 41:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 41:11" />N-ye nlɛ kobuo fɔ anu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:11">diekye lo nii dielenkee mi.<verse eid="PSA 41:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 41:12" />Di ɔsaabla nii di osuku kanya fɛɛkyakaako mi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:12">ni fɛɛyɔ mi feese di anu lɛfɔ dinaa ni kaloo nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 41:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 41:13" />Katansa ninle Saate nwu, Israel batii Yaa lele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 41:13">diɛyɔ ni di nua diesifi ni dinaa ni kaloo.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 41:13">Diwa kaanya diekple diwa kaanya.<verse eid="PSA 41:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 41" />
  <chapter number="42" style="c" sid="PSA 42" />
  <para style="ms1">Kukũ Nyɔɔfa</para>
  <para style="mr">Sinu 42–72</para>
  <para style="cl">Onu 42</para>
  <para style="s1">Otii Onwii Di Sɛlanle Kamɛ Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ</para>
  <para style="d">Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ. <char style="tl">maskil</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dite fɛle onu lɛsambi lewo dile</char></note> Kuɔta ni Kora Babisuɔtɔbi.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 42:1" />Fɛ mmle di kafɛ mmiɛ ni seklenyii ntu yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:1">O Yaa, nkpo di ɔkla nii komiɛ fɔ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 42:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 42:2" />Yaa otukɔnsɔ nkle ɔkla nii, di Yaa wɔ ninkpe ni nkpa suoto.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:2">Ɔmɛmbe kamakyɛ naakyaka ku Yaa?<verse eid="PSA 42:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 42:3" />Nnumɛɛ nii ninle mi alesaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:3">kakũ ku kakyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 42:3">obe wɔ di batii kɔkaalɛ mi dii kufĩ kumu alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:3">"Ɔfɛ di Yaa lɛfɔ nkpe?"<verse eid="PSA 42:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 42:4" />Nnyuma asaa ya mmle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:4">nse lebuo di suoto nii kamɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 42:4">mmle ninkyɛ ni ku dikudi nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:4">nleko ma ni katũ munkyɛ ni Yaa leyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 42:4">ku suoto lɛyɔɔ afafa ku sɛfa ɔpɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:4">di dikudi nwu dii ole kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 42:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 42:5" />O ɔkla nii, be oso feebuo sɛnyaami nkpo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:5">Be oso fɛɛkpɔkpɔtɔ kaamɛ nii nkpo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 42:5">Yɔ osuku onyu lɛfɔ fatika di Yaa suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:5">diekye kamakple ntansa nwɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:5">Dikitɛ nii ku <verse eid="PSA 42:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 42:6" />Yaa nii.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 42:6" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 42:6">Ɔkla nii lebuo sɛnyaami kaamɛ nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:6">nioso kamanyuma fɔ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 42:6">di Yordan kasɔ nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:6">Hermon katakalekɔ nwu- di Misa Kobokote.<verse eid="PSA 42:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 42:7" />Kakyofo di nkyofokɔ nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:7">fanta ntu lɛfɔ ndie ku sɛlɔ di n-yefekɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 42:7">ntu ɔpɛ lɛfɔ ku afuuta amuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:7">ntɔɔfɛ eetĩi mi.<verse eid="PSA 42:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 42:8" />Saate nwu ntuo lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ ku kakũ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:8">nsa onu nɔɔ ku kakyɛ-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:8">ɔlaa ɔpɛ ɔta Yaa wɔ ninle mi ni nkpa.<verse eid="PSA 42:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 42:9" />Nkaalɛ Yaa, Difuɔnkpaa nii nlɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:9">"Be oso fatooyee mi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 42:9">Be oso kakyɛ nkyi ntoowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:9">lo nwu ntoonyinka mi?"<verse eid="PSA 42:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 42:10" />Akufi nii konu suoto dibuo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:10">ta mmle di bakyiditɛ nii kɔma mi ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 42:10">mankaalɛ mi ni dii kufĩ kumu alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:10">"Ɔfɛ di Yaa lɛfɔ nwu nkpe?"<verse eid="PSA 42:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 42:11" />O ɔkla nii, be oso feebuo sɛnyaami nkpo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:11">Be oso fɛɛkpɔkpɔtɔ kaamɛ nii nkpo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 42:11">Yɔ osuku onyu lɛfɔ fatika di Yaa suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:11">diekye kamakple ntansa nwɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 42:11">Dikitɛ nii ku Yaa nii.<verse eid="PSA 42:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 42" />
  <chapter number="43" style="c" sid="PSA 43" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 43</para>
  <para style="s1">Otii Onwii Di Sɛlanle Kamɛ Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ</para>
  <para style="r">(Onu 42 sitũ ɔkyɛ)</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 43:1" />O Yaa, tɛɛ lɛbɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:1">faabuɛ ɔlaa nii kafɔɔ fatɛɛ di kale ka ninambu ni Yaa nfũ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:1">diki mi di balaatɛ ku bakpiletɛ nnɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 43:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 43:2" />Afɔ ninle Yaa kamaa kakpɛkɔ nii.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:2">Obe oso fatoosĩ mi?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 43:2">Obe oso kakyɛ nkyi ntoowi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:2">lo nwu ntoonyinka mi?<verse eid="PSA 43:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 43:3" />Kyesee lɛkpa lɛfɔ ku onukwale lɛfɔ nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:3">faata nya aleko mi katũ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 43:3">faata nya akpaa mi awako kobokote klekle lɛfɔ nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:3">di lɛba le fasi ni.<verse eid="PSA 43:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 43:4" />Ni kamakyɛ Yaa oleɔta akyikye katũ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:4">di Yaa, lɛpɔ̀ nii ku suoto lɛyɔɔ nii nfũ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 43:4">Matansa fɔ ku sanku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:4">O Yaa, Yaa nii.<verse eid="PSA 43:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 43:5" />O ɔkla nii, be oso feebuo sɛnyaami nkpo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:5">Be oso fɛɛkpɔkpɔtɔ kaamɛ nii nkpo?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 43:5">Yɔ osuku onyu lɛfɔ fatika di Yaa suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:5">diekye kamakple ntansa nwɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 43:5">Dikitɛ nii ku Yaa nii.<verse eid="PSA 43:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 43" />
  <chapter number="44" style="c" sid="PSA 44" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 44</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Diɛta Ni Otii Suoto Onyu</para>
  <para style="d">Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ. <char style="tl">Maskil</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dite fɛle onu lɛsambi lewo dile</char></note> Kuɔta ni Kora Babisuɔtɔbi.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 44:1" />O Yaa, butoonu ku atoko loo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:1">bate loo ntɔɔtɔkɔ wo</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 44:1">nle faabla ni di obe lɛma kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:1">di obe wɔ nitɔbafe ni kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 44:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 44:2" />Ku nnɛɛ lɛfɔ faatososa nnle nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:2">ni faata bate loo lasiɛ nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 44:2">faata diabuo batii nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:2">ni faata bate loo lɛlɛ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 44:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 44:3" />Ditale kapamii lɛma baayɔ baafũ kasɔ nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:3">ee kɔnɛɛ lɛma niata ma lelenkee;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 44:3">koletanɛɛ lɛfɔ nwu, kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:3">ku anu lɛfɔ lɛkpa nwu, diekye faabɔmbɔ ma.<verse eid="PSA 44:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 44:4" />Afɔ ninle Ɔka nii ku Yaa nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:4">nnwɔ ninta ni Yakob lelenkee nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 44:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 44:5" />Diefe ni di suoto lɛfɔ muntukusa balo loo munsifiko sɛmaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:5">diefe ni di leyooto lɛfɔ kamɛ munanafu bakyiditɛ loo.<verse eid="PSA 44:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 44:6" />Nintika disi nii di kɔtaa nii suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:6">kapamii nii nintɛɛ lelenkee;<verse eid="PSA 44:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 44:7" />kafɔɔ afɔ nieta wo lelenkee di balo loo suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:7">fɛɛta sinunsɔ lɛkpɛ bakyiditɛ loo.<verse eid="PSA 44:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 44:8" />Di Yaa kamɛ munkanta dii kufĩ kumu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:8">nioso bubatansa leyooto lɛfɔ dinaa ni kaloo. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ</char><verse eid="PSA 44:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 44:9" />Kafɔɔ kanunua fatoosĩ wo fɛɛtɛ wo kaasɔ kafɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:9">flosindie ku bakpɛtɛ loo.<verse eid="PSA 44:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 44:10" />Faata wo buakple nkpaamaa di lo nwu anu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:10">ni di bakyiditɛ loo labayɔ wo asaa nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 44:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 44:11" />Faayɔ wo faata falɛ bawee fɛle bafoso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:11">faasamisa wo kafɔɔ faakpee di nnle nwu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 44:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 44:12" />Faasunsũ batii lɛfɔ faafũ koto kafui,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:12">fatawɛ ni lɛsalɛsaa di osunsũ lɛma nwu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 44:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 44:13" />Fatɔɔta wo buokple ninunsɔsaa buɔta bawo loo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:13">lɛmansaa ku ditufa buɔta batii ba niɛmana wo beekyi nii.<verse eid="PSA 44:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 44:14" />Fatɔɔta wo buɔbla okyonsanu di nnle nwu kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:14">batii nwu ntũkunsa asi lɛma mankpee wo.<verse eid="PSA 44:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 44:15" />Sinunsɔ nii nte di anu nii dii kufĩ kumu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:15">anu nii kafɔɔ letĩi ku sinunsɔ<verse eid="PSA 44:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 44:16" />di mba niekyidi mi ni atufa ku ditiikpɔnɔfɔsa suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:16">ta lo nwu di ninu lɛsɛɛ alɛ ɔɔbla ankyisa ni oso.<verse eid="PSA 44:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 44:17" />N-ya mmle amuu lawa wo di suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:17">nu butayee fɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:17">ee busĩ kanya ninii lɛfɔ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 44:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 44:18" />Situ loo diikple nkpaamaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:18">nkpaa loo diidiɛ ɔkyɛ di osuku lɛfɔ suoto.<verse eid="PSA 44:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 44:19" />Kafɔɔ faananfi wo kootoko ni faata wo buabla sina buata lepoo kamɛ baweewee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:19">faayɔ kafɔɔ ditunu tunutunu faatĩi wo.<verse eid="PSA 44:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 44:20" />Nse fɛ mun-yee Yaa loo leyooto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:20">ee munse nnɛɛ loo munta bafɔɔ afiɔ,<verse eid="PSA 44:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 44:21" />sɛɛ Yaa ditaatofo nwu ole,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:21">diekye aaye otu kamɛ awofasaa?<verse eid="PSA 44:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 44:22" />Kafɔɔ ta afɔ oso kukpi kɔkyɔɔ wo anu dii kufĩ kumu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:22">bɔɔnya wo fɛ bafoso babalo nii.<verse eid="PSA 44:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 44:23" />O Saate, sɛnkɛ! Obe oso fɔɔkyɔsĩi?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:23">Taka! Tansĩ wo diidii.<verse eid="PSA 44:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 44:24" />Obe oso foowofasa anu lɛfɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:24">fan-yee kafɔɔ dibuo loo ku amumu ya bɔɔbla wo ni?<verse eid="PSA 44:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 44:25" />Batɔɔtɛ wo kaasɔ di kudu kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:25">suoto loo ntɔɔka kaasɔ.<verse eid="PSA 44:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 44:26" />Taka faakyakaako wo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 44:26">diki wo ta lɛbɔmbɔ lɛfɔ le ninaa ni kaloo oso.<verse eid="PSA 44:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 44" />
  <chapter number="45" style="c" sid="PSA 45" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 45</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔka Leyo Kamɛ Ɔsanko Ɔyɔ Onu</para>
  <para style="d">Ɔsanko ɔyɔ onu. Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ. Basa nwu di "Lilie" sɛlɔ kanya. <char style="tl">maskil</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dite fɛle onu lɛsambi lewo dile</char></note> Kuɔta ni Kora Babisuɔtɔbi.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 45:1" />Otu nii leyii ku sɛlaa biene</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:1">di mmle kobuɛ sĩ nta ni ɔka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:1">ɔkplalomii nii ninle kpanatɛ nwaa kakpanawesee.<verse eid="PSA 45:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 45:2" />Afɔ niɛtɛ fale ɔnwaa di batii kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:2">bɛɛpɛ anyasibi lɛfɔ kafɔɔ ɔfɔɔ ku sibualɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:2">diekye Yaa ntoowii fɔ lɛyɔɔ dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="PSA 45:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 45:3" />O afɔ wɔ nilenke ni, minisa kapamii lɛfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:3">faakpee akasaa lɛfɔ ku leklekle di sɛka kanya.<verse eid="PSA 45:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 45:4" />Di sɛka lɛfɔ kanya die fabafe di lelenkee kanya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:4">di onukwale ku suoto kasɔ ɔwakosa ku ɔsaabla tinini kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:4">ta koletanɛɛ lɛfɔ kudiki ablasaa ya niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ kutuo.<verse eid="PSA 45:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 45:5" />Ta kɔtaa lɛfɔ blɛblɛ nwu atofo ɔka balo siitu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:5">ta nnle nwu dinɔɔ di nkpaatũ lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 45:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 45:6" />O Yaa, lɛkakpomii lɛfɔ mate dinaa ni kaloo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:6">lɛkanko biene kayofo nimale sɛka kalekɔ lɛfɔ kayofo.<verse eid="PSA 45:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 45:7" />Fambɔmbɔ ɔsaabla tinini, feekyidi amumu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:7">nioso Yaa, Yaa lɛfɔ ntɔɔtakatɛsa fɔ katoo falenke baklopo lɛfɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:7">ɛɛpɛ fɔ ɔfɔɔ ku suoto lɛyɔɔ nnɔnyi.<verse eid="PSA 45:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 45:8" />Awukyɔ lɛfɔ amuu kɔpɛɔkɔnɔ ku olufuii ku pɛplɛ ku kloboo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:8">diɛ baka ayo bɛɛyɔ bato anyɛɛ beelolaa nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:8">di basanku sinu nta fɔ ni suoto lɛyɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 45:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 45:9" />Baka babisankobi nsi di dibu basanko lɛfɔ kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:9">ɔka ɔsɔfɔ lenyukũ Ofir koto sɛɛle asaa asi di oletanɛɛkyɛ lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 45:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 45:10" />O obisankobi, kyɔɔ kotoko faanu, faabu nwu disi:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:10">Diɛ batii lɛfɔ ku teefɔ leyo fatɛ.<verse eid="PSA 45:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 45:11" />Sekpeele lɛfɔ labuo ɔka nwu anu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:11">yɔ dibu fatɔɔ, diekye saate lɛfɔ ale.<verse eid="PSA 45:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 45:12" />Tiro Babisankobi kamawa ku akyɛsaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:12">basaawɛntɛ kamamiɛ sibualɛ lɛfɔ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 45:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 45:13" />Dibu nimuu ninle ɔka obisankobi di leyo nɔɔ kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:13">koto sɛɛle bɛɛyɔ beeloso akpeele nɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 45:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 45:14" />Eekpee akpeele ya bɛɛkaa asaa bɛɛkakaasa ni bɔɔkpaa nwɔ mankyɛnko ɔka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:14">kubitɛ wo nɔɔ ko ninan-ye ni basuɔtɔ ntikanko nwɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:14">bɔɔkpaa nwɔ manwako fɔ.<verse eid="PSA 45:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 45:15" />Baayɔ suoto lɛyɔɔ ku lɛpɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:15">baabuo ɔka leyo.<verse eid="PSA 45:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 45:16" />Babisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ kamasiɛ di bate lɛfɔ kasiɛkɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:16">fababla ma banɔɔfotii di kasɔ kamuu suoto.<verse eid="PSA 45:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 45:17" />Kamata leyooto lɛfɔ nte ninta ana amuu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 45:17">nioso nnle nwu kamatansa fɔ dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="PSA 45:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 45" />
  <chapter number="46" style="c" sid="PSA 46" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 46</para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa Nsiko Wo</para>
  <para style="d">Onu. Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ. Basa nwu di <char style="tl">alamot</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dite fɛle onu lɛsambi lewo dile</char></note>sɛlɔ kanya. Kuɔta ni Kora Babisuɔtɔbi.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 46:1" />Yaa ninle katanikokɔ ku osie loo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:1">akpe ankyakaako ni di dibuo obe kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 46:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 46:2" />Nioso bulɔbayɛkɛ, kuntɛ kasɔ letũkũ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:2">di abokote kafɔɔ lewisi eebuo di lɛkpo ntɛɛntɛɛ,<verse eid="PSA 46:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 46:3" />kuntɛ ntu nimi kɔpɛ ku afuuta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:3">di abokote kafɔɔ letũkũ ku osie lɛnya. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ</char><verse eid="PSA 46:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 46:4" />Okle onwii nkpe di koklenyii nɔɔ nta ni Yaa okpoo kplɛ nwu suoto lɛyɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:4">kakleklekɔ nwu nfũ di Nnwɔ Niɛtaka Katoo Alenke ni nsi ni.<verse eid="PSA 46:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 46:5" />Yaa nsi nwɔ kaamɛ, ɔlɔbatũkũ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:5">Yaa makyakaako nwɔ ku kolɛsɛtũ.<verse eid="PSA 46:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 46:6" />Nnle nsi di difu kamɛ, sɛka nlekɔ kobiɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:6">antakatɛsa sɛlɔ nɔɔ katoo, kasɔ nnyanakĩi.<verse eid="PSA 46:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 46:7" />Saate wɔ Ninlenke ni nsiko wo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:7">Yakob Yaa nwu ninle wo kɔba. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ </char><verse eid="PSA 46:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 46:8" />Biwa biɛbanyu Saate nwu sɛsaabla,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:8">kawɔɔ ka atɔɔwako ni kaasɔ nwu suoto.<verse eid="PSA 46:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 46:9" />Anta mandiɛ nkpɛ ninaadu kasɔ nwu nyɛntɛlekɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:9">anfefee ataa, anlalaasa kafɔɔ akplɔ nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:9">anfiɛ kafɔɔ kubiafunsaa nwu ku ɔtɔ.<verse eid="PSA 46:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 46:10" />"Bisiɛ kloklo, bietofo kafɔɔ bilɛ ami ninle Yaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:10">babatakatɛsa mi katoo di nnle nwu kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:10">babatakatɛsa mi katoo di kasɔ nwu suoto.”<verse eid="PSA 46:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 46:11" />Saate wɔ Ninlenke ni nsiko wo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 46:11">Yakob Yaa nwu ninle wo kɔba. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ</char><verse eid="PSA 46:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 46" />
  <chapter number="47" style="c" sid="PSA 47" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 47</para>
  <para style="s1">Tunletɛ Kplɛ Nwu</para>
  <para style="d">Onu. Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ. Kora Babisuɔtɔbi onu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 47:1" />Aye nnle mmuu, bipɛ anɛɛkya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:1">bifafaa ku suoto lɛyɔɔ sinu bita Yaa.<verse eid="PSA 47:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 47:2" />Mmle di lɛyɛkɛ nsi ni di Saate wɔ Niɛtaka Katoo Alenke ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:2">ɔka kplɛ nwu di kasɔ kamuu suoto!<verse eid="PSA 47:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 47:3" />Aawakosa nnle kasɔ aakpee wo kaalɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:3">batii ba ninsi ni di nkpaa loo kalɔ.<verse eid="PSA 47:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 47:4" />Aadiki atesaa loo aata wo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:4">ale ni Yakob wɔ aabɔmbɔ ni lɛkantasaa.<char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ</char><verse eid="PSA 47:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 47:5" />Yaa ntoosifi osi ku suoto lɛyɔɔ kudu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:5">Saate nwu lasifi di akyukyoo sɛlɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 47:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 47:6" />Bisa katansa sinu bita Yaa, bisa katansa sinu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:6">bisa katansa sinu bita Ɔka loo, bisa katansa sinu.<verse eid="PSA 47:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 47:7" />Diekye Yaa ninle Ɔka di kasɔ kamuu suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:7">bisa katansa onu bitɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 47:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 47:8" />Yaa kole sɛka di nnle nwu suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:8">Yaa nsi di lɛkakpomii nɔɔ klekle suoto.<verse eid="PSA 47:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 47:9" />Nnle nwu batii finle n-si</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:9">fɛ Abraham Yaa batii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 47:9">diekye kasɔ nwu suoto baka nle Yaa bale;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 47:9">bɛɛtakatɛsa nwɔ katoo nwaa.<verse eid="PSA 47:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 47" />
  <chapter number="48" style="c" sid="PSA 48" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 48</para>
  <para style="s1">Sion, Yaa Okpoo Kplɛ Nwu</para>
  <para style="d">Onu. Kora Babisuɔtɔbi onu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 48:1" />Saate nwu lemuɔ, ɛɛtɛ eesiɛko katansa kafɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:1">di Yaa loo okpoo kplɛ kamɛ, kobokote nɔɔ klekle nwu.<verse eid="PSA 48:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 48:2" />Kuɔlɛ onyu di katakalekɔ ninwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:2">kasɔ nwu kamuu suoto lɛyɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 48:2">Fɛle Safon katakalekɔ petee ninle ni Sion Kobokote,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:2">Ɔka Kplɛ okpoo kplɛ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 48:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 48:3" />Yaa nsi di nwofakɔ nɔɔ kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:3">eediki suoto nɔɔ eetuo alɛ ale nwɔ kɔba.<verse eid="PSA 48:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 48:4" />Obe wɔ di baka nwu lasiisa ni bakpɛtɛ lɛma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:4">baataka ni kanya kanwii,<verse eid="PSA 48:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 48:5" />baanyɔɔ, ni di ɔfɔɔ lasifi ma nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:5">baatoso baasifi ku lɛyɛkɛ.<verse eid="PSA 48:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 48:6" />Ditũtũkũ lamufũ ma ninfa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:6">fɛle ɔsanko wɔ nikɔkpɛ ni kolofo dibuo.<verse eid="PSA 48:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 48:7" />Faawɔɔsa ma fɛle Tarsis seklo kplɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:7">di kufĩ katunkɔ afɛɛfɔ lebibiɛ nii.<verse eid="PSA 48:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 48:8" />Fɛ mmle nwu buanu nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:8">nkpo kafɔɔ butɔɔnya</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 48:8">di Saate wɔ Ninlenke ni okpoo kplɛ nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:8">di Yaa loo okpoo kplɛ nwu kamɛ nɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:8">Yaa lɛbla nwɔ eewo anaa ni kaloo. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ</char><verse eid="PSA 48:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 48:9" />O Yaa, di olekatakɔ lɛfɔ kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:9">mumbu disi di lɛbɔmbɔ lɛfɔ le ninaa ni kaloo suoto.<verse eid="PSA 48:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 48:10" />O Yaa, fɛle leyooto lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:10">katansa lɛfɔ ndu kasɔ nwu nyɛntɛlekɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:10">koletanɛɛ lɛfɔ leyii ku ɔsaabla tinini.<verse eid="PSA 48:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 48:11" />Sion Kobokote nnya suoto lɛyɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:11">Yuda nkpayotũ nwu kɔpɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:11">ta lɛkanko lɛfɔ oso.<verse eid="PSA 48:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 48:12" />Sion binafu bifenfe, biɛkyɛ bikyi nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:12">ka ayo takale nɔɔ,<verse eid="PSA 48:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 48:13" />bilolaa siyoyiɛ nɔɔ binyu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:13">bienyu nwofakɔ nɔɔ nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:13">alɛ biabuɛ sĩ mintɔkɔ ana ya nikɔwa ni.<verse eid="PSA 48:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 48:14" />Diekye Yaa wɔ mmle ninle Yaa loo anaa ni kaloo nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 48:14">abale wo nyuntɛ anaase bia kayɛntɛkɔ.<verse eid="PSA 48:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 48" />
  <chapter number="49" style="c" sid="PSA 49" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 49</para>
  <para style="s1">Lɛsaa Ɔtantofo Di Disi Otika Di Lɛsaawɛ Suoto</para>
  <para style="d">Onu. Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ. Kuɔta ni Kora Babisuɔtɔbi.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 49:1" />Batii bamuu binu nle mmle;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:1">bamuu lee ba ninsi ni kaayi ka mmle kamɛ, binu,<verse eid="PSA 49:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 49:2" />babisɔ ku banɔɔfo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:2">asaabawɛntɛ ku bapiitɛ kyɛkyɛ:<verse eid="PSA 49:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 49:3" />Kanya nii mabuɛ ninumbe sɛlaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:3">lɛkakatɛ le niekye ni otu nii kamɛ mata lɛsɔnu.<verse eid="PSA 49:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 49:4" />Kamakyɔɔ kotoko nii nnu lɛkpa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:4">kamadiki lɛkpa nii nwu kasɔ ku sanku:<verse eid="PSA 49:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 49:5" />Obe oso kamayɛkɛ nse ayi kpile lɛwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:5">obe wɔ di bakpiletɛ balaatɛ lɛmana mi beekyi ni-<verse eid="PSA 49:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 49:6" />mba nietika ni disi di lɛsaawɛ lɛma suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:6">bɔɔkanta ni kafɔɔ di lɛsaawɛ kplɛ lɛma suoto?<verse eid="PSA 49:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 49:7" />Otii kuonwii dilaafuo owo nɔɔ nkpa ofũ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:7">ee ata Yaa koto di disi nɔɔ-<verse eid="PSA 49:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 49:8" />koto ɔta di otii nkpa disi lefũ kɔya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:8">letota kuninwii dilɔbabuo anu-<verse eid="PSA 49:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 49:9" />alɛ aasiɛ nkpa dinaa ni kaloo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:9">alɛ ɔlɔbabuu nii.<verse eid="PSA 49:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 49:10" />Diekye obiala kɔnya alɛ banumbentɛ nkpi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:10">babuutɛ ku mba ninan-ye ni lɛsaa bamuu nkpi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:10">mandiɛ lɛsaawɛ lɛma kafɔɔ mantɛ batii bamba.<verse eid="PSA 49:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 49:11" />Sɛkya lɛma makple ayo lɛma dinaa ni kaloo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:11">nsiɛkɔ lɛma mate ninta ana ya ninaa ni kase,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:11">nu beetika nsɔ ayooto bɛɛta suoto lɛma.<verse eid="PSA 49:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 49:12" />Kafɔɔ kuntɛ otii nkpe lɛsaawɛ yi, anaa nkpa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:12">ate fɛle lepoo kamɛ babɔkɛɛ ba ninwɔɔ nii.<verse eid="PSA 49:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 49:13" />Nni ninwa di batii ba nietika ni disi di mma bamu suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:13">ku batikankotɛ lɛma ba ninfũ ni akakatɛ lɛma mankpee ni nɛ. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ</char><verse eid="PSA 49:13" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 49:14" />Bɛɛbla bɛɛta ma alɛ baakpi mansifi ɔkya kamɛ fɛle bafoso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:14">kukpi kafɔɔ makonko di suoto lɛma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 49:14">Batii ba di situ kamɛ lɛkpa ni male sɛka di suoto lɛma ku oyita;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:14">suoto lɛma mabuu di ɔkya kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:14">mankpukiti di sika ayo kplɛ lɛma nwu suoto.<verse eid="PSA 49:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 49:15" />Kafɔɔ Yaa madiki nkpa nii ankyeko ɔkya kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:15">nwaako abakpaa mi ansifiko ɔkyɛ nɔɔ. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ</char><verse eid="PSA 49:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 49:16" />Tanyɛkɛ nse otii owo lekple saawɛntɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:16">nse leyo nɔɔ lɛlɛ diɛkyakaa;<verse eid="PSA 49:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 49:17" />diekye ɔlɔbayɔ lɛsalɛsaa asifiko nse eekpi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:17">lɛlɛ nɔɔ dilɔbasoo disifi ku nnwɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 49:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 49:18" />Kuntɛ di obe wɔ aasiɛ ni nkpa aanya suoto nɔɔ fɛ otii wɔ beewii ni lɛyɔɔ-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:18">batii kafɔɔ ntansa fɔ nse diɔlɛ fɔ ni-<verse eid="PSA 49:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 49:19" />abalaakyakaa di ote anɛ kɔna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:19">ɔlɔbasinya ni nkpa nwu lɛkpa diidii.<verse eid="PSA 49:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 49:20" />Otii wɔ nikpe ni lɛsaawɛ anaa ni lɛsɔnu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 49:20">nte fɛle lepoo kamɛ babɔkɛɛ ba ninwɔɔ nii.<verse eid="PSA 49:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 49" />
  <chapter number="50" style="c" sid="PSA 50" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 50</para>
  <para style="s1">Onukwale Kasumu</para>
  <para style="d">Asaf Onu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 50:1" />Yaa, Saate nwu, Nnwɔ Ninlenke ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:1">kɔkakatɛ anlɛɛ batii bamuu kaasɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:1">ankyeko kufĩ katunkɔ diɛlaase ni di nfũ kunmɛɛ nii.<verse eid="PSA 50:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 50:2" />Yaa kɔkpa nwaa ku sɛlɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:2">ankye Sion.<verse eid="PSA 50:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 50:3" />Yaa loo kɔwa ɔlɔbalo kanana kafɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:3">ɔtɔ kofiɛ di anu nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:3">ɔblɔ yakayaka kafɔɔ lɛmana nwɔ kuokyi.<verse eid="PSA 50:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 50:4" />Ɛɛlɛɛ osi fanfa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:4">ku kasɔ alɛ ɔɔkanko batii nɔɔ:<verse eid="PSA 50:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 50:5" />"Siisa baklekletɛ nii fatɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:5">mba nienii ni kanya ku ami di oleɔta kamɛ.”<verse eid="PSA 50:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 50:6" />Osi koyie ɔsaabla tinini nɔɔ lɛkya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:6">diekye Yaa omu ninle kantɛ.<char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ</char><verse eid="PSA 50:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 50:7" />"O batii nii, binu, kamakakatɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:7">O Israel, mabuɛ ɔlaa ntika fɔ di suoto:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:7">Ami ninle Yaa, Yaa lɛfɔ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 50:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 50:8" />Ninsĩ ɔlaa nta fɔ di oleɔta lɛfɔ suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:8">ee ofiɛ asaaɔta lɛfɔ ya ninte ni di anu nii obe lele.<verse eid="PSA 50:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 50:9" />Nankyue di nankyue kɔba lɛfɔ diefĩ mi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:9">ee batie di atieyo lɛfɔ kamɛ,<verse eid="PSA 50:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 50:10" />diekye bɔkɛɛ biala di lepoo kamɛ nle mi ole,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:10">ku banankyue ba di akpenkpe kakpe osi.<verse eid="PSA 50:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 50:11" />N-ye kansiɛ biala di abokote nwu suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:11">babɔkɛɛ ba kafɔɔ di lepoo nle mi bale.<verse eid="PSA 50:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 50:12" />Nse fɛ kɔka nklee mi nse ntabatɔkɔ fɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:12">diekye kayi nwu kale mi kale, ku asaa ya amuu ninsi ka ni kaamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 50:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 50:13" />Nwee banankyue sina</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:13">ee nnyi batie ntɔ?<verse eid="PSA 50:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 50:14" />Ta sɛfa ɔpɛ asaaɔta oleɔta fata Yaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:14">faabla di ntam be faaka faata ni Nnwɔ Niɛtaka Kotoo Alenke ni,<verse eid="PSA 50:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 50:15" />faalɛɛ mi kafɔɔ di nimiinayi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:15">kamadiki fɔ, fan-yɔ dibu kafɔɔ fantɛɛ.”<verse eid="PSA 50:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 50:16" />Kafɔɔ bakpiletɛ mma, Yaa alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 50:16">"Ɔmɛnsuku fakpe fanka afiofa nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:16">ee fan-yɔ anyasibi lɛfɔ fambuɛ kanya ninii nii?<verse eid="PSA 50:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 50:17" />Feekyidi kɔkà nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:17">ni fɛɛyɔ sɛlaa nii feeyu sɛɛmaa lɛfɔ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 50:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 50:18" />Nse fɛɛnya yu, fantikanko nwɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:18">fanaabla onwii ku asɔnɔ bakpeetɛ.<verse eid="PSA 50:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 50:19" />Fan-yɔ kanya lɛfɔ fambla okpile</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:19">feesiisa sɛlaa ku afunu kafɔɔ di ɔkplalomii lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 50:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 50:20" />Obe lele fɔɔkakatɛ di obilee suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:20">fanlalaasa kafɔɔ yaafɔ omu obisuɔtɔbi.<verse eid="PSA 50:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 50:21" />Asaa ya mmle fatɔɔbla nɛ, lelokanana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:21">feenyu falɛ nkpo late fɛle afɔ nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 50:21">Kafɔɔ masĩ ɔlaa nta fɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:21">nin-yɔ sɛlaa nwu kafɔɔ ntɛ di anu lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 50:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 50:22" />"Nyu nle mmle, afɔ wɔ nieyee ni Yaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:22">ee mabɛbɛɛ fɔ kɔkyɛɛkɔkyɛɛ, di kuonwii nnaa abafũ fɔ nii:<verse eid="PSA 50:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 50:23" />Otii wɔ ninta ni sɛfa ɔpɛ asaaɔta oleɔta ntɛɛ dibu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:23">anlolaa kafɔɔ osuku nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 50:23">di mmle katuo nwɔ ni Yaa didiki nwu.”<verse eid="PSA 50:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 50" />
  <chapter number="51" style="c" sid="PSA 51" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 51</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Diɛta Ni Ɔyɔ Ɔkyɛ</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu. Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ. Di obe wɔ di Yaa ɔlaa buɛtɛtɛ Natan lakyɛ ni ɔkyɛ nɔɔ di Dawid lakpee ni asɔnɔ ku Batsheba aaloo ni sɛmaa.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 51:1" />O Yaa, nyɛɛ nyaami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:1">di lɛbɔmbɔ lɛfɔ le ninaa ni kaloo kanya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 51:1">di sifutulɛ kplɛ lɛfɔ nwu kanya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:1">yɛɛsa ɔtanlolaa ɔbla nii.<verse eid="PSA 51:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 51:2" />Foto asaa kpile nii amuu fawii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:2">faakleklesɛsa mi kafɔɔ di sikpile nii suoto.<verse eid="PSA 51:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 51:3" />Diekye n-ye ɔtanlolaa ɔbla nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:3">sikpile nii kafɔɔ nte di anu nii obe lele.<verse eid="PSA 51:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 51:4" />Labla okpile di suoto lɛfɔ, di lete lɛfɔ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:4">labla kafɔɔ lɛsaa le ninle ni dikpilesaa di anu lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 51:4">alɛ ɔlaa lɛfɔ nkpe nse fɛɛkakatɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:4">fabale lɛbɛ kafɔɔ nse fɛɛka.<verse eid="PSA 51:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 51:5" />Nwaako kpiletɛ lale bia kalofokɔ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:5">kpiletɛ di obe wɔ di yaami lalaka ni lɛmɛ nii.<verse eid="PSA 51:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 51:6" />Nwaako onukwale wɔ niekye ni kamɛkamɛ fammiɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:6">afɔ tuo mi ninumbe di otu nii kamɛ kaamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 51:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 51:7" />Kleklesa mi ku isop<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12.22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">hisope nle ɔfa owo ninte ni fɛ olombolo </char></note>, ni kamabla klekle;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:7">foto mi, ni mapu nlenkee atubɔkanii.<verse eid="PSA 51:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 51:8" />Tɛɛ nnya suoto lɛyɔɔ, nimpɔ kafɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:8">ta akufi nwu feebibiɛ ni anya suoto lɛyɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 51:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 51:9" />Wofasa anu lɛfɔ di sikpile nii suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:9">faayɛɛsa kafɔɔ asaa kpile nii amuu fadiki.<verse eid="PSA 51:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 51:10" />O Yaa, bla otu klekle di kamɛ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:10">faase ninwuna le niewo ni nimu kafɔɔ lɛbla kaamɛ nii.<verse eid="PSA 51:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 51:11" />Tantososa mi di anu lɛfɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:11">ee faadiki Ninwuna Klekle lɛfɔ di kamɛ nii.<verse eid="PSA 51:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 51:12" />Kplesa suoto lɛyɔɔ didiki lɛfɔ nwu fatɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:12">faatɛɛ ninwuna le kafɔɔ nin-yɔ nwu ni ole, alɛ aaklee mi.<verse eid="PSA 51:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 51:13" />Ni kamatuo batii ba ninoololaa babla ni sisuku lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:13">bakpileblatɛ kafɔɔ makple manwa ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 51:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 51:14" />O Yaa, diki mi di ntɔ owii lɛpɔɔ okpi kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:14">Yaa wɔ nindiki mi ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:14">ni ɔkplalomii nii kafɔɔ masa ɔsaabla tinini lɛfɔ onu.<verse eid="PSA 51:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 51:15" />O Saate, bɛ anyasibi nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:15">kanya nii kafɔɔ madiki katansa lɛfɔ kambuɛ.<verse eid="PSA 51:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 51:16" />Suoto ninn-yɔɔ fɔ di oleɔta suoto, see ntabawako nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:16">fammbɔmbɔ kafɔɔ ofiɛ asaaɔta.<verse eid="PSA 51:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 51:17" />Yaa oleɔta nwu nle ninwuna le niɛwakosa ni suoto kasɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:17">O Yaa, flɔbasĩ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:17">otu wɔ niebiɛ, kuɔwakosa ni kafɔɔ suoto kasɔ.<verse eid="PSA 51:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 51:18" />Di suoto lɛyɔɔ lɛfɔ nwaa kamɛ yi, bla Sion diɛlɛ nwɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:18">faatofo Yerusalem siyoyiɛ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 51:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 51:19" />Ni oleɔta tinini kamawɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:19">ofiɛ asaaɔta omuu nta suoto n-yɔɔ fɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 51:19">ni babata banankyue suɔtɔ di oleɔta akyikye lɛfɔ suoto.<verse eid="PSA 51:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 51" />
  <chapter number="52" style="c" sid="PSA 52" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 52</para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa Lɛkanko Ku Sibualɛ</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid<char style="tl">maskil</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dite fɛle onu lɛsambi lewo dile</char></note>. Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ. Di obe wɔ di Doeg, Edom otii nwu lakyɛ aalaatɔkɔ ni Saulo alɛ: "Dawid lakyɛ ni Ahimelek leyo.”</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 52:1" />Afɔ sientɛ, be oso fankanta di dikpilesaa suoto?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:1">Be oso fankanta dii kufĩ kumu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:1">afɔ wɔ ninle ni sinunsɔ di Yaa anu?<verse eid="PSA 52:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 52:2" />Ɔkplalomii lɛfɔ mbuɛ kawɔɔsa sɛlaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:2">kute fɛle disi kakpaasupamii blɛblɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:2">afɔ wɔ nimblako ni kakyɔnkyɔ ɔkpɛ.<verse eid="PSA 52:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 52:3" />Fambɔmbɔ dikpile fanlenkee dibiene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:3">sɛlaa ku afunu fanlenkee onukwale obuɛ. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ</char><verse eid="PSA 52:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 52:4" />Fambɔmbɔ ɔlaa biala ninlalasa ni asaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:4">O afɔ kakyɔnkyɔ ɔkplalomii!<verse eid="PSA 52:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 52:5" />Nwaako Yaa mawakosa fɔ kasɔ di kawɔɔ ka ninaa ni kaloo:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:5">Abakpafɛ fɔ ambɛbɛɛ fɔ kafɔɔ di akpanta lɛfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 52:5">abasifi fɔ di nkpa basiɛtɛ kasɔ suoto. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ</char><verse eid="PSA 52:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 52:6" />Batinintɛ manya manyɛkɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:6">babama nwɔ, mambuɛ alɛ,<verse eid="PSA 52:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 52:7" />"Nnya otii nwu nfɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:7">nnwɔ ninan-yɔ Yaa abla ni katanikokɔ nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 52:7">kafɔɔ aatika disi di lɛsaawɛ kplɛ nɔɔ suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:7">aawɛ ni osie aatɔɔwɔɔsa ni bawo nɔɔ!"<verse eid="PSA 52:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 52:8" />Kafɔɔ nte fɛle nnɔnyi kowoso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:8">kuɔlɛ ni di Yaa leyo kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 52:8">letika disi di Yaa lɛbɔmbɔ le ninaa ni kaloo suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:8">dinaa ni kaloo diidii.<verse eid="PSA 52:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 52:9" />Kamatansa fɔ dinaa ni kaloo di nle fɛɛbla nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:9">di leyooto lɛfɔ kamɛ kamanyu osuku, diekye leyooto lɛfɔ nlɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 52:9">Kamatansa fɔ di baklekletɛ lɛfɔ anu.<verse eid="PSA 52:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 52" />
  <chapter number="53" style="c" sid="PSA 53" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 53</para>
  <para style="s1">Batii Sikpile Ole</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid <char style="tl">maskil</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">53.0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dite fɛle onu lɛsambi lewo dile</char></note> Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ. Basa nwu di <char style="tl">mahalat</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">53.0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dite fɛle onu lɛsambi lewo dile</char></note> kanya.</para>
  <para style="r">(Ps 14)</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 53:1" />Babuutɛ mbuɛ di situ lɛma kamɛ alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:1">"Yaa nnaa.”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 53:1">Batɔɔlalaa, sɛsaabla lɛma kafɔɔ ninnlɛ onyu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:1">kuonwii lɛma nimbla lɛsaa biene.<verse eid="PSA 53:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 53:2" />Yaa nnyu batii babisuɔtɔbi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:2">ankyeko osi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 53:2">aanyu nse owo nkpe aye ni lɛsaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:2">anwolaa ni Yaa osuku.<verse eid="PSA 53:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 53:3" />Otii biala ntookple nkpaamaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:3">batoosi bɛɛlalaa;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 53:3">kuonwii lɛma nimbla lɛsaa biene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:3">bia onwii nnaa.<verse eid="PSA 53:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 53:4" />Bakpileblatɛ dilɔbatekete lɛsaa-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:4">mba ninwee ni batii nii fɛ mmle di batii nle ni bloblo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:4">di mma kafɔɔ manampɛ ɔlaa baata ni Yaa?<verse eid="PSA 53:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 53:5" />Nfa baawɛ ku difu kplɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:5">nfũ di lɛsalɛsaa ditawɛ baayɛkɛ nii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 53:5">Yaa lasamiisa mba niadieko fɔ ni akufi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:5">faakpee ma sinunsɔ, diekye Yaa lasĩ ma.<verse eid="PSA 53:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 53:6" />O, Israel didiki nwu madie ninkye Sion!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:6">Nse Yaa lekplesa lɛsaawɛ nwu ɛɛta batii nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 53:6">ta Yakob anya suoto lɛyɔɔ di Israel kafɔɔ apɔ!<verse eid="PSA 53:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 53" />
  <chapter number="54" style="c" sid="PSA 54" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 54</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Di Odiki Okyeko Balo Nnɛɛ</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid <char style="tl">maskil</char> <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">53.0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dite fɛle onu lɛsambi lewo dile</char></note>. Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ. Basa nwu ku sikũ sanku. Di obe wɔ di Sifi batii lakyɛ ni Saulo nfũ baalaabuɛ ni alɛ, "Diele Dawid niewofa kaamɛ loo nɛ?"</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 54:1" />O Yaa, diki mi di leyooto lɛfɔ kanya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:1">tɛɛ lɛbɛ di osie lɛfɔ kanya.<verse eid="PSA 54:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 54:2" />O Yaa, nu ɔlaa ɔpɛ ɔta nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:2">kyɔɔ kanya nii sɛlaa atoko.<verse eid="PSA 54:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 54:3" />Bafɔɔ kodieko mi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:3">amumu batii komiɛ alɛ badiki mi nkpa-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:3">batii ba ninambu ni Yaa. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ </char><verse eid="PSA 54:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 54:4" />Nwaako Yaa ninle mi lɛkyakaako;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:4">Saate nwu ninle nnwɔ ninyu mi nii.<verse eid="PSA 54:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 54:5" />Ta dikpile dikple disifi mba nikɔkpɔnɔfɔsa mi ni leyooto nfũ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:5">wɔɔsa ma di onukwale lɛfɔ nwu kanya.<verse eid="PSA 54:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 54:6" />Kamata otu biene asaaɔta oleɔta nta fɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:6">O Saate, kamatansa leyooto lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:6">diekye dilɛ.<verse eid="PSA 54:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 54:7" />Diekye atoodiki mi di amiina nii amuu kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 54:7">anu nii kafɔɔ ntɔɔnya lelenkee di bakyiditɛ nii suoto.<verse eid="PSA 54:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 54" />
  <chapter number="55" style="c" sid="PSA 55" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 55</para>
  <para style="s1">Otii Onwii Di Siɛwo Nɔɔ Ladiki Nwɔ Aata Ni Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid <char style="tl">maskil</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">53.0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dite fɛle onu lɛsambi lewo dile</char></note>. Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ. Basa nwu ku sikũ sanku.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 55:1" />O Yaa, kyɔɔ ɔlaa ɔpɛ nii atoko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:1">tansĩ lekoto otikiti nii;<verse eid="PSA 55:1" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 55:2" />nu mi ɔlaa faatuna fatɛɛ kafɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 55:2">Asibu nii kokpee mi kubuɛ ntɔɔkpɔkpɔtɔ kafɔɔ<verse eid="PSA 55:2" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 55:3" />ta balo sɛlɔ nwu oso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:3">ta mmle di bakpiletɛ nwu konyu ni oso;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 55:3">diekye beetika dibuo di suoto nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:3">beekyidi mi di ɔblɔ lɛma kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 55:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 55:4" />Otu nii nsi di dibuo kamɛ, kaamɛ nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:4">kukpi difu ntoodieko mi.<verse eid="PSA 55:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 55:5" />Lɛyɛkɛ ku ditũtũkũ ntoomufũ mi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:5">difu ntoolenkee mi nnɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 55:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 55:6" />Labuɛ nlɛ, "O, nse fɛ nkpe ablonuma afoko yi!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:6">Ntabaflɛlɛtɛ nsifi nnaatɛ ɔnyɛɛ-<verse eid="PSA 55:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 55:7" />ntabaflɛlɛtɛ nsifi fanfa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:7">nnaasiɛ di ɔfaafuu; <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ </char><verse eid="PSA 55:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 55:8" />ntabapɛsɛwa nsifi kawofakɔ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:8">fanfa di kakitikɔ ku afɛɛfɔ kanya.”<verse eid="PSA 55:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 55:9" />O Saate, lalaasa bakpiletɛ asibu, faakpɔkpɔtɔsa lɛkakatɛ lɛma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:9">diekye kɔnya amumu ku dibuɛkpee di okpoo nwu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 55:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 55:10" />Bookyi siyoyiɛ ninwu kakũ ku kakyɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:10">apilansaa ku amumu nsinwu kaamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 55:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 55:11" />Kasaalaasa kɔbla ɔkpɛ di okpoo nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:11">afunaa ku sɛlaa ku afunu dilɔbadie di akpaka ninwu.<verse eid="PSA 55:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 55:12" />Nse fɛ lo nikotufa mi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:12">dilaabuo mi suoto;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 55:12">nse kyiditɛ nii nikoyiyie ankpee mi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:12">ntabafuo nwɔ owofa.<verse eid="PSA 55:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 55:13" />Kafɔɔ afɔ, otii fɛle ami okle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:13">oklopo nii, siɛwo nii kpankpa,<verse eid="PSA 55:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 55:14" />ku nnwɔɔ botoodinya ni suoto lɛyɔɔ nwaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:14">fɛ mmle munkyɛ ni ku dikudi di Yaa leyo.<verse eid="PSA 55:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 55:15" />Ta kukpi kufua balo nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:15">ta ma basifi ɔkya kamɛ ku nkpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:15">diekye okpile nwɛ kasiɛkɔ kaamɛ lɛma.<verse eid="PSA 55:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 55:16" />Kafɔɔ lalɛɛ Yaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:16">ni di Saate nwu lediki mi nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 55:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 55:17" />Olesɛ ku kakũ ku kɔtɔɔfɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:17">lawi ku sɛnyaami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:17">ni aanu mi sɛlɔ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 55:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 55:18" />Aadiki mi di lɛsalɛsaa ditabla mi ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:18">aakyeko kakpɛ ka baakpɛko mi nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:18">nu di batii kpinwu layila mi di suoto.<verse eid="PSA 55:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 55:19" />Yaa wɔ ninsi ni di lɛkakpomii dinaa ni kaloo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:19">manuko ma ankpɛko ma- <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ </char></para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 55:19">batii ba ninankyi ni diidii di sisuku lɛma suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:19">manan-yɛkɛ ni Yaa.<verse eid="PSA 55:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 55:20" />Oklopo nii ndieko basiɛwo nɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:20">ansĩ kanya ninii nɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 55:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 55:21" />Lɛkakatɛ nɔɔ lɛkylɔkylɔ fɛ lɛla,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:21">kafɔɔ kakpɛ nsi di otu nɔɔ kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 55:21">sɛlaa nɔɔ lɛblɔblɔ silenke nnɔnyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:21">kafɔɔ mpamii be bɛɛbɔkɛtɛ ni sile.<verse eid="PSA 55:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 55:22" />Yɔ atoo lɛfɔ fatika di Saate nwu suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:22">ni abanyu fɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:22">ɔlɔbata tininitɛ anɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 55:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 55:23" />O Yaa, kafɔɔ afɔ fabawakosa bakpiletɛ nwu kasɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:23">di kalalaa dibiɔ nwu kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 55:23">mba nin-wii ni ntɔ ku balaatɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 55:23">dilɔbasiɛ kayi lɛma nkpa kakyɛ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 55:23" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 55:23">Kafɔɔ ami, letika fɔ disi.<verse eid="PSA 55:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 55" />
  <chapter number="56" style="c" sid="PSA 56" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 56</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Di Disi Otika Di Yaa Suoto</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid <char style="tl">miktam.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">53.0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dite fɛle onu lɛsambi lewo dile</char></note> Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ. "Ablonuma di Awoso kplɛ Kaakyonkɔ" sɛlɔ baayɔbasa nwu. Di obe wɔ di Filisti batii lamufũ nwɔ ni di Gat.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 56:1" />O Yaa, nyɛɛ nyaami, diekye batii ntikanko mi osie kanya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:1">dii kufĩ kumu boonyinka mi mantɛ kaasɔ.<verse eid="PSA 56:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 56:2" />Kanya nii babuditɛ ntikanko mi dii kufĩ kumu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:2">batii kpinwu kodieko mi di lɛkanta lɛma kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 56:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 56:3" />Nse kɔyɛkɛ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:3">matika disi nii di suoto lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 56:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 56:4" />Di Yaa, nnwɔ ɔlaa nintansa ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:4">Yaa letika disi; namayɛkɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:4">Obe di otii-nyu mafuo mi ɔbla?<verse eid="PSA 56:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 56:5" />Dii kufĩ kumu mammunikĩisa sɛlaa nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:5">obe lele bookpee asi baawo alɛ bababla mi amumu.<verse eid="PSA 56:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 56:6" />Bookũ kanwumbe, bɔɔtɛtɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:6">boonyunyu nnafunkpaa nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:6">boomiɛ alɛ balo mi.<verse eid="PSA 56:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 56:7" />O Yaa, di ɔblɔ lɛfɔ kamɛ, wakosa nnle nwu kasɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:7">tanta ma baatoso baasifi di osuku kuonwii suoto.<verse eid="PSA 56:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 56:8" />Kpana ɔnyaami-laa nii fatɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:8">tɛ nnumɛɛ nii nsũ di kukũ lɛfɔ kamɛ-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:8">aasi di kukũ lɛfɔ kamɛ?<verse eid="PSA 56:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 56:9" />Ni balo nii makple nkpaamaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:9">nse lɛkaalɛ lɛkyakaako.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:9">Di nle mmle kamɛ matofo nlɛ Yaa ole mi ale.<verse eid="PSA 56:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 56:10" />Di Yaa, nnwɔ ɔlaa nintansa ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:10">di Saate nwu, nnwɔ ɔlaa nintansa ni-<verse eid="PSA 56:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 56:11" />Yaa letika disi; namayɛkɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:11">Obe di otii mafuo mi ɔbla?<verse eid="PSA 56:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 56:12" />O Yaa, nsi di ntam kalɔ lɛta fɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:12">mayɔ sɛfa ɔpɛ asaaɔta nii nta fɔ.<verse eid="PSA 56:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 56:13" />Diekye fatoodiki mi feekyeko kukpi kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:13">feenyu nkpaa nii kafɔɔ alɛ dietuula,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 56:13">alɛ kakyɛ di Yaa anu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 56:13">di nkpa lɛkpa nwu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 56:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 56" />
  <chapter number="57" style="c" sid="PSA 57" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 57</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Diɛta Ni Lɛkyaakaako</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu. <char style="tl">miktam.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">53.0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dite fɛle onu lɛsambi lewo dile</char></note> Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ. Basa nwu di "Bitanwɔɔsa" kanya. Di obe wɔ aatoso ni di Saulo nfũ aasifi ni ofuɔntuu kamɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 57:1" />Nyɛɛ nyaami, O Yaa, nyɛɛ nyaami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:1">diekye afɔ kamɛ di ɔkla nii ntaniko.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 57:1">Mataniko di afoko lɛfɔ kunyii kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:1">diɛlaase di obe wɔ di anyale nwu ntoofe nii.<verse eid="PSA 57:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 57:2" />Lawi lalɛɛ Yaa wɔ Niɛtaka Katoo Alenke ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:2">lata Yaa, nnwɔ nimbla ni di ɔlaa nɔɔ suoto antɛɛ nii.<verse eid="PSA 57:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 57:3" />Ankyesee lɛkyakaako ninkye osi kafɔɔ nimadiki mi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:3">ansĩ ɔlaa anta batii ba nintikako mi ni osie kanya; <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ </char></para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:3">Yaa nkyesee lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ ku onukwale nɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 57:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 57:4" />Nsi di bakyata ntɛɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:4">nte di bakɔkɛɛ ba di aka nkle ni yakayaka kamɛ-</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 57:4">batii ba anyɛɛ ninle ni akplɔ ku ataa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:4">di sɛkplalomii lɛma nle ni mpamii blɛblɛ.<verse eid="PSA 57:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 57:5" />O Yaa, takatɛsa suoto katoo falenkeesa osi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:5">ta lɛkpa lɛfɔ difũ kasɔ kamuu.<verse eid="PSA 57:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 57:6" />Beefukuti asawu bɛɛta nkpaa nii-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:6">baawakosa mi kasɔ di nimiina kamɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 57:6">Baakutu dibiɔ di osuku nii-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:6">kafɔɔ batɔɔkpa beebuo ni kaamɛ mma bamu. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ </char><verse eid="PSA 57:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 57:7" />Otu nii n-yɛ kekleke, O Yaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:7">otu nii n-yɛ kekleke;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:7">kamasa sinu ku sɛlɔ mɛnɛmɛnɛ.<verse eid="PSA 57:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 57:8" />Sɛnkɛ, ɔkla nii!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:8">Bisɛnkɛ, sanku ku kyitaa!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:8">Kolesɛtũ kamasɛnkɛ.<verse eid="PSA 57:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 57:9" />O Saate, matansa fɔ di nnle kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:9">masa sinu di suoto lɛfɔ di batii nwu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 57:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 57:10" />Diekye lɛbɔmbɔ lɛfɔ lemuɔ, diɛlaadu osi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:10">onukwale lɛfɔ ndu kolo.<verse eid="PSA 57:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 57:11" />O Yaa, takatɛsa suoto katoo falenkeesa osi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 57:11">ta lɛkpa lɛfɔ difũ kasɔ kamuu.<verse eid="PSA 57:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 57" />
  <chapter number="58" style="c" sid="PSA 58" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 58</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Ɔta Yaa Alɛ Aananfi Bakpiletɛ Kootoko</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid <char style="tl">miktam.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">53.0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dite fɛle onu lɛsambi lewo dile</char></note> Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ. Basa nwu di "Bitanwɔɔsa" kanya.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 58:1" />Aye batunletɛ nwaako mimbuɛ ɔlaa wɔ ninte ni nkpo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:1">Minka lɛka tinini di batii kamɛ?<verse eid="PSA 58:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 58:2" />Oowo, mimbu asi kpile di situ lee kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:2">nnɛɛ lee kafɔɔ ndiki kudú di kasɔ suoto.<verse eid="PSA 58:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 58:3" />Bakpiletɛ osuku layu bia kalofokɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:3">baalalaa baakye kafutu kamɛ, mankakatɛ kafɔɔ sɛlaa ku afunu.<verse eid="PSA 58:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 58:4" />Adii lɛma nte fɛle kɔsanwu adii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:4">fɛle kɔwɛɛfɛɛko nietĩi ni atoko nɔɔ,<verse eid="PSA 58:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 58:5" />alɛ ɔlɔbanu fatɛ sɛlɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:5">akpakpa aye ɔkɛkɛɛsa nwu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 58:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 58:6" />O Yaa, kpakpaa anyɛɛ lɛma kaanya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:6">O Saate, bɔkɔtɛ bakyata aweenyɛɛ!<verse eid="PSA 58:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 58:7" />Ta ma bayɛ fɛle ntu be nikobiɛ ninfe ni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:7">nse bɛɛnanfi kɔtaa, ta kubi lɛma nwu nnya ate tutulutu.<verse eid="PSA 58:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 58:8" />Fɛle mmle di dikunfɛɛ n-yɛ ni nse dikyɛ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:8">fɛle difutudie obi, tanta ma baanya kufĩ.<verse eid="PSA 58:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 58:9" />Fiɛ di abukii lɛfɔ manu ni siwuu nwu difila-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:9">kuntɛ sɛkɔnle ee sekosole sile-babafiɛ bakpiletɛ nwu mansifiko.<verse eid="PSA 58:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 58:10" />Suoto mayɔɔ batininitɛ nse bootufu ma koto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:10">nse beefoto nkpaa lɛma di bakpiletɛ ntɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 58:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 58:11" />Ni batii mabuɛ alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:11">"Nwaako letota lekple dikpe diɛta batininitɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 58:11">nwaako Yaa owo nkpe ankanko ni kasɔ.”<verse eid="PSA 58:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 58" />
  <chapter number="59" style="c" sid="PSA 59" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 59</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Diɛta Ni Katĩtĩi</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid <char style="tl">miktam.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">53.0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dite fɛle onu lɛsambi lewo dile</char></note> Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ. Basa nwu di "Bitanwɔɔsa" kanya. Di obe wɔ di Saulo lakpee ni batii alɛ balaanyu ni Dawid leyo di mmle baalo nwɔ ni kanya.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 59:1" />O Yaa, diki mi fakyeko balo nii nnɛɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:1">tĩtĩi mi fakyeko mba niɛtaka bayɛ mi ni di suoto.<verse eid="PSA 59:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 59:2" />Diki mi fakyeko asaakpile bablatɛ nnɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:2">faafũ mi kafɔɔ fakyeko mba nin-wii ni ntɔ nnɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 59:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 59:3" />Nyu mmle bɛɛtɛ mi ni kala!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:3">Batii yakayaka kokũ kanwumbe di suoto nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:3">O Saate, ninambla ni lɛsalɛsaa ee okpile kuonwii.<verse eid="PSA 59:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 59:4" />Nimbla opkile kuonwii, kafɔɔ beelolaa suoto alɛ boodieko mi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:4">Taka faakyakaako mi; nyu ɔlaa nii!<verse eid="PSA 59:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 59:5" />O Saate Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni, Israel batii Yaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:5">takatɛ disi faananfi nnle mmuu kootoko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:5">tannya bakpiletɛ ba nindiki batii manta ni nyaami. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ </char><verse eid="PSA 59:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 59:6" />Kɔtɔɔfɔ mankple,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:6">mantookumii fɛle baweewee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:6">mankyɛ kafɔɔ mantookyi okpoo.<verse eid="PSA 59:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 59:7" />Nyu n-se boodiki mankyeko ni nnya lɛma lo-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:7">boodiki mpamii mankyeko anyasibi lɛma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:7">mambuɛ kafɔɔ alɛ, "Owe nimafuo wo onu?"<verse eid="PSA 59:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 59:8" />O Yaa, kafɔɔ afɔ famma ma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:8">famma nnle nwu nkpo mmuu.<verse eid="PSA 59:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 59:9" />O Osie nii, konyu fɔ osuku;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:9">O Yaa, afɔ ninle mi kɔba, <verse eid="PSA 59:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 59:10" />Yaa bɔmbɔtɛ nii.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 59:10" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 59:10">Yaa maleko mi katũ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:10">antɛɛ nnya suoto lɛyɔɔ kafɔɔ di mba nikɔlalaasa mi ni leyooto.<verse eid="PSA 59:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 59:11" />O Saate kubidifunsaa loo, kafɔɔ tanlo ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:11">se diele nkpo batii nii kamayee.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 59:11">Di osie lɛfɔ kamɛ, bla ma baakyɛ batookyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:11">faawakosa ma kasɔ kafɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 59:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 59:12" />Ta nnya lɛma sikpile oso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:12">ta anyasibi lɛma sɛlaa oso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:12">ta lɛkanta lɛma didiki ma fɛle okũ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 59:12">Ta akpaani ku sɛlaa ku afunu se boobuɛ ni oso,<verse eid="PSA 59:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 59:13" />wɔɔsa ma di ɔblɔ kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:13">wɔɔsa ma dilaase di obe wɔ babaloo ni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 59:13">Ni kasɔ nyɛntɛlekɔ kamatofo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:13">alɛ Yaa kole sɛka di Yakob Suoto. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ </char><verse eid="PSA 59:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 59:14" />Kɔtɔɔfɔ mankple,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:14">mantookumii fɛle baweewee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:14">mankyɛ kafɔɔ mantookyi okpoo.<verse eid="PSA 59:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 59:15" />Mantookyi mantoomiɛ alesaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:15">mantooyiisa kudu kafɔɔ nse baamiɛ.<verse eid="PSA 59:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 59:16" />Kafɔɔ masa osie lɛfɔ sinu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:16">masa lɛbɔmbɔ lɛfɔ sinu ku olesɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 59:16">diekye afɔ ninle mi kɔba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:16">katanikokɔ di nimiina nii obe kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 59:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 59:17" />O osie nii, nsa sinu ntansa fɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 59:17">O Yaa, afɔ ninle mi kɔba, Yaa bɔmbɔtɛ nii.<verse eid="PSA 59:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 59" />
  <chapter number="60" style="c" sid="PSA 60" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 60</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Diɛta Ni Didiki</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid <char style="tl">miktam.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">53.0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dite fɛle onu lɛsambi lewo dile</char></note> Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ. Basa nwu di "Atoto Kanya Ninii" kanya. Kuɔta ni asaaotuo. Di obe wɔ aakpɛko ni Aram Naharaim ku Aram Soba, ku obe wɔ di Yoab lakple aasifi aalaalo ni Edom batii lefosi nkpe nnyɔ di mmba Obombo nwu kamɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 60:1" />O Yaa, fatoosĩ wo, fatoodiɛ wo nnɛɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:1">fatɔɔnya ɔblɔ- nunua se wo lelolaa!<verse eid="PSA 60:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 60:2" />Fatootũkunsa kasɔ, fɛɛbɛ ka kafɔɔ fɛɛtɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:2">tĩi mbɛkɔ nika, diekye kootũkũ.<verse eid="PSA 60:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 60:3" />Fatootuo batii lɛfɔ dibuo nwaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:3">fatɔɔta wo nta be ninkɔta wo munsiɛ ni.<verse eid="PSA 60:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 60:4" />Kafɔɔ batii ba ninyɛkɛ fɔ nii, fatɔɔtakatɛsa flankaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:4">alɛ aafukuti antĩi kɔtaa nwu. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ </char><verse eid="PSA 60:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 60:5" />Fũ wo faakyakaako wo kafɔɔ ku koletanɛɛ lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:5">alɛ faadiki batii ba fambɔmbɔ nii.<verse eid="PSA 60:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 60:6" />Yaa ntɔɔkakatɛ eekyeko kakleklekɔ nɔɔ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:6">"Di suoto lɛyɔɔ kamɛ kamasɛ Sekem ndiki</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:6">nsɛ kafɔɔ Sukot Ɔtaata nwu.<verse eid="PSA 60:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 60:7" />Gilead ole mi ale, Manase kafɔɔ ole mi ale;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:7">Efraim ninle mi abɔɔsaa lekoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:7">Yuda kayofo nii.<verse eid="PSA 60:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 60:8" />Moab ninle mi asaa ofoto bɛɛsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:8">Edom ninfuki ntokota nii ntɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:8">Filisti suoto mayiisa lelenkee kudu.”<verse eid="PSA 60:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 60:9" />Owe nimakpaa mi anwako okpoo wɔ beetofo oyoyiɛ beekyisa ni?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:9">Owe nimaleko mi katũ ankyɛnko Edom?<verse eid="PSA 60:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 60:10" />O Yaa, diele afɔ nɛ, afɔ wɔ niasĩ wo ni nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:10">floosintikanko bakpɛtɛ loo kafɔɔ?<verse eid="PSA 60:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 60:11" />Ta wo lɛkyakaako di lo loo suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:11">diekye otii lɛkyakaako diele lɛsalɛsaa.<verse eid="PSA 60:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 60:12" />Ku Yaa, bubawɛ lelenkee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 60:12">abananafu balo loo kafɔɔ antɛ kaasɔ.<verse eid="PSA 60:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 60" />
  <chapter number="61" style="c" sid="PSA 61" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 61</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Diɛta Ni Kanyu</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu. Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ. Basa nwu ku sikũ sanku.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 61:1" />O Yaa, nu mi kaku;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:1">kyɔɔ ɔlaa ɔpɛ nii atoko.<verse eid="PSA 61:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 61:2" />Di kasɔ nyɛntɛlekɔ kɔlɛɛ fɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:2">kɔlɛɛ di obe wɔ di otu nii koloo ni ɔnyɛɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:2">kpaa mi fakyɛnko difuɔnkpaa le niɛtaka katoo dilenke mi ni katũ.<verse eid="PSA 61:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 61:3" />Diekye afɔ ninle katanikokɔ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:3">leyo takale siene di lo nwu suoto.<verse eid="PSA 61:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 61:4" />Tɛɛ nsiɛ di lɛkpaayo lɛfɔ kamɛ dinaa ni kaloo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:4">nintaniko kafɔɔ di afoko lɛfɔ kalɔ fɛ kasiɛkɔ. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ </char><verse eid="PSA 61:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 61:5" />O Yaa, diekye fatoonu ntam nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:5">fatɔɔyɔ batii ba nin-yɛkɛ fɔ ni leyooto atesaa fɛɛtɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 61:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 61:6" />Kyakaa ayi di ɔka nkpa suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:6">alɛɛ nɔɔ atikanko ana kpinwu.<verse eid="PSA 61:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 61:7" />Ta base nwɔ sɛka di Yaa anu dinaa ni kaloo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:7">ta lɛbɔmbɔ ku onukwale lɛfɔ kunyu nwɔ.<verse eid="PSA 61:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 61:8" />Ni obe lele masa sinu ntansa leyooto lɛfɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 61:8">kamabla kafɔɔ di ntam nii nwu dii biala.<verse eid="PSA 61:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 61" />
  <chapter number="62" style="c" sid="PSA 62" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 62</para>
  <para style="s1">Disi Otika Di Yaa Kanyu Suoto</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu. Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ. Kuɔta ni Yedutun.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 62:1" />Ɔkla nii nwɛ onyɛɛ ɔtɛ di Yaa lete kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:1">didiki nii nkye ɔkyɛ nɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 62:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 62:2" />Lete nɔɔ ninle difuɔnkpaa nii ku didiki nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:2">nnwɔɔ ninle kɔba nii, namatũkũ diidii.<verse eid="PSA 62:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 62:3" />Ɔmɛmbe fabadieko otii faanaase?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:3">Oyoyiɛ wɔ mmle ninkpɛ ni, kɔba ko nikɔkpà ni-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:3">bamuu lee bibafuki nwɔ mintɛ kaasɔ?<verse eid="PSA 62:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 62:4" />Ɔtɛ bɛɛtɛ alɛ bɔɔtakatɛ nwɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:4">di kayilakɔ kplɛ nɔɔ suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:4">suoto n-yɔɔ ma di sɛlaa ku afunu suoto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 62:4">Manwii lɛyɔɔ ku nnya lɛma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:4">kafɔɔ mankpaani di situ lɛma kamɛ. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ </char><verse eid="PSA 62:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 62:5" />O ɔkla nii, miɛ ɔnyɛɛ ɔtɛ di Yaa lete kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:5">osuku onyu nii nkye ɔkyɛ nɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 62:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 62:6" />Lete nɔɔ ninle difuɔnkpaa nii ku didiki nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:6">nnwɔɔ ninle kɔba nii, namatũkũ.<verse eid="PSA 62:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 62:7" />Didiki nii ku dibu nii ntika di Yaa suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:7">nnwɔɔ ninle difuɔnkpaa kplɛ nii ku katanikokɔ nii nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 62:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 62:8" />O batii, obe lele bitika nwɔ disi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:8">bidiki situ lee kamɛ sɛlaa bitɔkɔ nwɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:8">diekye Yaa ninle katanikokɔ loo. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ </char><verse eid="PSA 62:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 62:9" />Batii ba ninaa ni kɔnɛɛ nte fɛ kɔfɛɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:9">batii ba ninkpe ni kɔnɛɛ nle balaatɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 62:9">nse bɛɛkadi ma di lɛkadisaa suoto, baale lɛsalɛsaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:9">akyuu nwu anyɔ kɔfɛɛfɔ lete ko bale.<verse eid="PSA 62:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 62:10" />Bitantika disi di katafaa suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:10">ee biatakatɛsa suoto katoo di ayusaa kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 62:10">kuntɛ lɛsaawɛ lee kɔtaka katoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:10">bitanta situ lee latika ninnya suoto.<verse eid="PSA 62:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 62:11" />Ɔlaa onwii di Yaa ntoobuɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:11">ɛlaa ɛnyɔ lenu:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 62:11">O Yaa, alɛ afɔ fakpe osie,<verse eid="PSA 62:11" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 62:12" />O Saate, alɛ afɔ fambɔmbɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 62:12">Nwaako fabata otii biala letota</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 62:12">di nle ɛɛbla ni kanya.<verse eid="PSA 62:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 62" />
  <chapter number="63" style="c" sid="PSA 63" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 63</para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa Owolaa Nwaa</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu. Di obe wɔ aawɛ ni di Yuda Ɔfaafuu.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 63:1" />O Yaa, afɔ ninle Yaa nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:1">kowolaa fɔ osie kanya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 63:1">otukɔnsɔ nkle ɔkla nii di suoto lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:1">suoto nii kowolaa fɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 63:1">di kasɔ kosole ku kasɔ ka nintookpi ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:1">di lɛba le di ntu nnaa nii.<verse eid="PSA 63:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 63:2" />Ntɔɔnya fɔ di kakleklekɔ nwu kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:2">lɛnya osie lɛfɔ ku lɛkpa lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 63:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 63:3" />Diekye lɛbɔmbɔ lɛfɔ nlɛ dilenke nkpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:3">anyasibi nii madiki fɔ kɔlɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 63:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 63:4" />Matansa fɔ di obe wɔ lɛnya nkpe ni nkpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:4">di leyooto lɛfɔ kamɛ matakatɛsa nnɛɛ nii katoo.<verse eid="PSA 63:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 63:5" />Ɔkla nii mamiɛ ku alesaa ya niɛtɛ alɛ ni nwaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:5">ku sinu ɔsa anyasibi, kanya nii matansa fɔ.<verse eid="PSA 63:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 63:6" />Nnyuma fɔ di atensaa nii suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:6">mbu fɔ disi kakyɛ kamuu.<verse eid="PSA 63:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 63:7" />Diekye afɔ ninle kyakaakotɛ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:7">nsa sinu di afoko lɛfɔ oyududu kalɔ.<verse eid="PSA 63:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 63:8" />Ɔkla nii nka fɔ di suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:8">koletanɛɛ lɛfɔ lemufũ mi kuklee.<verse eid="PSA 63:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 63:9" />Babawɔɔsa batii ba nikomiɛ ni nkpa nii ɔlaalaasa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:9">babasoo mansifi kasɔ nwu kakyofokɔ.<verse eid="PSA 63:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 63:10" />Babayɔ ma manta kapamii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:10">mankple alesaa manta lepoo kamɛ baweewee.<verse eid="PSA 63:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 63:11" />Kafɔɔ ɔka manya suoto lɛyɔɔ di Yaa kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:11">batii ba bamuu niɛka ni ntam di Yaa leyooto kamɛ matansa nwɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 63:11">di obe wɔ babamaasa ni balaatɛ nnya.<verse eid="PSA 63:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 63" />
  <chapter number="64" style="c" sid="PSA 64" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 64</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Diɛta Ni Kanyu</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu. Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 64:1" />O Yaa, nu mi sɛlɔ, di obe wɔ kɔka ɔlaa nii nitika fɔ ni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:1">fũ mi nkpa fakyeko lo nii afunaa kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 64:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 64:2" />Wofasa mi di bakpiletɛ kanwumbe nwu kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:2">di sikpile bablatɛ kpinwu kudu nwu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 64:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 64:3" />Bɛɛlɔɔfɔ sɛkplalomii lɛma fɛle mpamii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:3">bɔɔtɛ kafɔɔ sɛlaa lɛma fɛle akplɔ yakayaka.<verse eid="PSA 64:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 64:4" />Mantaa otii wɔ ninambla ni okpile mankyeko nwofakɔ lɛma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:4">mantaa di difua kamɛ, manan-yɛkɛ nii.<verse eid="PSA 64:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 64:5" />Mankpee bawo osie di sikpile ole sisuku suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:5">mankakatɛ di mmle babawofasa ni sikũ lɛma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:5">mambuɛ alɛ, "Owe nimanya ma?"<verse eid="PSA 64:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 64:6" />Mambu sikpile ole mambuɛ alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:6">"Butoodiki kɔkpaa biene!"</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:6">Nwaako otii disibu ku otu kamɛ lekyofo.<verse eid="PSA 64:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 64:7" />Kafɔɔ Yaa mataa ma ku akplɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:7">nfanwu babataa ma mantɛ kaasɔ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 64:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 64:8" />Abamunikĩisa sɛkplalomii lɛma simu ankpee ma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:8">anta ma kafɔɔ man-wɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:8">batii ba bamuu nimanya ma ni matũkunsa asi lɛma mamma.<verse eid="PSA 64:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 64:9" />Batii bamuu mayɛkɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:9">babayie Yaa sɛkpɛ nwu lɛkya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:9">mambu sĩ disi di nle ɛɛbla ni suoto.<verse eid="PSA 64:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 64:10" />Ta batininitɛ banya suoto lɛyɔɔ di Saate nwu kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:10">baataniko nwɔ kafɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 64:10">ta batii ba bamuu niɛbla ni tinini di situ lɛma kamɛ batansa nwɔ!<verse eid="PSA 64:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 64" />
  <chapter number="65" style="c" sid="PSA 65" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 65</para>
  <para style="s1">Katansa Ku Sɛfa Ɔpɛ</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu. Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 65:1" />O Yaa, katansa nsoko fɔ di Sion;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:1">afɔ bubata ntam asaa loo munta.<verse eid="PSA 65:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 65:2" />O afɔ wɔ ninnu ni ɔlaa ɔpɛ ɔta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:2">ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ di batii bamuu mawa.<verse eid="PSA 65:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 65:3" />Obe wɔ di sikpile lalenkee wo ni nnɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:3">faayɔ ɔtanlolaa loo ɔbla faakyɛ wo.<verse eid="PSA 65:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 65:4" />Suoto siyɔɔ batii ba feediki ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:4">fɛɛkpaa ma kafɔɔ falɛ babasiɛ ni di akpata lɛfɔ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 65:4">Leyo lɛfɔ asaa biene nwu ntoomiɛsa wo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:4">di olekatakɔ klekle lɛfɔ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 65:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 65:5" />Afɔ niatuna faata wo ku sɛsaabla tinini se niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:5">O Yaa, Dikitɛ loo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 65:5">kasɔ kamuu nyɛntɛlekɔ osuku onyu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:5">ku lekpo nwu di kakyonkɔ,<verse eid="PSA 65:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 65:6" />niabla ni abokote di osie lɛfɔ kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:6">fɛɛyɔ osie feeminisa ɔ̀tɔ,<verse eid="PSA 65:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 65:7" />afɔ wɔ ninyɔɔsa ni lekpo kɔfɛɛfɔ kanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:7">afɛɛfɔ lɛma nwu nikofuu ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:7">ku nnle nwu kudú.<verse eid="PSA 65:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 65:8" />Mba ninsi ni di kakyonkɔ kɔyɛkɛ ablasaa lɛfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:8">di nfũ di kale nsɛ ni ku kale nloo ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:8">nsa ni suoto lɛyɔɔ sinu.<verse eid="PSA 65:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 65:9" />Fannyu kasɔ nwu fankpete ka ntu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:9">fanta ka kanlɛ nwaa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:9">Yaa sekle leyii ku ntu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:9">alɛ siata batii alesaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:9">diekye nkpo fɛɛbla ka nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 65:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 65:10" />Afɔ ninkpete sekplo nɔɔ ntu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:10">fankyɛkyɛsa kafɔɔ atii ninya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 65:10">fan-yɔɔsa nya ku kanto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:10">fanwii lɛyɔɔ, alesaa nwu kafɔɔ nlɛ.<verse eid="PSA 65:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 65:11" />Fanta lɛlɛɛ nwu nloo ku alesaa kpinwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:11">kakɔlele di alokonkyɛ lɛfɔ lefe kafɔɔ alesaa nwɛ kpinwu.<verse eid="PSA 65:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 65:12" />Babɔkɛɛ sɛfa nweekɔ di ɔfaafuu nlɛ bokoboko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:12">akpenkpe nwu nnya suoto lɛyɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 65:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 65:13" />Babɔkɛɛ sɛfa kaweekɔ leyii ku batie ku bafoso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:13">sɛtaata nwu kafɔɔ leyii ku atitabi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 65:13">booyiisa kudu, mansa sinu ku suoto lɛyɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 65:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 65" />
  <chapter number="66" style="c" sid="PSA 66" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 66</para>
  <para style="s1">Katansa Ku Sɛfa Ɔpɛ Onu</para>
  <para style="d">Onu. Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 66:1" />Kasɔ kamuu yiisa kudu ku suoto lɛyɔɔ bita Yaa!<verse eid="PSA 66:1" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 66:2" />Bisa sinu se nimata ni leyooto nɔɔ dibu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:2">bita dibu disiɛ di katansa nɔɔ!<verse eid="PSA 66:2" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 66:3" />Tɔkɔ Yaa falɛ, "Lɛyɛkɛ nsi di sɛsaabla lɛfɔ kamɛ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:3">Osie lɛfɔ lɛtɛ kuomuɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:3">alɛ balo lɛfɔ nwakasɔ di anu lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 66:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 66:4" />Kasɔ kamuu nwakasɔ kanta fɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:4">mansa katansa sinu manta fɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:4">mansa katansa sinu mata leyooto lɛfɔ.” <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ </char><verse eid="PSA 66:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 66:5" />Biwa biɛbanyu nle di Yaa lɛbla ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:5">mmle di sɛkpɛ nɔɔ nle ni lɛyɛkɛ di batii kamɛ!<verse eid="PSA 66:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 66:6" />Aata lekpo lakple kasɔ kosole,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:6">baafe di ntu nwu kamɛ ku nkpaa-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:6">biwa, biɛta bunya suoto lɛyɔɔ di kamɛ nɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 66:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 66:7" />Oole sɛka dinaa ni kaloo ku osie nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:7">anu nɔɔ kɔnya nnle nwu-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:7">bitanta batokopĩitɛ lataka baayila nwɔ di suoto. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ </char><verse eid="PSA 66:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 66:8" />O batii, bitansa Yaa loo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:8">bita banu katansa nɔɔ sɛlɔ nwu;<verse eid="PSA 66:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 66:9" />eenyu nkpa loo disi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:9">annyu nkpaa loo kafɔɔ alɛ diɛfɛntɛ.<verse eid="PSA 66:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 66:10" />O Yaa, diekye afɔ niasɔ wo faanyu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:10">feefoto wo fɛle koto fututu.<verse eid="PSA 66:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 66:11" />Faatɛ wo di leyo katenkɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:11">faayɔ atoo kafɔɔ faatika di mmaa loo.<verse eid="PSA 66:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 66:12" />Fɛɛta batii kosiɛ di asi loo manfe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:12">buafe di ɔtɔ ku ntu kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:12">kafɔɔ faakpaa wo faawako lɛba le di lɛlɛ nkpe nii.<verse eid="PSA 66:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 66:13" />Kamawa olekatakɔ lɛfɔ ku ofiɛ asaaɔta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:13">kamale kafɔɔ onukwale nta fɔ di ntam nii kanya-<verse eid="PSA 66:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 66:14" />ntam be di anyasibi nii labuɛ aatɛ ni ku kanya nii lakakatɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:14">di obe wɔ lawɛ ni ɔlaa.<verse eid="PSA 66:14" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 66:15" />Kamayɔ babɔkɛɛ ba ninsi ni lɛla nta oleɔta nta fɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:15">ku asaaɔta akunumuu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:15">kamata banankyue ku batie nta fɔ. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ </char><verse eid="PSA 66:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 66:16" />Aye ba bamuu ninyɛkɛ ni Yaa, biwa biɛbanu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:16">bitɛɛntɔkɔ ye lɛsaa le ɛɛbla ɛɛtɛɛ ni.<verse eid="PSA 66:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 66:17" />Lawi lalɛɛ nwɔ ku kanya nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:17">katansa nɔɔ ntika di ɔkplalomii nii suoto.<verse eid="PSA 66:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 66:18" />Nse fɛ mbɔmbɔ okpile di otu nii kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:18">see Saate nwu ditaakyɔɔ mi atoko;<verse eid="PSA 66:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 66:19" />kafɔɔ nwaako Yaa ntɔɔkyɔɔ mi atoko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:19">eenu kafɔɔ sɛlɔ nii di ɔlaa ɔpɛ kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 66:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 66:20" />Baatansa Yaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:20">nnwɔ nintasĩ ni ɔlaa ɔpɛ ɔta nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 66:20">ee adiɛ mi ni lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ ɔta!<verse eid="PSA 66:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 66" />
  <chapter number="67" style="c" sid="PSA 67" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 67</para>
  <para style="s1">Sɛfa Ɔpɛ Onu</para>
  <para style="d">Onu. Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ. Basa nwu ku sikũ sanku.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 67:1" />Yaa ale wo sibualɛ aawii wo lɛyɔɔ kafɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:1">aata kafɔɔ anu nɔɔ akpa akpete wo, <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ </char><verse eid="PSA 67:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 67:2" />alɛ baatofo sisuku lɛfɔ kaasɔ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:2">didiki lɛfɔ nwu di nnle mmuu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 67:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 67:3" />O Yaa, ta batii nwu batansa fɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:3">ta batii nwu bamuu batansa fɔ.<verse eid="PSA 67:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 67:4" />Bita nnle nwu bapɔ, baasa suoto lɛyɔɔ sinu kafɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:4">diekye foole sɛka di batii suoto di osuku kanya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:4">fɔɔkpaa kafɔɔ nnle nwu kaasɔ suoto. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ </char><verse eid="PSA 67:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 67:5" />O Yaa, ta batii nwu batansa fɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:5">ta batii nwu bamuu batansa fɔ.<verse eid="PSA 67:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 67:6" />Ni kasɔ nwu kamalɛ alesaa ninya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:6">ni Yaa, Yaa loo, mawii wo lɛyɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 67:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 67:7" />Yaa mawii wo lɛyɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 67:7">ni kasɔ nyɛntɛlekɔ nwu mmuu kafɔɔ mayɛkɛ nwɔ.<verse eid="PSA 67:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 67" />
  <chapter number="68" style="c" sid="PSA 68" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 68</para>
  <para style="s1">Kale Lelenkee Onu</para>
  <para style="d">Onu. Dawid onu. Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 68:1" />Yaa ataka, aata balo nɔɔ basamii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:1">ta bakyiditɛ nɔɔ batoso di anu nɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 68:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 68:2" />Fɛ mmle kɔɔfɛɛfɔ nfɛ kɔyɔ kunsifiko nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:2">nkpo faafɛ ma fansifiko nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:2">fɛ mmle di sɛtɔ̀ nnyinakĩi ni di ɔtɔ katũ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:2">nkpo di bakpiletɛ bawɔɔ di Yaa anu nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 68:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 68:3" />Kafɔɔ ta batininitɛ bapɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:3">baanya suoto lɛyɔɔ kafɔɔ di Yaa anu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:3">ta suoto siyɔɔ ma baapɔ.<verse eid="PSA 68:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 68:4" />Bisa sinu bita Yaa, bisa katansa sinu bita leyooto nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:4">bitakatɛsa nnwɔ ninsiɛ ni di alokonkyɛ suoto katoo-</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:4">leyooto nɔɔ ninle Saate nɛ-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:4">binya suoto lɛyɔɔ di anu nɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 68:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 68:5" />Kote ale ɛɛta bakuɛbi, bakpisɔfɔ nyuntɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:5">ninle Yaa di kasiɛkɔ klekle nɔɔ nwu nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 68:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 68:6" />Yaa nta batii ba dielo ni banantii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:6">anleko leyo batentɛ katũ ku sinu ɔsa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:6">kafɔɔ batokopĩitɛ nsiɛ di kufĩ- kufĩ kpankpa kasɔ suoto.<verse eid="PSA 68:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 68:7" />O Yaa, nse feedie kayi di batii lɛfɔ anu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:7">nse fɛɛkyɛ feefe di ɔfaafuu nwu, <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ </char><verse eid="PSA 68:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 68:8" />kasɔ nwu ntũkũ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:8">kanto nnɔɔ ankye osi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:8">di Yaa anu, Nnwɔ niekye ni Sinai,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:8">di Yaa anu, Israel Yaa nwu.<verse eid="PSA 68:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 68:9" />O Yaa, faata kanto kpinwu lanɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:9">faakple faasɛnkɛsa atesaa lɛfɔ kofole nwu.<verse eid="PSA 68:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 68:10" />Batii lasiɛ ninka suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:10">O Yaa, di lɛlɛ lɛfɔ nwu kamɛ faabie asaa faata bapiitɛ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 68:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 68:11" />Saate nwu labuɛ ɔlaa nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:11">ni di mba niale ni dikudi kplɛ layie nwu lɛkya nɛ:<verse eid="PSA 68:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 68:12" />"Baka ku bakpɛtɛ latoso ku nkye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:12">batii lasɛ kakpɛ asaa nwu di nsikɔ nwu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 68:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 68:13" />Bia obe wɔ bite ni di nsikɔ sɛtɔ kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:13">beetĩi ablonuma nii afoko ku koto fututu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:13">selonkoo nɔɔ ku koto sɛɛle seseele.”<verse eid="PSA 68:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 68:14" />Obe wɔ di Nnwɔ Ninlenke ni lasamiisa ni baka nwu di kasɔ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:14">ote diate fɛle atubakanii nikɔkpakpa di Salmon.<verse eid="PSA 68:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 68:15" />Basan abokote nwu nle abokote kplɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:15">Basan abokote nwu lekyookyoo.<verse eid="PSA 68:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 68:16" />O abokote kyookyoo, obe oso fɔɔkpɛ sɛsɔfɔwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:16">di kobokote ko di Yaa lediki alɛ oole ni sɛka suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:16">di nfũ di Saate nwu omu kamasiɛ ni dinaa ni kaloo?<verse eid="PSA 68:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 68:17" />Yaa bakeke ba di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi ni nle nkpe afosi, afosi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:17">ku nkpe nkpe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:17">Saate nwu ntookye Sinai ɛɛbabuo lɛkpaayo klekle nɔɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 68:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 68:18" />Obe wɔ faataka faasifi ni osi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:18">faakpaa batii ba faakpɛ faafũ ni faasifiko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:18">faafũ akyɛsaa di batii nfũ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:18">bia di batokopĩitɛ nfũ-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:18">O Saate Yaa, alɛ afɔ faasiɛ ninfa.<verse eid="PSA 68:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 68:19" />Baatansa Saate nwu, Yaa Dikitɛ loo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:19">nnwɔ nintuka ni atoo loo dii biala. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ </char><verse eid="PSA 68:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 68:20" />Yaa loo nle Yaa wɔ nindiki ni batii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:20">Saate nwu Ninlenke ni nfũ di odie di kukpi kamɛ nkye.<verse eid="PSA 68:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 68:21" />Nwaako Saate mabibiɛ balo nɔɔ asi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:21">mba ninkpe ni asi sinwini wua basi ni di sikpile lɛma kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 68:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 68:22" />Saate nwu alɛ, "Kamakpaa ma nkyeko Basan;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:22">kamadiki ma nkyeko lɛkpo nkyofokɔ nwu kamɛ,<verse eid="PSA 68:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 68:23" />alɛ fabayɔ nkpaa lɛfɔ fankpee di bakyiditɛ lɛfɔ ntɔ kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:23">alɛ baweewee lɛfɔ sɛkplalomii nwɛ lele lɛma.”<verse eid="PSA 68:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 68:24" />O Yaa, lɛkyɛmbi lɛfɔ nfɛ nte bɔɔnya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:24">Yaa nii ku Ɔka, lɛkyɛmbi lɛfɔ nwu obuo di lɛkpaayo klekle nwu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 68:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 68:25" />Sinu basantɛ nle katũ, mma sɛmaa basanku bapɛtɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:25">di bakpeele nsi ma ni kaamɛ bɔɔsɔkɔ ni akasa.<verse eid="PSA 68:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 68:26" />Bitansa Yaa di dikudi kplɛ nwu kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:26">bitansa Saate nwu di Israel kasiisakɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 68:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 68:27" />Benyamin kɔna biibii nleko ma katũ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:27">Yuda banɔɔfotii dikudi kplɛ nkpe ninfa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:27">nfa kafɔɔ di Sebulum ku Naftali banɔɔfotii nkpe nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 68:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 68:28" />O Yaa, diki osie lɛfɔ fatuo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:28">O Yaa, tuo wo ɔnyɛɛ lɛfɔ, fɛ mmle fatodibla ni.<verse eid="PSA 68:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 68:29" />Ta olekatakɔ lɛfɔ nwu di Yerusalem oso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:29">baka mawako fɔ akyɛsaa.<verse eid="PSA 68:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 68:30" />Sĩ ɔlaa fata lepoo kamɛ babɔkɛɛ di anwaakɛ kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:30">faasĩ ɔlaa fata banankyue suɔtɔ dikudi nwu di anankyuebi di nnle nwu kamɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:30">Ta ma bawakosa suoto kasɔ, baawako koto fututu aboo.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:30">Samiisa nnle be di nkpɛ lɛmɛnɛmɛnɛ ni.<verse eid="PSA 68:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 68:31" />Banɔɔfo makye Egipte manwa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:31">Kus mayɔ suoto nɔɔ anta Yaa.<verse eid="PSA 68:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 68:32" />O sɛka nlekɔ kaasɔ suoto, bisa sinu bita Yaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:32">bisa katansa sinu bita Saate nwu, <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ </char><verse eid="PSA 68:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 68:33" />bita nnwɔ ninsiɛ ni di saa kolo di osi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:33">ankpududuu ni ku sɛlɔ kplɛ.<verse eid="PSA 68:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 68:34" />Biyie Yaa osie nwu lɛkya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:34">oole ni sɛka di Israel suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:34">di osie nɔɔ nkpe ni di kolo.<verse eid="PSA 68:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 68:35" />O Yaa, lɛyɛkɛ nsi kaamɛ lɛfɔ di lɛkpaayo klekle lɛfɔ kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 68:35">Israel Yaa nwu nta batii nɔɔ osie ku ɔnyɛɛ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 68:35" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 68:35">Baatansa Yaa!<verse eid="PSA 68:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 68" />
  <chapter number="69" style="c" sid="PSA 69" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 69</para>
  <para style="s1">Kaku Owi Diɛta Ni Lɛkyakaako</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu. Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ. Basa nwu di "Lili" sɛlɔ kanya.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 69:1" />O Yaa, diki mi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:1">diekye ntu nwu ntoodu simu nii.<verse eid="PSA 69:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 69:2" />Ntɔɔmɛ di apatapata kyofole kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:2">lɛba le di kɔkpaa kasekɔ nnaa nii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:2">Ntoodu ntu kyofole kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:2">ntu ntooyii diemufũ mi.<verse eid="PSA 69:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 69:3" />Koloo okpi komiɛ ni lɛkyakaako;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:3">ɔkɔnsɔ nii ntookoso.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:3">Anu nii nte tutufuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:3">oowolaa ni Yaa nii.<verse eid="PSA 69:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 69:4" />Batii ba niekyidi mi ni kasakasa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:4">mpɔ balenke disi nii sinwini;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:4">balo nii mpɔ ninambla ni lɛsalɛsaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:4">mba nikomiɛ alɛ bawɔɔsa mi nii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:4">Boonyinka mi alɛ nta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:4">lɛsaa le ninan-yu ni koto.<verse eid="PSA 69:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 69:5" />O Yaa, faye mi dibuu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:5">lɛpɔɔ nii okpi diele fɔ lewofasaa.<verse eid="PSA 69:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 69:6" />Tanta mba nikonyu fɔ ni osuku</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:6">sinunsɔ lakpɛ ma ta ami oso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:6">O Saate, Saate wɔ Ninlenke ni;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:6">tanta baakpee mba ninwolaa fɔ ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:6">sinunsɔ ta ami oso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:6">O Israel Yaa.<verse eid="PSA 69:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 69:7" />Nfũ ditufa ta afɔ oso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:7">nioso sinunsɔ leyii mi anu.<verse eid="PSA 69:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 69:8" />Ɔfɔɔ nle nta babiloo suɔtɔbi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:8">kɔnalookyo nta yaami babisuɔtɔbi;<verse eid="PSA 69:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 69:9" />diekye oleɔyɔ di leyo lɛfɔ ntoole mi kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:9">mba nintufa fɔ ni atufa kafɔɔ ntika mi di suoto.<verse eid="PSA 69:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 69:10" />Nse lewi, lenii kanya kafɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:10">dikpeni nfũ atufa,<verse eid="PSA 69:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 69:11" />nse leklee kaku asaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:11">batii nnyu mi nyakatãa.<verse eid="PSA 69:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 69:12" />Mba ninsiɛ ni di kayoko mma mi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:12">nle kafɔɔ onu nta batasiɛntɛ.<verse eid="PSA 69:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 69:13" />O Saate, kafɔɔ mpɛ ɔlaa nta fɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:13">di sibualɛ lɛfɔ obe kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:13">O Yaa, di lɛbɔmbɔ kplɛ lɛfɔ nwu kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:13">tuna mi ku onukwale lɛfɔ didiki.<verse eid="PSA 69:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 69:14" />Diki mi di apatapata kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:14">tantɛɛ lamɛɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:14">diki mi fakyeko mba niekyidi mi ni nnɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:14">fakyeko ntu kyofole nwu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 69:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 69:15" />Tanta ntu oyii nwu layɔ mi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:15">ee lamɛɛ di kakyofokɔ nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:15">ee dibiɔ nwu kanya katĩi mi kaakpee kaamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 69:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 69:16" />O Saate, tuna mi di lɛbɔmbɔ biene lɛfɔ nwu kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:16">di nyaami ɔnya lɛfɔ kplɛ kamɛ, munikĩi fawa ɔkyɛ nii.<verse eid="PSA 69:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 69:17" />Tanwofasa anu lɛfɔ di kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:17">tuna fatɛɛ wla, diekye ɔlaa letũ mi.<verse eid="PSA 69:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 69:18" />Tɛɛtɛɛ mi faafũ mi kafɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:18">diki mi ta bakyiditɛ nii oso.<verse eid="PSA 69:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 69:19" />Faye mmle bootufa mi, mankpee ni sinunsɔ, mannyu mi ni kafɔɔ nyakatãa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:19">balo nii bamuu nsi di anu lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 69:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 69:20" />Atufa ntoobiɛ mi otu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:20">diɛta alɛ lɛkyakaako nnaa mi kafɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:20">komiɛ lɛkyakaako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:20">kafɔɔ kuninwii nnaa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:20">kɔnɛɛ kaafutu bakpeetɛ, kafɔɔ ntawɛ kuonwii.<verse eid="PSA 69:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 69:21" />Baakpee kɔfa loonle di alesaa nii kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:21">baatɛɛ kafɔɔ katabu alɛ nnyi di otukɔnsɔ kanya.<verse eid="PSA 69:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 69:22" />Ta alesaa opunu wɔ beese ni di anu lɛma kukple dikyĩ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:22">ta nwu kukple letoko nanfi ku okũ.<verse eid="PSA 69:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 69:23" />Ta anu awɔfɔ ma alɛ blasinnya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:23">mmaa lɛma kafɔɔ dibo dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="PSA 69:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 69:24" />Nyɛɛnɛ ɔblɔ lɛfɔ fakpete ma di suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:24">faata lɛblɔfiɛ yakayaka lɛfɔ kafɔɔ dilenkee ma.<verse eid="PSA 69:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 69:25" />Ta kasiɛkɔ lɛma kate kafukuti;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:25">tanta kuonwii lasiɛ di akpanta lɛma kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 69:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 69:26" />Diekye batikanko mba feetika ni nkɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:26">mankakatɛ kafɔɔ di mba beepila ni ninyinyi suoto.<verse eid="PSA 69:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 69:27" />Nanfi ma kootoko faakple fananfi ma kootoko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:27">tanta ma baawɛ didiki lɛfɔ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 69:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 69:28" />Ta bayɛɛsa ma ayooto di nkpa kukũ kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:28">tanta kafɔɔ baakpana ma ayooto baakpee di batininitɛ kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 69:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 69:29" />Nsi di ninyinyi ku dibuo kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:29">O Yaa, ta didiki lɛfɔ dinyu mi.<verse eid="PSA 69:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 69:30" />Matansa Yaa leyooto ku sinu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:30">matɔɔ dibu ku sɛfa ɔpɛ.<verse eid="PSA 69:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 69:31" />Nle mmle mabuo Saate nwu anu ninlenkee nankyue wɔ beediki ni ɔsayɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:31">ninlenkee nankyue suɔtɔ ku akya ku akpɔbi nɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 69:31" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 69:32" />Bapiitɛ manya mampɔ kafɔɔ-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:32">aye ba ninwolaa ni Yaa, situ lee sisiɛ nkpa!<verse eid="PSA 69:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 69:33" />Saate nwu nnu mba diefĩ ni sɛlɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:33">annsĩ kafɔɔ batii nɔɔ ba ninte ni di ayo katenkɔ.<verse eid="PSA 69:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 69:34" />Ta osi ku kasɔ batansa nwɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:34">lekpo nwu ku asaa ya amuu ninkyɛ ni kaamɛ,<verse eid="PSA 69:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 69:35" />diekye Yaa kamadiki Sion</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:35">anse kafɔɔ Yuda sekpoo kplɛ nwu dibudi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 69:35">Ni batii masiɛ ninfa kanle ma kale;<verse eid="PSA 69:35" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 69:36" />bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ babi nimale ka asaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 69:36">mba kafɔɔ nimbɔmbɔ ni leyooto nɔɔ nimasiɛ ninfa.<verse eid="PSA 69:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 69" />
  <chapter number="70" style="c" sid="PSA 70" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 70</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Diɛta Ni Lɛkyakaako</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu. Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ. Ɔlaa ɔyɔ ɔtɛ di anu.</para>
  <para style="r">(Ps 40.13–17)</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 70:1" />O Yaa, pɛsɛwa faadiki mi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:1">O Saate, wa wla faabakyakaako mi.<verse eid="PSA 70:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 70:2" />Ta batii ba nikomiɛ mi ni dikple</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:2">banunsɔ baakpɔkpɔtɔ kafɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 70:2">ta mba bamuu nikomiɛ mi ni kawɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:2">bakple nkpaamaa ku sinunsɔ.<verse eid="PSA 70:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 70:3" />Ta mba nikobuɛ ni alɛ, "Ɛhɛ̃ɛ! ɛhɛ̃ɛ!"</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:3">bakple nkpaamaa ta sinunsɔ lɛma oso.<verse eid="PSA 70:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 70:4" />Kafɔɔ ta mba ninwolaa fɔ ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:4">banya suoto lɛyɔɔ baapɔ kaamɛ lɛfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 70:4">Ta mba nimbɔmbɔ ni didiki lɛfɔ obe lele babuɛ alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:4">"Ta batakatɛsa Yaa katoo!"<verse eid="PSA 70:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 70:5" />Kafɔɔ dipii nkle mi, diefĩ mi kafɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:5">O Yaa, wa ɔkyɛ nii wla.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 70:5">Afɔ ninle lɛkyakaako nii ku dikitɛ nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 70:5">O Saate, tankyɛkyɛlɛ.<verse eid="PSA 70:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 70" />
  <chapter number="71" style="c" sid="PSA 71" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 71</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔnɔɔfo Onwii Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 71:1" />O Saate, afɔ lɛtaniko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:1">tanta sinunsɔ lakpɛ mi diidii.<verse eid="PSA 71:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 71:2" />Fũ mi faadiki mi di ɔsaabla tinini lɛfɔ kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:2">kyɔɔ mi kotoko lɛfɔ faadiki mi kafɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 71:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 71:3" />Le katanikokɔ nii difuɔnkpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:3">di lɛba le kafuo ni ɔkyɛ obe lele;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 71:3">diki kanya kaadiki mi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:3">diekye afɔ ninle difuɔnkpaa nii ku kɔba nii.<verse eid="PSA 71:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 71:4" />O Yaa nii, diki mi fakyeko bakpiletɛ nnɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:4">fakyeko batii kpile ku amumu bablatɛ nnɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 71:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 71:5" />O Saate Kplɛ, diekye afɔ ninle osuku onyu nii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 71:5">anu nii ditikasaa diɛyɔ ni di sekosopo nii obe.<verse eid="PSA 71:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 71:6" />Diɛyɔ ni di kalofokɔ nii letika fɔ anu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:6">faalofo mi faakyeko yaami olofofɔtɔ kamɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:6">Kamatansa fɔ obe lele.<verse eid="PSA 71:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 71:7" />Ntɔɔbla fɛle ɔtɛ onyu lɛta batii kpinwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:7">kafɔɔ afɔ ninle katanikokɔ nii siene.<verse eid="PSA 71:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 71:8" />Kanya nii leyii ku katansa lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:8">ndiki dibu lɛfɔ mbuɛ dii kufĩ kumu.<verse eid="PSA 71:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 71:9" />Tan-yɔ mi faayu nse ntoobe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:9">tandiɛ mi nnɛɛ nse ɔnyɛɛ nii ntooloo.<verse eid="PSA 71:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 71:10" />Diekye balo nii kɔkakatɛ di suoto nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:10">mba ninsoko alɛ boolo mi ni kokpee asi baawo.<verse eid="PSA 71:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 71:11" />Boobuɛ alɛ, "Yaa ntoodiɛ nwɔ nnɛɛ; bitikanko nwɔ biemufũ nwɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:11">diekye kuonwii dilɔbafũ nwɔ.”<verse eid="PSA 71:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 71:12" />O Yaa, tankyo mi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:12">O Yaa nii, wa wla faabakyakaako mi.<verse eid="PSA 71:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 71:13" />Ta kanya nii babuditɛ bawɔɔ ku sinunsɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:13">ta mba nikomiɛ alɛ babla mi ni amumu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:13">bafũ atufa ku sinunsɔ.<verse eid="PSA 71:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 71:14" />Kafɔɔ ami yi, kamawɛ osuku onyu obe lele;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:14">kamatansa fɔ nkple ntansa fɔ.<verse eid="PSA 71:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 71:15" />Kanya nii mabuɛ ɔsaabla tinini lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:15">di didiki lɛfɔ dii kufĩ kumu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:15">nu ninan-ye mmle di lɛpɔ nini nte nii.<verse eid="PSA 71:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 71:16" />O Saate Kplɛ, kamawa mayie lɛkya di ablasaa kplɛ lɛfɔ suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:16">kamayie lɛkya di ɔsaabla tinini lɛfɔ, lete lɛfɔ lele suoto.<verse eid="PSA 71:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 71:17" />O Yaa, diayɔ ni di sekosopo nii obe faatuo mi asaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:17">ni di miɛ dii le mmle kobuɛ sɛsaabla lɛfɔ se niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ ntuo nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 71:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 71:18" />Kuntɛ obe wɔ ntoobe lepu ni disi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:18">O Yaa, tandiɛ mi nnɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 71:18">diediki lebuɛ osie lɛfɔ lɛtɔkɔ ana ya sɛɛmaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:18">mbuɛ osie lɛfɔ ntɔkɔ batii ba bamuu nimawa nii.<verse eid="PSA 71:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 71:19" />O Yaa, ɔsaabla tinini lɛfɔ ledu osi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:19">afɔ wɔ niɛbla ni asaa kplɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:19">O Yaa, owe ninte fɛle afɔ?<verse eid="PSA 71:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 71:20" />Kuntɛ fɛɛtɛɛ lɛwɛ dibuo kpinwu ku olo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:20">fabakplesa osie nii fantɛɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 71:20">diɛyɔ ni di kasɔ kakyofokɔ nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:20">fabakplesa mi fanwako.<verse eid="PSA 71:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 71:21" />Fabata dibu nii nkple nimpɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:21">fankple fankpee mi kɔnɛɛ kaafutu kafɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 71:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 71:22" />Kamatansa fɔ ku kyitaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:22">O Yaa nii, ta onukwale lɛfɔ oso;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 71:22">O Israel Klekletɛ nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:22">kamasa katansa sinu nta fɔ ku sanku.<verse eid="PSA 71:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 71:23" />Anyasibi nii mayiisa suoto lɛyɔɔ kudu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:23">nse kɔsa katansa sinu nta fɔ-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:23">ami, nnwɔ feediki nii.<verse eid="PSA 71:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 71:24" />Ɔkplalomii nii mabuɛ sɛsaabla tinini lɛfɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:24">dii kufĩ kumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 71:24">diekye mba nikomiɛ alɛ babla mi ni amumu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 71:24">sinunsɔ ntɔɔkpɛ ma bɛɛkpɔkpɔtɔ kafɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 71:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 71" />
  <chapter number="72" style="c" sid="PSA 72" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 72</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Ɔta Ɔka</para>
  <para style="d">Solomo onu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 72:1" />O Yaa, kyakaako ɔka nwu ku lɛka tinini lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:1">ɔka obi nwu ku ɔsaabla tinini lɛfɔ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 72:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 72:2" />Abakanko batii lɛfɔ di ɔsaabla tinini kanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:2">anta bale fɔ ba diobuo ni lɛbɛ.<verse eid="PSA 72:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 72:3" />Abokote nwu kamawako batii nwu lɛlɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:3">akpenkpe nwu nwako ɔsaabla tinini.<verse eid="PSA 72:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 72:4" />Abakpɛ̀ anta mba diobuo ni di batii nwu kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:4">andiki kafɔɔ mba diefĩ ni babi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:4">ababibiɛ amumu baletɛ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 72:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 72:5" />Abasiɛ nkpa fɛ mmle di kufĩ lɛnya kukpe ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:5">fɛ mmle di kɔwɛntɛ lɛnya kukpe ni, ninfe nkpo ninsifi ana amuu.<verse eid="PSA 72:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 72:6" />Abate fɛle kanto nikɔnɔɔ ankpete ni di kofe ko bɛɛkpɛ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:6">fɛle kanto wɛɛwɛɛ nikokpete ni kasɔ nwu ntu.<verse eid="PSA 72:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 72:7" />Di obe nɔɔ kamɛ asaa malɛ anta batininitɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:7">lɛlɛ mawɛ di lɛpɔ kamɛ ninaase di obe wɔ di kɔwɛntɛ dilɔbasinwɛ nii.<verse eid="PSA 72:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 72:8" />Abale sɛka diɛyɔ ni di lekpo kotoko diesifi ni lekpo kotoko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:8">diɛyɔ ni kafɔɔ di Okle diesifi ni kasɔ nwu nyɛntɛlekɔ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 72:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 72:9" />Mba ninsi ni di ɔfaafuu mawakasɔ di anu nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:9">balo nɔɔ kafɔɔ kamale kudu.<verse eid="PSA 72:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 72:10" />Baka nwu di Tarsis ku mba di lekpo kotoko fanfa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:10">mawako nwɔ asɔsĩ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 72:10">baka nwu di Saba ku Seba</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:10">matɔɔ akyɛsaa.<verse eid="PSA 72:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 72:11" />Baka bamuu mawakasɔ mantɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:11">nnle mmuu kafɔɔ masumu nwɔ.<verse eid="PSA 72:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 72:12" />Diekye abadiki nnwɔ diefĩ ni eewi ɛɛlɛɛ nwɔ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:12">nnwɔ diobuo ni anaa ni kuonwii abakyakaako nwɔ ni.<verse eid="PSA 72:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 72:13" />Abanya nnwɔ ninaa ni osie ku nnwɔ diefĩ ni nyaami</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:13">andiki kafɔɔ nnwɔ diefĩ ni ankyeko kukpi nnɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 72:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 72:14" />Abadiki ma ankyeko amiina ku amumu kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:14">diekye ntɔ lɛma lefũ kɔya di anu nɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 72:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 72:15" />Ta asiɛ nkpa aklɛ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:15">Ta bayɔ koto sɛɛle bakyeko Saba bawako nwɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 72:15">Ta batii bapɛ ɔlaa batɔɔ dinaa ni kaloo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:15">baawii nwɔ lɛyɔɔ kafɔɔ dii kufĩ kumu.<verse eid="PSA 72:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 72:16" />Ta atitabi apɔ di kasɔ nwu kamuu suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:16">aakpɛ afɛɛfɔ di akpenkpe nsintɛɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 72:16">Ta nya alɛ fɛle Lebanon ale okle;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:16">ta nya abokoboko fɛle kofe sɛfa.<verse eid="PSA 72:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 72:17" />Ta leyooto nɔɔ dite dinaa ni kaloo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:17">ta dite disifi fɛ mmle di kufĩ lɛnya kukpe ni.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 72:17" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 72:17">Babawii nnle mmuu lɛyɔɔ diefe ni di suoto nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:17">babalɛɛ nwɔ kafɔɔ alɛ lɛyɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 72:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 72:18" />Baatansa Saate Yaa, Israel batii Yaa nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:18">di lete nɔɔ nimbla ni ablasaa ya niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ.<verse eid="PSA 72:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 72:19" />Baatansa leyooto nɔɔ klekle nwu dinaa ni kaloo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 72:19">ta kasɔ kamuu kayii ku lɛkpa nɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 72:19">Diwa kaanya diekple diwa kaanya.<verse eid="PSA 72:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 72:20" />Nle mmle niɛyɛntɛ Yese obisuɔtɔbi Dawid sɛlaa ɔpɛ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 72:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 72" />
  <chapter number="73" style="c" sid="PSA 73" />
  <para style="ms1">Kukũ Tiɛfa</para>
  <para style="mr">Sinu 73-89</para>
  <para style="cl">Onu 73</para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa Lɛka Tinini</para>
  <para style="d">Asaf onu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 73:1" />Nwaako Yaa nlɛ ata Israel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:1">alɛ ata mba niɛkpa ni di situ kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 73:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 73:2" />Kafɔɔ ami yi, nkpaa nii leloo ɔfɛntɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 73:2">leloo kɔkpaa nii kasekɔ oyu.<verse eid="PSA 73:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 73:3" />Diekye nkpɛko mba ninkanta ni sɛsɔfɔwo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:3">nse lɛnya bakpiletɛ lɛsaawɛ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 73:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 73:4" />Banaa dibuo kuninwii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:4">suoto lɛma nlɛ, bakpe osie kafɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 73:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 73:5" />Mma blɔɔnya dibuo le okle di otii kɔnya nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:5">sifiɛ kplɛ se nimpɛ ni otii nimpɛ ma.<verse eid="PSA 73:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 73:6" />Nioso lɛkanta ninle kɔnyɛnɛ lɛma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:6">akpeele lɛma ninle kudú okpee.<verse eid="PSA 73:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 73:7" />Situ kyofole lɛma nwu kamɛ di sikpile nkye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:7">okpile wɔ bakle ni di asibu lɛma nnaa kase.<verse eid="PSA 73:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 73:8" />Maama, mambuɛ sɛlaakuu kafɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:8">di suoto katoo lɛma ɔtakatɛsa kamɛ manfunaa amumu ɔbla.<verse eid="PSA 73:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 73:9" />Mambuɛ sɛlaa kpile di osi suoto ku nnya lɛma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:9">sɛkplalomii lɛma kafɔɔ nfũ kasɔ nwu simpɛ sɛɛkambi.<verse eid="PSA 73:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 73:10" />Nioso batii lɛma nkyi mannyu ma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:10">mannyi ntu kafɔɔ kpinwu.<verse eid="PSA 73:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 73:11" />Mambuɛ alɛ, "Lɛ di Yaa matofo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:11">Nnwɔ Ninlenke ni nkpe lɛsaatofo?"<verse eid="PSA 73:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 73:12" />Nya mmle di bakpiletɛ nte ni-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:12">obe lele baayɔ nwu ole, lɛsaawɛ lɛma kɔpɔ.<verse eid="PSA 73:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 73:13" />Nwaako kasakasa di otu nii lɛkpa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:13">kasakasa lefoto nnɛɛ nii di okpile ɔtambla kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 73:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 73:14" />Ofiɛ kplɛ lɛpɛ mi dii kufĩ kumu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:14">bɔɔnanfi mi kootoko olesɛ biala.<verse eid="PSA 73:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 73:15" />Nse labuɛ nlɛ, "Kamabuɛ nsĩ nkpo,”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:15">see ntabadiki babi lɛfɔ nta.<verse eid="PSA 73:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 73:16" />Nse lakpee kɔnyaabe nlɛ konu n-se mmle simuu kasɔ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:16">diawɛ osie diatɛɛ<verse eid="PSA 73:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 73:17" />diediki labuo di Yaa lɛkpaayo klekle nwu kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:17">fiɛ lanu kalookɔ lɛma kasɔ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 73:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 73:18" />Nwaako fɛɛyɔ ma fɛɛtɛ di kasɔ kplɔkplɔ suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:18">fɛɛtɛ ma kaasɔ alɛ bawɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 73:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 73:19" />Lɛ babawɔɔsa ma nfanfanwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:19">lɛyɛkɛ mafiɛ ma klekle ninsifiko!<verse eid="PSA 73:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 73:20" />Fɛ mmle di kɔlaafɔ nte ni, nse otii lɛsɛnkɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:20">O Saate, nioso nse fɛɛtaka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:20">fabanya ma fɛle kɔlaafɔ ɔsɛ.<verse eid="PSA 73:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 73:21" />Obe wɔ di otu nii lawi nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:21">ninwuna nii kafɔɔ labuo ni nyaami,<verse eid="PSA 73:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 73:22" />ntawɛ disibu, ntatofo lɛsalɛsaa kafɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:22">lale bɔkɛɛ yakayaka di anu lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 73:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 73:23" />Kafɔɔ obe lele nkpe di ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:23">famufũ mi di koletanɛɛ nii.<verse eid="PSA 73:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 73:24" />Fanleko mi katũ ku kɔ̀ka lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:24">sɛmaa kafɔɔ fankpaa mi fankpee di dibu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 73:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 73:25" />Owe ninkpe mi di osi fɛ afɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:25">Lɛsalɛsaa kafɔɔ nnaa kaasɔ nimbɔmbɔ nkyakaa ni di afɔ.<verse eid="PSA 73:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 73:26" />Suoto nii ku otu nii mawakasɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:26">kafɔɔ Yaa ninle otu nii nwu osie</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:26">ku kalekɔ nii dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="PSA 73:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 73:27" />Mba niekyo ni di suoto lɛfɔ makpi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:27">fanwɔɔsa mba bamuu ninaa ni onukwale bɛɛta fɔ ni.<verse eid="PSA 73:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 73:28" />Kafɔɔ ami, dilɛ alɛ lɛtɛɛtɛɛ Yaa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:28">Ntɔɔbla Saate Kplɛ nwu katanikokɔ nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 73:28">kamabuɛ ɔsaabla lɛfɔ omuu.<verse eid="PSA 73:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 73" />
  <chapter number="74" style="c" sid="PSA 74" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 74</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Diɛta Ni Kale Didiki</para>
  <para style="d">
    <char style="tl">maskil</char>
    <note caller="+" style="f">
      <char style="fr" closed="false">6:0 </char>
      <char style="ft" closed="false">Dite fɛle onu lɛsambi lewo dile</char>
    </note> kuɔta ni Asaf.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 74:1" />O Yaa, obe oso fatoosĩ wo nkpo dinaa ni kaloo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:1">Obe oso di ɔblɔ lɛfɔ kɔfiɛ di bafoso sɛfa kaweekɔ lɛfɔ nkpo?<verse eid="PSA 74:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 74:2" />Nyuma batii nwu faaya ni saa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:2">kɔna lɛfɔ nwu atesaa ya faadiki ni-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:2">Sion Kobokote ko faasiɛ ni.<verse eid="PSA 74:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 74:3" />Munikĩisa akpaakyala lɛfɔ fakyɔɔ kawɔɔ ka mmle ninaa ni kaloo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:3">kawɔɔ ka mmle kamuu di balo nwu ntɔɔwako ni di lɛkpaayo klekle nwu suoto.<verse eid="PSA 74:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 74:4" />Bakyiditɛ lɛfɔ kokumii di lɛba le faakyakako wo nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:4">bɛɛtɛ nyilakɔ lɛma nwu fɛ nsũ atɛsaa.<verse eid="PSA 74:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 74:5" />Bɔɔbla fɛle batii nikɔnwanyi nfɛ̀</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:5">alɛ boobudi lɛpooku awoso.<verse eid="PSA 74:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 74:6" />Bɛɛlalaasa ewoso wolale nwu emuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:6">ku nfɛ̀ ku nfɛ̀mii lɛma.<verse eid="PSA 74:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 74:7" />Bɛɛfiɛ lɛkpaayo klekle lɛfɔ nwu bɛɛtɛ kaasɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:7">bɛɛkpɔnɔfɔsa kasiɛkɔ lɛfɔ nwu Leyooto.<verse eid="PSA 74:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 74:8" />Baabuɛ di situ lɛma alɛ, "Bubawɔɔsa ma fɛɛ!"</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:8">Beefiɛ lɛba biala baatoosumu ni Yaa di kasɔ nwu suoto.<verse eid="PSA 74:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 74:9" />Batata wo asaa ya niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ nsũ atɛsaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:9">Yaa ɔlaa buɛtɛtɛ kuonwii diesimbu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:9">kuonwii loo kafɔɔ dieye lɛ di nle mmle mate ninaadu nii.<verse eid="PSA 74:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 74:10" />O Yaa, ɔmɛmbe di balo mama fɔ manaase?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:10">Bakyiditɛ lɛfɔ makyidi leyooto lɛfɔ dinaa ni kaloo?<verse eid="PSA 74:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 74:11" />Obe oso fookplesa kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ, koletanɛɛ lɛfɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:11">Diki kũ di akpeele lɛfɔ kamɛ faawɔɔsa ma.<verse eid="PSA 74:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 74:12" />O Yaa, kafɔɔ diayɔ ni di saa, afɔ ninle ɔka nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:12">fɛɛwako didiki kaasɔ nwu suoto.<verse eid="PSA 74:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 74:13" />Afɔ niasɛ lekpo kamɛ di osie lɛfɔ kanya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:13">afɔ niabibiɛ asaanwu yɛkɛle nwu asi di ntu nwu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 74:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 74:14" />Afɔ niabibiɛ Lefiatan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kɔsaanwu kplɛ kule di lekpo kamɛ</char></note> nwu asi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:14">ni faayɔ nwɔ faata ɔfaafuu babɔkɛɛ fɛ alesaa nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 74:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 74:15" />Afɔ niata sekle ku ntu ntaakɔ lataa ntu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:15">afɔ niasɔɔsa ekle be nimbiɛ sinfe ni obe lele.<verse eid="PSA 74:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 74:16" />Dii nwu lele fɔ dile, kakyɛ nwu kafɔɔ kale fɔ kale;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:16">fɛɛbla kufĩ ku kɔwɛntɛ.<verse eid="PSA 74:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 74:17" />Afɔ ninle nnwɔ niasɛ ni kasɔ nwu amɛ amuu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:17">afɔ niabla kɔkyɛɛ ku kabiene akyuu nwu anyɔ.<verse eid="PSA 74:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 74:18" />O Saate, nyuma mmle di lo nwu lama fɔ ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 74:18">mmle di babuutɛ nwu lekyidi ni leyooto lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 74:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 74:19" />Tan-yɔ ablonuma lɛfɔ nkpa faakpee di lepoo kamɛ babɔkɛɛ nnɛɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:19">tan-yee batii lɛfɔ ba nikonu ni dibuo nkpa dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="PSA 74:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 74:20" />Wɛ dibu fata kanya ninii lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:20">diekye amumu ɔbla leyii ditunu aba di kasɔ nwu suoto.<verse eid="PSA 74:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 74:21" />Tanta mba bɔɔtafaa ni lakple ku sinunsɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:21">ta bapiitɛ ku mba diefĩ ni batansa leyooto lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 74:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 74:22" />O Yaa, taka faata suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:22">nyuma mmle di babuutɛ mma fɔ ni dii kufĩ kumu.<verse eid="PSA 74:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 74:23" />Tansĩ balo lɛfɔ nwu ɔblɔ afafaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 74:23">balo lɛfɔ nwu kudu ko nikodie ni obe lele.<verse eid="PSA 74:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 74" />
  <chapter number="75" style="c" sid="PSA 75" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 75</para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa Kantɛ Nwu</para>
  <para style="d">Asaf onu. Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ. Di "Tanwɔɔsa.” Sɛlɔ kanya.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 75:1" />O Yaa, buɔpɛ fɔ sɛfa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:1">buɔpɛ sɛfa, diekye Leyooto lɛfɔ ntɔɔtɛɛtɛɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:1">batii kobuɛ ablasaa lɛfɔ ya niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ.<verse eid="PSA 75:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 75:2" />Fambuɛ falɛ, "Ami nintɛ obe wɔ niɛsiɛko ni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:2">ami ninle nwɔ ninka ni lɛka biene.<verse eid="PSA 75:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 75:3" />Nse kasɔ ku batii nika bamuu letũkũ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:3">ami ninle nnwɔ nimufũ ni akpaka nini anklee ni kpinkpĩ nɛ. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ </char><verse eid="PSA 75:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 75:4" />Kɔtɔkɔ mba nintakatɛsa ni suoto katoo nlɛ, 'Bitansinkanta,'</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:4">bakpiletɛ kafɔɔ, 'Bitasintakatɛsa akya lee katoo.<verse eid="PSA 75:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 75:5" />Bitasintakatɛsa akya lee di osi suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:5">bitankakatɛ ku simu lɛnaanfi.' "<verse eid="PSA 75:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 75:6" />Kuonwii niekye ni kufĩ katunkɔ ee kufĩ kamɛɛkɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:6">ee niekye ni ɔfaafuu kafuo otii katoo ɔtakatɛsa.<verse eid="PSA 75:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 75:7" />Kafɔɔ Yaa ninle nnwɔ ninka nii:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:7">Anwakosa onwii kasɔ, antakatɛsa ɔbamba katoo.<verse eid="PSA 75:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 75:8" />Opũ nsi di Saate nwu kɔnɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:8">nta fuule bɛɛkpɔtɔɔsa ni ku akɔnɔkɔnɔsaa leyii nwu kamɛ pɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 75:8">annyɛɛnɛ mi, ni di bakpiletɛ bamuu kaasɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:8">nnyi mi mansooko ninaadu akpiti ni mi.<verse eid="PSA 75:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 75:9" />Ami fɛ ami, madiki nle mmle mbuɛ dinaa ni kaloo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:9">kamasa katansa sinu nta Yakob Yaa.<verse eid="PSA 75:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 75:10" />Kamabudi bakpiletɛ akya amuu n-yu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 75:10">kafɔɔ batinitɛ akya nnya babatakatɛsa nya katoo.<verse eid="PSA 75:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 75" />
  <chapter number="76" style="c" sid="PSA 76" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 76</para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa Lenkeetɛ Nwu</para>
  <para style="d">Asaf onu. Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ. Basa nwu ku sikũ sanku.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 76:1" />Baye Yaa di Yuda;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:1">leyooto nɔɔ lemuɔ di Israel.<verse eid="PSA 76:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 76:2" />Akpanta nɔɔ n-yɛ di Salem,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:2">kasiɛkɔ nɔɔ di Sion.<verse eid="PSA 76:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 76:3" />Nfa aafefee akplɔ yakaka nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:3">kubiafunsaa nwu ku mpamii nwu, kakpɛ kamɛ akpɛsaa nwu nɛ. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ </char><verse eid="PSA 76:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 76:4" />Fɔɔtɛ fanlɛ onyu ku lɛkpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:4">fakpe dibu falenke abokote ya ninkpe ni ku babɔkɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 76:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 76:5" />Baafũ asaa di sɛkambi bakpɛtɛ nnɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:5">bɔɔkyɔsĩi sɛkyɔsĩ lɛma yɛntɛle;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 76:5">bakpɛtɛ nwu kuonwii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:5">dilaafuo nnɛɛ nɔɔ ɔtakatɛsa.<verse eid="PSA 76:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 76:6" />O Yakob Yaa, di ɔlaa lɛfɔ osĩ ɔta kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:6">pɔnkɔ ku keke wɔ di pɔnkɔ nnanfi ni akyuu nwu anyɔ nte kloklo.<verse eid="PSA 76:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 76:7" />Lete lɛfɔ dikaatɛ man-yɛkɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:7">Owe nimafuo oyila di anu lɛfɔ nse fɛɛnya ɔblɔ?<verse eid="PSA 76:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 76:8" />Feediki lɛbɛ ku lɛpɔɔ feekyeko osi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:8">ni di kasɔ layɛkɛ kaalo kanana nɛ-<verse eid="PSA 76:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 76:9" />O Yaa, nse fɛɛtaka falɛ fɔɔka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:9">falɛ foofũ batii ba bamuu diobuo ni di kasɔ nwu. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ </char><verse eid="PSA 76:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 76:10" />Nwaako ɔblɔ lɛfɔ di batii suoto nwako fɔ katansa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:10">fan-yɔ mba niebu bakpe ni nkpa di ɔblɔ lɛfɔ nwu kanya kafɔɔ fanta suoto.<verse eid="PSA 76:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 76:11" />Ka ntam fata Saate Yaa lɛfɔ, faabla ninwu kanya kafɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:11">ta nsɔ be mmuu ninkaako ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:11">bawako Nnwɔ baayɛkɛ ni akyɛsaa.<verse eid="PSA 76:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 76:12" />Nnwɔɔ nindiki kanya bayilatɛ anwuna nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 76:12">kasɔ nwu baka nyɛkɛ nwɔ.<verse eid="PSA 76:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 76" />
  <chapter number="77" style="c" sid="PSA 77" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 77</para>
  <para style="s1">Kɔnɛɛ Okpee Kaafutu Di Dibuo Obe Kamɛ</para>
  <para style="d">Asaf onu. Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ. Kuɔta Yedutun.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 77:1" />Lawi lalɛɛ Yaa diɛta ni lɛkyakaako;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:1">lawi lalɛɛ Yaa nlɛ anu mi ɔlaa.<verse eid="PSA 77:1" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 77:2" />Obe wɔ lasiɛ ni di dibuo kamɛ, lawolaa Saate nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:2">lananfi nnɛɛ be ninambuo ni ku kakyɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:2">ɔkla nii kafɔɔ lasĩ alɛ batankpee nwɔ kɔnɛɛ kaafutu.<verse eid="PSA 77:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 77:3" />O Yaa, lanyuma fɔ, latuuni kafɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:3">labu disi, ɔnyɛɛ kafɔɔ latooloo mi. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛɛ </char><verse eid="PSA 77:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 77:4" />Fatatɛɛ lamaasa anu nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:4">dibuo oso ntafuo ɔkakatɛ.<verse eid="PSA 77:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 77:5" />Lanyuma saa ayi nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:5">alɛɛ ya nintɔbafe ni kofokofoko;<verse eid="PSA 77:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 77:6" />Lanyuma sinu nii ku kakyɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:6">Otu nii mbu nwu ole, ninwuna nii kafɔɔ lawolaa kamɛ;<verse eid="PSA 77:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 77:7" />"Saate nwu kamasĩ wo dinaa ni kaloo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:7">Ɔlɔbasinle wo sibualɛ nɔɔ?<verse eid="PSA 77:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 77:8" />Lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ le ninaa ni kaloo ntooyu dinaa ni kaloo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:8">Atoodiɛ obe lele ntam nɔɔ nwu?<verse eid="PSA 77:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 77:9" />Yaa ntooyee alɛ aanya nyaami?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:9">Di ɔblɔ kamɛ atoodiɛ sibualɛ nɔɔ ole?" <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ </char><verse eid="PSA 77:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 77:10" />Ni labuɛ nlɛ, "Ta nle mmle oso, kamatikiti lekoto:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:10">Nnwɔ Ninlenke ni koletanɛɛ ntookyi.”<verse eid="PSA 77:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 77:11" />Kamanyuma Saate nwu sɛsaabla;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:11">nwaa, kamanyuma saa sɛkpɛ lɛfɔ se niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ.<verse eid="PSA 77:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 77:12" />Kamabu disi di sɛkpɛ lɛfɔ simuu suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:12">ntɛ anu kafɔɔ nnyu sɛsaabla kplɛ lɛfɔ nwu simuu.<verse eid="PSA 77:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 77:13" />O Yaa, sisuku lɛfɔ lɛbla klekle.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:13">Amɛn-fiɔ niɛtɛ eemuɔ fɛ Yaa loo?<verse eid="PSA 77:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 77:14" />Yaa wɔ nimbla ni sɛkpɛ se niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ fale;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:14">feediki osie lɛfɔ feetuo di batii nwu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 77:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 77:15" />Ku kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ kplɛ feediki batii lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:15">Yakob ku Yosef banantii nwu. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ </char><verse eid="PSA 77:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 77:16" />O Yaa, ntu nwu lanya fɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:16">ntu nwu lanya fɔ diayɛkɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:16">nkyofokɔ nwu lanya fɔ diatũkũ.<verse eid="PSA 77:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 77:17" />Alokonkyɛ nwu lata kanto lanɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:17">kolo nwu latuna ku akpududuu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:17">akplɔ lɛfɔ lawanyi aafɛ sitũ ku sɛmaa.<verse eid="PSA 77:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 77:18" />Baanu akpududuu lɛfɔ di afɛɛfɔ siene kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:18">ɔplalaa lɛfɔ lasɔ ɔtɔ kaayi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:18">kasɔ nwu kafɔɔ layɛkɛ kaatũkũ.<verse eid="PSA 77:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 77:19" />Nkpaa osuku lɛfɔ lafe di lekpo nwu kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:19">osuku lɛfɔ lafe di ntu kplɛ nwu kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:19">nu batanya nnafukpaa lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 77:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 77:20" />Faaleko batii lɛfɔ katũ fɛle bafoso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 77:20">di Mose ku Aron nnɛɛ nwu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 77:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 77" />
  <chapter number="78" style="c" sid="PSA 78" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 78</para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa Ku Batii Nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="d">Asaf onu. <char style="tl">maskil</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dite fɛle onu lɛsambi lewo dile</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 78:1" />O batii nii, binu asaa otuo nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:1">bikyɔɔ kanya nii sɛlaa atoko.<verse eid="PSA 78:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 78:2" />Kamabɛ kanya nii di akpa kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:2">mbuɛ awofasaa, asaa ya niekye ni okofobee kamɛ-<verse eid="PSA 78:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 78:3" />n-se butoonu, buotofo ni kafɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:3">n-se di bate loo ntɔɔtɔkɔ wo nii.<verse eid="PSA 78:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 78:4" />Bulɔbayɔ nya bukookaa babi lɛma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:4">bubatɔkɔ kɔna ko nikɔwa ni</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 78:4">Saate nwu katansa sɛsaabla nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:4">osie nɔɔ ku sɛkpɛ se niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ ɛɛbla nii.<verse eid="PSA 78:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 78:5" />Aabla afiofa aata Yakob</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:5">aatɛ kafɔɔ kufiofa di Israel,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 78:5">nnya aakpee bawa loo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="PSA 78:5">alɛ batuo ni babi lɛma,<verse eid="PSA 78:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 78:6" />alɛ kɔna ko nikɔwa ni katofo nya nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:6">bia babi babalofo ni sɛɛmaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:6">mma kafɔɔ babatɔkɔ babi lɛma.<verse eid="PSA 78:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 78:7" />Ni babayɔ anu lɛma mantika di Yaa suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:7">ni blɔbayee sɛsaabla nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:7">kafɔɔ manklee afiofa nɔɔ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 78:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 78:8" />Blɔbate fɛle bawa lɛma-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:8">onunsie ku batokopĩitɛ kɔna nwu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 78:8">di situ lɛma ditakyɔɔ ni Yaa atoko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:8">di anwuna lɛma ditale ni onukwale aatɔɔ nii.<verse eid="PSA 78:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 78:9" />Efraim batii, kuntɛ baalolaa suoto ku ataa yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:9">baakple nkpaamaa di kakpɛ dii suoto;<verse eid="PSA 78:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 78:10" />batamufũ Yaa kanya ninii baakle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:10">beesĩ kafɔɔ alɛ boosiɛ nkpa di kufiofa nɔɔ kanya.<verse eid="PSA 78:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 78:11" />Baayee nle ɛɛbla nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:11">atuosaa ya niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ aatuo ma nii.<verse eid="PSA 78:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 78:12" />Aabla sɛkpɛ se niabla ni ɔkpɛ di bate lɛma anu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:12">di Egipte kasɔ, di Soan kasɔ.<verse eid="PSA 78:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 78:13" />Aasɛ lekpo kamɛ ni aaleko ma katũ aafenko nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:13">aata ntu layila kloklo fɛle oyoyiɛ.<verse eid="PSA 78:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 78:14" />Aaklee ma ku lelokonkyɛ nwu ku anunwaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:14">lɛkpa niakye ni ɔtɔ nwu kamɛ ku kakyɛ kamuu.<verse eid="PSA 78:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 78:15" />Aabɛ afuɔ nwu di ɔfaafuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:15">ni aata ma ntu kpinwu fɛ lekpo nɛ;<verse eid="PSA 78:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 78:16" />aadiki seklenyĩi aakyeko difuɔ kyookyoo kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:16">ni aata ntu labiɛ diafe fɛle sekle nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 78:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 78:17" />Kafɔɔ baakple baatɔɔbla sikpile di suoto nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:17">otokopĩ di Nnwɔ Ninlenke ni suoto di ɔfaafuu nwu.<verse eid="PSA 78:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 78:18" />Baatɛ baasɔ Yaa baanyu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:18">baatɔɔkaalɛ alesaa ya baatoomiɛ nii.<verse eid="PSA 78:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 78:19" />Baakakatɛ di Yaa suoto, baabuɛ alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:19">"Yaa kafuo opunu ɔblɛfɛsa di ɔfaafuu nwu?<verse eid="PSA 78:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 78:20" />Obe wɔ aapɛ ni difuɔ nwu, ntu ladie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:20">ni di seklenyĩi labiɛ siafe kpinwu nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 78:20">Abafuo wo alesaa kafɔɔ ɔta?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:20">Abafuo batii nɔɔ sina ɔta?<verse eid="PSA 78:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 78:21" />Obe wɔ di Saate nwu lanu ma nii, ɔblɔ lafiɛ nwɔ osie kanya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:21">ni aadiki ɔtɔ nɔɔ aakpee Yakob nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:21">ninfɛ di ɔblɔ yakayaka nɔɔ lataka di Israel suoto nɛ,<verse eid="PSA 78:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 78:22" />diekye batafũ Yaa baanu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:22">ee batika disi di didiki nɔɔ suoto.<verse eid="PSA 78:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 78:23" />Kafɔɔ aadiki kanya aata kolo kaatoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:23">aasɛkɛtɛ kafɔɔ osi n-yoko;<verse eid="PSA 78:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 78:24" />aata mana lakpakpaa aata batii lale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:24">aata ma osi atitabi nwu.<verse eid="PSA 78:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 78:25" />Batii lale Yaa batɔkyɛntɛ bloblo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:25">aakyesee ma alesaa ya amuu baafuo ni ole.<verse eid="PSA 78:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 78:26" />Aata kufĩ katunkɔ kɔfɛɛfɔ lafɛ kuakye osi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:26">aaleko kalakasɔ kɔfɛɛfɔ katũ di osie nɔɔ kanya.<verse eid="PSA 78:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 78:27" />Aata sina lakpakpaa di suoto lɛma fɛle kudu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:27">bakansiɛ flɛlɛtɛle fɛle ɔtɛnsia di lekpo kotoko.<verse eid="PSA 78:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 78:28" />Aata ma baasoo di nsiɛkɔ lɛma nwu kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:28">bamuu lamana akpaayo lɛma baakyi.<verse eid="PSA 78:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 78:29" />Baale baamiɛ baalenkeesa mmle boomiɛ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:29">diekye aata ma nle baatoomiɛ nii.<verse eid="PSA 78:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 78:30" />Kafɔɔ fiɛ babadiɛ ni alesaa ya baatoomiɛ ni ole,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:30">bia di obe wɔ aasiɛ ni di nnya lɛma kamɛ,<verse eid="PSA 78:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 78:31" />Yaa lanya ɔblɔ di suoto lɛma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:31">aalo basientɛ kaamɛ lɛma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:31">aapɛ Israel bakosopo kaasɔ.<verse eid="PSA 78:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 78:32" />Di n-ya mmle amuu sɛmaa, baakple baatɔɔbla sikpile;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:32">di sɛsaabla nɔɔ se niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ sɛmaa, batafũ baanu.<verse eid="PSA 78:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 78:33" />Nioso aata ayi lɛma laloo wla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:33">alɛɛ lɛma kafɔɔ di lɛyɛkɛ kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 78:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 78:34" />Nse Yaa lelo ma, babawolaa nwɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:34">mankyi mankple mansifi ɔkyɛ nɔɔ wla.<verse eid="PSA 78:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 78:35" />Baanyuma alɛ Yaa nianle ma Difuɔnkpaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:35">alɛ Yaa wɔ Niɛtaka Katoo alenke ni niale ma Dikitɛ.<verse eid="PSA 78:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 78:36" />Kafɔɔ mankyɔnkyɔ nwɔ ku nnya lɛma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:36">manlaa mantɔɔ ku sɛkplalomii lɛma;<verse eid="PSA 78:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 78:37" />batayɔ situ lɛma baatɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:37">batale onukwale baata kanya ninii nɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 78:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 78:38" />Kafɔɔ nyaami nyatɛ aale;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:38">aayɔ ɔtanlolaa ɔbla lɛma aakyɛ ma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:38">nioso atawɔɔsa ma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 78:38">Di obe, di obe kamɛ andiɛ ɔblɔ nɔɔ ɔnya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:38">ansinnya kafɔɔ ɔblɔ yakayaka nɔɔ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 78:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 78:39" />Aanyuma alɛ batii ko bale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:39">kɔfɛɛfɔ ko ninfe ni kunaankple nii.<verse eid="PSA 78:39" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 78:40" />Sɛsɛ́ batabla atokopĩsaa baakpee nwɔ di ɔfaafuu kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:40">baakpee nwɔ sɛnyaami kafɔɔ di kasɔ kosole nwu suoto!<verse eid="PSA 78:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 78:41" />Baasɔ baakple baasɔ Yaa baanyu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:41">baakpee Israel Klekletɛ nwɔ ɔblɔ.<verse eid="PSA 78:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 78:42" />Batanyuma osie nɔɔ-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:42">dii le aadiki ma aakyeko ni amumu bablatɛ nnɛɛ,<verse eid="PSA 78:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 78:43" />dii le aadiki atuosaa nɔɔ ya niabla ni ɔkpɛ aatuo ni di Egipte,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:43">sɛkpɛ nɔɔ se niabla ni ɔkpɛ di Soan kasɔ suoto.<verse eid="PSA 78:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 78:44" />Aamunikĩisa sekle lɛma ntu aabla ntɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:44">batafuo seklenyĩi lɛma ntu onyi.<verse eid="PSA 78:44" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 78:45" />Aata banwakɛ sɛlambu labatataa ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:45">ku basua ba niakpee ma ni kubuɛ.<verse eid="PSA 78:45" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 78:46" />Aayɔ alesaa di afe lɛma aata atroe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:46">awosobi lɛma kafɔɔ aata akpakyekyee.<verse eid="PSA 78:46" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 78:47" />Aalalaasa awosobi awoso lɛma ku atubɔkanii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:47">ku sikamɔ-abue lɛma ku kabiene kanto.<verse eid="PSA 78:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 78:48" />Aayɔ banankyue lɛma aata atubɔkanii nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:48">basebɔkɛɛ lɛma aata ɔplalaa amunaa.<verse eid="PSA 78:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 78:49" />Aadiki ɔblɔ nɔɔ kpankpa aatuo di suoto lɛma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:49">ɔblɔ yakayaka nɔɔ ku lɛbɔfiɛ ku amumu-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:49">kawɔɔ batɔkyɛntɛ dikudi.<verse eid="PSA 78:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 78:50" />Aalolaa nkpaa osuku aata ɔblɔ nɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:50">atayɔ kukpi aakyɛ ma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:50">kafɔɔ aayɔ ma aata ofiɛ kplɛ.<verse eid="PSA 78:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 78:51" />Aalo lelofo kasale babi bamuu di Egipte,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:51">sisuɔtɔ kamɛ lelofo kasale nwu di Ham akpaayo kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 78:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 78:52" />Kafɔɔ aakpaa batii nɔɔ aadieko fɛle bafoso dikudi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:52">aaleko ma katũ fɛle bafoso aafenko di ɔfaafuu nwu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 78:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="PSA 78:53" />Aanyu ma nwaa, nioso batayɛkɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:53">kafɔɔ lekpo nwu lamana balo lɛma.<verse eid="PSA 78:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="PSA 78:54" />Diata aakpaa ma aawako kasɔ klekle nɔɔ nwu suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:54">akpenkpe nɔɔ kale nwu di koletanɛɛ nɔɔ lafũ nii.<verse eid="PSA 78:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="PSA 78:55" />Aatososa nnle di anu lɛma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:55">ni aayɔ nsɔ lɛma kafɔɔ aata ma fɛ atesaa nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:55">aasiɛsa Israel nfaabi nwu di ayo lɛma.<verse eid="PSA 78:55" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="PSA 78:56" />Kafɔɔ baasɔ Yaa baanyu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:56">baataka baayila di Nnwɔ Niɛtaka Katoo Alenke ni suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:56">batamufũ afiofa nɔɔ baaklee.<verse eid="PSA 78:56" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="PSA 78:57" />Baate fɛle bate lɛma, baawɛ onunsie ku ɔtaanfũ onu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 78:57">fɛ kasɛfɛ ka ninanlɛ ni manantika ka ni disi.<verse eid="PSA 78:57" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="PSA 78:58" />Baakpee nwɔ ɔblɔ ku ntakalekɔ lɛma nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:58">baata sɛsɔfɔwo ɔkpɛ nɔɔ lataka katoo ku afiɔ lɛma nwu.<verse eid="PSA 78:58" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="PSA 78:59" />Nse Yaa lenu ma yi, ɔblɔ nfiɛ nwɔ osie kanya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:59">aasĩ Israel fɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 78:59" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="PSA 78:60" />Aadiɛ Silo lɛkpaayo klekle nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:60">akpanta nwu aapɛ ni di batii kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 78:60" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="PSA 78:61" />Aayɔ kanya ninii lɛlakaa kplɛ nɔɔ nwu aasifiko sɛlanle kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:61">aayɔ asaa nɔɔ kafɔɔ aakpee di lo nwu nnɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 78:61" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="PSA 78:62" />Aayɔ batii nɔɔ aata kapamii nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:62">aanya ɔblɔ osie kanya ku atesaa nɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 78:62" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="PSA 78:63" />Ɔtɔ lafiɛ bakosopo lɛma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:63">bakpeele lɛma kafɔɔ ditawɛ sɛkafɔɔ sinu;<verse eid="PSA 78:63" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="PSA 78:64" />baalo olebatatɛ lɛma kafɔɔ ku kapamii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:64">bakpisɔfɔ lɛma kafɔɔ ditafuo owi.<verse eid="PSA 78:64" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="PSA 78:65" />Ninfɛ di Saate nwu lasɛnkɛ fɛle sɛkyɔsĩ kamɛ aakye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:65">fɛ mmle di otii nsɛnkɛ ni di lɛtansiɛ kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 78:65" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="PSA 78:66" />Aapɛ balo nɔɔ aakplesa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:66">aata sinunsɔ lakpɛ ma dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="PSA 78:66" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="PSA 78:67" />Ninfɛ aasĩ Yosef akpanta nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:67">atadiki Efraim kafaabi nwu;<verse eid="PSA 78:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="PSA 78:68" />kafɔɔ aadiki Yuda kafaabi nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:68">Sion Kobokote nwu ambɔmbɔ ni.<verse eid="PSA 78:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="PSA 78:69" />Aabla lɛkpaayo klekle nɔɔ fɛle ntakalekɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:69">fɛle kasɔ nwu ɛɛtɛ ni dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="PSA 78:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="PSA 78:70" />Aadiki Dawid kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:70">aakpaa nwɔ kafɔɔ aakyeko lefosoyo nwu;<verse eid="PSA 78:70" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="PSA 78:71" />bafoso kanyunkɔ aakpaa nwɔ aakyeko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:71">alɛ abale bafosokpatɛ ata batii nɔɔ Yakob,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:71">dile ni Israel atesaa nɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 78:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="PSA 78:72" />Dawid kafɔɔ lanyu ma ku otu biene;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 78:72">ku lɛsaatofo nnɛɛ aaleko ma katũ.<verse eid="PSA 78:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 78" />
  <chapter number="79" style="c" sid="PSA 79" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 79</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Diɛta Ni Kale Didiki</para>
  <para style="d">Asaf onu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 79:1" />O Yaa, nnle nwu ntoofũ atesaa lɛfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:1">batɔɔkpɔnɔfɔsa olekatakɔ klekle lɛfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:1">batoobibiɛ Yerusalem bɛɛtɛ kaasɔ.<verse eid="PSA 79:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 79:2" />Batɔɔyɔ bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ bakpi bɛɛta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:2">kɔfɛɛfɔ bakansiɛ fɛ alesaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:2">baklekletɛ lɛfɔ suoto bɛɛta lepoo kamɛ babɔkɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 79:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 79:3" />Batɔɔnyɛɛnɛ ntɔ beewii fɛle ntu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:3">niɛmana Yerusalem omuu diekyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:3">kuonwii kafɔɔ nnaa abakookaa ni bakpi nwu.<verse eid="PSA 79:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 79:4" />Butookple ditufa buɔta bawo loo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:4">lɛmansaa ku diyududusa buɔta mba niɛmana wo beekye ni.<verse eid="PSA 79:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 79:5" />O Saate, ɔmɛmbe? Fabanya ɔblɔ dinaa ni kaloo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:5">Ɔmɛmbe di sɛsɔfɔwo ɔkpɛ lɛfɔ nwu mafiɛ fɛle ɔtɔ kunaase?<verse eid="PSA 79:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 79:6" />Soosa ɔblɔ yakayaka lɛfɔ nwu fakpete nnle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:6">be ninan-ye fɔ ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 79:6">di sɛka nlekɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:6">be ninanlɛɛ ni leyooto lɛfɔ;<verse eid="PSA 79:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 79:7" />diekye batɔɔbɛbɛɛ Yakob</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:7">bɛɛwɔɔsa kafa nɔɔ kafɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 79:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 79:8" />Tan-yɔ bate loo sikple faata wo koto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:8">ta nyaami ɔnya lɛfɔ diwa wla diɛbatũ wo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:8">diekye diefĩ wo osie kanya.<verse eid="PSA 79:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 79:9" />O Yaa Dikitɛ loo, kyakaako wo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:9">ta leyooto lɛfɔ dibu nwu oso;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 79:9">diki wo, faayɔ sikpile loo fakyɛ wo kafɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:9">ta leyooto lɛfɔ oso.<verse eid="PSA 79:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 79:10" />Lɛ oso di nnle nwu mbuɛ alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:10">"Ɔfɛ di Yaa lɛma nkpe?"</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 79:10">Diki fatuo di nnle nwu kamɛ di anu loo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:10">falɛ fantufu koto di bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ ntɔ be beewii nii.<verse eid="PSA 79:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 79:11" />Ta ayo batentɛ atuuni awa ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:11">fũ batii ba bɛɛtɛ alɛ babalo ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:11">ku kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ osie.<verse eid="PSA 79:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 79:12" />Ta koto sikuɛnsĩ simu fata bawo loo di atĩ lɛma suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:12">O Saate, di atufa ya batootufa fɔ ni.<verse eid="PSA 79:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 79:13" />Ni awo batii lɛfɔ, bafoso di sɛfa kaweekɔ lɛfɔ nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:13">bubatansa fɔ dinaa ni kaloo;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 79:13">diɛyɔ ni kɔɔna diesifi ni kɔna</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 79:13">bubayɔ lɛtansa lɛfɔ muntɔɔta fɔ.<verse eid="PSA 79:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 79" />
  <chapter number="80" style="c" sid="PSA 80" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 80</para>
  <para style="s">Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Diɛta Ni Kale Lese Lelolaa</para>
  <para style="d">Asaf onu. Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ. Basa nwu di "Lili Kanya Ninii kanya"</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 80:1" />O Israel Bafosokpatɛ, nu wo ɔlaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:1">afɔ wɔ nialeko ni Yosef katũ fɛle foso;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 80:1">afɔ wɔ nikole ni sɛka di bakerubim ntɛɛ, fɔɔkpa<verse eid="PSA 80:1" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 80:2" />di Efraim ku Benyamin ku Manase anu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 80:2">Sɛnkɛsa osie lɛfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:2">faawa fabafũ wo.<verse eid="PSA 80:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 80:3" />O Yaa, kple fakpee wo osie;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:3">ta anu lɛfɔ akpa akpete wo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:3">alɛ buawɛ didiki.<verse eid="PSA 80:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 80:4" />O Saate Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:4">ɔmɛmbe di ɔblɔ lɛfɔ mafiɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:4">di batii lɛfɔ ɔlaa ɔpɛ suoto kunaase?<verse eid="PSA 80:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 80:5" />Faata ma nnumɛɛ bloblo baale;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:5">faata ma nnumɛɛ di lɛpɔ kamɛ baanyi.<verse eid="PSA 80:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 80:6" />Fatɔɔta wo buokple ditufa buɔta bawo loo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:6">balo loo kafɔɔ kɔma wo.<verse eid="PSA 80:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 80:7" />O Yaa, kple fakpee wo osie;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:7">ta anu lɛfɔ akpa akpete wo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:7">alɛ buawɛ didiki.<verse eid="PSA 80:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 80:8" />Faakpaa awosobi kowoso faakyeko Egipte;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:8">faatososa nnle, ni faasɔ kũ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 80:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 80:9" />Faakpɛ kasɔ faatɛ kũ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:9">ni kuase odu kuayii kasɔ nwu nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 80:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 80:10" />Oyududu nikũ latĩi abokote</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:10">basedar kplɛ nwu ku sɛla nikũ.<verse eid="PSA 80:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 80:11" />Kuadiki ntɛɛ sɛla nikũ kuakpee di Lekpo nwu kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:11">ntaakɔ nikũ lalaadu bia Okle nwu.<verse eid="PSA 80:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 80:12" />Obe oso fatoobibiɛ siyoyiɛ ninwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:12">alɛ bamuu ba ninfe ninfa nsɛsɛɛ kũ abi?<verse eid="PSA 80:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 80:13" />Babeetũ di lepoo nlalaasa nya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:13">babɔkɛɛ di lepoo kafɔɔ nle kũ abi.<verse eid="PSA 80:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 80:14" />O Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni, kple fawa ɔkyɛ loo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:14">Nyu fakyeko osi faanyu kasɔ!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 80:14">Nyu awosobi kowoso ko mmle,<verse eid="PSA 80:14" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 80:15" />odu nwu di koletanɛɛ lɛfɔ lasɔ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:15">obisuɔtɔbi nwu faakaanasa faata ni suoto lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 80:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 80:16" />Beebudi awosobi kowoso lɛfɔ nwu bɛɛtɛ kaasɔ, bɛɛfiɛ kũ ku ɔtɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:16">di ɔlaa lɛfɔ osĩ ɔta kamɛ batii lɛfɔ kokpi.<verse eid="PSA 80:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 80:17" />Ta kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ kutika di otii wɔ di oletanɛɛkyɛ lɛfɔ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:17">otii obisuɔtɔbi nwu faakaanasa faata ni suoto lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 80:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 80:18" />Ni bulɔbakple busifi budiɛ fɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:18">sɛnkɛsa wo, ni bubalɛɛ leyooto lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 80:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 80:19" />O Yaa, kple fakpee wo osie;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:19">ta anu lɛfɔ akpa akpete wo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 80:19">alɛ buawɛ didiki.<verse eid="PSA 80:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 80" />
  <chapter number="81" style="c" sid="PSA 81" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 81</para>
  <para style="s1">Onu Kuɔta Ni Dii Ole</para>
  <para style="d">Asaf onu. Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ. Asa nwu di <char style="tl">gitit.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dite fɛle onu lɛsambi lewo dile</char></note> Sɛlɔ kanya.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 81:1" />Bisa suoto lɛyɔɔ sinu bita Yaa, osie loo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:1">Bifaa osie kanya bita Yakob Yaa nwu!<verse eid="PSA 81:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 81:2" />Bikpee onu, bisɔkɔ akasa nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:2">bipɛ bakyitaa ku basanku mɛnɛmɛnɛ.<verse eid="PSA 81:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 81:3" />Bifɛ dikunumuu lɛkya di Kɔwɛntɛ Fɔle kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:3">nse kɔwɛntɛ ntoosi di dii le suoto buole ni Dii loo nwu;<verse eid="PSA 81:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 81:4" />nle mmle ninle kufiofa kuɔta ni Israel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:4">Yakob Yaa ɔsaabla nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 81:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 81:5" />Aabla kũ aatɛ fɛ kufiofa aata Yosef</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:5">di obe wɔ aakyɛ aalaadieko ni Egipte,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:5">lɛba le buanu ni sele se butanu ni kasɔ.<verse eid="PSA 81:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 81:6" />Aabuɛ alɛ, "Latekete atoo di amuusi lɛma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:6">baatekete nnɛɛ lɛma di kakyikyɛ nwu suoto.<verse eid="PSA 81:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 81:7" />Faalɛɛ di nimiina lɛfɔ kamɛ, ni ladiki fɔ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:7">latuna lata fɔ di kanto okpududuu dituntũ kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:7">lasɔ fɔ lanyu di Meriba ntu katũ. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ </char><verse eid="PSA 81:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 81:8" />"O batii nii, binu, kamasĩ ɔlaa nta ye-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:8">O Israel, nse bibakyɔɔ mi atoko!<verse eid="PSA 81:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 81:9" />Bitasinklee afiɔ bamba kaamɛ lee;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:9">bitanwakasɔ biata bafɔɔ afiɔ.<verse eid="PSA 81:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 81:10" />Ami ninle Saate, Yaa lee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:10">nnwɔ niakpaa ye aakyeko ni Egipte.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:10">Bɛ kanya lɛfɔ foo, ni mata ka kan-yii.<verse eid="PSA 81:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 81:11" />"Kafɔɔ batii nii dilɔbakyɔɔ mi atoko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:11">Israel dilɔbawakosa suoto kasɔ atɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 81:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 81:12" />Nioso layɔ ma lata onunsie situ lɛma nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:12">alɛ baasiɛ nkpa lɛma mmu.<verse eid="PSA 81:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 81:13" />"Nse batii nii makyɔɔ mi atoko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:13">nse Israel matikanko sisuku nii,<verse eid="PSA 81:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 81:14" />lɛ ninapɛsɛwa nlenkee balo lɛma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:14">mmunikĩisa kɔnɛɛ nii kafɔɔ di bakyiditɛ lɛma suoto!<verse eid="PSA 81:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 81:15" />Batii ba niekyidi ni Saate nwu kamayɛkɛ, manwa anu nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:15">letoko nanfi lɛma kafɔɔ mate dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="PSA 81:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 81:16" />Kafɔɔ makonkosa fɔ ku anaatĩ nwaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 81:16">kamamiɛsa fɔ ku bablɔ ba niekye ni difuɔnkpaa kamɛ.”<verse eid="PSA 81:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 81" />
  <chapter number="82" style="c" sid="PSA 82" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 82</para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa Tunletɛ Kplɛ Nwu</para>
  <para style="d">Asaf onu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 82:1" />Yaa nsiɛ di dikudi kplɛ nwu kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:1">andiki lɛbɛ ku lɛpɔɔ di "bayaa" nwu kamɛ;<verse eid="PSA 82:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 82:2" />Ɔmɛmbe babadiɛ amumu aka ɔka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:2">mindiɛ kafɔɔ bakpiletɛ kamaa oyila? <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ </char><verse eid="PSA 82:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 82:3" />Bikpɛ bita mba ninaa ni ɔnyɛɛ ku bakuɛbi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:3">bita bapiitɛ ku mba bɔɔbla ni amumu lɛbɛ lɛma.<verse eid="PSA 82:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 82:4" />Bifũ mba ninaa ni ɔnyɛɛ ku mba dinaa ni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:4">bidiki ma di bakpiletɛ nnɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 82:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 82:5" />"Baaye lɛsalɛsaa, mannu lɛsalɛsaa kasɔ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:5">Ditunu kamɛ mankyɛ mankyi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:5">kasɔ asɔse amuu kotũkũ.<verse eid="PSA 82:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 82:6" />"Labuɛ nlɛ, ' "Bayaa" bile;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:6">Nnwɔ Ninlenke ni babisuɔtɔbi bile bamuu.'<verse eid="PSA 82:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 82:7" />Kafɔɔ bibakpi fɛle batii ko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:7">bibanɔɔ fɛle tunletɛ biala.”<verse eid="PSA 82:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 82:8" />O Yaa, taka, kanko kasɔ nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 82:8">diekye nnle nwu mmuu atesaa lɛfɔ ale.<verse eid="PSA 82:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 82" />
  <chapter number="83" style="c" sid="PSA 83" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 83</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Diɛta Ni Israel Balo Lelenkee</para>
  <para style="d">Asaf onu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 83:1" />O Yaa, tammaasa kanya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:1">O Yaa, tanlo kanana, tansiɛ kloklo.<verse eid="PSA 83:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 83:2" />Nyu mmle di balo lɛfɔ kokpee ni kudú,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:2">mmle di bakyiditɛ lɛfɔ lɛtakatɛsa ni asi lɛma.<verse eid="PSA 83:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 83:3" />Mantɛ batii lɛfɔ kala ku kakyɔkyɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:3">mankũ kanwube di mba fambɔmbɔ ni suoto.<verse eid="PSA 83:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 83:4" />Mambuɛ alɛ, "Biwa biɛta buwɔɔsa ma fɛ kale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:4">alɛ balaasinnyuma Israel leyooto nwu diidii.”<verse eid="PSA 83:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 83:5" />Mankũ kanwube ku disibu ninwii kyɛkyɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:5">beenii kanya di suoto lɛfɔ-<verse eid="PSA 83:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 83:6" />Edom akpanta ku Ismael batii nwu ale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:6">Moab ku Hagar batii ale,<verse eid="PSA 83:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 83:7" />Gebal ku Amon ku Amalek,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:7">Filisti batii ku Tiro batii.<verse eid="PSA 83:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 83:8" />Bia Asiria ntoobuo ma kaamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:8">alɛ bɔɔkyakaako Lot banantii. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ </char><verse eid="PSA 83:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 83:9" />Bla ma fɛ mmle faabla ni Midia batii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:9">fɛ mmle faabla ni Sisera ku Yabin di Kison okle,<verse eid="PSA 83:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 83:10" />baawɔɔ ni di Endor,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:10">baabakple fɛle aku di kasɔ nwu suoto.<verse eid="PSA 83:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 83:11" />Bla batii finle lɛma fɛle Oreb ku Seeb,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:11">banɔɔfo lɛma bamuu fɛle Seba ku Salmuna,<verse eid="PSA 83:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 83:12" />niabuɛ ni alɛ, "Bitabuyɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:12">Yaa babɔkɛɛ sɛfa kaweekɔ kasɔ nwu.”<verse eid="PSA 83:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 83:13" />O Yaa nii, bla ma fɛle tentrewuo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:13">fɛle sɛsɔ di kɔfɛɛfɔ anu.<verse eid="PSA 83:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 83:14" />Fɛ mmle di ɔtɔ nfiɛ ni lepoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:14">ee ɔtɔ bembe nfiɛ ni abokote,<verse eid="PSA 83:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 83:15" />nkpo faatikanko ma ku ɔblɔ lɛfɔ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:15">faayɛkɛsa ma kafɔɔ ku afɛɛfɔ lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 83:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 83:16" />O Saate, tĩi anu lɛma ku sinunsɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:16">alɛ batii kawolaa leyooto lɛfɔ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 83:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 83:17" />Ta banunsɔ diɛbla ma ɔkpɛ dinaa ni kaloo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:17">ta bawɔɔ di sinunsɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 83:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 83:18" />Ta ma batafo alɛ, nnwɔ leyooto ninle ni Saate nwu-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 83:18">alɛ lete lɛfɔ ninle Nnwɔ Niɛtaka Katoo Alenke ni di kasɔ nwu kamuu suoto nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 83:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 83" />
  <chapter number="84" style="c" sid="PSA 84" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 84</para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa Leyo Ɔkyɛ Ɔkɔnsɔ Oklee</para>
  <para style="d">Kora babisuɔtɔbi onu. Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ. Asa nwu di <char style="tl">gitit.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dite fɛle onu lɛsambi lewo dile</char></note> Sɛlɔ kanya.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 84:1" />O Saate wɔ Ninlenke ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:1">nyu mmle di kasiɛkɔ lɛfɔ nwu lɛtɛ kalɛ ni!<verse eid="PSA 84:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 84:2" />Dikle ɔkla nii ɔkɔnsɔ, bia nloo ɔnyɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:2">diɛta ni Saate nwu olekatakɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 84:2">otu nii ku suoto nii nwi kaku</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:2">diɛta Yaa wɔ ninkpe ni nkpa.<verse eid="PSA 84:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 84:3" />Bia kakyɛnyi nkpe leyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:3">katiitĩi kafɔɔ mbla leyo kanta suoto nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:3">nfũ abatɛ ni abi nɔɔ-</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 84:3">di lɛba le niɛkaako ni olekatakɔ lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:3">O Saate wɔ Ninlenke ni, Ɔka nii ku Yaa nii.<verse eid="PSA 84:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 84:4" />Suoto siyɔɔ batii ba ninsiɛ ni di leyo lɛfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:4">obe lele bɔɔtansa fɔ ni. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ </char><verse eid="PSA 84:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 84:5" />Suoto siyɔɔ batii ba osie ninsi ni di kamɛ lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:5">bɛɛyɔ situ lɛma beetika ni di kasumukɔ ɔkyɛ suoto.<verse eid="PSA 84:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 84:6" />Manfe ni di Bakà Ɔtaata nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:6">bɛɛbla nwu ni ntu ntaakɔ lɛba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:6">apanta nwu nyii ku kɔkyɛɛ kanto.<verse eid="PSA 84:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 84:7" />Mantɔɔwɛ osie obe lele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:7">ninaase di obe wɔ di obiala kamakyɔɔ ni di Yaa anu di Sion.<verse eid="PSA 84:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 84:8" />O Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni, nu ɔlaa ɔpɛ nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:8">O Yakob Yaa, kyɔɔ mi atoko. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ </char><verse eid="PSA 84:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 84:9" />O Yaa, nyu kubidifunsaa loo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:9">nyu nnwɔ fɛɛpɛ ni ɔfɔɔ ku lɛbɔmbɔ.<verse eid="PSA 84:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 84:10" />Leyo lɛfɔ osiɛ dii ninwii nlɛ dilenke</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:10">ayi kakpe di kakɔ bamba;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 84:10">kamale kayoko nyuntɛ di Yaa nii leyo bia,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:10">ninlenkee alɛ kasiɛ di bakpiletɛ akpanta kalɔ.<verse eid="PSA 84:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 84:11" />Diekye Saate Yaa nle kufĩ ku kubidifunsaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:11">Saate nwu nle sibualɛ anta kafɔɔ batii dibu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 84:11">an-sĩ lɛsaa biene ɔbla ɔta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:11">mba di lɛkyɛmbi lɛma nnaa ole kuonwii.<verse eid="PSA 84:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 84:12" />O Saate wɔ Ninlenke ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 84:12">suoto siyɔɔ otii wɔ nietika fɔ ni disi.<verse eid="PSA 84:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 84" />
  <chapter number="85" style="c" sid="PSA 85" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 85</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Diɛta Ni Kale Nwu Lɛlɛ</para>
  <para style="d">Kora Babisuɔtɔbi onu. Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 85:1" />O Saate, feele kasɔ lɛfɔ sibualɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:1">faakplesa Yakob lɛlɛ faatɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 85:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 85:2" />Faayɔ batii lɛfɔ ɔtanlolaa ɔbla faakyɛ ma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:2">faatĩi kafɔɔ sikpile lɛma simuu. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ </char><verse eid="PSA 85:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 85:3" />Faakyisa ɔblɔ lɛfɔ omuu faatɛ di ɔlɔɔkɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:3">faadiɛ kafɔɔ lɛblɔfiɛ yakayaka lɛfɔ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 85:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 85:4" />O Yaa Dikitɛ loo, kple fase wo lelolaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:4">faadiɛ ɔblɔ ɔnya di suoto loo.<verse eid="PSA 85:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 85:5" />Fabanya ɔblɔ fankpee ko wo dinaa ni kaloo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:5">Fabata lɛblɔfiɛ lɛfɔ nwu nfe di ana nwu amuu suoto?<verse eid="PSA 85:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 85:6" />Fabakple fankpee wo osie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:6">alɛ batii lɛfɔ kanya suoto lɛyɔɔ kaamɛ lɛfɔ?<verse eid="PSA 85:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 85:7" />O Saate, tuo wo lɛbɔmbɔ lɛfɔ le ninaa ni kaloo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:7">faatawo didiki lɛfɔ nwu kafɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 85:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 85:8" />Kamanu ɔlaa wɔ di Saate Yaa nwu mabuɛ nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:8">aabuɛ aatɛ alɛ abata atoko ɔkyɛ ole batii nɔɔ, baklekletɛ nɔɔ-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:8">kafɔɔ tanta ma baakple baabla sibuu.<verse eid="PSA 85:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 85:9" />Nwaako didiki nɔɔ ntɔɔtɛɛtɛɛ mba ninyɛkɛ nwɔ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:9">alɛ lɛkpa nɔɔ kawɛ di kasɔ loo suoto.<verse eid="PSA 85:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 85:10" />Lɛbɔmbɔ ku onukwale nkyaka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:10">ɔsaabla tinini ku atoko ɔkyɛ ole mminiko bawo.<verse eid="PSA 85:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 85:11" />Onukwale ntaa kunkye kasɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:11">ɔsaabla tinini kafɔɔ nnyu aankyeko osi.<verse eid="PSA 85:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 85:12" />Nwaako Saate nwu kamata nle ninlɛ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:12">kasɔ loo kafɔɔ kamalɛ alesaa nwaa.<verse eid="PSA 85:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 85:13" />Ɔsaabla tinini nleko nwɔ katũ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 85:13">kunlolaa osuku kunta nnafukpaa nɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 85:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 85" />
  <chapter number="86" style="c" sid="PSA 86" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 86</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Diɛta Ni Lɛkakaako</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid ɔlaa ɔpɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 86:1" />O Saate, nu faatuna fatɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:1">diekye dipii nkle mi diefĩ mi kafɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 86:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 86:2" />Nyu nkpa nii, diekye lɛyɔ nwu ole di suoto lɛfɔ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:2">Yaa nii fale; diki kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:2">wɔ nietika fɔ ni disi.<verse eid="PSA 86:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 86:3" />O Saate, nyɛɛ nyaami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:3">diekye nlɛɛ fɔ di dii kufĩ kumu.<verse eid="PSA 86:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 86:4" />Ta kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ awɛ suoto lɛyɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:4">O Saate, diekye afɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:4">lɛtakatɛsa ɔkla nii lɛkyɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 86:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 86:5" />O Saate, fale ɔyɔ ɔkyɛ, falɛ kafɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:5">fakpe lɛbɔmbɔ kpinwu fɛɛta bamuu ba ninlɛɛ fɔ nii.<verse eid="PSA 86:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 86:6" />O Saate, nu ɔlaa ɔpɛ nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:6">kyɔɔ kaku nii atoko diɛta ni nyaami ɔnya.<verse eid="PSA 86:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 86:7" />Di dii le di ɔlaa letũ mi nii, kamalɛɛ fɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:7">diekye fabatuna fantɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 86:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 86:8" />O Saate, di afiɔ nwu kamɛ, kuanwii nnaa fɛle afɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:8">ɔsaabla kuonwii nnaa kuakaatɛɛ ni ku ole fɔ.<verse eid="PSA 86:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 86:9" />O Saate, nnle be mmuu fɛɛbla ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:9">mawa mamasumu di anu lɛfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:9">man-yɔ dibu manta leyooto lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 86:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 86:10" />Diekye feemuɔ, fɔɔbla kafɔɔ sɛsaabla se nimbla ni ɔkpɛ.<verse eid="PSA 86:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 86:11" />O Saate, tuo mi sisuku lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:11">ni kamakyɛ di onukwale lɛfɔ kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 86:11">tɛɛ otu wɔ ninansɛ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:11">alɛ kayɛkɛ leyooto lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 86:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 86:12" />O Saate Yaa nii, kamatansa fɔ, ku otu nii omuu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:12">kamatansa leyooto lɛfɔ dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="PSA 86:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 86:13" />Diekye lɛbɔmbɔ lɛfɔ lemuɔ di suoto nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:13">feediki mi feekyeko ɔkya kyofole kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 86:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 86:14" />O Yaa, mba nintakatɛsa ni suoto katoo kodieko mi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:14">amumu bablatɛ dikudi komiɛ alɛ badiki nkpa nii-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:14">batii ba ninaa ni dibu bɛɛta fɔ nii.<verse eid="PSA 86:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 86:15" />O Saate, kafɔɔ afɔ Yaa wɔ ninya ni nyaami fakpe ni sibualɛ fale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:15">ɔblɔ lɛfɔ nte buɛɛ, lɛbɔmbɔ mpɔ fɔ fakpe onukwale kafɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 86:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 86:16" />Munikĩi fanyu mi faanyɛɛ nyaami kafɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:16">ta kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ osie lɛfɔ nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:16">faadiki kpɛmblatɛ-sanko lɛfɔ obisuɔtɔbi.<verse eid="PSA 86:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 86:17" />Tɛɛ dibiene lɛfɔ nsũ lɛtɛsaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:17">alɛ balo nii kanya ni, sinunsɔ nkpɛ ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 86:17">O Saate, diekye afɔ niakyakaako mi feekpee mi kɔnɛɛ kaafutu.<verse eid="PSA 86:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 86" />
  <chapter number="87" style="c" sid="PSA 87" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 87</para>
  <para style="s1">Di Yerusalem Katansa</para>
  <para style="d">Onu. Kora babisuɔtɔbi ole.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 87:1" />Eese lɛsɔse nɔɔ di kobokote klekle nwu osi;<verse eid="PSA 87:1" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 87:2" />Saate nwu mbɔmbɔ Sion n-yoko nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:2">anlenkee Yakob nsiɛkɔ nwu mmuu.<verse eid="PSA 87:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 87:3" />O Yaa okpoo kplɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:3">dibu sɛlaa beebuɛ di suoto lɛfɔ: <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ </char><verse eid="PSA 87:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 87:4" />"Kamakpana Rahab ku Babilon ayooto ntɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:4">di mba nin-ye mi ni kamɛ-</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 87:4">Filisti kafɔɔ ku Tiro ku Kus-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:4">mabuɛ alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:4">"Nnwɔ mmle baalofo nwɔ di Sion.'<verse eid="PSA 87:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 87:5" />Nwaako, bababuɛ di Sion suoto alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:5">"Baalofo nnwɔ mmle ku nnwɔ kaamɛ nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:5">Nnwɔ Ninlenke ni omu nimatɛ nwɔ.”<verse eid="PSA 87:5" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 87:6" />Saate nwu makpana batii nwu ayooto di kukũ kamɛ alɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:6">"Baalofo nnwɔ mmle di Sion.” <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ </char><verse eid="PSA 87:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 87:7" />Bɔɔsa ni sinu babasa alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 87:7">"Ntu ntaakɔ nii mmuu nsi kaamɛ lɛfɔ.”<verse eid="PSA 87:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 87" />
  <chapter number="88" style="c" sid="PSA 88" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 88</para>
  <para style="s1">Kaku Owi Diɛta Ni Lɛkyakaako</para>
  <para style="d">Onu. Kora babisuɔtɔbi onu. Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ. Basa nwu di Hema Esra otii nwu <char style="tl">mahalat leanot.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">53.0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dite fɛle onu lɛsambi lewo dile</char></note> <char style="tl">maskil</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">53.0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dite fɛle onu lɛsambi lewo dile</char></note> ole kanya.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 88:1" />O Saate, Yaa wɔ nindiki ni batii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:1">kakũ ku kakyɛ nwi di anu lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 88:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 88:2" />Ta ɔlaa nii ɔpɛ kuwa anu lɛfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:2">munikĩisa kotoko lɛfɔ fakyɔɔ kaku nii.<verse eid="PSA 88:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 88:3" />Diekye ɔkla nii leyii ku nimiina</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:3">nkpa nii kafɔɔ kɔtɛɛtɛɛ ɔkya.<verse eid="PSA 88:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 88:4" />Bɛɛka mi beekpee di mba nikofe ni dibiɔ kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:4">nte fɛle otii wɔ ninaa ni osie.<verse eid="PSA 88:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 88:5" />Batoodiɛ mi di bakpi kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:5">fɛle mba beelo ni bate ni di ɔkya kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 88:5">fonoosinyuma ma nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:5">batoodiki ma ni di nnɛɛ lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 88:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 88:6" />Fatɔɔyɔ mi fɛɛtɛ di dibiɔ lɛkɛtɛɛ kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:6">di kakyofokɔ tunutunu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 88:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 88:7" />Ɔblɔ lɛfɔ ntika mi di suoto ku onutũ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:7">fatɔɔta ntu lɛfɔ nwu nikɔkpɛ ni lelenkee mi nnɛɛ. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ </char><verse eid="PSA 88:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 88:8" />Fatɔɔkpaa mi feekyeko basiɛwo nii ba niɛtɛ bɛɛkaako mi nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:8">fɛɛbla mi kafɔɔ diyududusaa fɛɛta ma.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 88:8">Ntɔɔka, ninamasinfuo otoso kafɔɔ;<verse eid="PSA 88:8" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 88:9" />anu nii nte tutufuu ku sɛnyaami.<verse eid="PSA 88:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 88:10" />Bakpi fantuo sɛkpɛ lɛfɔ se niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:10">Mba nintookpi ni ntaka mantansa fɔ? <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ </char><verse eid="PSA 88:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 88:11" />Mandiki lɛbɔmbɔ lɛfɔ mambuɛ di ɔkya kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:11">onukwale lɛfɔ di Kawɔɔ kamɛ?<verse eid="PSA 88:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 88:12" />Baye sɛkpɛ lɛfɔ se niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ di lɛba le ninle ni ditunu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:12">ee kasɔ ka batooyee ni sɛsaabla tinini lɛfɔ nwu?<verse eid="PSA 88:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 88:13" />O Saate, lawi lalɛɛ fɔ diɛta ni lɛkyakaako;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:13">ɔlaa nii ɔpɛ nwa anu lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 88:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 88:14" />O Saate, obe oso foosĩ mi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:14">foowofasa anu lɛfɔ kafɔɔ di suoto nii?<verse eid="PSA 88:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 88:15" />Diayɔ di sekosopo nii obe kamɛ diobu mi, ntɔɔtɛɛtɛɛ kukpi kafɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:15">ditoobuo mi ku difu lɛfɔ nwu, nnɛɛ toofee mi kafɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 88:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 88:16" />Ɔblɔ lɛfɔ nwu ntoofiɛ mi kuofe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:16">difu lɛfɔ nwu ntɔɔwɔɔsa mi.<verse eid="PSA 88:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 88:17" />Bɛɛmana mi beekyi dii kufĩ kumu fɛle ntu nieyii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:17">batootĩi mi fɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 88:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 88:18" />Fatɔɔkpaa baklopo ku babɔmbɔtɛ nii di suoto nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 88:18">ditunu nwu ninle siɛwo nii bɔmbɔtɛ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 88:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 88" />
  <chapter number="89" style="c" sid="PSA 89" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 89</para>
  <para style="s1">Onu Di Kale Nimiina Kamɛ</para>
  <para style="d">Etan Esra otii nwu <char style="tl">maskil</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">53.0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dite fɛle onu lɛsambi lewo dile</char></note></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 89:1" />Kamasa onu di Saate lɛbɔmbɔ kplɛ le ninaa ni kaloo suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:1">ku kanya nii kamata mantofo onukwale lɛfɔ diefe ni di ana nwu suoto.<verse eid="PSA 89:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 89:2" />Mabuɛ nlɛ lɛbɔmbɔ lɛfɔ n-yɛ kpinkpĩ dinaa ni kaloo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:2">alɛ fɛɛtɛ onukwale lɛfɔ nwu di osi omu.<verse eid="PSA 89:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 89:3" />Faabuɛ falɛ, "Ntoonii kanya ku nnwɔ lediki nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:3">ntɔɔka ntam lɛta Dawid kpɛmblatɛ nii,<verse eid="PSA 89:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 89:4" />'Masiɛsa ɔnantii lɛfɔ di lekpomii dinaa ni kaloo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:4">nta sɛka lɛfɔ kafɔɔ nyila kpinkpĩ diefe ni di ana amuu suoto.' " <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ </char><verse eid="PSA 89:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 89:5" />O Saate, osi kɔtansa sɛkpɛ lɛfɔ se niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:5">onukwale lɛfɔ kafɔɔ di baklekletɛ dikudi nwu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 89:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 89:6" />Diekye owe ninkpe di kolo fanfa baayɔ mankaatɛɛsa ku Saate nwu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:6">Owe ninte fɛle Saate nwu di Yaa babisuɔtɔbi kamɛ?<verse eid="PSA 89:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 89:7" />Man-yɛkɛ Yaa osie kanya di baklekletɛ kasikɔ nwu kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:7">asi difu alenke bamuu ba niɛmana nwɔ beekyi nii.<verse eid="PSA 89:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 89:8" />O Saate Yaa wɔ Ninlenke ni, owe ninte fɛle afɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:8">O Saate, feemuɔ, onukwale lɛfɔ kafɔɔ lɛmana fɔ kuokyi.<verse eid="PSA 89:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 89:9" />Foole sɛka di lekpo le niɛyakayaka ni suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:9">nse diɛpɛ diɛtaka yi, fanta ninte kloklo.<verse eid="PSA 89:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 89:10" />Faabibiɛ Rahab fɛle nnwɔ beelo nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:10">ku kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ osie faasamiisa balo lɛfɔ. <verse eid="PSA 89:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 89:11" />Osi nwu ole fɔ kule, kale fɔ kafɔɔ di kasɔ nwu nle;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:11">afɔ niabla kayi ku asaa ya amuu ninsi ka ni kaamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 89:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 89:12" />Afɔ niabla katoo ku kala;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:12">Tabor ku Hermon kɔsa suoto lɛyɔɔ sinu di leyooto lɛfɔ suoto.<verse eid="PSA 89:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 89:13" />Bɛɛbla kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ ku osie;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:13">kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ nkpe osie, koletanɛɛ lɛfɔ lɛtaka katoo.<verse eid="PSA 89:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 89:14" />Ɔsaabla tinini ku lɛka tinini ninle sɛka lɛfɔ lɛsɔse;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:14">lɛbɔmbɔ ku onukwale n-le fɔ katũ.<verse eid="PSA 89:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 89:15" />Suoto siyɔɔ mba nin-ye alɛ baatansa fɔ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:15">O Saate, mankyɛ ni di lɛkpa lɛfɔ kamɛ di anu lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 89:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 89:16" />Man-nya suoto lɛyɔɔ di leyooto lɛfɔ kamɛ dii kufĩ kumu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:16">mampɔ di ɔsaabla tinini lɛfɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 89:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 89:17" />Diekye afɔ ninle ma lɛkpa ku osie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:17">di sibualɛ lɛfɔ kanya fɛɛtakatɛsa lɛkya loo katoo.<verse eid="PSA 89:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 89:18" />Nwaako, kubidifunsaa loo ninle Saate nwu lele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:18">ɔka loo ɛɛta ni Israel Klekletɛ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 89:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Yaa Laka Ntam Aata Dawid</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 89:19" />Obe onwii faakakatɛ di odiki otuo kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:19">faata banukwaletɛ lɛfɔ falɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 89:19">"Ntɔɔyɔ osie lɛta kpɛtɛ siene;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:19">ntɔɔtakatɛsa okosopo onwii katoo di batii nwu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 89:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 89:20" />Ntɔɔwɛ Dawid kpɛmblatɛ nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:20">lɛpɛ nwɔ ɔfɔɔ ku nnɔnyi klekle nii.<verse eid="PSA 89:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 89:21" />Kɔnɛɛ nii kamanyu nwɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:21">nwaako kɔnɛɛ nii kamakpee nwɔ osie.<verse eid="PSA 89:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 89:22" />Lo kuonwii dilɔbayila nwɔ di suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:22">kpiletɛ kuonwii dilɔbanyinka nwɔ.<verse eid="PSA 89:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 89:23" />Kamabibiɛ balo nɔɔ di anu nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:23">ampɛ bakyiditɛ nɔɔ antɛ kaasɔ.<verse eid="PSA 89:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 89:24" />Onukwale lɛbɔmbɔ nii masiɛko nwɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:24">diefe ni di leyooto nii kamɛ kafɔɔ, babatakatɛsa lɛkya nɔɔ katoo.<verse eid="PSA 89:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 89:25" />Kamayɔ kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ ntika di lekpo osi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:25">koletanɛɛ nɔɔ di sekle osi.<verse eid="PSA 89:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 89:26" />Abalɛɛ mi alɛ, 'Teemi fale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:26">Yaa nii, Difuɔnkpaa nwu Dikitɛ nii.'<verse eid="PSA 89:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 89:27" />Kamabla nwɔ obi nii kasale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:27">nnwɔ babatakatɛsa ni katoo manlenkee ni baka di kasɔ nwu suoto.<verse eid="PSA 89:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 89:28" />Kamayɔ lɛbɔmbɔ nii ntika nwɔ di suoto dinaa ni kaloo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:28">kanya ninii nii ku nnwɔɔ dilɔbalalaa diidii.<verse eid="PSA 89:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 89:29" />Kamatɛ banantii nɔɔ dinaa ni kaloo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:29">sɛka nɔɔ ole di osi lɛnya kukpe ni okpe.<verse eid="PSA 89:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 89:30" />"Nse babisuɔtɔbi nɔɔ lesĩ kufiofa nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:30">manantikanko sisuku nii,<verse eid="PSA 89:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 89:31" />nse bɛɛwaala ɔsaabla nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:31">beesĩ kafɔɔ asaa otuo nii,<verse eid="PSA 89:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 89:32" />kamananfi sikpile lɛma kootoko ku lɛbɔɔsaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:32">ɔtanlolaa ɔbla lɛma ku lɛpɛ;<verse eid="PSA 89:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 89:33" />kafɔɔ namadiki lɛbɔmbɔ nii di ɔkyɛ nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:33">ee nsĩ onukwale nii diidii.<verse eid="PSA 89:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 89:34" />Namawaalɛ kanya ninii nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:34">ee nkyɛlɛnsa nnwɔ di anyasibi nii labuɛ nii.<verse eid="PSA 89:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 89:35" />Ntɔɔka ntam ninwii di lɛklekle nii kanya-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:35">namalaa kafɔɔ nta Dawid-<verse eid="PSA 89:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 89:36" />alɛ banantii nɔɔ makpɛ dinaa ni kaloo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:36">sɛka nɔɔ ole kafɔɔ nte di anu nii fɛle kufĩ;<verse eid="PSA 89:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 89:37" />babase sĩ dinaa ni kaloo fɛle kɔwɛntɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:37">onukwale kamaayilatɛ di kolo.” <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ </char><verse eid="PSA 89:37" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Sɛnyaami Owi Di Ɔka Nwu Lelenkee Suoto</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 89:38" />Kafɔɔ feesĩ, feediɛ nwɔ nnɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:38">fɛɛnya ɔblɔ osie kanya ku nnwɔ fɛɛpɛ ni ɔfɔɔ lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 89:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 89:39" />Fatɔɔlalaasa kanya ninii nwu ku kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:39">fɛɛkpɔnɔfɔsa lɛkakoto nɔɔ nwu di kudu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 89:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 89:40" />Fatoobiɛ feefe di seyoyiɛ nɔɔ simuu kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:40">fɛɛtɛ kafɔɔ kɔba siene nɔɔ kaasɔ kuɔwɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 89:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 89:41" />Mba bamuu ninfe ni ninfa n-yɔ nwɔ asaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:41">atookple lɛmansaa ɛɛta bawo nɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 89:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 89:42" />Fatɔɔtakatɛsa bakyiditɛ nɔɔ koletanɛɛ katoo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:42">fɛɛta suoto kɔyɔɔ balo nɔɔ bamuu.<verse eid="PSA 89:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 89:43" />Fatoomunikĩisa kapamii nɔɔ nwu sɛmaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:43">fatakyakaako nwɔ kafɔɔ di kakpɛ kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 89:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 89:44" />Fatɔɔta sɛlɛ nɔɔ ntoose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:44">fɛɛtɛ kafɔɔ sɛka nɔɔ kaasɔ.<verse eid="PSA 89:44" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 89:45" />Feebudi sekosopo nɔɔ ayi kakuu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:45">feetĩi nwɔ ku sinunsɔ katĩita. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ </char><verse eid="PSA 89:45" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Diɛta Ni Didiki</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 89:46" />O Saate, ɔmɛmbe? Fabawofasa suoto lɛfɔ dinaa ni kaloo?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:46">Ɔmɛmbe di ɔblɔ lɛfɔ nwu kamafiɛ fɛle ɔtɔ kunse?<verse eid="PSA 89:46" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 89:47" />Nyuma mmle di nkpa nii nle ni kakuu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:47">Diekye di mmle faabla ni batii bamuu kasakasa!<verse eid="PSA 89:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 89:48" />Ɔmɛntii nimafuo osiɛ alɛ ɔlɔbanya kukpi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:48">ee andiki suoto nɔɔ ankyeko ɔkya osie nnɛɛ? <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ </char><verse eid="PSA 89:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 89:49" />O Saate, ɔfɛ di lɛbɔmbɔ kplɛ kofole lɛfɔ nwu nkpe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:49">ninle ni onukwale lɛfɔ nwu faaka ni ntam faata ni Dawid?<verse eid="PSA 89:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 89:50" />Saate, nyuma mmle batɔɔma ni kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:50">mmle lefũ ni atufa di nnle mmuu ɔkyɛ di otu nii kamɛ,<verse eid="PSA 89:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 89:51" />O Saate, atufa ku mmle di balo lɛfɔ lama ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 89:51">ku mmle baama ni nnwɔ faapɛ ni ɔfɔɔ lɛfɔ di lɛkpaakyala biala aadiki ni suoto.<verse eid="PSA 89:51" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 89:52" />Baatansa Saate nwu dinaa ni kaloo!</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 89:52">Diwa kaanya, diɛwa kaaya.<verse eid="PSA 89:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 89" />
  <chapter number="90" style="c" sid="PSA 90" />
  <para style="ms">Kukũ Naafa</para>
  <para style="mr">Sinu 90-106</para>
  <para style="cl">Onu 90</para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa Ku Batii Nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="d">Yaa Otii Mose Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 90:1" />Saate, afɔ ninle wo kasiɛkɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:1">diefe ni di ana amuu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 90:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 90:2" />Fiɛ baabla ni abokote</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:2">ee faawako ni kasɔ ku kayi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:2">dieyɔ ni di nua diesifi ni dinaa ni kaloo, afɔ ninle Yaa.<verse eid="PSA 90:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 90:3" />Afɔ ninkplesa batii fambla kudu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:3">fambuɛ falɛ, "O batii babi, bikple bisifi kudu kamɛ.”<verse eid="PSA 90:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 90:4" />Diekye alɛɛ kakpe di anu lɛfɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:4">nte fɛle dii ninwii nintoofe ni nunua,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:4">ee fɛle ninyu ninwii di kakyɛ.<verse eid="PSA 90:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 90:5" />Afɔ ninkpaa batii fansifiko kukpi sɛkyɔsĩ kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:5">ote bate fɛle olesɛ sɛfa fɔle-<verse eid="PSA 90:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 90:6" />nu sinfukuti sɛfɔle ku olesɛ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:6">kɔtɔɔfɔ sin-yɔɔ, sinkoso kafɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 90:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 90:7" />Ɔblɔ lɛfɔ nwɔɔsa wo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:7">lɛblɔfiɛ lɛfɔ kafɔɔ nkpee wo difu.<verse eid="PSA 90:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 90:8" />Fatɔɔyɔ ɔtanlolaa ɔbla loo fɛɛtɛ di anu lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:8">sikpile loo wofale di anu lɛfɔ lɛkpa kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 90:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 90:9" />Ayi loo amuu nwaalɛ anfe di ɔblɔ lɛfɔ kanya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:9">alɛɛ loo nloo ku atuuni.<verse eid="PSA 90:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 90:10" />Ayi loo kanɛ ninle alɛɛ afosi akuɛnsĩ-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:10">ee afosi anɛ, nse bukpe osie nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 90:10">kafɔɔ di obe lɛma nwu kamɛ, dibuo ku sɛnyaami owi ninle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:10">diekye anwaalɛ anfe wla, ni mun-yɛ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 90:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 90:11" />Owe nin-ye ɔblɔ lɛfɔ nwu osie?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:11">Diekye lɛblɔfiɛ lɛfɔ kanya nkpe osie fɛ lɛyɛkɛ le niesiɛko fɔ nii.<verse eid="PSA 90:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 90:12" />Tuo wo mmle buɔka ni ayi loo nwaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:12">alɛ buawɛ ninumbe otu.<verse eid="PSA 90:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 90:13" />O Saate, ɔblɔ buɛɛ! Ɔmɛmbe kubayɔɔ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:13">Nya bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ nyaami.<verse eid="PSA 90:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 90:14" />Ta lɛbɔmbɔ lɛfɔ le ninaa ni kaloo dimiɛsa wo ku olesɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:14">alɛ buasa sinu mumpɔ, mumnya suoto lɛyɔɔ di ayi loo amuu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 90:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 90:15" />Ta wo suoto lɛyɔɔ, fɛ ayi kpinwu ya fɛɛta diemiina wo ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:15">fɛ alɛɛ kpinwu ya butɔɔnya ni dibuo.<verse eid="PSA 90:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 90:16" />Ta batuo bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ sɛsaabla lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:16">baatuo babi lɛma dibu lɛfɔ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 90:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 90:17" />Ta Saate Yaa loo nwu sibualɛ sitika di suoto loo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:17">sè nnɛɛ loo kamɛ sɛkpɛ fata wo-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 90:17">yii, sè nnɛɛ loo kamɛ sɛkpɛ.<verse eid="PSA 90:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 90" />
  <chapter number="91" style="c" sid="PSA 91" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 91</para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa Nyuntɛ Loo</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 91:1" />Nnwɔ ninsiɛ ni di Nnwɔ Niɛtaka Katoo Alenke ni kasiɛkɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:1">kamatɛ ɔnyɛɛ di Nnwɔ Ninleke ni oyududu.<verse eid="PSA 91:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 91:2" />Kamabuɛ di Saate nwu suoto nlɛ, "Nnwɔɔ ninle mi katanikokɔ ku kawofakɔ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:2">Yaa nii, nnwɔ kamɛ letika ni disi.”<verse eid="PSA 91:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 91:3" />Nwaako abadiki fɔ ankyeko kansiɛ okũ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:3">ku ofiɛ kpile wɔ ninlo ni batii nnɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 91:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 91:4" />Abatĩi fɔ ku selonkoo nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:4">di afoko nɔɔ kalɔ kafɔɔ fabawɛ katanikokɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:4">onukwale nɔɔ nimale fɔ kubidifunsaa ku kɔba.<verse eid="PSA 91:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 91:5" />Flɔbayɛkɛ kakyɛ difu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:5">ee lɛkplɔ le ninfenfe ni di dii kamɛ,<verse eid="PSA 91:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 91:6" />ee ofiɛ kpile wɔ nimpɛ ni otii di ditunu kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:6">ee dibuo le ninlalaasa ni asaa ku kakũ.<verse eid="PSA 91:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 91:7" />Kakpe kamanɔɔ di ɔlɔɔkɔ lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:7">nkpe lefosi di oletanɛɛkyɛ lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:7">kafɔɔ dilɔbatɛɛtɛɛ fɔ.<verse eid="PSA 91:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 91:8" />Ɔnya ko fabanya ku anu lɛfɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:8">fannya bakpiletɛ nwu letoko naanfi.<verse eid="PSA 91:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 91:9" />Nse fɛɛyɔ Nnwɔ Niɛtaka Katoo Alenke ni fɛɛbla kasiɛkɔ lɛfɔ-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:9">bia Saate nwu ninle mi ni katanikokɔ-<verse eid="PSA 91:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 91:10" />ni okpile kuonwii dilɔbatũ fɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:10">ɔlaa kuonwii dilɔbatɛɛtɛɛ lɛkpaayo lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 91:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 91:11" />Diekye abadiki batɔkyɛntɛ nɔɔ kanya di suoto lɛfɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:11">alɛ banyu fɔ di sisuku lɛfɔ simuu suoto;<verse eid="PSA 91:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 91:12" />babakɛnkɛ fɔ di nnɛɛ lɛma kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:12">alɛ flɔbayɔ kɔkpaa lɛfɔ fasa di difɔ suoto.<verse eid="PSA 91:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 91:13" />Fabakyɛ di kyata ku kɔwɛɛfɛɛko suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:13">fabananafu kyata kplɛ nwu ku kɔsaanwu.<verse eid="PSA 91:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 91:14" />Saate nwu alɛ, "Diekye ambɔmbɔ mi, kamadiki nwɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:14">kamanyu nwɔ, diekye aye leyooto nii.<verse eid="PSA 91:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 91:15" />Abalɛɛ mi, ami kafɔɔ kamatuna ntɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:15">kamasiɛko nwɔ di nimiina obe kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:15">kamadiki nwɔ ntɔɔ dibu kafɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 91:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 91:16" />Kamayɔ nkpa kaanale mmiɛsa nwɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 91:16">ntuo nwɔ kafɔɔ didiki nii.”<verse eid="PSA 91:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 91" />
  <chapter number="92" style="c" sid="PSA 92" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 92</para>
  <para style="s1">Katansa Onu</para>
  <para style="d">Onu. Kuɔta ni Lɛnyɛɛtɛyi.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 92:1" />Dilɛ alɛ baatansa Saate nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:1">O Nnwɔ Niɛtaka Katoo Alenke ni, mansa sinu mantasa leyooto lɛfɔ,<verse eid="PSA 92:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 92:2" />mayie lɛbɔmbɔ lɛfɔ lɛkya ku olesɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:2">onukwale lɛfɔ kafɔɔ ku kakyɛ,<verse eid="PSA 92:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 92:3" />di ekũ lefosi kyitaa sinu kanya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:3">ku sanku nwu sɛlɔ.<verse eid="PSA 92:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 92:4" />O Saate, diekye fɛɛtɛɛ suoto lɛyɔɔ ku sɛsaabla lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:4">nsa sinu mpɔ di nnɛɛ lɛfɔ sɛkpɛ ɔbla suoto.<verse eid="PSA 92:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 92:5" />O Saate, mmle di sɛkpɛ lɛfɔ lemuɔ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:5">mmle di disibu lɛfɔ lekyofo ni!<verse eid="PSA 92:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 92:6" />Otii wɔ di disi nnaa ni dieye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:6">babuutɛ ninnu kasɔ,<verse eid="PSA 92:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 92:7" />alɛ kuntɛ bakpiletɛ kɔlɛ fɛle sɛfa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:7">di asaa kɔlɛ ɔkyɛ anta sikpile bablatɛ yi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 92:7">babawɔɔsa ma dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="PSA 92:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 92:8" />O Saate, kafɔɔ afɔ bɛɛtakatɛsa fɔ katoo dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="PSA 92:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 92:9" />O Saate, diekye nwaako balo lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:9">nwaako balo lɛfɔ kamakpi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:9">babasamiisa sikpile bablatɛ bamuu.<verse eid="PSA 92:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 92:10" />Fatɔɔtakatɛsa lɛkya nii katoo fɛle kɔ̀kɔ lele;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:10">bɛɛnyɛɛnɛ nnɔnyi nwaa beekpete mi di suoto.<verse eid="PSA 92:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 92:11" />Anu nii ntɔɔnya lelenkee nwu di batikankotɛ nii suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:11">atoko nii ntoonu bakyiditɛ nii bakpiletɛ nwu kawɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 92:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 92:12" />Asaa malɛ ɔkyɛ anta batinintɛ fɛle ɔwɔsɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:12">babamuɔ fɛle seda kowoso di Lebanon;<verse eid="PSA 92:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 92:13" />bɛɛsɔ ni di Saate nwu leyo kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:13">babalɛ di Yaa loo akpata nwu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 92:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 92:14" />Babakple mantika abi di sɛnɔɔfo lɛma kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:14">babate kpotokpoto manlɛ onyu kafɔɔ,<verse eid="PSA 92:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 92:15" />mantoobuɛ alɛ, "Saate nwu nte tinini;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 92:15">nnwɔɔ ninle Difuɔnkpaa nii nɛ, akpilesaa kuanwii kafɔɔ diesi kaamɛ nɔɔ.”<verse eid="PSA 92:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 92" />
  <chapter number="93" style="c" sid="PSA 93" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 93</para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa Ɔka Nwu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 93:1" />Saate nwu kole sɛka, akle akasaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:1">Saate nwu nkle akasaa di dibu kanya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:1">akle kafɔɔ akpɛsaa ku osie.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 93:1">Bɛɛtɛ kayi nwu kpinkpĩ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:1">blɔbafuo ka ɔkpa.<verse eid="PSA 93:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 93:2" />Faase lɛkakpomii lɛfɔ nwu kofokofoko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:2">fakpe dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="PSA 93:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 93:3" />O Saate, lekpo nwu ntɔɔnyana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:3">lekpo nwu ntɔɔnyana diɔpɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:3">lekpo nwu ntɔɔnyana, ntu nini kɔpɛ osie kanya.<verse eid="PSA 93:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 93:4" />Fakpe onutũ falenke ntu kplɛ nwu lɛpɛ fɛle kanto dikpududuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:4">fakpe onutũ falenke lekpo le nikɔpɛ ni-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:4">Saate nwu kaatoo nkpe onutũ.<verse eid="PSA 93:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 93:5" />Afiofa lɛfɔ n-yɛ kpinkpĩ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:5">leklekle lɛsiɛko leyo lɛfɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 93:5">O Saate, diɛta ni ayi ya ninaa ni kase.<verse eid="PSA 93:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 93" />
  <chapter number="94" style="c" sid="PSA 94" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 94</para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa, Batii Bamuu Kantɛ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 94:1" />O Saate, Yaa wɔ nimbla ankyisa ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:1">O Yaa wɔ nimbla ankyisa ni, kpa nfɛ.<verse eid="PSA 94:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 94:2" />O kasɔ nwu kantɛ, taka;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:2">ta suoto katoo batakatɛsa koto ko niɛsiɛko ma ni.<verse eid="PSA 94:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 94:3" />O Saate, ɔmɛmbe di bakpiletɛ nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:3">ɔmɛmbe di bakpiletɛ nwu mapɔ manaase?<verse eid="PSA 94:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 94:4" />Boodiki lɛkanta sɛlaa mantɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:4">lɛkanta leyii sikpile babalatɛ bamuu kamɛ pɔ.<verse eid="PSA 94:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 94:5" />O Saate, mambibiɛ batii lɛfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:5">boonyinka atesaa ya ninle ni batii lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 94:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 94:6" />Manlo bakpisɔfɔ ku bafɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:6">mambudi bakuɛbi asi.<verse eid="PSA 94:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 94:7" />Mambuɛ alɛ, "Saate nwu dilɔɔnya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:7">Yakob Yaa nwu dilɔɔkyɔɔ atoko.”<verse eid="PSA 94:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 94:8" />Bikyɔɔ atoko, aye ba ninan-ye ni lɛsaa di batii kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:8">aye babuutɛ, ɔmɛmbe bibabe anu?<verse eid="PSA 94:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 94:9" />Nnwɔ niɛkaasa ni kotoko ninnu?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:9">Nnwɔ niɛbla ni ninu ninnya?<verse eid="PSA 94:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 94:10" />Nnwɔ ninanfi ni nnle kootoko ninnanfi batii kootoko?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:10">Nnwɔ nintuo ni otii asaa nnaa lɛsaatofo?<verse eid="PSA 94:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 94:11" />Saate nwu n-ye otii disibu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:11">aye alɛ asaakuu ale.<verse eid="PSA 94:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 94:12" />O Saate, suoto siyɔɔ otii wɔ kotoko fɛɛnanfi ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:12">otii wɔ feetuo ni asaa di kufiofa lɛfɔ suoto;<verse eid="PSA 94:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 94:13" />fandiki nwɔ fankyeko dibuo ayi kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:13">ninaase di obe wɔ beekutu dibiɔ bɛɛta ni bakpiletɛ.<verse eid="PSA 94:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 94:14" />Diekye Saate nwu dilɔbasĩ batii nɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:14">ɔlɔbadiɛ atesaa nɔɔ diidii.<verse eid="PSA 94:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 94:15" />Babakple mannya lɛkanko biene di ɔsaabla tinini suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:15">bamuu ba situ niɛkpa ni kamatikanko nwu.<verse eid="PSA 94:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 94:16" />Owe nimataka anyila di bakpiletɛ suoto antɛɛ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:16">Owe nimayila di sikpile bablatɛ suoto antɛɛ?<verse eid="PSA 94:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 94:17" />Diediki Saate nwu lɛtɛɛ lɛkyakaako,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:17">nunua ntabalo kanana nsiɛ di kukpi kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 94:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 94:18" />Obe wɔ labuɛ nlɛ, "Kɔkpaa nii kɔfɛntɛ,” ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:18">O Saate, lɛbɔmbɔ lɛfɔ lakyakaako mi.<verse eid="PSA 94:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 94:19" />Nse nimiina kplɛ lɛwa mi di suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:19">kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ okpee kaafutu nta suoto n-yɔɔ ɔkla nii.<verse eid="PSA 94:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 94:20" />Sɛka kalekɔ ka ninankpa ni kɔmɛ kafuo onwii ɔbla ku afɔ-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:20">nnwɔ nin-yɔ dibuo anwako ni di kufiofa nikũ kanya?<verse eid="PSA 94:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 94:21" />Mannii kanya di batininitɛ suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:21">manlo mba ole ninkpe ni kukpi lɛpɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 94:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 94:22" />Kafɔɔ Saate nwu ntookple kawofakɔ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:22">Yaa nii kafɔɔ, difuɔnkpaa le kamɛ nintaniko nii.<verse eid="PSA 94:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 94:23" />Abata ma koto ankyisa di sikpile lɛma kanya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:23">anwɔɔsa ma ta amumu lɛma oso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 94:23">Saate Yaa loo nwu kamawɔɔsa ma.<verse eid="PSA 94:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 94" />
  <chapter number="95" style="c" sid="PSA 95" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 95</para>
  <para style="s1">Katasa Onu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 95:1" />Biwa, biɛta busa suoto lɛyɔɔ sinu buta Saate nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:1">bita bufaa osie kanya buta didiki loo Difuɔnkpaa nwu.<verse eid="PSA 95:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 95:2" />Bita buwa anu nɔɔ ku sɛfa ɔpɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:2">buɔtansa nwɔ ku sinu ɔsa.<verse eid="PSA 95:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 95:3" />Diekye Saate nwu ninle Yaa kplɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:3">Ɔka kplɛ nwu niɛtaka katoo alenke ni afiɔ amuu.<verse eid="PSA 95:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 95:4" />Kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ kamɛ di kasɔ nwu lekyofo nsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:4">abokote ntakalekɔ nwu kafɔɔ nle nwɔ ale.<verse eid="PSA 95:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 95:5" />Lele nwɔ di lekpo nwu nle, diekye nnwɔɔ niɛbla ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:5">nnɛɛ nɔɔ kafɔɔ niatɛ kasɔ kosole nwu.<verse eid="PSA 95:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 95:6" />Biwa, biɛta buwakasɔ busumu nwɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:6">bita bupɛ akunkyi di Saate, Blatɛ loo nwu anu;<verse eid="PSA 95:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 95:7" />diekye nnwɔɔ ninle Yaa loo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:7">awo kafɔɔ ninle batii di sɛfa nɔɔ kaweekɔ nwu nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:7">bafoso nɔɔ ba oonyu ni nɛ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 95:7" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 95:7">Mmiɛ, nse bienu sɛlɔ nɔɔ,<verse eid="PSA 95:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 95:8" />bitanta situ lee lawɛ osie fɛ mmle biabla ni di Meriba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:8">fɛ mmle biabla ni dii nwu di Masa di ɔfaafuu nwu,<verse eid="PSA 95:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 95:9" />nfa di bate lee lawolaa mi kaanya, baasɔ mi baanyu nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:9">nu baanya lɛsaa le labla nii.<verse eid="PSA 95:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 95:10" />Alɛɛ afosi-ana amu di ɔblɔ lafiɛ mi di kɔna nwu suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:10">labuɛ nlɛ, "Bale batii ba situ nieyu nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:10">batatofo sisuku nii kafɔɔ.”<verse eid="PSA 95:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 95:11" />Nioso laka ntam di lɛblɔfiɛ nii kamɛ nlɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 95:11">"Blɔbabuo ɔnyɛɛ nii katɛkɔ.”<verse eid="PSA 95:11" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 95" />
  <chapter number="96" style="c" sid="PSA 96" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 96</para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa Ɔka Kplɛ Nwu</para>
  <para style="r">(1 Kro.16.23–33)</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 96:1" />Bisa onu fɔle bita Saate nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:1">kasɔ kamuu, bisa sinu bita Saate nwu.<verse eid="PSA 96:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 96:2" />Bisa sinu bita Saate nwu, bitansa leyooto nɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:2">biyie didiki nɔɔ lɛkya dii biala.<verse eid="PSA 96:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 96:3" />Bidiki lɛkpa nɔɔ bibuɛ di nnle nwu kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:3">ablasaa nɔɔ ya niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ di batii bamuu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 96:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 96:4" />Diekye Saate nwu lemuɔ ɛɛtɛ eesiɛko ni katansa nwaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:4">dikaatɛ man-yɛkɛ nwɔ manlenkee afiɔ amuu.<verse eid="PSA 96:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 96:5" />Diekye nnle afiɔ amuu nle afatii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:5">kafɔɔ Saate nwu niɛbla osi.<verse eid="PSA 96:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 96:6" />Dibu ku sɛka nte nwɔ di anu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:6">osie ku sɛlɛ nte di lɛkpaayo klekle nɔɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 96:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 96:7" />O nnle nfaabi, biyɔ bita Saate nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:7">biyɔ dibu ku osie bita Saate nwu.<verse eid="PSA 96:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 96:8" />Biyɔ dibu le niesiɛko ni Saate nwu bita leyooto nɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:8">biyɔ asaaɔta biwako, biɛwa di akpata nɔɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 96:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 96:9" />Bisumu Saate nwu ku dibu di leklekle nɔɔ kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:9">kasɔ kamuu, bitũtũkũ di anu nɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 96:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 96:10" />Bibuɛ di nnle nwu mmuu kamɛ bilɛ, Saate nwu kole sika.”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:10">Ɛɛtɛ kayi nwu kpinkpĩ, klaafuo ɔkpa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:10">abakanko batii nwu kyɛkyɛ.<verse eid="PSA 96:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 96:11" />Bita osi anya suoto lɛyɔɔ, biɛta kasɔ kapɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:11">bita lekpo ku asaa ya amuu ninsi ni kaamɛ adiki kanya;<verse eid="PSA 96:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 96:12" />bita afe ku lɛsaa biala kaamɛ nɔɔ anya suoto lɛyɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 96:12">Ni lepoo kamɛ awoso amuu kamasa sinu ampɔ;<verse eid="PSA 96:12" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 96:13" />babasa sinu di Saate nwu anu, diekye ɔɔwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:13">ɔɔwa abakanko kasɔ nwu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 96:13">Abakanko kayi di ɔsaabla tinini kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 96:13">ku batii nwu di onukwale nɔɔ kanya.<verse eid="PSA 96:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 96" />
  <chapter number="97" style="c" sid="PSA 97" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 97</para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa Tunletɛ Kplɛ Nwu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 97:1" />Saate nwu kole sɛka, bita kasɔ kanya suoto lɛyɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:1">bita lekpo kotoko nsɔ be ninkpe ni fanfa dipɔ.<verse eid="PSA 97:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 97:2" />Alokonkyɛ ku dintunu pinle lɛmana nwɔ eekyi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:2">ɔsaabla tinini ku lɛka tinini ninle sɛka kalekɔ nɔɔ lɛsɔse.<verse eid="PSA 97:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 97:3" />Ɔtɔ nleko nwɔ katũ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:3">kunfiɛfiɛ bakyiditɛ nɔɔ di ɔfankyi biala.<verse eid="PSA 97:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 97:4" />Ɔplalaa nɔɔ amunaa nsɔ ɔtɔ kaayi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:4">kasɔ kafɔɔ nnya, kantũtũkũ.<verse eid="PSA 97:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 97:5" />Abokote nnyinakĩi fɛle sɛtɔ̀ di Saate nwu anu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:5">di kasɔ kamuu di Saate nwu anu.<verse eid="PSA 97:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 97:6" />Osi nwu nyie ɔsaabla tinini nɔɔ lɛkya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:6">batii nwu bamuu kafɔɔ nnya lɛkpa nɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 97:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 97:7" />Beekpee mba bamuu nintɔ ni awolasaa sinunsɔ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:7">mba ninkanta ni di afatii suoto-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:7">afiɔ amuu, bisumu nwɔ!<verse eid="PSA 97:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 97:8" />Sion nnu, annya suoto lɛyɔɔ kafɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:8">Yuda sekpoo kafɔɔ mpɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:8">O Saate, ta lɛkanko lɛfɔ nwu oso.<verse eid="PSA 97:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 97:9" />O Saate, diekye afɔ ninle Nnwɔ Niɛtaka ni Katoo alenke ni di kasɔ nwu kamuu suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:9">bɛɛtakatɛsa fɔ katoo fanfa balenke afiɔ amuu.<verse eid="PSA 97:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 97:10" />Bita batii ba bamuu nimbɔmbɔ ni Saate nwu bakyidi okpile,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:10">diekye nnwɔɔ ninyu banukwaletɛ nɔɔ nkpa disi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:10">andiki ma kafɔɔ ankyeko bakpiletɛ nnɛɛ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 97:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 97:11" />Lɛkpa nkpa ninta batininitɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:11">suoto n-yɔɔ mba di situ kamɛ lɛkpa ni.<verse eid="PSA 97:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 97:12" />Aye ba ninte ni tinini, suoto siyɔɔ ye di Saate nwu kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 97:12">biɛtansa leyooto nɔɔ klekle nwu.<verse eid="PSA 97:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 97" />
  <chapter number="98" style="c" sid="PSA 98" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 98</para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa, Kayi Nwu Tunletɛ</para>
  <para style="d">Onu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 98:1" />Bisa onu fɔle bita Saate nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:1">diekye ɛɛbla asaa ya niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 98:1">koletanɛɛ nɔɔ ku kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ klekle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:1">lɛbla didiki ɔkpɛ ɛɛtɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 98:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 98:2" />Saate nwu lɛta beetofo didiki nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:2">eediki kafɔɔ ɔsaabla tinini nɔɔ kayi ɛɛta nnle.<verse eid="PSA 98:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 98:3" />Atoonyuma lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:3">ku onukwale nɔɔ ɛɛta Israel leyo nwu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 98:3">kasɔ nyɛntɛlekɔ nwu mmuu ntɔɔnya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:3">Yaa loo nwu didiki.<verse eid="PSA 98:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 98:4" />Kasɔ kamuu, biyiisa suoto lɛyɔɔ kudu bita Saate nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:4">bidie ku lɛpɔ sinu ɔsa;<verse eid="PSA 98:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 98:5" />bisa sinu bita Saate nwu ku sanku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:5">ku sanku nwu ku sinu ɔsa sɛlɔ,<verse eid="PSA 98:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 98:6" />ku akyukyoo ku dikunumuu lɛkya lɛfɛ-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:6">bieyiisa suoto lɛyɔɔ kudu di Saate, Ɔka nwu anu.<verse eid="PSA 98:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 98:7" />bita lekpo ku asaa ya amuu ninsi ni kaamɛ adiki kanya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:7">kayi, ku mba bamuu ninsi ka ni kaamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 98:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 98:8" />Bita sekle sipɛ anɛɛkya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:8">bita abokote asi aasa suoto lɛyɔɔ sinu;<verse eid="PSA 98:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 98:9" />ta nya asa sinu di Saate nwu anu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:9">diekye ɔɔwa abakanko kasɔ nwu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 98:9">Abakanko kayi di ɔsaabla tinini kanya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 98:9">ku batii nwu kyɛkyɛ.<verse eid="PSA 98:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 98" />
  <chapter number="99" style="c" sid="PSA 99" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 99</para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa, Ɔka Kplɛ Nwu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 99:1" />Saate nwu kole sɛka,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:1">bita nnle ditũtũkũ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 99:1">asi oole sɛka di bakerubim obo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:1">bita kasɔ katũkũ.<verse eid="PSA 99:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 99:2" />Saate nwu Lemuɔ di Sion;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:2">bɛɛtakatɛsa nwu katoo di nnle mmuu suoto.<verse eid="PSA 99:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 99:3" />Bita ma batansa leyooto kplɛ ku lɛyɛkɛle lɛfɔ nwu-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:3">ate klekle.<verse eid="PSA 99:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 99:4" />Ɔka nwu nkpe onutũ, ambɔmbɔ lɛka tinini-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:4">afɔ niɛtɛ ɔsaabla kyɛkyɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 99:4">di Yakob kamɛ fɛɛbla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:4">lɛsaa le ninte ni nkpo, dilɛ ni kafɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 99:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 99:5" />Bitakatɛsa Saate Yaa loo katoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:5">biesumu di nkpaa ditikasaa nɔɔ katũ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:5">ate klekle.<verse eid="PSA 99:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 99:6" />Mose ku Aron lasiɛ di olebatatɛ nɔɔ kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:6">Samuel kafɔɔ lasiɛ di mba nialɛɛ ni leyooto nɔɔ kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 99:6">baalɛɛ Saate nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:6">ni aatuna aata ma nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 99:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 99:7" />Aakakatɛ aata ma di dituntũ takale nwu kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:7">baale afiofa nɔɔ, baakyɛ di sisuku nɔɔ se aata ma nii.<verse eid="PSA 99:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 99:8" />O Saate, Yaa loo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:8">faatuna faata ma;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 99:8">faale Yaa wɔ nin-yɔ ankyɛ ni faata Israel,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:8">kuntɛ faanaanfi ɔtanlolaa ɔbla lɛma kootoko.<verse eid="PSA 99:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 99:9" />Bitakatɛsa Saate Yaa loo nwu katoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:9">biesumu di kobokote klekle nɔɔ nwu suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 99:9">diekye Saate, Yaa loo nwu nte klekle.<verse eid="PSA 99:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 99" />
  <chapter number="100" style="c" sid="PSA 100" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 100</para>
  <para style="s1">Katansa Onu</para>
  <para style="d">Onu. Kuɔta ni sɛfa ɔpɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 100:1" />Kasɔ kamuu, biyiisa suoto lɛyɔɔ kudu bita Saate nwu.<verse eid="PSA 100:1" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 100:2" />Bisumu Saate nwu ku lɛpɔ̀;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:2">biwa anu nɔɔ ku suoto lɛyɔɔ sinu.<verse eid="PSA 100:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 100:3" />Bitofo bilɛ Saate nwu ninle Yaa nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:3">Nnwɔɔ ninle nnwɔ niabla wo nii, bale nwɔ kafɔɔ bule;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:3">batii nɔɔ bule, bafoso di sɛfa nɔɔ kaweekɔ.<verse eid="PSA 100:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 100:4" />Bibuo di n-yoko nɔɔ ku sɛfa ɔpɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:4">ku akpata nɔɔ ku katansa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:4">bipɛ nwɔ sɛfa, biɛtansa leyooto nɔɔ kafɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 100:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 100:5" />Diekye Saate nwu nlɛ, lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ kafɔɔ nkpe dinaa ni kaloo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 100:5">onukwale nɔɔ nte kuosifi ana amuu.<verse eid="PSA 100:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 100" />
  <chapter number="101" style="c" sid="PSA 101" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 101</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔka Onwii Ntam</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 101:1" />Kamasa onu di lɛbɔmbɔ ku lɛka tinini lɛfɔ suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:1">O Saate, afɔ kamasa onu ntansa.<verse eid="PSA 101:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 101:2" />Kamalolaa nnyu, nsiɛ nkpa be di ole kuonwii nnaa nii-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:2">ɔmɛmbe fabawa ɔkyɛ nii?<verse eid="PSA 101:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 101:3" />Namayɔ lɛsaa le ninanlɛ ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:3">ntɛ di anu nii.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 101:3" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 101:3">Lekyidi batii ba ninaa ni onukwale sɛsaabla;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:3">blɔbatɛɛtɛɛ mi.<verse eid="PSA 101:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 101:4" />Nnya nsɛkɛnsɛkɛ batii makyɛ lookyo di suoto nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:4">nnaa lɛblasaa kuninwii ku okpile.<verse eid="PSA 101:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 101:5" />Olele niebudi owo nɔɔ kanya di lewofa kamɛ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:5">kamamaasa nwɔ kanya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 101:5">olele nimbɛbɛɛ anu ku otu wɔ ninkanta nii yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:5">namatunako nwɔ.<verse eid="PSA 101:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 101:6" />Anu nii kamatika di banukwaletɛ suoto di kasɔ nwu suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:6">alɛ baasiɛ ku ami;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 101:6">nnwɔ di lɛkyɛmbi nɔɔ nnaa ni ole kuonwii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:6">kamasumu mi.<verse eid="PSA 101:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 101:7" />Otii lele ninkpe kakyɔnkyɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:7">dilɔbasiɛ di leyo nii;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 101:7">otii lele ninkakatɛ sɛlaa ku afunu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:7">dilɔbayila di anu nii.<verse eid="PSA 101:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 101:8" />Olesɛ biala kamamaasa kanya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:8">bakpiletɛ bamuu n-nya di kasɔ nwu suoto;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 101:8">kamadiki kpileblatɛ biala</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 101:8">di Saate nwu okpoo kplɛ kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 101:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 101" />
  <chapter number="102" style="c" sid="PSA 102" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 102</para>
  <para style="s1">Okosopo Onwii Di Ɔlaa Nitika Ni Di Suoto Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ</para>
  <para style="d">Osuɔtɔ onwii diobuo ni ɔlaa ɔpɛ. Nse ɔnyɛɛ koloo nwɔ andiki sɛlaa nɔɔ antɛ ni di Saate nwu anu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 102:1" />O Saate, nu ɔlaa ɔpɛ nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:1">ta kaku owi nii diɛta ni lɛkyakaako kawa ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 102:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 102:2" />Tanwofasa anu lɛfɔ di suoto nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:2">nse nsi di nimiina kamɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 102:2">Munikĩisa kotoko lɛfɔ fakyɔɔ mi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:2">nse lɛlɛɛ, tuna fatɛɛ wla.<verse eid="PSA 102:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 102:3" />Diekye ayi nii kɔyɛ fɛle kɔyɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:3">akufi nii kɔfiɛ fɛle atɔkɔnii kɛsɛɛle.<verse eid="PSA 102:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 102:4" />Bɛɛpɛ otu nii kuɔyɔɔ kafɔɔ fɛle sɛfa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:4">layee alesaa nii ole.<verse eid="PSA 102:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 102:5" />Ta atuuni nii osie kanya oso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:5">ntɔɔsɔɔ di suoto lɛkaa di akufi.<verse eid="PSA 102:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 102:6" />Nte fɛle ɔfaafuu disukusuku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:6">fɛle disukusuku di kawɔɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 102:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 102:7" />Nsɛnkɛ nte; ntookple</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:7">fɛle kansiɛ wɔ nintika ni di lɛkya osi lete nɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 102:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 102:8" />Balo nii ndieko mi dii kufĩ kumu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:8">mba niɛtaka bayɛ mi ni di suoto n-yɔ leyooto nii fɛ lɛkpaani.<verse eid="PSA 102:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 102:9" />Diekye ntɔ̀ nfɛ kole fɛ alesaa nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:9">nkpɔtɔɔsa ninyinle nii kafɔɔ ku nnumɛɛ<verse eid="PSA 102:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 102:10" />ta ɔblɔ yakayaka lɛfɔ nwu oso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:10">diekye fatɔɔyɔ mi feeyu kafɔɔ di ɔlɔɔkɔ.<verse eid="PSA 102:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 102:11" />Ayi nii nte fɛle kɔtɔɔfɔ kunyii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:11">kɔyɔɔ fɛle sɛfa.<verse eid="PSA 102:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 102:12" />O Saate, kafɔɔ afɔ, fasi foole sɛka dinaa ni kaloo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:12">leyooto lɛfɔ nte diesifi ana amuu suoto.<verse eid="PSA 102:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 102:13" />Fabataka fannya kafɔɔ Sion nyaami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:13">diekye obe ntoowo faale nwɔ ni sibualɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:13">obe wɔ bɛɛtɛ ni ntoodu.<verse eid="PSA 102:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 102:14" />Diekye afuɔ nɔɔ lefũ kɔya ɛɛta bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:14">annya kudu nɔɔ nwu nyaami.<verse eid="PSA 102:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 102:15" />Nnle nwu mayɛkɛ Saate nwu leyooto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:15">baka nwu bamuu di kasɔ nwu suoto mayɛkɛ lɛkpa lɛfɔ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 102:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 102:16" />Diekye Saate nwu makple anse Sion letofo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:16">abakyɔɔ kafɔɔ di lɛkpa nɔɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 102:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 102:17" />Abatuna anta bapiitɛ ɔlaa ɔpɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:17">ɔlɔbasĩ ɔlaa lɛma onu.<verse eid="PSA 102:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 102:18" />Ta bakpana nle mmle batɛ kɔna ko nikɔwa ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:18">alɛ batii ba manadibla ni katansa ni Saate nwu:<verse eid="PSA 102:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 102:19" />"Saate nwu nnyu ankyeko lɛkpaayo klekle nɔɔ kaatoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:19">annya kasɔ ankyeko osi,<verse eid="PSA 102:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 102:20" />annu ayo batentɛ atuuni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:20">andiki kafɔɔ mba beelo ni kukpi lɛpɔɔ.”<verse eid="PSA 102:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 102:21" />Nioso babalɛɛ Saate nwu leyooto di Sion</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:21">katansa nɔɔ kafɔɔ di Yerusalem<verse eid="PSA 102:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 102:22" />nse batii nwu ku sɛka nlekɔ nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:22">lesi alɛ boosumu Saate nwu.<verse eid="PSA 102:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 102:23" />Di nkpa nii kamɛ, aakɔkɔlɛ osie nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:23">aabudi ayi nii kakuu.<verse eid="PSA 102:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 102:24" />Nioso labuɛ nlɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:24">"O Yaa nii, tankpaa mi di ayi nii ntɛɛ kamɛ faasifiko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:24">alɛɛ lɛfɔ nkyɛ anfe di ana amuu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 102:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 102:25" />Di kasɔ kakyekɔ faase kasɔ nwu asɔse,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:25">osi nwu kafɔɔ nle nnɛɛ lɛfɔ ɔkpɛ.<verse eid="PSA 102:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 102:26" />Babakpi, kafɔɔ afɔ fakpe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:26">bamuu kamayɛɛ fɛle sikpilakpi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 102:26">Fabakyɛlɛnsa nya fɛle abula</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:26">babadiɛ nya mantɛ.<verse eid="PSA 102:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 102:27" />Kafɔɔ afɔ nkpo nwu fate ote nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:27">alɛɛ lɛfɔ kafɔɔ dilɔbaloo diidii.<verse eid="PSA 102:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 102:28" />Bakpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ babi kamasiɛ di anu lɛfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 102:28">banantii lɛma kamawɛ di anu lɛfɔ.”<verse eid="PSA 102:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 102" />
  <chapter number="103" style="c" sid="PSA 103" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 103</para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa Lɛbɔmbɔ</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 103:1" />O ɔkla nii, tansa Saate nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:1">asaa ya amuu ninsi ni kaamɛ nii, tansa leyooto klekle nɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 103:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 103:2" />O ɔkla nii, tansa Saate nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:2">tanyee kafɔɔ abiene nɔɔ amuu-<verse eid="PSA 103:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 103:3" />nnwɔ nin-yɔ sikpile lɛfɔ simuu ankyɛ nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:3">ankya ni sifiɛ lɛfɔ simuu kafɔɔ,<verse eid="PSA 103:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 103:4" />andiki ni nkpa lɛfɔ ankyeko ni dibiɔ kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:4">antũkunsa fɔ ni lɛbɔmbɔ ku nyaami ɔnya lɛkakoto,<verse eid="PSA 103:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 103:5" />nnwɔ ninta ni abiesaa lɛfɔ ku asaa biene</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:5">mmle di sekosopo lɛfɔ katoose ni lɛfɔle ɔbla fɛle klikpo sele.<verse eid="PSA 103:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 103:6" />Saate mbla ɔsaabla tinini sɛkpɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:6">anta kafɔɔ mba bamuu boonyinka ni lɛbɛ.<verse eid="PSA 103:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 103:7" />Antuo Mose sisuku nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:7">antuo Israel batii sɛsaabla nɔɔ:<verse eid="PSA 103:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 103:8" />Saate nwu nnya nyaami, akpe kafɔɔ sifutulɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:8">ɔblɔ nɔɔ nte buɛɛ, lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ mpɔ.<verse eid="PSA 103:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 103:9" />Ɔlɔbatɛ fɔ koló obe lele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:9">ee anya ɔblɔ dinaa ni kaloo;<verse eid="PSA 103:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 103:10" />annanfi wo kootoko fɛ mmle di sikpile loo lesiɛko nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:10">ee ata wo koto di ɔtanlolaa loo ɔbla kanya.<verse eid="PSA 103:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 103:11" />Diekye fɛ mmle di osi lɛtaka kulenke ni kasɔ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:11">nkpo di lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ lemuɔ diɛta mba ninyɛkɛ nwɔ ni nɛ;<verse eid="PSA 103:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 103:12" />fɛ mmle di kufĩ katunkɔ lekyo ni di kufĩ kamɛɛkɔ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:12">nkpo kafɔɔ atootekete ɔtanlolaa loo ɔbla di suoto loo nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 103:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 103:13" />Fɛ mmle di kote nnya ni babi nɔɔ nyaami yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:13">nkpo di Saate nwu nnya mba ninyɛkɛ nwɔ ni nyaami nɛ;<verse eid="PSA 103:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 103:14" />diekye aye mmle bɛɛbla wo nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:14">anyuma alɛ kudu bule.<verse eid="PSA 103:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 103:15" />Otii nnwɔɔ, ayi nɔɔ nte fɛle sɛfa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:15">anlɛ fɛle lepoo kamɛ atoto;<verse eid="PSA 103:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 103:16" />kɔfɛɛfɔ nfɛ kunfe nya di suoto se atoosifi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:16">mansinyuma kafɔɔ kasiɛkɔ nɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 103:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 103:17" />Kafɔɔ diɛyɔ ni di nua diesifi ni dinaa ni kaloo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:17">Saate nwu lɛbɔmbɔ nsiko mba ninyɛkɛ nwɔ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:17">ɔsaabla tinini nɔɔ kafɔɔ nsiko babi lɛma babi-<verse eid="PSA 103:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 103:18" />ku mba niemufũ kanya ninii nɔɔ bakle ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:18">manyuma manle ni afiofa nɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 103:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 103:19" />Saate nwu ntɔɔtɛ sɛka kalekɔ nɔɔ di osi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:19">sɛka kalekɔ nɔɔ kafɔɔ kole sɛka di bamuu suoto.<verse eid="PSA 103:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 103:20" />Bitansa Saate nwu, aye batɔkyɛntɛ nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:20">aye Yaa babisuɔtɔbi nimbla ni di ɔlaa nɔɔ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:20">ninkyɔɔ ni ɔlaa nɔɔ atoko.<verse eid="PSA 103:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 103:21" />Bitansa Saate nwu, osi bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ bamuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:21">aye bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ ba nimbla ni dibiesaa nɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 103:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 103:22" />Bitansa Saate nwu, aye sɛkpɛ nɔɔ simuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 103:22">di kakɔ biala di sɛka kalekɔ nɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 103:22" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 103:22">O ɔkla nii, tansa Saate nwu.<verse eid="PSA 103:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 103" />
  <chapter number="104" style="c" sid="PSA 104" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 104</para>
  <para style="s1">Katansa Diɛta Ni Kayi Blatɛ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 104:1" />O ɔkla nii, tansa Saate nwu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 104:1" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 104:1">O Saate Yaa nii, fɛɛtɛ feemuɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:1">fɛɛkpa dibu ku sɛka ole.<verse eid="PSA 104:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 104:2" />Fɛɛkpa lɛkpa fɛ dibula;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:2">anfukuti osi fɛle lɛkpaayo<verse eid="PSA 104:2" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 104:3" />feese osi ayo lɛfɔ akpaka di ntu suoto.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 104:3">An-yɔ alokonkyɛ ambla keke nɔɔ wɔ di bapɔnkɔ nnanfi nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:3">ansiɛ kafɔɔ di kɔfɛɛfɔ nwu afoko suoto.<verse eid="PSA 104:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 104:4" />An-yɔ kɔfɛɛfɔ ambla batɔkyɛntɛ nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:4">ɔtɔ sɛkplalomii kafɔɔ ambla bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 104:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 104:5" />Ɛɛtɛ kasɔ di asɔse nika suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:5">blaafuo ka ɔkpa diidii.<verse eid="PSA 104:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 104:6" />Feetĩi ka ku nkyofokɔ nwu fɛ dibula;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:6">ntu nwu lataka katoo dialenkee abokote nwu.<verse eid="PSA 104:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 104:7" />Kafɔɔ di ɔlaa lɛfɔ osĩ ɔta kamɛ yi, ntu nwu latoso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:7">di kanto dikpududuu lɛfɔ sɛlɔ kamɛ diakpukuti diasifi;<verse eid="PSA 104:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 104:8" />diabiɛ diafe di abokote nsintɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:8">diafe diabuo di sɛtaata nwu kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:8">di lɛba le faata mi nii.<verse eid="PSA 104:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 104:9" />Fɛɛtɛ kɔmɛ ko di ntu nwu dilɔbafuo ni ɔwaalɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:9">dilɔbasinkple diyii kasɔ nwu diidii.<verse eid="PSA 104:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 104:10" />Anta ntu ntaakɔ mbiɛ nimbuo di awɛ kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:10">nimbiɛ ninfe di abokote sebo.<verse eid="PSA 104:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 104:11" />Manta lepoo kamɛ babɔkɛɛ bamuu ntu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:11">bakuɔ nlo otukɔnsɔ lɛma.<verse eid="PSA 104:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 104:12" />Bakansiɛ di kɔfɛɛfɔ nloso ayo di ntu nwu ɔlɔɔkɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:12">mansa sinu di sewosola nwu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 104:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 104:13" />Ankpete abokote nwu ntu ankyeko ayo nɔɔ di osi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:13">kasɔ ntoomiɛ ku ɔkpɛ nɔɔ ɔsaabla.<verse eid="PSA 104:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 104:14" />Anta sɛfa nyie sinta banankyue,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:14">ku alesaa kubi alɛ batii bakpɛ afe-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:14">anta alesaa ankyeko kasɔ nwu:<verse eid="PSA 104:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 104:15" />nta be ninta suoto n-yɔɔ ni otii otu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:15">nnɔnyi be ninta ni anu nɔɔ nsesee nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:15">ku alesaa ya nikaklee ni otu nɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 104:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 104:16" />Bookpete Saate nwu awoso ntu nwaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:16">Lebanon baseda ba aasɔ nii.<verse eid="PSA 104:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 104:17" />Nfa di bakansiɛ mbla ayo lɛma nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:17">nkyɛnyi mbla ayo ninya di ɛfram awoso kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 104:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 104:18" />Abokote takale nle lepoo kamɛ batie ale;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:18">afuɔ sɛkyɛɛfɛ nle katanikokɔ ɛɛta basaafɔ.<verse eid="PSA 104:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 104:19" />Kɔwɛntɛ ntɛ obe nsũ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:19">kufĩ kafɔɔ ntofo obe wɔ kubamɛɛ nii.<verse eid="PSA 104:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 104:20" />Fanwako ditunu, nimakple kakyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:20">ni di lepoo kamɛ babɔkɛɛ bamuu ndie mankyi nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 104:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 104:21" />Bakyata nkumii diɛta ni babɔkɛɛ omufũ lɛma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:21">mamiɛ alesaa lɛma mankyeko Yaa nfũ.<verse eid="PSA 104:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 104:22" />Nse kufĩ letũ, mampɛ mankple;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:22">mansifi manaate di ayo lɛma.<verse eid="PSA 104:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 104:23" />Nse otii ntoodie eefe ɔkpɛ nɔɔ kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:23">anaabla ɔkpɛ nɔɔ anaase di kɔtɔɔfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 104:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 104:24" />O Saate, sɛkpɛ lɛfɔ mpɔ lo!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:24">Di ninumbe kanya fɛɛbla nya amuu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:24">kasɔ leyii ku ɔsaabla lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 104:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 104:25" />Lekpo nte ninfa, diemuɔ diɛblɛfɛ kafɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:25">dieyii ku asaa ya manaafuo ni ɔka-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:25">asaa ya ninkpe ni nkpa, akplɛ ku abiibii.<verse eid="PSA 104:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 104:26" />Nfa di seklo nkyɛ sinkple nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:26">ku lefiatan<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">27.1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kɔsaanwu kplɛ kule di lekpo kamɛ</char></note> wɔ faabla falɛ akpee ni kɔkyɔ ninfa.<verse eid="PSA 104:26" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 104:27" />N-ya mmle amuu konyu fɔ di anu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:27">alɛ ta ma alesaa lɛma di obe nwaa kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 104:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 104:28" />Nse fɛɛyɔ nya fɛɛta ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:28">mansiisa nya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 104:28">nse feefukuti kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:28">ammiɛsa ma ku asaa biene.<verse eid="PSA 104:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 104:29" />Nse feewofasa anu lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:29">difu mpɛ ma;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 104:29">nse feediki ninwuna lɛma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:29">mankpi mankple masifi kudu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 104:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 104:30" />Nse feekyesee Ninwuna lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:30">mambla nkpa bale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:30">fanse kasɔ anu kafɔɔ lɛbla.<verse eid="PSA 104:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 104:31" />Saate nwu lɛkpa diwɛ dinaa ni kaloo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:31">Saate nwu anya suoto lɛyɔɔ di sɛkpɛ nɔɔ kamɛ-<verse eid="PSA 104:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 104:32" />nnwɔ ninyu ni kasɔ, kantũkũ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:32">ankpanko ni abokote, andie ni kɔyɔ.<verse eid="PSA 104:32" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 104:33" />Kamasa sinu nta Saate nwu di nkpa nii mmuu kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:33">kamasa katansa sinu nta Yaa nii di obe wɔ nsi ni nkpa.<verse eid="PSA 104:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 104:34" />Ta disi nii obu ditoobuo nwɔ anu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:34">fɛ mmle kɔnya ni suoto lɛyɔɔ di Saate nwu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 104:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 104:35" />Kafɔɔ ta bakpileblatɛ bayɛ di kasɔ nwu suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 104:35">bakpiletɛ kafɔɔ batasinwɛ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 104:35" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 104:35">Tansa Saate nwu, O ɔkla nii.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 104:35" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 104:35">Tansa Saate nwu.<verse eid="PSA 104:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 104" />
  <chapter number="105" style="c" sid="PSA 105" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 105</para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa Ku Batii Nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="r">(1 Kro.16.8–22)</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 105:1" />Bipɛ Saate nwu sɛfa, bilɛɛ leyooto nɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:1">bidiki lɛsaa le ɛɛbla ni bibuɛ di nnle nwu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 105:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 105:2" />Bisa sinu bitɔɔ, bisa katansa sinu bitɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:2">bibuɛ sɛsaabla nɔɔ se simuu niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ.<verse eid="PSA 105:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 105:3" />Binya suoto lɛyɔɔ di leyooto klekle nɔɔ kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:3">bita mba situ ninwolaa ni Saate nwu bapɔ.<verse eid="PSA 105:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 105:4" />Bitika Saate nwu ku osie nɔɔ disi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:4">biwolaa anu nɔɔ obe lele.<verse eid="PSA 105:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 105:5" />Binyuma atuosaa nwu aabla ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:5">sɛkpɛ nɔɔ se niabla ni ɔkpɛ ku akanko ya aabuɛ nii,<verse eid="PSA 105:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 105:6" />O Abraham kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ banantii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:6">O Yakob babisuɔtɔbi, bale nwɔ ba eediki ni.<verse eid="PSA 105:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 105:7" />Nnwɔɔ ninle Saate Yaa loo nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:7">akanko nɔɔ nkpe di kasɔ nwu kamuu.<verse eid="PSA 105:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 105:8" />Antoonyuma kanya ninii nɔɔ dinaa ni kaloo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:8">ɔlaa nwu aabuɛ aatɛ ni ana kakpe,<verse eid="PSA 105:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 105:9" />kanya nwu aanii ni ku Abraham,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:9">ntam be aaka aata ni Isak.<verse eid="PSA 105:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 105:10" />Aatika nwu difuɔ aata Yakob fɛ kufiofa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:10">aata Israel fɛ kanya ninii le ninaa ni kaloo:<verse eid="PSA 105:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 105:11" />Alɛ "Afɔ kamayɔ Kanaan kasɔ nwu nta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:11">fɛ kalekɔ ka fabale ni atesaa.”<verse eid="PSA 105:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 105:12" />Obe wɔ baale ni batii kafui,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:12">nwaako kafui ku bafɔɔ kafɔɔ baale ninka suoto,<verse eid="PSA 105:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 105:13" />baakyɛ baakyi, badie kaale baafe kale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:13">baadie di sɛka kalekɔ kanwii baafe kabamba.<verse eid="PSA 105:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 105:14" />Atata kuonwii lanyinka ma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:14">ta diisi lɛma oso aasĩ ɔlaa aata baka alɛ:<verse eid="PSA 105:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 105:15" />"Bitankpanko nnwɔ lɛpɛ ni ɔfɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:15">tambla ɔlaa babuɛtɛtɛ nii dikpile.”<verse eid="PSA 105:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 105:16" />Aata kɔka lawa di kasɔ nwu suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:16">kuabawɔɔsa alesaa nkyekɔ lɛma mmuu;<verse eid="PSA 105:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 105:17" />ni aakyesee osuɔtɔ onwii aale ma katũ nɛ-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:17">Yosef, baasunsũ ni fɛ ɔlanle.<verse eid="PSA 105:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 105:18" />Baafifielesa nkpaa nɔɔ ku anyɛnɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:18">baayɔ abɔɔsaa baakpee nwɔ di simu,<verse eid="PSA 105:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 105:19" />dialaase di obe wɔ di ɔlaa wɔ aabuɛ ni lawa ni kaanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:19">dialaase di obe wɔ di Saate nwu ɔlaa lafũ nwɔ aakpee alɛ nwaako dile nii.<verse eid="PSA 105:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 105:20" />Ɔka nwu lakpee baalaadiki nwɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:20">batii kanyayilatɛ nwu ladiki nwɔ di leyo katenkɔ.<verse eid="PSA 105:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 105:21" />Aayɔ nwɔ aabla saate di leyo nɔɔ batii suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:21">kanyayilatɛ di asaa ya amuu niawɛ nwɔ ni suoto,<verse eid="PSA 105:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 105:22" />aatookpee banɔɔfotii nɔɔ atɔ fɛ mmle dilɛ nwɔ nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:22">aatuo kafɔɔ banɔɔfo nɔɔ ninumbe.<verse eid="PSA 105:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 105:23" />Ni di Israel labuo Egipte nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:23">Yakob lasiɛ di Ham kasɔ suoto fɛ ɔfɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 105:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 105:24" />Saate nwu lata batii nɔɔ lakpɛ̀ nwaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:24">aata ma baawɛ osie baata bakyiditɛ lɛma,<verse eid="PSA 105:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 105:25" />mba situ aabla alɛ bakyidi ni batii nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:25">alɛ bakũ ni kanwumbe di bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ suoto.<verse eid="PSA 105:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 105:26" />Aakyesee Mose kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:26">ku Aron, nnwɔ aadiki nii.<verse eid="PSA 105:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 105:27" />Baabla sɛkpɛ nɔɔ se niabla ni ɔkpɛ ablasaa di kamɛ lɛma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:27">atuosaa di Ham kasɔ suoto.<verse eid="PSA 105:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 105:28" />Aakyesee ditunu aata kasɔ nwu kafɔɔ lawɔfɔ-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:28">diekye batataka baayila di sɛlaa nɔɔ suoto?<verse eid="PSA 105:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 105:29" />Aamunikĩisa ntu lɛma aabla ntɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:29">diata kɔkpaku lɛma lakpi.<verse eid="PSA 105:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 105:30" />Kasɔ lɛma nwu layii ku basua</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:30">ba niakyɛ ni kanyabayilatɛ lɛma atenyo kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 105:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 105:31" />Aakakatɛ, ni di basunsũ sɛlambu lawa nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:31">kunikĩtĩ kafɔɔ di kale lɛma kamuu.<verse eid="PSA 105:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 105:32" />Aamunikĩisa kanto lɛma aabla atubɔbani,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:32">ku kanto omunaa di kasɔ lɛma kamuu;<verse eid="PSA 105:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 105:33" />aalalaasa nta awosobi lɛma ku abue awoso afe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:33">aafefee kale lɛma nwu awoso.<verse eid="PSA 105:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 105:34" />Aakakatɛ, ni di atroee ladie nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:34">atroee ya manamafuo ni ɔka;<verse eid="PSA 105:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 105:35" />laya lɛsaa kɔnle biala di kasɔ lɛma suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:35">baaya kɔtɛ lɛma nwu asaa.<verse eid="PSA 105:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 105:36" />Ni aalo lelofo kasale babi bamuu di kasɔ lɛma suoto nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:36">sisuɔtɔ lɛma lelofo kasale bamuu.<verse eid="PSA 105:36" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 105:37" />Aakpaa Israel aadieko ku koto sɛɛle ku koto fututu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:37">di ana lɛma kamɛ kuonwii ditakpɛkpɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 105:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 105:38" />Egipte lanya suoto lɛyɔɔ di obe wɔ baasifi nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:38">diekye difu lapɛ ma ta Israel oso.<verse eid="PSA 105:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 105:39" />Aafukuti alokonkyɛ fɛ ditĩisaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:39">ɔtɔ kafɔɔ alɛ kuata ma ɔtɔ ku kakyɛ.<verse eid="PSA 105:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 105:40" />Baakaalɛ, ni aata ma nkyinkyinkpakala nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:40">aata ma kafɔɔ osi bloblo baale baamiɛ.<verse eid="PSA 105:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 105:41" />Aatikiti difuɔnkpaa nwu, ni di ntu lafɛ diadie nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:41">diabiɛ diafe di ɔfaafuu nwu fɛle okle.<verse eid="PSA 105:41" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 105:42" />Diekye aanyuma ɔlaa klekle nɔɔ wɔ aabuɛ aatɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:42">alɛ abata ni kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ Abraham.<verse eid="PSA 105:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 105:43" />Aakpaa batii nɔɔ aadieko ku lɛpɔ̀,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:43">batii nɔɔ ba aadiki ni ku suoto lɛyɔɔ;<verse eid="PSA 105:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 105:44" />aayɔ nnle nwu nsɔ aata ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:44">ni baale atesaa ya suoto diabuo ni batii bamba nɛ-<verse eid="PSA 105:44" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 105:45" />alɛ baakyɛ di sisuku nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 105:45">manle kafɔɔ afiofa nɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 105:45" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 105:45">Bitansa Yaa nwu.<verse eid="PSA 105:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 105" />
  <chapter number="106" style="c" sid="PSA 106" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 106</para>
  <para style="s1">Saate Nwu Sifutulɛ Di Batii Nɔɔ Suoto</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 106:1" />Bitansa Saate nwu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 106:1" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:1">Bipɛ Saate nwu sɛfa, diekye alɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:1">lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ nkpe dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="PSA 106:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 106:2" />Owe nimafuo lɛkya oyie di Saate nwu ablasaa kplɛ nwu suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:2">ee aabuɛ katansa nɔɔ kamuu?<verse eid="PSA 106:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 106:3" />Suoto siyɔɔ mba ninka ni aaka di osuku kanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:3">mambla ni nle ninlɛ ni obe lele.<verse eid="PSA 106:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 106:4" />O Saate, nyuma mi, nse foole batii lɛfɔ sibualɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:4">wa fabakyakaako mi nse foodiki ma,<verse eid="PSA 106:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 106:5" />alɛ kale mba feediki ni lɛsaawɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:5">alɛ kanyako kale lɛfɔ nwu suoto lɛyɔɔ nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:5">ninkyakaa di atesaa lɛfɔ nwu ku katansa.<verse eid="PSA 106:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 106:6" />Buɔbla okpile, fɛ mmle bia di bate loo labla nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:6">butalolaa buabla, buadiki kɔkpaa kpile kafɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 106:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 106:7" />Obe wɔ di bate loo lawɛ ni di Egipte,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:7">batabu disi di sɛkpɛ lɛfɔ se niabla ni ɔkpɛ suoto;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:7">batanyuma sifutulɛ lɛfɔ nwu kpinwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:7">ni baabla otokopĩ di lekpo katũ nɛ, Lekpo Sɛɛle nwu.<verse eid="PSA 106:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 106:8" />Kafɔɔ aadiki ma ta leyooto nɔɔ oso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:8">alɛ ɔɔta mantofo osie kplɛ nɔɔ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 106:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 106:9" />Aasĩ ɔlaa aata Lekpo Sɛɛle nwu, ni diasɔɔ nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:9">aakpaa ma aafenko di nkyofokɔ nwu fɛ ɔfaafuu okle.<verse eid="PSA 106:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 106:10" />Aafũ ma aakyeko kyiditɛ nwu kɔnɛɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:10">aadiki ma aakyeko lo nwu kɔnɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 106:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 106:11" />Ntu nwu latĩi balo lɛma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:11">kuonwii lɛma ditawɛ nkpa.<verse eid="PSA 106:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 106:12" />Ni baafũ ɔlaa nɔɔ wɔ aabuɛ aatɛ ni baanu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:12">ni baasa katansa nɔɔ sinu nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 106:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 106:13" />Kafɔɔ ditaklɛ fiɛ baayee nle aabla ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:13">batasoko kafɔɔ lɛkakatɛ ɔta nɔɔ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 106:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 106:14" />Ni baasiɛ nkpa di dibiesaa lɛma kanya di ɔfaafuu nwu nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:14">baasɔ Yaa baanyu di kasɔ fukuti nwu suoto.<verse eid="PSA 106:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 106:15" />Nioso aata ma nle baakaalɛ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:15">kafɔɔ aakyesee ofiɛ kpile onwii kaamɛ lɛma.<verse eid="PSA 106:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 106:16" />Di kasiɛkɔ nwu kamɛ baakpɛ sɛsɔfɔwo di Mose</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:16">ku Aron suoto, nnwɔ baakleklesa baata ni Saate nwu.<verse eid="PSA 106:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 106:17" />Ni di kasɔ nwu labɛ kanya kaamɛ Datan nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:17">kaakookaa Abiram bakyakaakotɛ.<verse eid="PSA 106:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 106:18" />Ɔtɔ lamufũ di batikankotɛ lɛma kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:18">lɛfɛnku nwu lawɔɔsa bakpiletɛ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 106:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 106:19" />Baabla lɛnankyuebi di Horeb</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:19">ni baatɔ afiɔ ya baabla ni ku lɛbɔɔsaa nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 106:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 106:20" />Baakyɛlɛnsa Dibu lɛma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:20">baafũ nankyue letembi le ninwee ni sɛfa.<verse eid="PSA 106:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 106:21" />Baayee Yaa wɔ niadiki ma nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:21">nnwɔ niabla ni asaa laamulamu di Egipte,<verse eid="PSA 106:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 106:22" />asaa ya niabla ni ɔkpɛ di Ham kasɔ suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:22">ku ablasaa yɛkɛle di Lekpo Sɛɛle katũ.<verse eid="PSA 106:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 106:23" />Nioso aabuɛ alɛ abawɔɔsa ma-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:23">Mose, nnwɔ aadiki ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:23">niataka aayila di anu nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:23">alɛ adiɛ ɔblɔ nɔɔ nwu aadiɛ ma ɔwɔɔsa.<verse eid="PSA 106:23" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 106:24" />Ninfɛ baasĩ kasɔ biene nwu nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:24">batafũ ɔlaa obuɛ ɔtɛ nɔɔ nwu baanu.<verse eid="PSA 106:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 106:25" />Baakakakatɛ di akpaayo lɛma kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:25">nioso batakyɔɔ Saate nwu ɔlaa kotoko.<verse eid="PSA 106:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 106:26" />Nioso aaka ntam aata ma ku kɔnɛɛ katoo ɔtakatɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:26">alɛ abata ma mankpi di ɔfaafuu nwu,<verse eid="PSA 106:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 106:27" />aasamiisa ma aakpete di kasɔ nwu kamuu suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:27">aata banantii lɛma lakpi di nnle nwu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 106:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 106:28" />Baayɔ suoto lɛma baatika di Baal suoto di Peor</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:28">baale oleɔta wɔ baata ni afiɔ ya di nkpa diesi ni kaamɛ;<verse eid="PSA 106:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 106:29" />baakpee Saate nwu ɔblɔ ku asaa kpile lɛma nwu sɛsaabla,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:29">ni di ofiɛ kpile labuo kaamɛ lɛma nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 106:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 106:30" />Kafɔɔ Pinehas ladiki kɔkpaa di ɔlaa nwu suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:30">ni di ofiɛ kpile nwu lasifi nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 106:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 106:31" />Baayɔ dibu le mmle baatɔɔ fɛ ɔsaabla tinini</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:31">baata ana ya nimawa ni anaa ni kase.<verse eid="PSA 106:31" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 106:32" />Baakpee Saate nwu ɔblɔ di Meriba ntu katũ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:32">ni di Mose lawɛ ɔlaa ta mma oso nɛ;<verse eid="PSA 106:32" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 106:33" />diekye baataka baayila di Yaa Ninwuna suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:33">ni di sɛlaa se di Mose ditatɛ ni ladie di kanya nɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 106:33" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 106:34" />Batawɔɔsa batii nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:34">fɛ mmle di Saate nwu latɔkɔ ma nii,<verse eid="PSA 106:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 106:35" />kafɔɔ baakpɔtɔɔ ku nnle nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:35">ni baatekete sɛsaabla lɛma nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 106:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 106:36" />Baatɔ afiɔ lɛma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:36">niabakple ni dikyĩ diata ma nii.<verse eid="PSA 106:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 106:37" />Baayɔ babisuɔtɔbi lɛma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:37">ku babisankobi lɛma baata oleɔta baata anwuna kpile.<verse eid="PSA 106:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 106:38" />Baawii ntɔ be ninta kpi ni lɛpɔɔ kaasɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:38">babisuɔtɔbi ku babisankobi lɛma ntɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:38">mbe baata ni oleɔta baata ni Kanaan afiɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:38">baalalaasa kasɔ nwu kafɔɔ ku ntɔ lɛma.<verse eid="PSA 106:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 106:39" />Baakpɔnɔfɔsa suoto lɛma ku nle baabla nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:39">ablasaa lɛma lata ma baakpee asɔnɔ di suoto lɛma kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 106:39" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 106:40" />Nioso Saate nwu lanya ɔblɔ aakpee batii nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:40">ni di atesaa nɔɔ nwu lakpɛ nwɔ oyududu nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 106:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 106:41" />Ni aayɔ ma aakpee di nnle nwu nnɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:41">ni di bakyiditɛ lɛma lale sɛka di suoto lɛma nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 106:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 106:42" />Balo lɛma lanyinka ma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:42">baasiɛ ma di suoto ku osie lɛma.<verse eid="PSA 106:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 106:43" />Obe kpinwu kamɛ aadiki ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:43">kafɔɔ baanwini di ɔtaka oyila suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:43">ni baawɔɔ di sikpile lɛma kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 106:43" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 106:44" />Kafɔɔ aatofo nimiina lɛma</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:44">di obe wɔ aanu ni kaku lɛma;<verse eid="PSA 106:44" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 106:45" />ta mma oso aanyuma kanya ninii nɔɔ nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:45">ta lɛbɔmbɔ kplɛ nɔɔ oso aakyɛlɛnsa disibu.<verse eid="PSA 106:45" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 106:46" />Aata mba bamuu niamufũ ma ni sɛlanle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:46">lanya ma nyaami.<verse eid="PSA 106:46" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 106:47" />O Saate Yaa loo, diki wo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:47">faasiisa wo fakyeko nnle kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:47">alɛ buapɛ sɛfa di leyooto klekle lɛfɔ nwu suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:47">ku dibu lɛfɔ nwu katansa.<verse eid="PSA 106:47" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 106:48" />Baatansa Saate nwu, Israel Yaa nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 106:48">diɛyɔ ni di nua diesifi ni dinaa ni kaloo.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:48">Bita batii bamuu babuɛ alɛ, "Diwa kaaya!"</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 106:48" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 106:48">Bitansa Saate nwu.<verse eid="PSA 106:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 106" />
  <chapter number="107" style="c" sid="PSA 107" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 107</para>
  <para style="ms">Kukũ Nɔnle</para>
  <para style="mr">Sinu 107-150</para>
  <para style="s1">Di Yaa Sifutulɛ Katansa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 107:1" />Bipɛ Saate nwu sɛfa, diekye alɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:1">lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ nkpe dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="PSA 107:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 107:2" />Bita mba di Saate nwu ladiki ni babuɛ nle mmle-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:2">mba aadiki aakyeko ni kyiditɛ nwu kɔnɛɛ,<verse eid="PSA 107:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 107:3" />mba aasiisa akyeko ni nsɔ nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:3">aakyeko ni kufĩ katunkɔ ku kufĩ kamɛɛkɔ, aakyeko ni katoo kasɔ ku kala kasɔ.<verse eid="PSA 107:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 107:4" />Bawo lakyɛ baakyi ɔfaafuu kasɔ fukuti nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:4">batatɔɔwɛ ni osuku baafe basifi ni okpoo wɔ babasiɛ nii.<verse eid="PSA 107:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 107:5" />Kɔka ku otukɔnsɔ laklee ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:5">ɔnyɛɛ latooloo ma.<verse eid="PSA 107:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 107:6" />Ninfɛ baawi baalɛɛ Saate nwu di dibuo lɛma kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:6">ni aadiki ma aakyeko nimiina lɛma kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 107:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 107:7" />Aaleko ma katũ di osuku tinini suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:7">aasifiko okpoo wɔ baafuo ni osiɛ.<verse eid="PSA 107:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 107:8" />Bita ma bapɛ Saate nwu sɛfa ta lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ le ninaa ni kaloo oso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:8">ku sɛsaabla nɔɔ se niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ ɛɛbla ɛɛta ni batii,<verse eid="PSA 107:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 107:9" />diekye aata otukunsɔ bakleetɛ ntu baanyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:9">aka bakleetɛ kafɔɔ layii ku asaa biene.<verse eid="PSA 107:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 107:10" />Bawo lasiɛ di ditunu ku ditunu yɛkɛle nwu kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:10">ayo batentɛ dibuo di abɔɔsaa sɛkpɛnkyɛ kamɛ,<verse eid="PSA 107:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 107:11" />diekye baataka baayila di Yaa sɛlaa suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:11">ni baasĩ Nnwɔ Ninlenke ni kɔkà nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 107:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 107:12" />Nioso aata ma baabla sɛkpɛ siene;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:12">baatuula, kafɔɔ kuonwii ditawɛ aakyakaako nii.<verse eid="PSA 107:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 107:13" />Ninfɛ baawi baalɛɛ Saate di dibuo lɛma kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:13">ni aadiki ma di nimiina lɛma nwu kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 107:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 107:14" />Aadiki ma aakyeko ditunu ku ditunu yɛkɛle nwu kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:14">aafefee kafɔɔ sɛkpɛnkyɛ lɛma nwu aayu.<verse eid="PSA 107:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 107:15" />Bita ma bapɛ Saate nwu sɛfa ta lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ le ninaa ni kaloo oso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:15">ku sɛsaabla nɔɔ se niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ ɛɛbla ɛɛta ni batii,<verse eid="PSA 107:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 107:16" />diekye anfefee kɔbri n-yoko antɛ kaasɔ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 107:16">ambudi kafɔɔ abɔɔsaa sewoso anfenko.<verse eid="PSA 107:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 107:17" />Bawo lakple babuutɛ diafe ni di ɔtaka oyila sisuku suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:17">baanu dibuo ta ɔtanloolaa ɔbla lɛma oso.<verse eid="PSA 107:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 107:18" />Baakyidi alesaa amuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:18">baatɛɛtɛɛ kukpi n-yoko.<verse eid="PSA 107:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 107:19" />Ninfɛ baawi baalɛɛ Saate di dibuo lɛma kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:19">ni aadiki ma di nimiina lɛma kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 107:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 107:20" />Ni aakyesee ɔlaa kuabakya ma sifiɛ nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:20">aadiki ma aakyeko ɔkya kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 107:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 107:21" />Bita bapɛ Saate nwu sɛfa ta lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ le ninaa ni kaloo oso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:21">ku sɛsaabla nɔɔ se niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ ɛɛbla ɛɛta ni batii.<verse eid="PSA 107:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 107:22" />Bita ma bata sɛfa ɔpɛ asaaɔta oleɔta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:22">baabuɛ sɛkpɛ nɔɔ ɔbla ku suoto lɛyɔɔ sinu.<verse eid="PSA 107:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 107:23" />Babamba ladie baasifi lekpo osi di seklo kplɛ kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:23">asaa basunsũtɛ baale di ntu kplɛ nwu osi.<verse eid="PSA 107:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 107:24" />Baanya Saate nwu sɛkpɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:24">sɛsaabla nɔɔ se niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ di kakyofokɔ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 107:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 107:25" />Diekye aakakatɛ, ni di afɛɛfɔ siene lafɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:25">aatakatɛsa lekpo ntu nwu katoo.<verse eid="PSA 107:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 107:26" />Siataka katoo sialaadu osi siakple siasifi kakyofokɔ nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:26">situ lɛma lakpà di ɔkyɛ lɛma nwu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 107:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 107:27" />Baakpɔkpɔtɔ ni baatɔɔkpankpa fɛle batansiɛntɛ nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:27">batasintofo be nfɛ baabla.<verse eid="PSA 107:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 107:28" />Ninfɛ baawi baalɛɛ Saate nwu di dibuo lɛma kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:28">ni aadiki ma aakyeko nimiina lɛma kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 107:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 107:29" />Aata afɛɛfɔ siene nwu lalokanana aate kloklo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:29">lekpo ntu nwu late buɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 107:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 107:30" />Baapɔ di obe wɔ diate ni kloklo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:30">ni aaleko ma katũ aasifiko seklo kayilakɔ fɛ mmle baamiɛ ni nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 107:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 107:31" />Bita ma bapɛ Saate nwu sɛfa ta lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ le ninaa ni kaloo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:31">ku sɛsaabla nɔɔ se niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ siɛta ni batii oso.<verse eid="PSA 107:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 107:32" />Bita ma batakatɛsa nwɔ katoo di batii kasiisakɔ kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:32">baatansa nwɔ kafɔɔ di banɔɔfo nwu dikudi kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 107:32" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 107:33" />Aakplesa sekle aabla ɔfaafuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:33">ntu ntaakɔ be nimbiɛ ninfe ni labla kasɔ kosole,<verse eid="PSA 107:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 107:34" />alesaa kasɔ ninlɛ ni asaa kafɔɔ aabla mmba lalaale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:34">ta mba niasiɛ ni ninfa amumu oso.<verse eid="PSA 107:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 107:35" />Aamunikĩisa ɔfaafuu aabla ntu apanta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:35">kasɔ kosole kafɔɔ aabla sekle ntaakɔ se nikobiɛ sinfe nii;<verse eid="PSA 107:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 107:36" />nfa aakpaa akabakleetɛ aawako babasiɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:36">ni baatɛ okpoo kplɛ di nfũ baasiɛ ni nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 107:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 107:37" />Baakpɛ afe, baapɛ awosobi ya man-yɔ mambla ni nta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:37">diata baawɛ abi kpinwu baatɛsɛ;<verse eid="PSA 107:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 107:38" />aawii ma lɛyɔɔ, ni di lɛpɔ lɛma lataka katoo nwaa nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:38">atata kafɔɔ banankyue lɛma lakɔkɔlɛ.<verse eid="PSA 107:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 107:39" />Ninfɛ di lɛpɔ lɛma lawakasɔ, ni baawokosa suoto kasɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:39">di ninyinka ku nimiina ku sɛnyaami nɛ;<verse eid="PSA 107:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 107:40" />nnwɔ ninambu ni banɔɔfotii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:40">anta ma mankyɛ mankyi man-yu osuku di ɔfaafuu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 107:40" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 107:41" />Kafɔɔ antakatɛ bapiitɛ ankyeko nimiina lɛma kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:41">anta ayo lɛma batii nkpɛ̀ fɛle bafoso.<verse eid="PSA 107:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 107:42" />Bitininitɛ nnya, mannya suoto lɛyɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:42">kafɔɔ bakpiletɛ bamuu mmaasa nnya lɛma.<verse eid="PSA 107:42" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 107:43" />Olele niebe anu, bitɔɔ anu sɛlaa se mmle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 107:43">aatofo kafɔɔ Saate nwu lɛbɔmbɔ kplɛ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 107:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 107" />
  <chapter number="108" style="c" sid="PSA 108" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 108</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Diɛta Ni Lɛkyakaako Di Balo Suoto</para>
  <para style="d">Onu. Dawid onu.</para>
  <para style="r">(Ps 57.7–11; 60.5–12)</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 108:1" />O Yaa, otu nii ntoote;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:1">Kamasa sinu ku ɔkla nii omuu.<verse eid="PSA 108:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 108:2" />Kyitaa ku sanku, bisɛnkɛ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:2">Kamasɛnkɛsa kolesɛtũ.<verse eid="PSA 108:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 108:3" />O Saate, kamatansa fɔ di nnle nwu kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:3">Kamasa sinu anta fɔ di batii nwu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 108:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 108:4" />Diekye lɛbɔmbɔ lɛfɔ lemuɔ, diɛtaka katoo dilenke osi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:4">onukwale lɛfɔ ndu kolo.<verse eid="PSA 108:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 108:5" />O Yaa, ta batakatɛsa fɔ katoo, balenkee osi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:5">faata kafɔɔ lɛkpa lɛfɔ ditĩi kasɔ nwu kamuu suoto.<verse eid="PSA 108:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 108:6" />Fũ wo faakyakaako wo kafɔɔ ku koletanɛɛ lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:6">alɛ faadiki mba fambɔmbɔ nii.<verse eid="PSA 108:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 108:7" />Yaa ntɔɔkakatɛ eekyeko kakleklekɔ nɔɔ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:7">"Di suoto lɛyɔɔ kamɛ kamasɛ Sekem</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:7">nsɛ kafɔɔ Sukot Ɔtaata nwu.<verse eid="PSA 108:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 108:8" />Gilead ole mi ale, Manase kafɔɔ ole mi ale;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:8">Efraim ninle mi abɔɔsaa lekoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:8">Yuda kayofo nii.<verse eid="PSA 108:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 108:9" />Moab ninle mi asaa ofoto bɛɛsi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:9">Edom ninfuki ntokota nii ntɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:9">Filisti suoto ninyiisa suoto lɛyɔɔ kudu.”<verse eid="PSA 108:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 108:10" />Owe nimakpaa mi anwako okpoo wɔ beetofo oyoyiɛ beekyisa ni?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:10">Owe nimaleko mi katũ ankyɛnko Edom?<verse eid="PSA 108:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 108:11" />O Yaa, diele afɔ nɛ, afɔ wɔ niasĩ wo ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:11">floosintikanko bakpɛtɛ loo kafɔɔ?<verse eid="PSA 108:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 108:12" />Ta wo lɛkyakaako di lo loo suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:12">diekye otii lɛkyakaako diele lɛsalɛsaa.<verse eid="PSA 108:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 108:13" />Ku Yaa bubawɛ lelenkee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 108:13">abananafu balo loo kafɔɔ antɛ kaasɔ.<verse eid="PSA 108:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 108" />
  <chapter number="109" style="c" sid="PSA 109" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 109</para>
  <para style="s1">Otii Wɔ Ninsi Ni Di Dibuo Kamɛ Ɔlaa</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu. Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ.</para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 109:1" />O Yaa, nnwɔ nintansa ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:1">tanlo kanana,<verse eid="PSA 109:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 109:2" />diekye bakpiletɛ ku bakyɔnkyɔtɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:2">ntɔɔbɛ nnya lɛma di suoto nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:2">batɔɔkakatɛ di suoto nii ku sɛlaa ku afunu sɛkplalomii.<verse eid="PSA 109:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 109:3" />Bɛɛmana mi beekyi ku kakyidi sɛlaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:3">mandieko mi ninambla ni lɛsalɛsaa.<verse eid="PSA 109:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 109:4" />Di sisiɛwo nii kanya yi, ɔlaa bɔɔyɔ di suoto nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:4">kafɔɔ nle otii wɔ nimpɛ ni ɔlaa.<verse eid="PSA 109:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 109:5" />Bɛɛyɔ dikpile bɔɔta dibene nii koto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:5">baakyidi mi di sisiɛwo nii kanya.<verse eid="PSA 109:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 109:6" />Diki otii kpile aadieko nwɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:6">ta kanyabuditɛ ayila di oletanɛɛkyɛ nɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 109:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 109:7" />Nse bɛɛkanko nwɔ, ta balo nwɔ lɛpɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:7">faata kafɔɔ ɔlaa ɔpɛ nɔɔ kutɛ nwɔ kolò.<verse eid="PSA 109:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 109:8" />Ta ayi nɔɔ abla kafui;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:8">ta otii bamba ayila di tunletɛ kayilakɔ nɔɔ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 109:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 109:9" />Ta babi nɔɔ bale bakuɛbi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:9">ɔsɔfɔ nɔɔ kafɔɔ ale kpisɔfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 109:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 109:10" />Ta babi nɔɔ bale banyanyitɛ batookyi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:10">ta badiki ma di ayo biɛle lɛma kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 109:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 109:11" />Ta otii wɔ niafɛnsa nwɔ ni asaa afũ asaa ya amuu ninkpe nwɔ ni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:11">ta bafɔɔ bayɔ dibuo nɔɔ kamɛ asaa.<verse eid="PSA 109:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 109:12" />Tanta kuonwii labla nwɔ sifutulɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:12">ee anya bakuɛbi nɔɔ nwu nyaami.<verse eid="PSA 109:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 109:13" />Ta banantii nɔɔ baloo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:13">bayɛɛsa ayooto lɛma di kɔna ko nikɔwa ni kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 109:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 109:14" />Ta banyuma bate nɔɔ ɔtanlolaa ɔbla di Saate nwu anu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:14">tanta baayɛɛsa ɔya sikpile diidii.<verse eid="PSA 109:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 109:15" />Ta sikpile lɛma sika di Saate nwu anu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:15">alɛ alasinyuma ma di kasɔ nwu suoto.<verse eid="PSA 109:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 109:16" />Diekye diidii atanyu alɛ ɔɔbla sifutulɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:16">kafɔɔ bapiitɛ antikanko anlo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:16">ku mba diefĩ ni ku mba di situ kobiɛ ni.<verse eid="PSA 109:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 109:17" />Aabɔmbɔ lɛkpaani sɛlaa-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:17">ta ni diwa nwɔ di suoto;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 109:17">suoto nin-yɔɔ nwɔ di lɛyɔɔ owii suoto-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:17">ta dikyɛ lookyo di suoto nɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 109:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 109:18" />Ankpee akpaani fɛ akpeele nɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:18">ta dibuo di suoto nɔɔ kamɛ fɛle ntu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:18">di akufi nɔɔ kamɛ fɛle nnɔnyi.<verse eid="PSA 109:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 109:19" />Ta dite fɛle akpeele beemiminisa nwɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:19">fɛle ofiamɛ beenii beekyisa nwɔ, dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="PSA 109:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 109:20" />Ta nle mmle dile Saate nwu letota dita kanya nii babuditɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:20">dita mba nikɔkakatɛ ni dikpile kanya di suoto nii.<verse eid="PSA 109:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 109:21" />O Saate Kplɛ, kafɔɔ afɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:21">klee mi nwaa di leyooto lɛfɔ kanya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:21">ta lɛbɔmbɔ lɛfɔ biene nwu oso, diki mi.<verse eid="PSA 109:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 109:22" />Diekye dipii nkle mi, diefĩ mi kafɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:22">otu nii kafɔɔ lefũ kakɔ kaamɛ nii.<verse eid="PSA 109:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 109:23" />Kɔyɛ fɛle kɔtɔɔfɔ kunyii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:23">bɔɔkpa mi man-yu fɛle letroee.<verse eid="PSA 109:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 109:24" />Ntoonii kanya akunkyi nii lɛkpakpaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:24">ntookoso lɛbla wakalaa kafɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 109:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 109:25" />Nle lɛmansaa lɛta kanya nii babuditɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:25">nse bɛɛnyɛɛ, mantũkunsa asi lɛma.<verse eid="PSA 109:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 109:26" />O Saate Yaa nii, kyakaako mi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:26">diki mi ku lɛbɔmbɔ lɛfɔ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 109:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 109:27" />O Saate, ta ma batofo alɛ kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:27">niɛbla ni nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 109:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 109:28" />Baafuo ɔkpaani, kafɔɔ afɔ fabawii lɛyɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:28">nse bɛɛtaka, babakpee ma sinunsɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:28">kafɔɔ kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ kamanya suoto lɛyɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 109:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 109:29" />Sinunsɔ kamamana kanya nii babuditɛ sinkyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:29">manunsɔ kafɔɔ fɛ dibula beenyukũ.<verse eid="PSA 109:29" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 109:30" />Kamatakatɛsa Saate nwu katoo ku kanya nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:30">di batii dikudi kplɛ kamɛ kamatansa nwɔ.<verse eid="PSA 109:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 109:31" />Diekye anyila di nnwɔ diefĩ ni oletanɛɛkyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 109:31">anfũ nkpa nɔɔ ankyeko mba nielo nwɔ ni kukpi lɛpɔɔ nnɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 109:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 109" />
  <chapter number="110" style="c" sid="PSA 110" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 110</para>
  <para style="s1">Saate Nwu Ku Ɔka Nɔɔ Wɔ Eediki Nii</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 110:1" />Saate nwu mbuɛ antɔkɔ saate nii alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:1">"Siɛ di oletanɛɛkyɛ nii</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 110:1">dilaase di obe wɔ mabla ni balo lɛfɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:1">nkpaa ditikasaa nta ni nkpaa lɛfɔ.”<verse eid="PSA 110:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 110:2" />Saate nwu makyesee kayofo kplɛ lɛfɔ nwu kankye Sion;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:2">fabale sɛka di balo lɛfɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 110:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 110:3" />Bakpɛtɛ lɛfɔ matuna man-yɔ suoto manta</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:3">di kakpɛ lɛfɔ dii nwu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 110:3">Fanklee akasaa klekle nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:3">niekye ni kolesɛtũ olofofɔtɔ kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:3">fabafũ sekosopo lɛfɔ kamɛ oblokyi.<verse eid="PSA 110:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 110:4" />Saate nwu ntɔɔka ntam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:4">ɔlɔbasinkyɛlɛnsa disibu nɔɔ kafɔɔ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 110:4">"Ɔletatɛ nfɛ fale dinaa ni kaloo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:4">di Melkisedek osuku kanya.”<verse eid="PSA 110:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 110:5" />Saate nwu nsi di oletanɛɛkyɛ lɛfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 110:5">ababibiɛ baka di ɔblɔ nɔɔ dii suoto.<verse eid="PSA 110:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 110:6" />Abakanko nnle nwu, ansiisa bakpi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:6">ambibiɛ kafɔɔ kasɔ kamuu sɛka baletɛ.<verse eid="PSA 110:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 110:7" />Abanyi ntu di kaklenyii nwu di osuku kotoko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 110:7">nioso abatakatɛ disi nɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 110:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 110" />
  <chapter number="111" style="c" sid="PSA 111" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 111</para>
  <para style="s1">Di Saate Nwu Katansa Kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 111:1" />Bitansa Saate nwu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 111:1" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 111:1">Kamapɛ Saate nwu sɛfa ku otu nii omuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:1">di mba situ niɛkpa ni di dikudi nwu ku kasiisakɔ nwu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 111:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 111:2" />Saate nwu sɛkpɛ lɛmuɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:2">batii ba bamuu ninnya ni suoto lɛyɔɔ di suoto nɔɔ ntekete lɛsaa.<verse eid="PSA 111:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 111:3" />Dibu ku nimuɔ ninle sɛsaabla nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:3">ɔsaabla tinini nɔɔ nkpe dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="PSA 111:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 111:4" />Ɛɛta boonyuma sɛkpɛ nɔɔ se niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:4">Saate nwu nkpe sifutulɛ ku nyaami ɔnya.<verse eid="PSA 111:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 111:5" />Anta mba nin-yɛkɛ nwɔ ni alesaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:5">anyuma kanya ninii nɔɔ dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="PSA 111:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 111:6" />Atootuo batii nɔɔ sɛkpɛ nɔɔ osie nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:6">ɛɛyɔ nnle bamba nsɔ ɛɛta ma.<verse eid="PSA 111:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 111:7" />Nnɛɛ nɔɔ sɛkpɛ nkpe onukwale, site nkpo kafɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:7">afiofa nɔɔ amuu nle disitikasaa.<verse eid="PSA 111:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 111:8" />Bɛɛtɛ nya dinaa ni kaloo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:8">baabla nya di onukwale ku situ se niɛkpa ni kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 111:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 111:9" />Ɛɛta batii nɔɔ suoto osiɛko;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:9">eese kanya ninii nɔɔ dinaa ni kaloo-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:9">leklekle ku difu ninle leyooto nɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 111:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 111:10" />Saate nwu ɔyɛkɛ ninle ninumbe kasɔ kakyekɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:10">mba bamuu niele ni afiofa nɔɔ nkpe lɛsaatofo nwaa.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 111:10">Lele nwɔ ninle katansa dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="PSA 111:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 111" />
  <chapter number="112" style="c" sid="PSA 112" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 112</para>
  <para style="s1">Otii Biene Suoto Lɛyɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 112:1" />Bitansa Saate nwu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 112:1" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 112:1">Suoto siyɔɔ otii wɔ ninyɛkɛ ni Saate nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:1">aanya ni suoto lɛyɔɔ di afiofa nɔɔ suoto.<verse eid="PSA 112:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 112:2" />Babi nɔɔ kamale batii kplɛ di kasɔ nwu suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:2">suoto kamayɔɔ mba situ niɛkpa ni banantii.<verse eid="PSA 112:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 112:3" />Lɛsaawɛ ku lɛlɛ nkpe di leyo nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:3">ɔsaabla tinini nɔɔ kafɔɔ mate dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="PSA 112:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 112:4" />Bia di ditunu kamɛ lɛkpa nwɛ ninta mba situ niɛkpa ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:4">ninta bienetɛ ku nyaaminyatɛ ku tininitɛ.<verse eid="PSA 112:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 112:5" />Dibiene mawa ninta nnwɔ ninkpe ni sifutulɛ anfɛnsa asaa anta ni batii ku otu biene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:5">nnwɔ nimbla ni asaa nɔɔ di osuku kanya.<verse eid="PSA 112:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 112:6" />Nwaako ɔlɔbatũkũ diidii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:6">babanyuma tininitɛ dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="PSA 112:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 112:7" />Ɔlɔbayɛkɛ ɔlaa kpile kuonwii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:7">otu nɔɔ nte, antika Saate nwu disi.<verse eid="PSA 112:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 112:8" />Otu nɔɔ nnaa ole kuonwii, ɔlɔbayɛkɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:8">di kayɛntɛkɔ abanya bakyiditɛ nɔɔ kanɔɔkɔ.<verse eid="PSA 112:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 112:9" />Atɔɔsɛ akyɛsaa nɔɔ ɛɛta bapiitɛ eekyiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:9">ɔsaabla tinini nɔɔ nkpe dinaa ni kaloo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:9">babatakatɛ lɛkya nɔɔ katoo di dibu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 112:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 112:10" />Otii kpile nwu kamanya ɔblɔ nfiɛ nwɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:10">abawee anyɛɛ nɔɔ an-yɛ kafɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 112:10">kpiletɛ nwu abiesaa mabla kasakasa.<verse eid="PSA 112:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 112" />
  <chapter number="113" style="c" sid="PSA 113" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 113</para>
  <para style="s1">Katansa Di Saate Nwu Dibene Suoto</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 113:1" />Bitansa Saate nwu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 113:1" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 113:1">O Saate nwu bakpɛmblatɛ, bitansa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:1">bitansa Saate nwu leyooto.<verse eid="PSA 113:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 113:2" />Bita batansa Saate nwu leyooto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:2">diɛyɔ ni di nua dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="PSA 113:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 113:3" />Diɛyɔ ni di kufĩ katunkɔ diesifi ni lɛba le kummɛɛ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:3">batansa Saate nwu leyooto.<verse eid="PSA 113:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 113:4" />Bɛɛtakatsa Saate katoo di nnle nwu mmuu suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:4">lɛkpa nɔɔ lɛtaka katoo dilenke osi.<verse eid="PSA 113:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 113:5" />Owe ninte fɛle Saate Yaa loo nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:5">Nnwɔ ninsi ni di lɛkakpomii suoto di osi,<verse eid="PSA 113:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 113:6" />nnwɔ ninkɛnsa aanyu ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:6">osi ku kasɔ?<verse eid="PSA 113:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 113:7" />Antakatɛ bapiitɛ di kudu kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:7">antakatɛsa mba diefĩ ni di ntɔ̀ ditii suoto;<verse eid="PSA 113:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 113:8" />ansiɛsa ma ku banɔɔfotii babi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:8">ku batii lɛma banɔɔfotii babi.<verse eid="PSA 113:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 113:9" />Anta ɔsanko ɔlɛma nwu nsiɛ di leyo nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 113:9">fɛ babi ɔya ku suoto lɛyɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 113:9" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 113:9">Bitansa Saate nwu.<verse eid="PSA 113:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 113" />
  <chapter number="114" style="c" sid="PSA 114" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 114</para>
  <para style="s1">Okpi Diisi Ofe Onu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 114:1" />Obe wɔ di Israel ladie ni di Egipte,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:1">Yakob leyo batii nwu di bafɔɔ sele kamɛ,<verse eid="PSA 114:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 114:2" />Yuda labakple Yaa kakleklekɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:2">Israel, kafa nɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 114:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 114:3" />Lekpo nwu lanya ni diatoso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:3">Yordan lakple nkpaamaa;<verse eid="PSA 114:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 114:4" />abokote nwu layeyefe fɛle akunumuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:4">akpenkpe fɛle afosobi.<verse eid="PSA 114:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 114:5" />O lekpo, obe diale oso faatoso,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:5">O Yordan, alɛ faakple nkpaamaa,<verse eid="PSA 114:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 114:6" />aye abokote, alɛ biayeyefe fɛle akunumuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:6">aye akpenkpe, fɛle afosobi?<verse eid="PSA 114:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 114:7" />O kasɔ, tũkũ di Saate nwu anu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:7">di Yakob Yaa anu,<verse eid="PSA 114:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 114:8" />nnwɔ niamunikĩisa ni difuɔnkpaa aabla ni ntu lɛpanta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 114:8">difuɔ siene aabla ni ntu kataakɔ.<verse eid="PSA 114:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 114" />
  <chapter number="115" style="c" sid="PSA 115" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 115</para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa Onwii Nwu Onukwaletɛ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 115:1" />Diele awo, O Saate, diele awo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:1">kafɔɔ leyooto lɛfɔ nwu baata dibu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:1">ta lɛbɔmbɔ ku onukwale lɛfɔ oso.<verse eid="PSA 115:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 115:2" />Obe oso di nnle nwu nkaalɛ alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:2">" Ɔfɛ di Yaa lɛma nkpe?"<verse eid="PSA 115:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 115:3" />Yaa loo nkpe di osi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:3">ambla lele ninlɛ nwɔ.<verse eid="PSA 115:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 115:4" />Kafɔɔ afiɔ lɛma nle koto fututu ku koto sɛɛle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:4">batii nnɛɛ niɛbla nya.<verse eid="PSA 115:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 115:5" />Bakpe nnya, kafɔɔ mannfuo ɔkakatɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:5">anu, kafɔɔ blɔɔnya;<verse eid="PSA 115:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 115:6" />bakpe atoko, kafɔɔ bloonu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:6">sinwu, bafɔɔ bloonu ofũfũ;<verse eid="PSA 115:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 115:7" />bakpe nnɛɛ, kafɔɔ blootofo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:7">nkpaa, kafɔɔ bloofuo ɔkyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:7">ee bafuo sɛlɔ sewo ɔbla ku sɛkɔnsɔ lɛma.<verse eid="PSA 115:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 115:8" />Mba niɛbla nya ni kamate fɛle mma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:8">nkpo dibate ninta mba bamuu nietika nya ni disi nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 115:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 115:9" />O Israel leyo, tika Saate nwu disi-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:9">nnwɔɔ ninle ma lɛkyakaako ku kubidifunsaa nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 115:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 115:10" />O Aron leyo, tika Saate nwu disi-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:10">nnwɔɔ ninle ma lɛkyakaako ku kubidifunsaa nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 115:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 115:11" />Aye ba ninyɛkɛ nwɔ ni, bitika Saate nwu disi-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:11">nnwɔɔ ninle ma lɛkyakaako ku difuɔnkpaa nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 115:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 115:12" />Saate nwu nnyuma wo, abawii wo lɛyɔɔ kafɔɔ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:12">Abawii Israel leyo lɛyɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:12">abawii Aron leyo lɛyɔɔ,<verse eid="PSA 115:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 115:13" />abawii mba ninyɛkɛ ni Saate nwu lɛyɔɔ-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:13">babisɔ ku banɔɔfo kyɛkyɛ.<verse eid="PSA 115:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 115:14" />Ta Saate nwu ata ye bikpɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:14">aye ku babi lee akyuu lee anyɔ.<verse eid="PSA 115:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 115:15" />Ta Saate nwu awii ye lɛyɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:15">osi ku kasɔ nwu Blatɛ.<verse eid="PSA 115:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 115:16" />Osi nwu niɛtaka katoo kulenke ni nle Saate nwu ole,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:16">kafɔɔ ɛɛyɔ kasɔ nwu ɛɛta otii.<verse eid="PSA 115:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 115:17" />Diele bakpi nintansa Saate nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:17">mba ninsifi ni kasɔ kamɛ kanana;<verse eid="PSA 115:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 115:18" />awo ninle mba nintakatɛsa ni Saate nwu katoo nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 115:18">nunua dinaa ni kaloo kafɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 115:18" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 115:18">Bitansa Saate nwu.<verse eid="PSA 115:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 115" />
  <chapter number="116" style="c" sid="PSA 116" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 116</para>
  <para style="s1">Otii Onwii Baafũ Ni Nkpa Latansa Yaa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 116:1" />Mbɔmbɔ Saate nwu, diekye aanu mi sɛlɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:1">aanu nyaami nii ɔnya kaku.<verse eid="PSA 116:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 116:2" />Diekye aamunikĩisa kotoko nɔɔ aakyɔɔ mi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:2">kamalɛɛ nwɔ di obe wɔ lɛnya nsi ni nkpa.<verse eid="PSA 116:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 116:3" />Kukpi nwu sikũ lɛmana mi siekyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:3">ɔkya nwu difu lapɛ mi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:3">dibuo ku sɛnyaami lalenkee mi nnɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 116:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 116:4" />Ninfɛ lalɛɛ Saate nwu leyooto nlɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:4">"O Saate, fũ mi nkpa!"<verse eid="PSA 116:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 116:5" />Sibualɛ letɛ ku tininitɛ ninle Saate nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:5">nyaami ɔnya leyii Yaa loo kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 116:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 116:6" />Saate nwu nnyu mba ninaa ni osie;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:6">diafĩ mi ni osie kanya, aadiki mi.<verse eid="PSA 116:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 116:7" />O ɔkla nii, kple fatɛ ɔnyɛɛ fakyakaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:7">diekye Saate nwu ntodibla dibiene ɛɛta fɔ.<verse eid="PSA 116:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 116:8" />O Saate, diekye fatoodiki ɔkla nii di kukpi kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:8">anu nii di nnumɛɛ kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:8">nkpaa nii di otuula,<verse eid="PSA 116:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 116:9" />alɛ kafuo ɔkyɛ di Saate nwu anu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:9">di nkpa basiɛtɛ kasɔ suoto.<verse eid="PSA 116:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 116:10" />Lafũ lale; nioso labuɛ nlɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:10">"Ditoobuo mi osie kanya.”<verse eid="PSA 116:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 116:11" />Di nnɛɛ lafee mi nii, labuɛ nlɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:11">"Balaatɛ di batii bamuu nle.”<verse eid="PSA 116:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 116:12" />Lɛ nfɛ kata Saate nwu koto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:12">di sifutulɛ nɔɔ nwu simuu di suoto nii?<verse eid="PSA 116:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 116:13" />Kamatakatɛsa didiki opũ nwu katoo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:13">ninlɛɛ Saate nwu leyooto.<verse eid="PSA 116:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 116:14" />Kamata ntam nii asaa nta Saate nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:14">di batii nɔɔ bamuu anu.<verse eid="PSA 116:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 116:15" />Baklekletɛ nɔɔ kukpi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:15">lefũ kɔya di Saate nwu anu.<verse eid="PSA 116:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 116:16" />O Saate, nwaako kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ nle;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:16">kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ nle, ɔsanko kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ obisuɔtɔbi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:16">afɔ niefukuti mi di sɛkpɛnkyɛ kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 116:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 116:17" />Kamata sɛfa ɔpɛ asaaɔta oleɔta nta fɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:17">ninlɛɛ kafɔɔ Saate nwu leyooto.<verse eid="PSA 116:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 116:18" />Kamata ntam nii asaa nta Saate nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:18">di batii nɔɔ bamuu anu,<verse eid="PSA 116:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 116:19" />di Saate nwu leyo nflɔnkɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 116:19">O Yerusalem, di kamɛ lɛfɔ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 116:19" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 116:19">Bitansa Saate nwu.<verse eid="PSA 116:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 116" />
  <chapter number="117" style="c" sid="PSA 117" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 117</para>
  <para style="s1">Di Saate Nwu Katansa Suoto</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 117:1" />Bitansa Saate nwu, aye nnle nwu mmuu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 117:1">bitansa nwɔ, aye batii bamuu.<verse eid="PSA 117:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 117:2" />Diekye lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ lɛmuɔ di suoto loo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 117:2">Saate nwu onukwale kafɔɔ nkpe dinaa ni kaloo.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 117:2" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 117:2">Bitansa Saate nwu.<verse eid="PSA 117:2" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 117" />
  <chapter number="118" style="c" sid="PSA 118" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 118</para>
  <para style="s1">Sɛfa Ɔpɛ Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Di Lelenkee Suoto</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 118:1" />Bipɛ Saate nwu sɛfa, diekye alɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:1">lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ nkpe dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="PSA 118:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 118:2" />Bita Israel abuɛ alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:2">"Lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ nkpe dinaa ni kaloo.”<verse eid="PSA 118:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 118:3" />Bita Aron leyo babuɛ alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:3">"Lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ nkpe dinaa ni kaloo.”<verse eid="PSA 118:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 118:4" />Bita mba ninyɛkɛ ni Saate nwu babuɛ alɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:4">"Lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ nkpe dinaa ni kaloo.”<verse eid="PSA 118:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 118:5" />Di nimiina nii kamɛ lawi lalɛɛ Saate nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:5">ni aatuna aatekete dibuo nwu di suoto nii nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 118:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 118:6" />Saate nwu nsikoe; nioso namayɛkɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:6">Obe di otii kafuo mi ɔbla?<verse eid="PSA 118:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 118:7" />Saate nwu nsikoe; nnwɔɔ ninle mi kyakaakotɛ nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:7">Kamanya lelenkee di balo nii suoto.<verse eid="PSA 118:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 118:8" />Dilɛ alɛ faataniko Saate nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:8">ninlenke alɛ faatika anu di otii suoto.<verse eid="PSA 118:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 118:9" />Dilɛ alɛ faataniko Saate nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:9">ninlenkee alɛ faatika disi di banɔɔfotii babi suoto.<verse eid="PSA 118:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 118:10" />Nnle nwu mmuu lamana mi diakyi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:10">kafɔɔ di Saate nwu leyooto kamɛ lawɔɔsa ma.<verse eid="PSA 118:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 118:11" />Baamana mi baakyi di ɔfankyi biala,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:11">kafɔɔ di Saate nwu leyooto kamɛ lawɔɔsa ma.<verse eid="PSA 118:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 118:12" />Baafufuu di suoto nii fɛle banwakɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:12">kafɔɔ baakpi kunkye fɛ mmle di ɔtɔ nfiɛ ni siwuu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:12">di Saate nwu leyooto kamɛ lawɔɔsa ma.<verse eid="PSA 118:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 118:13" />Baatukusɛɛ kɛɛkɛɛ se lanɔɔ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:13">kafɔɔ Saate nwu lakyakaako mi.<verse eid="PSA 118:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 118:14" />Saate nwu ninle mi osie ku onu nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:14">atɔɔbakple didiki nii.<verse eid="PSA 118:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 118:15" />Suoto lɛyɔɔ ku lelenkee kudù</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:15">kodie di batininitɛ akpanta kalɔ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 118:15">"Saate nwu koletanɛɛ ntɔɔbla asaa kplɛ!<verse eid="PSA 118:15" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 118:16" />Bɛɛtakatɛsa Saate nwu koletanɛɛ katoo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:16">Saate nwu koletanɛɛ ntɔɔbla asaa kplɛ!"<verse eid="PSA 118:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 118:17" />Nɔmakpi, kafɔɔ masiɛ nkpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:17">nyie lɛkya di nle di Saate nwu lɛbla nii.<verse eid="PSA 118:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 118:18" />Saate nwu lananfi mi kootoko osie kanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:18">kafɔɔ ata yɔ mi aata kukpi.<verse eid="PSA 118:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 118:19" />Sɛkɛtɛ ɔsaabla tinini n-yoko fatɛɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:19">nimbuo mpɛ Saate nwu sɛfa.<verse eid="PSA 118:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 118:20" />Nka mmle ninle Saate nwu kayoko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:20">ka di batininitɛ kafe mambuo ni nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 118:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 118:21" />Kamapɛ fɔ sɛfa, diekye faatuna faatɛɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:21">fatɔɔbakple didiki nii.<verse eid="PSA 118:21" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 118:22" />Difuɔ le di ayobatofotɛ lasĩ ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:22">nintɔɔbakple leyokɔ difuɔ nɛ;<verse eid="PSA 118:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 118:23" />Saate nwu niɛbla nle mmle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:23">diɛbla ɔkpɛ di anu loo.<verse eid="PSA 118:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 118:24" />Nle mmle ninle dii le di Saate nwu lɛbla ni nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:24">bita bunya suoto lɛyɔɔ buɔpɔ ninni.<verse eid="PSA 118:24" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 118:25" />O Saate, fũ wo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:25">O Saate, ta dilɛ dita wo.<verse eid="PSA 118:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 118:26" />Suoto siyɔɔ otii wɔ ninwa ni di Saate nwu leyooto kamɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:26">Di Saate nwu leyo buowii ye lɛyɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 118:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 118:27" />Saate nwu ninle Yaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:27">nnwɔɔ kafɔɔ niɛta lɛkpa nɔɔ lɛkpa diekpete wo nɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 118:27">Aaklee owosola di kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ, aabuo di dii ole bakyɛntɛ dikudi nwu kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:27">baaladu oleɔta akyikye nwu akya.<verse eid="PSA 118:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 118:28" />Yaa nii fale, kamapɛ fɔ sɛfa kafɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:28">Yaa nii fale, kamatakatɛsa fɔ katoo.<verse eid="PSA 118:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 118:29" />Bipɛ Saate nwu sɛfa, diekye alɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 118:29">lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ nkpe dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="PSA 118:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 118" />
  <chapter number="119" style="c" sid="PSA 119" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 119</para>
  <para style="s1">Saate Nwu Kufiofa</para>
  <para style="qa">Alef</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 119:1" />Suoto siyɔɔ batii ba di ole kuonwii nnaa ni di sisuku lɛma suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:1">mankyɛ ni di Saate nwu kufiofa kanya.<verse eid="PSA 119:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 119:2" />Suoto siyɔɔ mba niemufũ sɛlaa nɔɔ bakle ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:2">manwolaa nwɔ ni kafɔɔ ku situ lɛma simuu.<verse eid="PSA 119:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 119:3" />Manambla lɛsaa le ninanlɛ ni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:3">mankyɛ ni di sisuku nɔɔ suoto.<verse eid="PSA 119:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 119:4" />Fɛɛtɛ sɛsaabla</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:4">se dikaatɛ baabla ni nwaa obe lele.<verse eid="PSA 119:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 119:5" />O, alɛ sisuku nii lawo nimu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:5">di kufiofa lɛfɔ ole kamɛ!<verse eid="PSA 119:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 119:6" />Ni blɔbakpee mi sinunsɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:6">nse lebu sɛlaa lɛfɔ simuu lenyu.<verse eid="PSA 119:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 119:7" />Kamatansa fɔ ku otu wɔ niɛkpa ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:7">fɛ mmle kotekete ni afiofa lɛfɔ tinini nwu.<verse eid="PSA 119:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 119:8" />Kamale afiofa lɛfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:8">tandiɛ mi nnɛɛ saa.<verse eid="PSA 119:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Saate Nwu Kufiofa Atoko Ɔkyɔɔ</para>
  <para style="qa">Bet</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 119:9" />Lɛ di okosopo kafuo nkpa tinini osiɛ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:9">Alɛ aasiɛ nkpa di ɔlaa lɛfɔ nwu kanya.<verse eid="PSA 119:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 119:10" />Nwolaa fɔ ku otu nii omuu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:10">tantɛɛ lakpukuti di afiofa lɛfɔ suoto.<verse eid="PSA 119:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 119:11" />Ntoowofasa ɔlaa lɛfɔ di otu nii kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:11">alɛ naabla okpile di suoto lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 119:12" />O Saate, batansa fɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:12">tuo mi sisuku lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 119:13" />Ku anyasibi nii n-se</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:13">afiofa ya amuu nindie ni di kanya lɛfɔ lɛka.<verse eid="PSA 119:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 119:14" />Suoto n-yɔɔ mi di sɛlaa lɛfɔ otinkanko kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:14">fɛ mmle di otii nnya ni suoto lɛyɔɔ di lɛsaawɛ kplɛ suoto.<verse eid="PSA 119:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 119:15" />Mbu disi di sɛlaa lɛfɔ suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:15">ntɛ anu kafɔɔ nnyu sisuku lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 119:16" />Suoto n-yɔɔ mi di afiofa lɛfɔ suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:16">namabla ɔlaa lɛfɔ nwu ɔfɔ́tɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Suoto Lɛyɔɔ Di Saate Nwu Kufiofa Kamɛ</para>
  <para style="qa">Gimel</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 119:17" />Bla dibiene fata kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ, ni kamasiɛ nkpa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:17">kamakyɔɔ ɔlaa lɛfɔ kotoko.<verse eid="PSA 119:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 119:18" />Tikiti mi anu alɛ kanya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:18">asaa ya niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ di kufiofa lɛfɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 119:19" />Ɔfɔɔ nle kaasɔ suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:19">tanwofasa mi afiofa lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 119:20" />Ɔkla nii kokpekpe anu anwolaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:20">afiofa lɛfɔ nwu obe lele.<verse eid="PSA 119:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 119:21" />Fansĩ ɔlaa fanta mba nintakatɛsa ni suoto katoo, bɛɛkpani ma ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:21">bɛɛblasa ni suoto di afiofa lɛfɔ suoto.<verse eid="PSA 119:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 119:22" />Diki mi fakyeko atufa ku lɛsaatambu lɛma kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:22">diekye lemufũ sɛsaabla lɛfɔ nkle.<verse eid="PSA 119:22" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 119:23" />Nu di baka lesi bookũ kanwumbe di suoto nii yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:23">kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ mbu disi di afiofa lɛfɔ suoto.<verse eid="PSA 119:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 119:24" />Sɛsaabla lɛfɔ ninle mi suoto lɛyɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:24">nnya ninká mi nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Disibu Ɔbla Ɔta Saate Nwu Kufiofa Ole</para>
  <para style="qa">Dalet</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 119:25" />Bɛɛtɛ mi kaasɔ di kudu kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:25">fũ mi nkpa di ɔlaa lɛfɔ nwu kanya.<verse eid="PSA 119:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 119:26" />Lakyisa nkpa nii, ni faatuna faatɛɛ nɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:26">tuo mi sisuku lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:26" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="PSA 119:27" />Tɛɛ nnu sɛsaabla lɛfɔ asaa otuo kasɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:27">ni kamabu disi di sɛkpɛ lɛfɔ se niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ suoto.<verse eid="PSA 119:27" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="PSA 119:28" />Ditoobuo ɔkla nii ku sɛnyaami owi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:28">kpee mi osie di ɔlaa lɛfɔ nwu kanya.<verse eid="PSA 119:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="PSA 119:29" />Kpukutisa kakyɔnkyɔ sisuku di suoto nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:29">le mi sibualɛ diefe ni di kufiofa lɛfɔ nwu suoto.<verse eid="PSA 119:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="PSA 119:30" />Ntoodiki onukwale osuku nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:30">ntɔɔyɔ otu nii letika di afiofa lɛfɔ suoto.<verse eid="PSA 119:30" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="PSA 119:31" />O Saate, lemufũ sɛlaa lɛfɔ nkle;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:31">tanta sinunsɔ lakpɛ mi.<verse eid="PSA 119:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="PSA 119:32" />Ntoso di afiofa lɛfɔ osuku suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:32">diekye fatɔɔta otu nii kunutoko.<verse eid="PSA 119:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Diɛta Ni Lɛsɔnu</para>
  <para style="qa">He</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="PSA 119:33" />O Saate, tuo mi sisuku lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:33">ni kamakle sĩ nnaase di kayɛntɛkɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:33" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="PSA 119:34" />Tɛɛ lɛsɔnu, ni kamale kufiofa lɛfɔ nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:34">kamamufũ kũ nklee ku otu nii omuu.<verse eid="PSA 119:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="PSA 119:35" />Kpaa mi fafenko di afiofa lɛfɔ osuku suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:35">diekye nfa ninnya suoto lɛyɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:35" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="PSA 119:36" />Munikĩisa otu nii fakyɔɔ sɛsaabla lɛfɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:36">kafɔɔ diele lete ni lɛlɛ kanya.<verse eid="PSA 119:36" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="PSA 119:37" />Munikĩisa anu nii di asaa ya ninanfĩ ni suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:37">fũ mi nkpa di ɔlaa lɛfɔ nwu kanya.<verse eid="PSA 119:37" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="PSA 119:38" />Ta ntam lɛfɔ nwu diwa kaanya dita kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:38">di mmle baayɛkɛ fɔ ni kanya.<verse eid="PSA 119:38" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="PSA 119:39" />Tekete sinunɔ se kɔyɛkɛ ni fasifiko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:39">diekye afiofa lɛfɔ nlɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:39" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="PSA 119:40" />Mmle di asaa otuo lɛfɔ nkle mi ni ɔkɔnsɔ!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:40">Fũ mi nkpa di ɔsaabla tinini lɛfɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Disi Otika Di Saate Nwu Kufiofa Suoto</para>
  <para style="qa">Waw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="PSA 119:41" />O Saate, ta lɛbɔmbɔ lɛfɔ nwu ninaa ni kalo diwa ɔkyɛ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:41">didiki lɛfɔ nwu di mmle fɛɛka ni ntam kanya;<verse eid="PSA 119:41" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="PSA 119:42" />ni kamakpee nnwɔ nintufa mi ni kanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:42">diekye letika disi di ɔlaa lɛfɔ suoto.<verse eid="PSA 119:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="PSA 119:43" />Tankpafɛ onukwale ɔlaa nwu di kanya nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:43">diekye ntɔɔyɔ osuku onyu nii letika di afiofa lɛfɔ suoto.<verse eid="PSA 119:43" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="PSA 119:44" />Obe lele kamale afiofa lɛfɔ nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:44">dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="PSA 119:44" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="PSA 119:45" />Kamakyɛ nkyi di atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:45">diekye ntootikanko asaa otuo lɛfɔ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 119:45" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="PSA 119:46" />Kamakakatɛ di sɛlaa lɛfɔ suoto di baka anu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:46">sinunsɔ dilɔbakpɛ mi kafɔɔ,<verse eid="PSA 119:46" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="PSA 119:47" />diekye nnya suoto lɛyɔɔ di afiofa lɛfɔ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:47">diekye mbɔmbɔ nya.<verse eid="PSA 119:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="PSA 119:48" />Lɛtakatɛsa nnɛɛ nii lɛkyɔɔ afiofa lɛfɔ ya nimbɔmbɔ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:48">mbu disi kafɔɔ di sɛsaabla lɛfɔ suoto.<verse eid="PSA 119:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Disi Otika Di Saate Nwu Kufiofa Suoto</para>
  <para style="qa">Sayin</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="PSA 119:49" />Nyuma ɔlaa wɔ faata ni kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:49">diekye fɛɛtɛɛ osuku onyu.<verse eid="PSA 119:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="PSA 119:50" />Nle mmle ninle kɔnɛɛ nii ɔkpee kaafutu di dibuo nii kamɛ nɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:50">Ntam lɛfɔ nfũ mi nkpa.<verse eid="PSA 119:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="PSA 119:51" />Mba ninkanta ni mma mi manandiɛ nii.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:51">kafɔɔ ninkyi di kufiofa lɛfɔ kamaa.<verse eid="PSA 119:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="PSA 119:52" />O Saate, nnyuma saa lɛfɔ afiofa nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:52">anta otu nii nte kafɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="PSA 119:53" />Ɔblɔ nfiɛ mi osie kanya ta bakpiletɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:53">ba niesĩ ni kufiofa lɛfɔ nwu oso.<verse eid="PSA 119:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="PSA 119:54" />Sɛsaabla lɛfɔ ninle sinu nii disi ɔlaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:54">di kakɔ lele lebuo kɔfɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="PSA 119:55" />O Saate, nnyuma leyooto lɛfɔ ku kakyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:55">kamamufũ kufiofa lɛfɔ nwu kafɔɔ nklee.<verse eid="PSA 119:55" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="PSA 119:56" />Nle mmle ninle ɔkpɛ nii nɛ:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:56">nkyɔɔ asaa otuo lɛfɔ atoko.<verse eid="PSA 119:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ole Ɔyɔ Di Saate Nwu Kufiofa Suoto</para>
  <para style="qa">Het</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="PSA 119:57" />O Saate, afɔ ninle ole mi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:57">lɛka ntam nlɛ makyɔɔ sɛlaa lɛfɔ kotoko.<verse eid="PSA 119:57" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="PSA 119:58" />Ntoowolaa anu lɛfɔ ku otu nii omuu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:58">le mi sibualɛ di ntam lɛfɔ nwu kanya.<verse eid="PSA 119:58" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="PSA 119:59" />Ntoobu disi di sisuku nii suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:59">nioso ntoomunikĩisa anu nii lɛkyɔɔ asaa otuo lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:59" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="PSA 119:60" />Kamapɛsɛwa, namakyɛkyɛlɛ kafɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:60">kakyɔɔ ni afiofa lɛfɔ kotoko.<verse eid="PSA 119:60" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="PSA 119:61" />Nu di bakpiletɛ leninii mi ku sikũ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:61">namayee kufiofa lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:61" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="PSA 119:62" />Ntaka ku nkyɛntɛɛ mpɛ fɔ sɛfa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:62">ta afiofa lɛfɔ tinini oso.<verse eid="PSA 119:62" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="PSA 119:63" />Siɛwo nle nta batii ba bamuu nin-yɛkɛ fɔ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:63">ku mba bamuu nintikanko ni asaa otuo lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:63" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="PSA 119:64" />O Saate, kasɔ leyii ku lɛbɔmbɔ lɛfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:64">tuo mi sisuku lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:64" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Saate Nwu Kufiofa Lefũ Kɔya</para>
  <para style="qa">Tet</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="PSA 119:65" />Bla dibiene fata kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:65">O Saate, di ɔlaa lɛfɔ nwu kanya.<verse eid="PSA 119:65" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="PSA 119:66" />Tuo mi lɛsaatofo ku lɛkanko biene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:66">diekye lefũ afiofa lɛfɔ lenu.<verse eid="PSA 119:66" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="PSA 119:67" />Fiɛ baananfi mi ni kootoko, layu osuku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:67">kafɔɔ nunua kɔkyɔɔ ɔlaa lɛfɔ kotoko.<verse eid="PSA 119:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="PSA 119:68" />Falɛ, nle fɔɔbla ni kafɔɔ nlɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:68">tuo mi sisuku lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="PSA 119:69" />Mba ninkanta ni lɛkpɔnɔfɔsa mi ku sɛlaa ku afunu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:69">nkle asaa otuo lɛfɔ ku otu nii omuu.<verse eid="PSA 119:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="PSA 119:70" />Situ lɛma nkpe osie ku lɛsɔnu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:70">kafɔɔ suoto n-yɔɔ mi di kufiofa lɛfɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:70" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="PSA 119:71" />Diasiɛko alɛ baananfi mi kootoko</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:71">alɛ katekete sɛsaabla lɛfɔ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 119:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="PSA 119:72" />Kufiofa nwu niekye ni kanya lɛfɔ lefũ mi kɔya kulenke</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:72">koto fututu ku koto sɛɛle nkpenkpe.<verse eid="PSA 119:72" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Saate Nwu Kufiofa Tinini</para>
  <para style="qa">Yod</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="PSA 119:73" />Nnɛɛ lɛfɔ niabla mi dialolaa mi kafɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:73">tɛɛ lɛsɔnu nintekete afiofa lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:73" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="PSA 119:74" />Ta mba ninyɛkɛ fɔ ni banya suoto lɛyɔɔ nse bɛɛnyɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:74">diekye lɛyɔ osuku onyu nii letika di ɔlaa lɛfɔ suoto.<verse eid="PSA 119:74" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="PSA 119:75" />O Saate n-ye nlɛ afiofa lɛfɔ nte tinini,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:75">di onukwale kanya fɛɛnaanfi mi kootoko.<verse eid="PSA 119:75" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="PSA 119:76" />Ta lɛbɔmbɔ lɛfɔ nwu ninaa ni kaloo dikpee mi kɔnɛɛ kaafutu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:76">di ntam be faaka faata ni kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ kanya.<verse eid="PSA 119:76" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="PSA 119:77" />Ta nyaami ɔnya lɛfɔ nwu ditɛɛ nsiɛ nkpa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:77">diekye kufiofa lɛfɔ nwu ninle mi suoto lɛyɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="PSA 119:78" />Ta sinunsɔ sikpɛ mba ninkanta ni ta bɔɔtɛ mi koló ninambla ni lɛsalɛsaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:78">kafɔɔ kamabu disi di asaa otuo lɛfɔ suoto.<verse eid="PSA 119:78" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="PSA 119:79" />Ta mba ninyɛkɛ fɔ ni bamunikĩi bawa ɔkyɛ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:79">mba nienu ni sɛsaabla lɛfɔ kasɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:79" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="PSA 119:80" />Tanta baatɛ otu nii koló di sisuku lɛfɔ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:80">alɛ balaakpee mi sinunsɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:80" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Diɛta Ni Didiki</para>
  <para style="qa">Kaf</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="81" style="v" sid="PSA 119:81" />Ɔkla nii nloo ɔnyɛɛ ku ole ɔyɔ di didiki lɛfɔ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:81">kafɔɔ lɛyɔ osuku onyu nii letika di ɔlaa lɛfɔ suoto.<verse eid="PSA 119:81" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="82" style="v" sid="PSA 119:82" />Ditoobuo anu nii, oowolaa ni ntam lɛfɔ nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:82">kɔkaalɛ nlɛ, "Ɔmɛmbe fabakpee mi kɔnɛɛ kaafutu?"<verse eid="PSA 119:82" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="83" style="v" sid="PSA 119:83" />Kuntɛ nte fɛle nta dikuuku di kɔyɔ kamɛ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:83">nin-yee sisuku lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:83" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="84" style="v" sid="PSA 119:84" />Ɔmɛmbe di kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ anyu osuku alaase?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:84">Ɔmɛmbe fabanaanfi mba nikowolaa mi ni kaanya kootoko?<verse eid="PSA 119:84" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="85" style="v" sid="PSA 119:85" />Mba ninkanta ni lekutu abiɔ bɛɛtɛ mi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:85">mananle ni kufiofa lɛfɔ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 119:85" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="86" style="v" sid="PSA 119:86" />Disi otika nkpe di afiofa lɛfɔ amuu suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:86">kyakaako mi, diekye batii kowolaa mi kaanya ninambla ni lɛsalɛsaa.<verse eid="PSA 119:86" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="87" style="v" sid="PSA 119:87" />Beeloo mi olo odiki kaasɔ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:87">kafɔɔ nindiɛ asaa otuo lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:87" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="88" style="v" sid="PSA 119:88" />Fũ mi nkpa di lɛbɔmbɔ lɛfɔ nwu kanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:88">ni kamabla di kanya lɛfɔ lɛkakatɛ suoto.<verse eid="PSA 119:88" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ofũ Onu Di Saate Nwu Kufiofa Kamɛ</para>
  <para style="qa">Lamed</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="89" style="v" sid="PSA 119:89" />O Saate, ɔlaa lɛfɔ nnaa kaloo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:89">kuyɛ kpinkpĩ di osi.<verse eid="PSA 119:89" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="90" style="v" sid="PSA 119:90" />Onukwale lɛfɔ makyɛ kunfe di ana lɛfɔ amuu kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:90">fɛɛtɛ kasɔ, ni kate dinaa ni kaloo nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:90" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="91" style="v" sid="PSA 119:91" />Afiofa lɛfɔ nte anaa kaloo ɛɛbadu dii le mmle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:91">diekye asaa amuu kosumu fɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:91" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="92" style="v" sid="PSA 119:92" />Nse diele kufiofa lɛfɔ ninle mi suoto lɛyɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:92">see ntabakpi di nimiina nii kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:92" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="93" style="v" sid="PSA 119:93" />Namayee asaa otuo lɛfɔ diidii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:93">diekye nnya faayɔ faafũ mi nkpa nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:93" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="94" style="v" sid="PSA 119:94" />Fũ mi nkpa, diekye ole fɔ nle,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:94">ntootikanko asaa otuo lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:94" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="95" style="v" sid="PSA 119:95" />Bakpiletɛ nsoko mi alɛ bɔɔwɔɔsɛa mi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:95">kafɔɔ kamabu sɛsaabla lɛfɔ disi.<verse eid="PSA 119:95" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="96" style="v" sid="PSA 119:96" />Kɔnya kase di asaa ya amuu niewo ni nimu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:96">kafɔɔ afiofa lɛfɔ nnaa kase.<verse eid="PSA 119:96" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lɛbɔmbɔ Diɛta Ni Saate Nwu Kufiofa</para>
  <para style="qa">Mem</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="97" style="v" sid="PSA 119:97" />O, mmle nimbɔmbɔ ni kufiofa lɛfɔ nwu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:97">mbu disi ninwu suoto dii kufĩ kumu.<verse eid="PSA 119:97" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="98" style="v" sid="PSA 119:98" />Afiofa lɛfɔ nwu ntɛɛ mbe anu nlenkee balo nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:98">diekye akpe di ɔkyɛ nii obe lele.<verse eid="PSA 119:98" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="99" style="v" sid="PSA 119:99" />Nkpe nya lɛsɔnu nlenke asaa batuotɛ nii bamuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:99">diekye mbu disi di sɛsaabla lɛfɔ suoto.<verse eid="PSA 119:99" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="100" style="v" sid="PSA 119:100" />Nkpe lɛsɔnu nlenke banɔɔfo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:100">diekye nkyɔɔ asaa otuo lɛfɔ kotoko.<verse eid="PSA 119:100" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="101" style="v" sid="PSA 119:101" />Ntookpukutisa nkpaa nii di okpile biala osuku suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:101">di mmle kakyɔɔ ni ɔlaa lɛfɔ kotoko.<verse eid="PSA 119:101" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="102" style="v" sid="PSA 119:102" />Nindiɛ afiofa lɛfɔ ole,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:102">diekye afɔ omu niatuo mi asaa.<verse eid="PSA 119:102" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="103" style="v" sid="PSA 119:103" />Sɛlaa lɛfɔ lɛmɛnɛ mi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:103">siɛmɛnɛmɛnɛ silenke bablɔ di kanya nii!<verse eid="PSA 119:103" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="104" style="v" sid="PSA 119:104" />Nwɛ lɛsɔnɔ nkyeko asaa otuo lɛfɔ kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:104">nioso lekyidi osuku kpile biala.<verse eid="PSA 119:104" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lɛkpa Le Niekye Ni Saate Nwu Kufiofa Kamɛ</para>
  <para style="qa">Nun</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="105" style="v" sid="PSA 119:105" />Ɔlaa lɛfɔ nle kandiɛ kuɔta nkpaa nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:105">lɛkpa kafɔɔ diɛta osuku nii.<verse eid="PSA 119:105" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="106" style="v" sid="PSA 119:106" />Ntɔɔka ntam letika difuɔ kafɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:106">nlɛ kamatikanko afiofa tinini lɛfɔ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 119:106" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="107" style="v" sid="PSA 119:107" />Ditoobuo mi diɛpɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:107">O Saate, tɛɛ nsiɛ nkpa di ɔlaa lɛfɔ nwu kanya.<verse eid="PSA 119:107" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="108" style="v" sid="PSA 119:108" />O Saate, fũ kanya nii kamɛ katansa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:108">faatuo mi kafɔɔ afiofa lɛfɔ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 119:108" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="109" style="v" sid="PSA 119:109" />Kuntɛ lɛtɛ lɛyɔ nkpa nii nkle ninnɛɛ nii yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:109">namayee kufiofa lɛfɔ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 119:109" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="110" style="v" sid="PSA 119:110" />Bakpiletɛ nwu ntɔɔkyɔɔ mi okũ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:110">kafɔɔ ninkyi asaa otuo lɛfɔ kamaa.<verse eid="PSA 119:110" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="111" style="v" sid="PSA 119:111" />Sɛlaa lɛfɔ ninle mi atesaa dinaa ni kaloo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:111">sile otu nii kamɛ suoto lɛyɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:111" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="112" style="v" sid="PSA 119:112" />Otu nii ntika di afiofa lɛfɔ ole suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:112">diɛlaase ni di kayɛntɛkɔ kamu.<verse eid="PSA 119:112" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Katitĩi Di Saate Nwu Kufiofa kamɛ</para>
  <para style="qa">Samek</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="113" style="v" sid="PSA 119:113" />Lekyidi batii ba asibu ninle ni anyɔ anyɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:113">kafɔɔ mbɔmbɔ kufiofa lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:113" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="114" style="v" sid="PSA 119:114" />Afɔ ninle mi katanikokɔ ku difuɔnkpaa nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:114">ntɔɔyɔ osuku onyu nii letika di ɔlaa lɛfɔ suoto.<verse eid="PSA 119:114" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="115" style="v" sid="PSA 119:115" />Bla di suoto nii, afɔ sikpilebablatɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:115">alɛ kale Yaa nii afiofa!<verse eid="PSA 119:115" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="116" style="v" sid="PSA 119:116" />Mufũ mi faklee di ntam lɛfɔ kanya, ni masiɛ nkpa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:116">tanta nnɛɛ lafee mi di osuku onyu nii suoto.<verse eid="PSA 119:116" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="117" style="v" sid="PSA 119:117" />Mufũ mi fase, ni babadiki mi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:117">obe lele nkpe dibu lɛta afiofa lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:117" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="118" style="v" sid="PSA 119:118" />Feesĩ mba bamuu nieyu ni osuku di afiofa lɛfɔ suoto.<verse eid="PSA 119:118" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="119" style="v" sid="PSA 119:119" />Feefuki bakpiletɛ bamuu di kasɔ suoto feeyu fɛle aku;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:119">nioso mbɔmbɔ sɛlaa lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:119" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="120" style="v" sid="PSA 119:120" />Ami omu kɔyɛkɛ fɔ ku ditũtũkũ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:120">n-yɛ ku difu di kufiofa lɛfɔ nwu suoto.<verse eid="PSA 119:120" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kotoko Ɔkyɔɔ Di Saate Nwu Kufiofa Suoto</para>
  <para style="qa">Ayin</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="121" style="v" sid="PSA 119:121" />Ntɔɔbla nle niɛbla ni tinini dite ni nkpo kafɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:121">tandiɛ mi faata mba nikonyinka mi nii.<verse eid="PSA 119:121" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="122" style="v" sid="PSA 119:122" />Tika difuɔ di kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ lɛlɛ suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:122">tanta mba ninkanta ni lanyinka mi.<verse eid="PSA 119:122" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="123" style="v" sid="PSA 119:123" />Ditoobuo anu nii, oowolaa ni didiki lɛfɔ nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:123">oowolaa ntam lɛfɔ tinini nwu.<verse eid="PSA 119:123" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="124" style="v" sid="PSA 119:124" />Bla fata kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ di lɛbɔmbɔ lɛfɔ kanya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:124">faatuo mi afiofa lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:124" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="125" style="v" sid="PSA 119:125" />Kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ nle, tɛɛ lɛsaatofo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:125">alɛ kanu sɛlaa lɛfɔ kasɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:125" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="126" style="v" sid="PSA 119:126" />O Saate, obe ntoowo fɔ faadiki ni kɔkpaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:126">bɔɔlalaasa kufiofa lɛfɔ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 119:126" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="127" style="v" sid="PSA 119:127" />Diekye mbɔmbɔ afiofa lɛfɔ nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:127">nlenkee koto sɛɛle, nlenkee koto sɛɛle nwaa,<verse eid="PSA 119:127" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="128" style="v" sid="PSA 119:128" />ta mmle nimbu ni disi kafɔɔ di asaa otuo lɛfɔ amuu nwaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:128">lekyidi osuku kpile biala.<verse eid="PSA 119:128" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Anu Otika Di Saate Nwu Kufiofa Ole Suoto</para>
  <para style="qa">Pe</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="129" style="v" sid="PSA 119:129" />Asaa otuo lɛfɔ lɛbla ɔkpɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:129">nioso nkyɔɔ nya kotoko.<verse eid="PSA 119:129" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="130" style="v" sid="PSA 119:130" />Sɛlaa lɛfɔ kasɔ odiki nta lɛkpa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:130">sinta mba nin-ye ni lɛsaa nnu kasɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:130" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="131" style="v" sid="PSA 119:131" />Mpɛsɛwa mbɛ kanya nii ntɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:131">nsoko afiofa lɛfɔ nwu kafɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:131" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="132" style="v" sid="PSA 119:132" />Munikĩi fawa ɔkyɛ nii faanyɛɛ nyaami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:132">fɛ mmle fambla ni obe lele fanta ni mba nimbɔmbɔ ni leyooto lɛfɔ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 119:132" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="133" style="v" sid="PSA 119:133" />Tuo nnafukpaa nii osuku di ɔlaa lɛfɔ nwu kanya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:133">tanta okpile kuonwii lale sika di suoto nii.<verse eid="PSA 119:133" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="134" style="v" sid="PSA 119:134" />Diki mi di batii ninyinka kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:134">alɛ kakyɔɔ asaa otuo lɛfɔ kotoko.<verse eid="PSA 119:134" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="135" style="v" sid="PSA 119:135" />Ta anu lɛfɔ akpa akpete kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:135">faatuo mi kafɔɔ sisuku lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:135" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="136" style="v" sid="PSA 119:136" />Nnumɛɛ seklenyii kobiɛ sinkye anu nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:136">diekye bloole kufiofa lɛfɔ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 119:136" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Saate Nwu Kufiofa Tinini Nwu</para>
  <para style="qa">Sade</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="137" style="v" sid="PSA 119:137" />O Saate, tininitɛ fale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:137">afiofa lɛfɔ kafɔɔ nkyɛ di osuku kanya.<verse eid="PSA 119:137" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="138" style="v" sid="PSA 119:138" />Asaa otuo ya fɛɛtɛ ni nte tinini;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:138">ɛɛtɛ ale disi ditikasaa.<verse eid="PSA 119:138" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="139" style="v" sid="PSA 119:139" />Nnɛɛ nfee mi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:139">diekye balo nii lesĩ sɛlaa lɛfɔ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 119:139" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="140" style="v" sid="PSA 119:140" />Ntɔɔsɔ ntam lɛfɔ nwu lenyu lefenko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:140">nioso kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ mbɔmbɔ mi.<verse eid="PSA 119:140" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="141" style="v" sid="PSA 119:141" />Nu ninandie lɛsalɛsaa, bɔɔnyɛɛ nyakatãa kafɔɔ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:141">nin-yee asaa otuo lɛfɔ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 119:141" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="142" style="v" sid="PSA 119:142" />Ɔsaabla tinini lɛfɔ nnaa kaloo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:142">onukwale kafɔɔ di kufiofa lɛfɔ nwu nle.<verse eid="PSA 119:142" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="143" style="v" sid="PSA 119:143" />Dibuo ku nimiina ntɔɔwa mi di suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:143">kafɔɔ afiofa lɛfɔ nle mi suoto lɛyɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:143" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="144" style="v" sid="PSA 119:144" />Sɛsaabla lɛfɔ lɛkpa kɔmɛ dinaa ni kaloo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:144">tɛɛ lɛsɔnu alɛ kasiɛ nkpa.<verse eid="PSA 119:144" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Diɛta Ni Didiki</para>
  <para style="qa">Kof</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="145" style="v" sid="PSA 119:145" />O Saate, kɔlɛɛ fɔ ku otu nii omuu; tuna fatɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:145">kamale afiofa lɛfɔ nwu kafɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:145" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="146" style="v" sid="PSA 119:146" />Lɛlɛɛ fɔ; diki mi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:146">kamamufũ asaa otuo lɛfɔ nwu nklee.<verse eid="PSA 119:146" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="147" style="v" sid="PSA 119:147" />Ntaka nnwi kaku diɛta ni lɛkyakaako fiɛ di kolesɛtũ nwo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:147">ntɔɔyɔ osuku onyu nii letika di ɔlaa lɛfɔ suoto.<verse eid="PSA 119:147" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="148" style="v" sid="PSA 119:148" />Nimmaasa anu nii kakyɛ kamuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:148">alɛ kabu disi di ntam lɛfɔ nwu suoto.<verse eid="PSA 119:148" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="149" style="v" sid="PSA 119:149" />Nu mi sɛlɔ, di lɛbɔmbɔ lɛfɔ nwu kanya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:149">O Saate, fũ mi nkpa, di afiofa lɛfɔ nwu kanya.<verse eid="PSA 119:149" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="150" style="v" sid="PSA 119:150" />Amumubablatɛ ninkũ ni kanwumbe ntɔɔtɛɛtɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:150">kafɔɔ beekyo di kufiofa lɛfɔ nwu suoto.<verse eid="PSA 119:150" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="151" style="v" sid="PSA 119:151" />O Saate, afɔ fɛɛtɛɛtɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:151">onukwale kafɔɔ di afiofa lɛfɔ nwu nle.<verse eid="PSA 119:151" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="152" style="v" sid="PSA 119:152" />Saa yi, latekete asaa lakyeko asaa otuo lɛfɔ nwu kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:152">alɛ faatɛ nya alɛ aate dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="PSA 119:152" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lekoto Otikiti Diɛta Ni Lɛkyakaako</para>
  <para style="qa">Resh</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="153" style="v" sid="PSA 119:153" />Nyu dibuo nii, faadiki mi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:153">diekye nin-yee kufiofa lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:153" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="154" style="v" sid="PSA 119:154" />Buɛ ɔlaa nii fatɛɛ faadiki mi kafɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:154">fũ mi nkpa di ntam lɛfɔ nwu kanya.<verse eid="PSA 119:154" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="155" style="v" sid="PSA 119:155" />Didiki lɛkyo di bakpiletɛ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:155">diekye mann-wola sisuku lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:155" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="156" style="v" sid="PSA 119:156" />O Saate, sibualɛ lɛfɔ lɛmuɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:156">fũ mi nkpa di afiofa lɛfɔ nwu kanya.<verse eid="PSA 119:156" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="157" style="v" sid="PSA 119:157" />Bakyiditɛ ba nikomiɛ mi ni dikpile mpɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:157">kafɔɔ ninkyi di afiofa lɛfɔ kamaa.<verse eid="PSA 119:157" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="158" style="v" sid="PSA 119:158" />Nnyu mba ninaa ni ofũonu ku ɔblɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:158">diekye mann-kyɔɔ ɔlaa lɛfɔ kotoko.<verse eid="PSA 119:158" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="159" style="v" sid="PSA 119:159" />Nyu mmle nimbɔmbɔ ni asaa otuo lɛfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:159">O Saate, fũ mi nkpa di lɛbɔmbɔ lɛfɔ nwu kanya.<verse eid="PSA 119:159" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="160" style="v" sid="PSA 119:160" />Sɛlaa lɛfɔ nwu simuu nle onukwale;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:160">afiofa tinini lɛfɔ nwu nkpe anaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="PSA 119:160" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Saate Nwu Kufiofa Okleklesa</para>
  <para style="qa">Sin ku Shin</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="161" style="v" sid="PSA 119:161" />Batunletɛ kodieko mi ninambla ni lɛsalɛsaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:161">kafɔɔ otu ni ntũtũkũ di ɔlaa lɛfɔ suoto.<verse eid="PSA 119:161" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="162" style="v" sid="PSA 119:162" />Nnya suoto lɛyɔɔ di ntam lɛfɔ suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:162">fɛle otii wɔ niɛwɛ ni kakpɛ kamɛ asaa kplɛ.<verse eid="PSA 119:162" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="163" style="v" sid="PSA 119:163" />Lekyidi ayududusaa ku sɛlaa ku afunu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:163">kafɔɔ mbɔmbɔ kufiofa lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:163" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="164" style="v" sid="PSA 119:164" />Sikuɛnsĩ di dii kamɛ nintansa fɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:164">diɛta ni afiofa tinini lɛfɔ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 119:164" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="165" style="v" sid="PSA 119:165" />Atoko ɔkyɛ ole kplɛ nkpe mba nimbɔmbɔ ni kufiofa lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:165">lɛsalɛsaa dilaata ma batuula.<verse eid="PSA 119:165" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="166" style="v" sid="PSA 119:166" />O Saate, nsoko didiki lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:166">ntikanko kafɔɔ afiofa lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:166" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="167" style="v" sid="PSA 119:167" />Mmufũ sɛsaabla lɛfɔ nklee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:167">mbɔmbɔ sĩ osie kanya.<verse eid="PSA 119:167" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="168" style="v" sid="PSA 119:168" />Nkyɔɔ asaa otuo ku sɛsaabla lɛfɔ kotoko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:168">diekye faye sisuku nii simuu.<verse eid="PSA 119:168" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Diɛta Ni Lɛkyakaako</para>
  <para style="qa">Taw</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="169" style="v" sid="PSA 119:169" />O Saate, kaku owi nii kɔwa anu lɛfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:169">tɛɛ lɛsɔnu di ɔlaa lɛfɔ nwu kanya.<verse eid="PSA 119:169" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="170" style="v" sid="PSA 119:170" />Ta ɔlaa ɔpɛ nii kuwa anu lɛfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:170">diki mi di ntam lɛfɔ nwu kanya.<verse eid="PSA 119:170" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="171" style="v" sid="PSA 119:171" />Ta anyasibi nii ayiisa kudu ku katansa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:171">diekye feetuo mi afiofa lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:171" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="172" style="v" sid="PSA 119:172" />Ta ɔkplalomii nii kusa sɛlaa lɛfɔ sinu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:172">diekye afiofa lɛfɔ nte tinini.<verse eid="PSA 119:172" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="173" style="v" sid="PSA 119:173" />Ta kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ kulolaa suoto kuɔbakyakaako mi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:173">diekye ntoodiki asaa otuo lɛfɔ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 119:173" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="174" style="v" sid="PSA 119:174" />O Saate, nsoko didiki lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:174">kufiofa lɛfɔ ninle mi suoto lɛyɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 119:174" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="175" style="v" sid="PSA 119:175" />Tɛɛ nsiɛ nkpa alɛ katansa fɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:175">alɛ afiofa lɛfɔ kaklee mi.<verse eid="PSA 119:175" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="176" style="v" sid="PSA 119:176" />Ntooyu osuku fɛle foso.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:176">Wolaa kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 119:176">diekye nin-yee afiofa lɛfɔ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 119:176" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 119" />
  <chapter number="120" style="c" sid="PSA 120" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 120</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Diɛta Ni Lɛkyakaako</para>
  <para style="d">Osuku bakyɛntɛ onu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 120:1" />Nlɛɛ Saate nwu di niniina nii kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:1">ni antuna antɛɛ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 120:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 120:2" />O Saate, diki mi fakyeko sɛlaa ku afunu anyasibi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:2">ku kakyɔnkyɔ sɛkplalomii kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 120:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 120:3" />Obe ababla fɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:3">O kakyɔnkyɔ ɔkplalomii, be bamba niekple dikpe?<verse eid="PSA 120:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 120:4" />Abanaanfi fɔ kootoko ku kpɛtɛ ataa blɛblɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:4">ku lɛkambe kowoso atɔkɔnii kpankpa.<verse eid="PSA 120:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 120:5" />Nnyɔɔsa alɛ nsi di Mesek,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:5">alɛ nsi di Keda akpaayo kamɛ!<verse eid="PSA 120:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 120:6" />Ntoosii osiɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:6">di mba niekyidi ni atoko ɔkyɛ ole kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 120:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 120:7" />Atoko ɔkyɛ ole otii nle;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 120:7">kafɔɔ nse lɛkakatɛ, mma mankpɛ kakpɛ.<verse eid="PSA 120:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 120" />
  <chapter number="121" style="c" sid="PSA 121" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 121</para>
  <para style="s1">Saate Nwu Tĩtĩitɛ Loo</para>
  <para style="d">Osuku bakyɛntɛ onu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 121:1" />Lɛtakatɛsa anu nii lɛkyɔɔ akpenkpe nwu-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:1">ɔfɛ di lɛkyakaako nii makye nin-wa?<verse eid="PSA 121:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 121:2" />Lɛkyakaako nii nkye Saate nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:2">osi ku kasɔ Blatɛ nfũ.<verse eid="PSA 121:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 121:3" />Ɔlɔbata kɔkpaa lɛfɔ kufɛntɛ-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:3">nnwɔ ninnyu fɔ ni dilɔbakyɔsĩi akpa;<verse eid="PSA 121:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 121:4" />nwaako, nnwɔ ninnyu ni Israel</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:4">dilɔbakyɔsĩi akpa ee aklɛ ate.<verse eid="PSA 121:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 121:5" />Saate nwu nnyu fɔ-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:5">Saate nwu nle fɔ oyududu di oletanɛɛkyɛ lɛfɔ;<verse eid="PSA 121:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 121:6" />kufĩ dilɔbabla fɔ dikpile ku kakũ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:6">ee kɔwɛntɛ ku kakyɛ.<verse eid="PSA 121:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 121:7" />Saate nwu kamablasa fɔ di akpilesaa amuu suoto-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:7">abanyu nkpa lɛfɔ disi;<verse eid="PSA 121:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 121:8" />Saate nwu kamanyu obuo ku odie lɛfɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 121:8">diɛyɔ ni di nua dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="PSA 121:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 121" />
  <chapter number="122" style="c" sid="PSA 122" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 122</para>
  <para style="s1">Yerusalɛm Katansa</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu. Osuku bakyɛntɛ onu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 122:1" />Lanya suoto lɛyɔɔ ku mba niatɔkɔ mi ni alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:1">"Bita bukyɛ ni Saate nwu leyo.”<verse eid="PSA 122:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 122:2" />O Yerusalem, nkpaa loo n-yɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:2">di n-yoko lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 122:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 122:3" />Beetofo Yerusalem fɛle okpoo kplɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:3">bɛɛkyasa baawo kpinkpĩ.<verse eid="PSA 122:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 122:4" />Nfa di nfaabi nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:4">Saate nwu nfaabi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 122:4">nkyɛ manaatansa Saate nwu leyooto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:4">di mmle kanya baata ni Israel kufiofa nwu.<verse eid="PSA 122:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 122:5" />Nfa di lɛkanko akakpomii n-yɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:5">Dawid leyo akakpomii.<verse eid="PSA 122:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 122:6" />Pɛ ɔlaa fata Yerusalem atoko ɔkyɛ ole:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:6">"Bita asaa alɛ ɔkyɛ ata mba nimbɔmbɔ fɔ ni.<verse eid="PSA 122:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 122:7" />Ta atoko ɔkyɛ ole awɛ di siyoyiɛ lɛfɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:7">di kanyu nwaa kafɔɔ kawɛ di akayo nwofakɔ lɛfɔ.”<verse eid="PSA 122:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 122:8" />Ta babiloo ku basiɛwo nii oso yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:8">kamabuɛ nlɛ, "Atoko ɔkyɛ ole asiɛ fɔ kaamɛ.”<verse eid="PSA 122:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 122:9" />Ta Saate, Yaa loo oso yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 122:9">kamamiɛ fɔ lɛlɛ.<verse eid="PSA 122:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 122" />
  <chapter number="123" style="c" sid="PSA 123" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 123</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Diɛta Ni Nyaami Ɔnya</para>
  <para style="d">Osuku bakyɛntɛ onu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 123:1" />Afɔ wɔ lɛkakpomii ninkpe ni di osi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:1">afɔ lɛtakatɛsa anu nii lɛkyɔɔ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 123:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 123:2" />Fɛ mmle di balanle anu konyu ni saate lɛma kɔnɛɛ osuku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:2">fɛ mmle di kpɛmblatɛ-sanko anu konyu ni saate-sanko nɔɔ kɔnɛɛ osuku yi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 123:2">nkpo di anu loo konyu Saate, Yaa loo osuku nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:2">diɛlaase di obe wɔ abanya wo ni nyaami nɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 123:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 123:3" />Nya wo nyaami, O Saate, nya wo nyaami,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:3">diekye butoonu atufa buɔpɔɔsa.<verse eid="PSA 123:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 123:4" />Mba nintakatɛsa ni suoto katoo ntɔɔma wo bɛɛklɛsa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 123:4">atufa kpinwu di mba ninkanta ni nnɛɛ.<verse eid="PSA 123:4" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 123" />
  <chapter number="124" style="c" sid="PSA 124" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 124</para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa, Batii Nɔɔ Nwu Nyuntɛ</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu. Osuku bakyɛntɛ onu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 124:1" />Nse fɛ diele Saate nwu ninkpe di kakyɛ loo-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:1">bita Israel abuɛ alɛ-<verse eid="PSA 124:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 124:2" />nse fɛ diele Saate nwu ninkpe di kakyɛ loo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:2">di obe wɔ di batii ladieko wo nii,<verse eid="PSA 124:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 124:3" />obe wɔ di ɔblɔ lɛma lataka ni di suoto loo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:3">see baamɛ wo ku nkpa;<verse eid="PSA 124:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 124:4" />see ntu oyii nwu layɔ wo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:4">see okle ntu kplɛ nwu lafiɛ wo diafenko,<verse eid="PSA 124:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 124:5" />see atukɛ nwu lafiɛ wo aasifiko.<verse eid="PSA 124:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 124:6" />Katansa baata Saate nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:6">nnwɔ ninanta babɛbɛɛ wo ni ku anyɛɛ lɛma.<verse eid="PSA 124:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 124:7" />Biatoso fɛle kansiɛ wɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:7">niedie ni di okũ kyɔɔtɛ okũ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 124:7">batoofefee okũ nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:7">ni buatoso nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 124:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 124:8" />Lɛkyakaako loo nsi di Saate nwu leyooto kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 124:8">osi ku kasɔ Blatɛ.<verse eid="PSA 124:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 124" />
  <chapter number="125" style="c" sid="PSA 125" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 125</para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa Batii Nwu Kanyu</para>
  <para style="d">Osuku bakyɛntɛ onu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 125:1" />Mba nietika ni disi di Saate nwu suoto nte fɛle Sion Kobokote</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:1">ko manamafuo ni otũkunsa kafɔɔ kubayila ni dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="PSA 125:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 125:2" />Fɛ mmle di abokote lɛmana ni Yerusalem eekyi nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:2">nkpo di Saate nwu mmana batii nɔɔ ankyi nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:2">diɛyɔ ni di nua dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="PSA 125:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 125:3" />Bakpiletɛ kayofo dilɔbate</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:3">di kasɔ ka bɛɛta ni batininitɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 125:3">diekye se diele nkpo batininitɛ mayɔ nnɛɛ lɛma mambla sikpile.<verse eid="PSA 125:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 125:4" />O Saate, bla dibiene, fata mba ninlɛ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:4">ku mba situ kamɛ niɛkpa ni.<verse eid="PSA 125:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 125:5" />Kafɔɔ mba niemunikĩi beefe ni di sisuku kɔnkɔnle suoto yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 125:5">Saate nwu kamafiɛ ma ku sikpilebablatɛ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 125:5" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 125:5">Atoko ɔkyɛ ole asiɛko Israel.<verse eid="PSA 125:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 125" />
  <chapter number="126" style="c" sid="PSA 126" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 126</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Diɛta Ni Didiki</para>
  <para style="d">Osuku bakyɛntɛ onu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 126:1" />Obe wɔ di Saate nwu lakplesa mba baamufũ ni di kakpɛ kamɛ aawako ni Sion,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:1">buate fɛle batii ba niasɛ ni alaafɔ.<verse eid="PSA 126:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 126:2" />Nnya loo layii ku sɛma pɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:2">sɛkplalomii loo ku suoto lɛyɔɔ sinu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 126:2">Ni baabuɛ di nnle nwu kamɛ alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:2">"Saate nwu lɛbla asaa kplɛ ɛɛta ma.”<verse eid="PSA 126:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 126:3" />Saate nwu lɛbla asaa kplɛ ɛɛta wo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:3">nioso suoto lɛyɔɔ leyii wo kamɛ pɔ.<verse eid="PSA 126:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 126:4" />O Saate, kplesa lɛlɛ loo fata wo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:4">fɛle seklenyii di Kala kasɔ Ɔfaafuu.<verse eid="PSA 126:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 126:5" />Mba niapɛ ni asaa ku nnumɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:5">matɛsɛ nya ku suoto lɛyɔɔ sinu.<verse eid="PSA 126:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 126:6" />Nnwɔ nindie ansifi ni ku kaku</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:6">antuka ni alesaa kubi alɛ ɔɔlaapɛ ni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 126:6">makple anwa ku suoto lɛyɔɔ sinu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 126:6">atuka ni kamɔɔ nɔɔ niile ɔɔwako nii.<verse eid="PSA 126:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 126" />
  <chapter number="127" style="c" sid="PSA 127" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 127</para>
  <para style="s1">Katansa Di Yaa Sifutulɛ Suoto</para>
  <para style="d">Salomo onu. Osuku bakyɛntɛ onu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 127:1" />Nse Saate nwu dietofo leyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:1">ni kasakasa di batofotɛ kɔbla ɔkpɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 127:1">Nse Saate nwu dienyu okpoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:1">kasakasa di banyuntɛ n-yɛ boonyu nwu.<verse eid="PSA 127:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 127:2" />Kasakasa mintaka ku kolesɛtũ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:2">minn-woolaa ote kafɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 127:2">biɔkpɛ̀ minta alesaa ya biale nii-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:2">diekye anta mba ambɔmbɔ ni nte mankyɔsĩi.<verse eid="PSA 127:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 127:3" />Babisuɔtɔbi nle atesaa ya niekye ni Saate nwu nfũ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:3">babi nle letota niekye ni ɔkyɛ nɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 127:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 127:4" />Fɛle kɔtaa di kpɛtɛ nnɛɛ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:4">nkpo di babisuɔtɔbi ba beelofo ni di sekosopo obe kamɛ nte nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 127:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 127:5" />Suoto siyɔɔ osuɔtɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:5">wɔ kɔtaa kotofo nieyii ni ku kɔtaa pɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 127:5">Blɔbakpee ma sinunsɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 127:5">nse bɛɛkyaka ku balo lɛma di lɛkpaka.<verse eid="PSA 127:5" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 127" />
  <chapter number="128" style="c" sid="PSA 128" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 128</para>
  <para style="s1">Saate Nwu Atoko Ɔkyɔɔ Letota</para>
  <para style="d">Osuku bakyɛntɛ onu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 128:1" />Suoto siyɔɔ mba bamuu nin-yɛkɛ ni Saate nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:1">mankyɛ ni di sisuku nɔɔ suoto.<verse eid="PSA 128:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 128:2" />Fabale kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ kamɛ alesaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:2">suoto lɛyɔɔ ku lɛlɛ nimale fɔ lele.<verse eid="PSA 128:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 128:3" />Ɔsɔfɔ lɛfɔ kamate fɛle kole-woso ko nintika ni abi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:3">di leyo lɛfɔ kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 128:3">babisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ kamate fɛle nnɔnyi kowoso afata sɛnya yeleyele</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:3">mammana opunu lɛfɔ mankyi.<verse eid="PSA 128:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 128:4" />Nkpo di suoto kamayɔɔ otii wɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:4">nin-yɛkɛ ni Saate nwu nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 128:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 128:5" />Saate nwu ata fɔ suoto lɛyɔɔ le niekye ni Sion</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 128:5">di nkpa lɛfɔ ayi amuu kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 128:5">ata fɔ fanya Yerusalem lɛlɛ,<verse eid="PSA 128:5" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 128:6" />aata fɔ kafɔɔ fanya babi lɛfɔ babi.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 128:6" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 128:6">Atoko ɔkyɛ ole asiɛko Israel.<verse eid="PSA 128:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 128" />
  <chapter number="129" style="c" sid="PSA 129" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 129</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Di Israel Balo Suoto</para>
  <para style="d">Osuku bakyɛntɛ onu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 129:1" />Batɔɔbla mi amumu osie kanya diayɔ ni di sekosopo nii obe-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:1">bita Israel abuɛ alɛ-<verse eid="PSA 129:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 129:2" />batɔɔbla mi amumu diayɔ ni di sekosopo nii obe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:2">kafɔɔ baafuo mi olenkee.<verse eid="PSA 129:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 129:3" />Beetika mi nkɔ kaamaa ku anwa blɛblɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:3">bɛɛtɛ sekplo kanaale fɛle mmle di fekpɛntɛ mbɛ ni kasɔ.<verse eid="PSA 129:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 129:4" />Kafɔɔ Saate nwu nle tininitɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:4">atoobudi mi eefukuti mi di bakpiletɛ sikũ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 129:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 129:5" />Bita mba niekyidi ni Sion</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:5">bakple basifi ku sinunsɔ.<verse eid="PSA 129:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 129:6" />Bita ma bate fɛle sɛfa di lɛkyá osi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:6">sin-yɔɔ ni fiɛ sintaka ni;<verse eid="PSA 129:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 129:7" />fiɛlɛtɛ ninfuo sĩ osiisa di kɔnɛɛ nɔɔ kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:7">ee nnwɔ ninsiisa ni, ayiisa sĩ di nnɛɛ nɔɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 129:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 129:8" />Tanta mba nimbudi manfe ni labuɛ alɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:8">"Saate nwu suoto lɛyɔɔ disiɛko ye;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 129:8">suoto siyɔɔ ye di Saate nwu leyooto kamɛ.”<verse eid="PSA 129:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 129" />
  <chapter number="130" style="c" sid="PSA 130" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 130</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Diɛta Ni Lɛkyakaako</para>
  <para style="d">Osuku bakyɛntɛ onu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 130:1" />O Saate, kakyofokɔ kamɛ kowi nlɛɛ fɔ,<verse eid="PSA 130:1" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 130:2" />O Saate, nu mi sɛlɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 130:2">Ta atoko lɛfɔ ate kaayi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:2">faanu nyaami nii ɔnya kaku.<verse eid="PSA 130:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 130:3" />O Saate, nse fɛɛtɛ sikpile nsũ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:3">O Saate, owe nikafuo oyila?<verse eid="PSA 130:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 130:4" />Kafɔɔ di ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ, ɔyɔ ɔkyɛ nkpe;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:4">nioso bɔɔyɛkɛ fɔ.<verse eid="PSA 130:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 130:5" />Nsoko Saate nwu, ɔkla nii nsoko nwɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:5">ɔlaa nɔɔ kamɛ kafɔɔ nkpe osuku onyu nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 130:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 130:6" />Ɔkla nii nsoko Saate nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:6">alenke mmle di asaa banyuntɛ nsoko ni olesɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:6">alenke mmle di asaa banyuntɛ nsoko ni olesɛ.<verse eid="PSA 130:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 130:7" />O Israel, yɔ osuku onyu lɛfɔ fatika di Saate nwu suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:7">diekye Saate nwu nfũ di lɛbɔmbɔ le ninaa ni kaloo nkpe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:7">ɔkyɛ nɔɔ kafɔɔ di atoko ɔkyɛ ole omuomu nkpe nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 130:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 130:8" />Nnwɔɔ omu nimadiki Israel</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 130:8">di sikpile lɛma simuu kamɛ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 130:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 130" />
  <chapter number="131" style="c" sid="PSA 131" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 131</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Di Suoto Kasɔ Ɔwakosa Disi Otika</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid. Osuku bakyɛntɛ onu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 131:1" />O Saate, otu nii dilɔɔtakatɛsa suoto katoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 131:1">nnaa anu kplɛ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 131:1">ninkpee suoto nii kubuɛ ku sɛlaa kplɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 131:1">ee sɛsaabla se niesii ni ɔkpɛ ɔbla suoto.<verse eid="PSA 131:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 131:2" />Kafɔɔ ntɔɔmaasa kanya, ɔkla nii kafɔɔ lelo kanana;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 131:2">fɛle mmle di obisɔ nlo kanana antika ni di ɔya suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 131:2">fɛle obisɔ wɔ nielo ni kanana nkpo di ɔkla nii nte kaamɛ nii nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 131:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 131:3" />O Israel, yɔ osuku onyu lɛfɔ fatika di Saate nwu suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 131:3">diɛyɔ ni di nua dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="PSA 131:3" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 131" />
  <chapter number="132" style="c" sid="PSA 132" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 132</para>
  <para style="s1">Katansa Diɛta Ni Olekatakɔ</para>
  <para style="d">Osuku bakyɛntɛ onu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 132:1" />O Saate, nyuma Dawid</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:1">ku dibuo le nimuu kamɛ aafe ni.<verse eid="PSA 132:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 132:2" />Aaka ntam aata Saate nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:2">aabuɛ aatɛ aata Nnwɔ Ninlenke ni Yakob:<verse eid="PSA 132:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 132:3" />"Namabuo leyo nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:3">ee nte di atensaa nii suoto-<verse eid="PSA 132:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 132:4" />Namamaasa anu nii nkyɔsĩi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:4">namamaasa sinumpoo nii,<verse eid="PSA 132:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 132:5" />diediki lɛwɛ lɛba lɛta Saate nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:5">kasiɛkɔ lɛta ni Nnwɔ Ninlenke ni Yakob.”<verse eid="PSA 132:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 132:6" />Buanu nwu di Efrata,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:6">buanya ni di Yaar afe.<verse eid="PSA 132:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 132:7" />"Bita bukyɛ kasiɛkɔ nɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:7">bita busumu di nkpaa ditikasaa nɔɔ katũ-<verse eid="PSA 132:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 132:8" />O Saate, taka fawa ɔnyɛɛ katɛkɔ lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:8">afɔ ku kanya ninii lɛlakaa lɛfɔ osie.<verse eid="PSA 132:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 132:9" />Ta bakpee olebatatɛ lɛfɔ awu ku ɔsaabla tinini;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:9">ta baklekletɛ lɛfɔ basa suoto lɛyɔɔ sinu.”<verse eid="PSA 132:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 132:10" />Ta kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ Dawid oso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:10">tansĩ ole fɔ wɔ faapɛ ni ɔfɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 132:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 132:11" />Saate nwu laka ntam aata Dawid,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:11">ntam be beetika ni difuɔ di Saate nwu dilɔbakplesa nii:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 132:11">"Banantii lɛfɔ bamu onwii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:11">kamayɔ nsiɛsa di lɛkakpomii lɛfɔ-<verse eid="PSA 132:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 132:12" />nse babisuɔtɔbi lɛfɔ lemufũ kanya ninii nii beeklee</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:12">ku asaa otuo nii ya latuo ma nii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 132:12">ni babisuɔtɔbi lɛma kamasiɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:12">di lɛkakpomii lɛfɔ suoto dinaa ni kaloo.”<verse eid="PSA 132:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 132:13" />Diekye Saate nwu ntoodiki Sion,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:13">aabɔmbɔ nwu aata kasiɛkɔ nɔɔ:<verse eid="PSA 132:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 132:14" />"Nle mmle ninle mi ɔnyɛɛ katɛkɔ dinaa ni kaloo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:14">nfũ kamasiɛ nle ni sɛka, diekye mbɔmbɔ nwu-<verse eid="PSA 132:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 132:15" />Kamawii nwɔ lɛyɔɔ ku asaa kpinwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:15">bapiitɛ nɔɔ kamale alesaa mammiɛ.<verse eid="PSA 132:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 132:16" />Kamakpee olebatatɛ nɔɔ ku didiki akpeele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:16">baklekletɛ nɔɔ kafɔɔ kamasa suoto lɛyɔɔ sinu dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="PSA 132:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 132:17" />"Nfũ kamata lɛkya mmuɔ ninta ni Dawid</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:17">n-se kandiɛ kafɔɔ nta nnwɔ lɛpɛ ni ɔfɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 132:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 132:18" />Kamayɔ sinunsɔ nkpee balo nɔɔ fɛle akpeele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 132:18">kafɔɔ lɛkakoto di disi nɔɔ kamakpà.<verse eid="PSA 132:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 132" />
  <chapter number="133" style="c" sid="PSA 133" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 133</para>
  <para style="s1">Katansa Di Atoko Ɔkyɛ Ole Osiɛ Kamɛ</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu. Osuku bakyɛntɛ onu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 133:1" />Nyu mmle dilɛ, dikpeni ɔmɛnɛfɛ kafɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 133:1">nse babilɛma nsi di lɛba ninwii di onwii ɔbla kamɛ!<verse eid="PSA 133:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 133:2" />Ote dite fɛle nnɔnyi be niefũ ni kɔya bɛɛnyɛɛnɛ beekpete ni diisi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 133:2">diosoo ninwa ni okusu suoto,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 133:2">diosoo ni di Aron okusu suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 133:2">diosoo nimbuo ni di awu nɔɔ simu.<verse eid="PSA 133:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 133:3" />Ote dite fɛ Hermon ɔblokyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 133:3">nikɔkpa kunkpete ni di Sion Kobokote.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 133:3">Diekye nfa di Saate nwu ntɛ lɛyɔɔ nɔɔ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 133:3">bia nkpa be ninaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="PSA 133:3" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 133" />
  <chapter number="134" style="c" sid="PSA 134" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 134</para>
  <para style="s1">Lɛlɛɛ Diɛta Ni Yaa Katansa</para>
  <para style="d">Osuku bakyɛntɛ onu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 134:1" />Bitansa Saate nwu, aye Saate nwu bakpɛmblatɛ bamuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 134:1">aye ba ninsumu ni di Saate nwu leyo ku kakyɛ.<verse eid="PSA 134:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 134:2" />Bitakatɛsa nnɛɛ lee katoo di lɛkpaayo klekle nwu kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 134:2">biɛtansa Saate nwu.<verse eid="PSA 134:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 134:3" />Ta Saate nwu, osi ku kasɔ Blatɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 134:3">awii fɔ lɛyɔɔ le niekye ni Sion.<verse eid="PSA 134:3" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 134" />
  <chapter number="135" style="c" sid="PSA 135" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 135</para>
  <para style="s1">Katansa Onu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 135:1" />Bitansa Saate nwu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 135:1" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 135:1">Bitansa Saate nwu leyooto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:1">aye bakpɛmblatɛ, bitansa nwɔ,<verse eid="PSA 135:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 135:2" />aye ba ninsumu ni di Saate nwu leyo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:2">di Yaa loo leyo akpata nwu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 135:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 135:3" />Bitansa Saate nwu, diekye Saate nwu nlɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:3">bisa sinu bitansa leyooto nɔɔ, diekye nni ninkpe ɔmɛnɛfɛ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 135:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 135:4" />Diekye Saate ntoodiki Yakob alɛ ale ole nwɔ omu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:4">alɛ Israel ale lɛsaawɛ nɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 135:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 135:5" />N-ye nlɛ Saate nwu lemuɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:5">Saate nwu lemuɔ alenke afiɔ amuu.<verse eid="PSA 135:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 135:6" />Saate nwu mbla nle ninlɛ nwɔ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:6">di osi ku kasɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:6">di lekpo ku nkyofokɔ nimi mmuu.<verse eid="PSA 135:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 135:7" />Anta alokonkyɛ ntaka ankye kasɔ nyɛntɛlekɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:7">ankyesee ɔplalaa amunaa ku kanto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:7">anta kafɔɔ afɛɛfɔ nkye asaa nɔɔ katɛkɔ.<verse eid="PSA 135:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 135:8" />Nnwɔɔ nialo Egipte lelofo kasale babi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:8">batii ku babɔkɛɛ alofo kasale babi nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 135:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 135:9" />O Egipte, aakyesee atuosaa ku sɛkpɛ nɔɔ se niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ di kamɛ lee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:9">di Farao ku bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ suoto.<verse eid="PSA 135:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 135:10" />Aatɛ nnle kpinwu kaasɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:10">aalo baka kplɛ-<verse eid="PSA 135:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 135:11" />Amori batii ɔka Sihon,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:11">Basan ɔka Og</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:11">ku baka bamuu di Kanaan kasɔ-<verse eid="PSA 135:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 135:12" />ni aayɔ kasɔ lɛma aata fɛ atesaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:12">aale atesaa aata batii nɔɔ Israel nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 135:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 135:13" />O Saate, leyooto lɛfɔ nte dinaa ni kaloo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:13">O Saate, babanyuma fɔ di ana amuu kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 135:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 135:14" />Diekye Saate nwu kamata batii nɔɔ lɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:14">annya kafɔɔ bakpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ nyaami.<verse eid="PSA 135:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 135:15" />Nnle nwu afiɔ ninle koto fututu ku koto sɛɛle</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:15">bɛɛyɔ batii nnɛɛ bɛɛbla nya nii.<verse eid="PSA 135:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 135:16" />Bakpe nnya, kafɔɔ bloofuo ɔkakatɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:16">bakpe anu, kafɔɔ bloofuo ɔnya;<verse eid="PSA 135:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 135:17" />bakpe atoko, kafɔɔ bloofuo onu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:17">ee banwuna kɔfɛɛfɔ di nnya lɛma kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 135:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 135:18" />Mba niɛbla nya ni kamate fɛle mma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:18">nkpo kafɔɔ dibate mba bamuu nietika nya ni disi nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 135:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 135:19" />O Israel leyo, bitansa Saate nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:19">O Aron leyo, bitansa Saate nwu;<verse eid="PSA 135:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 135:20" />O Lewi leyo, bitansa Saate nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:20">aye ba bamuu nin-yɛkɛ nwɔ ni, bitansa Saate nwu.<verse eid="PSA 135:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 135:21" />Baatansa Saate nwu niekye ni Sion,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 135:21">bata nnwɔ ninsi ni di Yerusalem.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 135:21" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 135:21">Bitansa Saate nwu.<verse eid="PSA 135:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 135" />
  <chapter number="136" style="c" sid="PSA 136" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 136</para>
  <para style="s1">Sɛfa Ɔpɛ Onu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 136:1" />Bipɛ Saate nwu sɛfa, diekye alɛ.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:1">
    <char style="tl">Lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ nkpe dinaa ni kaloo.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 136:2" />Bipɛ Yaa wɔ ninlenke ni afiɔ sɛfa.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:2">
    <char style="tl">Lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ nkpe dinaa ni kaloo.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 136:3" />Bipɛ basaate nwu Saate sɛfa:</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:3">
    <char style="tl">Lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ nkpe dinaa ni kaloo.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 136:4" />diɛta ni nnwɔ lete nimbla ni asaa kplɛ ya niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ,</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:4">
    <char style="tl">Lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ nkpe dinaa ni kaloo.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 136:5" />nnwɔ di lɛsɔnu nɔɔ kamɛ aabla ni osi,</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:5">
    <char style="tl">Lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ nkpe dinaa ni kaloo.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 136:6" />nnwɔ niablɛfɛsa ni kasɔ di ntu suoto,</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:6">
    <char style="tl">Lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ nkpe dinaa ni kaloo.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 136:7" />nnwɔ niabla ni sɛtɔ kplɛ nwu-</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:7">
    <char style="tl">Lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ nkpe dinaa ni kaloo.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 136:8" />kufĩ kule sɛka di dii suoto,</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:8">
    <char style="tl">Lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ nkpe dinaa ni kaloo.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 136:9" />kɔwɛntɛ ku awɛntrɛbi bale sɛka di kakyɛ suoto;</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:9">
    <char style="tl">Lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ nkpe dinaa ni kaloo.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 136:10" />nnwɔ nialo ni Egipte lelofo kasale babi</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:10">
    <char style="tl">Lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ nkpe dinaa ni kaloo.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 136:11" />ni aakpaa Israel aadiɛko kaamɛ lɛma nɛ</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:11">
    <char style="tl">Lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ nkpe dinaa ni kaloo.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 136:12" />ku kɔnɛɛ siene ku kɔnɛɛ lɛnaanfi;</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:12">
    <char style="tl">Lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ nkpe dinaa ni kaloo.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 136:13" />nnwɔ niasɛ ni Lɛkpo Sɛɛle di nkyɛ nnyɔ</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:13">
    <char style="tl">Lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ nkpe dinaa ni kaloo.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 136:14" />ni aakpaa Israel aafenko nintɛɛ nɛ</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:14">
    <char style="tl">Lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ nkpe dinaa ni kaloo.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 136:15" />kafɔɔ aafiɛ Farao ku bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ aakpete di Lekpo Sɛɛle kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:15">
    <char style="tl">Lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ nkpe dinaa ni kaloo.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:15" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 136:16" />nnwɔɔ nialeko batii nɔɔ katũ aafenko di ɔfaafuu nwu,</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:16">
    <char style="tl">Lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ nkpe dinaa ni kaloo.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 136:17" />nnwɔ niatɛ ni baka kplɛ kaasɔ,</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:17">
    <char style="tl">Lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ nkpe dinaa ni kaloo.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 136:18" />ni aalo baka siene-</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:18">
    <char style="tl">Lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ nkpe dinaa ni kaloo.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 136:19" />Amori batii ɔka Sihon</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:19">
    <char style="tl">Lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ nkpe dinaa ni kaloo.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 136:20" />ku Basan ɔka Og-</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:20">
    <char style="tl">Lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ nkpe dinaa ni kaloo.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 136:21" />ni aayɔ kasɔ lɛma aata fɛ atesaa,</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:21">
    <char style="tl">Lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ nkpe dinaa ni kaloo.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 136:22" />atesaa aata kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ Israel.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:22">
    <char style="tl">Lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ nkpe dinaa ni kaloo.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 136:23" />diɛta ni Nnwɔ nianyuma wo ni di kasɔ loo ɔwakosa kamɛ</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:23">
    <char style="tl">Lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ nkpe dinaa ni kaloo.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 136:24" />ni aata wo suoto osiɛko di balo loo nfũ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:24">
    <char style="tl">Lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ nkpe dinaa ni kaloo.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="PSA 136:25" />nnwɔ kafɔɔ ninta ni lɛblasaa nɔɔ biala alesaa.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:25">
    <char style="tl">Lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ nkpe dinaa ni kaloo.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:25" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="PSA 136:26" />Bipɛ Yaa di osi sɛfa.</para>
  <para style="qr" vid="PSA 136:26">
    <char style="tl">Lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ nkpe dinaa ni kaloo.</char><verse eid="PSA 136:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 136" />
  <chapter number="137" style="c" sid="PSA 137" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 137</para>
  <para style="s1">Israel Batii Kaku Owi Di Sɛlanle Kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 137:1" />Di Babilon sekle kotoko buasiɛ buawi kaku</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:1">di obe wɔ buanyuma ni Sion.<verse eid="PSA 137:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 137:2" />Awoso nwu ninfa suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:2">buasaka bakyitaa loo,<verse eid="PSA 137:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 137:3" />diekye nfa di mba niamufũ wo ni latɔkɔ wo alɛ busa sinu nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:3">mba niatɔɔbla wo ni amumu lakaalɛ suoto lɛyɔɔ sinu baakyeko ɔkyɛ loo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:3">baabuɛ alɛ, "Bisa Sion sinu nwu onwii bita wo!"<verse eid="PSA 137:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 137:4" />Lɛ nfɛ buasa Saate nwu sinu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:4">di obe wɔ bukpe ni di bafɔɔ kasɔ suoto?<verse eid="PSA 137:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 137:5" />O Yerusalem, nse leyee fɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:5">ta koletanɛɛ nii kuyee ɔsaabla nikũ.<verse eid="PSA 137:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 137:6" />Ta ɔkplalomii nii kuka di kanya takatoo nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:6">nse ninnyuma fɔ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 137:6">nse nimbu disi di Yerusalem suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:6">suoto lɛyɔɔ nii kplɛ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 137:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 137:7" />O Saate, nyuma, nle di Edom batii labla ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:7">di dii le di Yerusalem labiɛ ni.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 137:7">baabuɛ alɛ, "Bibiɛ nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:7">bibiɛ nwu bilaadu lɛsɔse ninwu!"<verse eid="PSA 137:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 137:8" />O Babilon Babisankobi, bɛɛwɔɔsa ye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:8">suoto siyɔɔ nwɔ nimata ye ni koto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:8">ta lɛsaa le biɛbla wo ni oso-<verse eid="PSA 137:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 137:9" />nnwɔ ninklee babifɔɔle lee anfũ ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 137:9">an-yɔ ma anlaasa ni di afuɔnkpaa nwu suoto.<verse eid="PSA 137:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 137" />
  <chapter number="138" style="c" sid="PSA 138" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 138</para>
  <para style="s1">Sɛfa Ɔpɛ Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 138:1" />O Saate, kamatansa fɔ ku otu nii omuu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:1">kamasa katansa sinu di "afiɔ" anu.<verse eid="PSA 138:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 138:2" />Kamawakasɔ nkyɔɔ anu olekatakɔ klekle lɛfɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:2">kamatansa leyooto lɛfɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:2">ta lɛbɔmbɔ lɛfɔ ku onukwale lɛfɔ oso,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 138:2">diekye fatɔɔtaka katoo falenke asaa amuu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:2">leyooto lɛfɔ ku ɔlaa lɛfɔ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 138:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 138:3" />Obe wɔ lalɛɛ fɔ nii, faatuna faatɛɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:3">faatɛɛ sɛkambi ku otu okpee.<verse eid="PSA 138:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 138:4" />O Saate, ta baka bamuu kaasɔ suoto batansa fɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:4">nse beenu kanya lɛfɔ sɛlaa.<verse eid="PSA 138:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 138:5" />Ta basa sinu di Saate nwu sisuku suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:5">diekye Saate nwu dibu lemuɔ.<verse eid="PSA 138:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 138:6" />Nu di Saate nwu ntika di osi yi, oonyu suoto kasɔ bawokosatɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:6">kafɔɔ suoto katoo batakatɛsatɛ mma aye ma fanfa.<verse eid="PSA 138:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 138:7" />Nu ninkyɛ di dibuo kamɛ yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:7">foonyu mi nkpa disi;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 138:7">fɛɛnanfi kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ fɛɛkyɔɔ di bakyiditɛ nii ɔblɔ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:7">feefũ mi ku koletanɛɛ lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 138:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 138:8" />Saate nwu mabla di nle ɛɛtɛ alɛ ababla antɛɛ ni suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:8">O Saate, lɛbɔmbɔ lɛfɔ nkpe dinaa ni kaloo-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 138:8">tandiɛ kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ sɛkpɛ faatɛ.<verse eid="PSA 138:8" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 138" />
  <chapter number="139" style="c" sid="PSA 139" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 139</para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa Lɛsaatofo Niewo Ni Nimu Ku Kanyu</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu. Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 139:1" />O Saate, fatoowolaa mi kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:1">feetofo mi kafɔɔ.<verse eid="PSA 139:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 139:2" />Faye obe wɔ ninsiɛ ni, ku obe wɔ nintaka nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:2">faye disibu nii di kakyonkɔ.<verse eid="PSA 139:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 139:3" />Fantofo odiebee nii ku otembee nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:3">faye sisuku nii simuu.<verse eid="PSA 139:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 139:4" />Fiɛ di ɔlaa kamatika ni di ɔkplalomii nii suoto yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:4">O Saate, faye nwu omuu.<verse eid="PSA 139:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 139:5" />Fɛɛmana mi feekyi- sitũ ku sɛmaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:5">feetika kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ di suoto nii.<verse eid="PSA 139:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 139:6" />Lɛsaatofo le mmle lɛtɛ diɛbla mi ɔkpɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:6">diɛtɛ diɛtaka katoo dilenke lɛsɔnu nii.<verse eid="PSA 139:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 139:7" />Ɔfɛ kakyɛ nfe di Ninwuna lɛfɔ katũ?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:7">Ɔfɛ katoso nfe di anu lɛfɔ?<verse eid="PSA 139:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 139:8" />Nse lɛkata lesifi osi, fakpe ninfa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:8">nse lɛtɛ atensaa nii di nkyofokɔ, fakpe ninfa.<verse eid="PSA 139:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 139:9" />Nse lɛtaka lɛflɛlɛtɛ ku kolesɛtũ afoko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:9">nse lesiɛ di lekpo ɔlɔɔkɔ fanfa,<verse eid="PSA 139:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 139:10" />bia nfa kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ kamatuo mi osuku,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:10">koletanɛɛ lɛfɔ kamamufũ mi kpinkpĩ.<verse eid="PSA 139:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 139:11" />Nse lebuɛ nlɛ, "Nwaako ditunu kamawofasa mi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:11">di lɛkpa kafɔɔ lekple kakyɛ diɛmana mi diekyi,”<verse eid="PSA 139:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 139:12" />bia ditunu dilɔbawɔfɔ dita fɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:12">kakyɛ kamakpa fɛle kakũ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:12">diekye ditunu nte fɛ lɛkpa diɛta fɔ.<verse eid="PSA 139:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 139:13" />Diekye afɔ niabla suoto nii kamɛ asaa;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:13">afɔ nialoso mi faasiisa di yaami olofofɔtɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 139:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 139:14" />Kɔtansa fɔ diekye fɛɛbla mi di lɛyɛkɛ le niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:14">sɛkpɛ lɛfɔ lɛbla ɔkpɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:14">n-ye nya amuu nwaa.<verse eid="PSA 139:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 139:15" />Akufi nii ditale fɔ lewofasaa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:15">di obe wɔ baabla mi ni di kawofakɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 139:15">Obe wɔ baaloso mi baakyasa ni di kasɔ nwu kakyofokɔ,<verse eid="PSA 139:15" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 139:16" />anu lɛfɔ lanya suoto nii se manadibla nii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 139:16">Ayi amuu fɛɛtɛɛ nii</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 139:16">faakpana nya faakpee di kukũ lɛfɔ kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:16">di obe wɔ di kuonwii lɛma ditawɛ nii.<verse eid="PSA 139:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 139:17" />O Yaa, mmle di disibu lɛfɔ lefũ mi ni kɔya!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:17">Mmle di lɛpɔ lɛma nte ni!<verse eid="PSA 139:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 139:18" />Nse alɛ nka ma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:18">babalenkee ɔtɛnsia.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 139:18">Nse lɛsɛnkɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:18">ɔkyɛ lɛfɔ lekple nkpe.<verse eid="PSA 139:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 139:19" />O Yaa, nse fabalo bakpiletɛ nwu!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:19">Bikpukuti di ɔlɔɔkɔ nii, aye batii ba nin-wii ni ntɔ!<verse eid="PSA 139:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 139:20" />Mankakatɛ di suoto lɛfɔ ku asibu kpile;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:20">bakyiditɛ lɛfɔ kɔlalaasa leyooto lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 139:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 139:21" />O Saate, ninkyidi mba niekyidi fɔ ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:21">nkyidi mba kafɔɔ niɛtaka bayɛ fɔ ni di suoto?<verse eid="PSA 139:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="PSA 139:22" />Okyidi dikpeni lekyidi ma;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:22">nnya ma fɛ balo nii.<verse eid="PSA 139:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="PSA 139:23" />O Yaa, wolaa mi kamɛ, faatofo otu nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:23">sɔ mi fanyu, faatofo disibu nii.<verse eid="PSA 139:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="PSA 139:24" />Nyu nse osuku kpile owo nsi mi kaamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 139:24">faaleko mi katũ di osuku wɔ ninaa ni kaloo suoto.<verse eid="PSA 139:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 139" />
  <chapter number="140" style="c" sid="PSA 140" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 140</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Diɛta Ni Katĩtĩi</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu. Kuɔta ni sinutuotɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 140:1" />O Saate, diki mi fakyeko batii kpile nnɛɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:1">fũ mi di amumu batii nnɛɛ;<verse eid="PSA 140:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 140:2" />mambu ni asi kpile di situ lɛma kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:2">manwako ni kakpɛ kafɔɔ dii biala.<verse eid="PSA 140:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 140:3" />Bɛɛbla sɛkplalomii lɛma blɛblɛ fɛ kɔsanwu ole,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:3">kɔwɛɛfɛɛko adii ntika di anyasibi lɛma. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ</char><verse eid="PSA 140:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 140:4" />O Saate, fũ mi fakyeko bakpiletɛ nnɛɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:4">diki mi fakyeko amumu bablatɛ nnɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:4">bookũ ni kanwumbe alɛ bɔɔkyɔɔ ni nkpaa nii okũ.<verse eid="PSA 140:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 140:5" />Batii ba ninkanta ni lɛkyɔɔ mi dikyĩ di lewofa kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:5">beefukuti asawu lɛma sikũ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:5">bɛɛkyɔɔ mi dikyĩ kafɔɔ di nkpaa nii osuku. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ </char><verse eid="PSA 140:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 140:6" />O Saate, kobuɛ ntɔkɔ fɔ nlɛ, "Yaa nii fale.”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:6">O Saate, nu kaku nii diɛta ni nyaami ɔnya.<verse eid="PSA 140:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 140:7" />O Saate Kplɛ, dikitɛ nii siene,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:7">afɔ wɔ nintĩi ni disi nii di kakpɛ dii suoto-<verse eid="PSA 140:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 140:8" />O Saate, tanta bakpiletɛ abiɛsaa lɛma lawa kaanya</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:8">tanta asibu lɛma labla ɔkpɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:8">se diele nkpo babakanta. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ</char><verse eid="PSA 140:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 140:9" />Ta mba niɛmana mi beekyi ni asi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:9">atuka dibuo le di anyasibi lɛma lɛta ɛɛwa ni.<verse eid="PSA 140:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 140:10" />Ta atɔkɔnii akpa atika ma di suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:10">ta bafuki ma bakpee di ɔtɔ kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:10">di apatapata dibiɔ kamɛ manamasintaka ni diidii.<verse eid="PSA 140:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 140:11" />Tanta asaa balalaasatɛ lasiɛ di kasɔ nwu suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:11">ta ɔlaa kutũ batii ba nimbla ni amumu.<verse eid="PSA 140:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 140:12" />N-ye nlɛ Saate nwu nta bapiitɛ lɛbɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:12">ammufũ mba diefĩ ni kafɔɔ anklee.<verse eid="PSA 140:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 140:13" />Nwaako batininitɛ kamatansa leyooto lɛfɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 140:13">mba situ niɛkpa ni kafɔɔ kamasiɛ nkpa di anu lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 140:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 140" />
  <chapter number="141" style="c" sid="PSA 141" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 141</para>
  <para style="s1">Kɔtɔɔfɔ Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 141:1" />O Saate, kɔlɛɛ fɔ; pɛsɛwa fawa ɔkyɛ nii.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:1">Nu mi sɛlɔ nse lɛlɛɛ fɔ.<verse eid="PSA 141:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 141:2" />Ta ɔlaa ɔpɛ nii kute di anu lɛfɔ fɛle olufui;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:2">ta nnɛɛ nii katoo ɔtakatɛsa dite fɛle kɔtɔɔfɔ oleɔta.<verse eid="PSA 141:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 141:3" />O Saate, sè nyuntɛ fata kanya nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:3">toonyu anyasibi nii kayoko.<verse eid="PSA 141:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 141:4" />Tanta otu nii labuo di nle ninle ni okpile kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:4">alɛ kasiɛ di sikpile sɛsaabla kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 141:4">ku batii ba ninle ni sikpilebablatɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:4">tantɛɛ lale alesaa mɛnɛmɛnɛ lɛma.<verse eid="PSA 141:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 141:5" />Ta tininitɛ apɛ mi- sifutulɛ sile;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:5">tɔɔ asĩ ɔlaa atɛɛ- nnɔnyi dile di disi nii.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:5">Disi nii dilɔbasĩ mi.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 141:5" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 141:5">Kafɔɔ obe lele mpɛ ɔlaa nyila di sikpile bablatɛ sɛsaabla suoto;<verse eid="PSA 141:5" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 141:6" />babakpakatɛ batunletɛ lɛma di nkyokyookɔ nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:6">ni di bakpiletɛ kafɔɔ kamatofo alɛ baaloolaa Saate nwu sɛlaa baabuɛ nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 141:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 141:7" />Bababuɛ alɛ, "Fɛ mmle di otii nsasafɔ kasɔ ampukupukusa ni yi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:7">nkpo batɔɔsamiisa akufi loo di ɔkya kotoko nɛ.”<verse eid="PSA 141:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 141:8" />O Saate Kplɛ, kafɔɔ anu nii ntika di suoto lɛfɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:8">afɔ lɛtaniko-tan-yɔ mi faata kukpi.<verse eid="PSA 141:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 141:9" />Blasa mi di akyĩ ya bɛɛkyɔɔ mi ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:9">di sikũ se di sikpilebablatɛ lɛtɛ ni.<verse eid="PSA 141:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 141:10" />Ta bakpiletɛ babuo di asawu lɛma amu kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 141:10">alɛ ami kafe ninfa di ole kuonwii nnaa nii.<verse eid="PSA 141:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 141" />
  <chapter number="142" style="c" sid="PSA 142" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 142</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Diɛta Ni Lɛkyakaako</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu <char style="tl">maskil.</char><note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:0 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Dite fɛle onu lɛsambi lewo dile</char></note> Di obe wɔ aasiɛ ni di ofuɔntuu kamɛ.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 142:1" />Lawi osie kanya lalɛɛ Saate nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:1">latakatɛ sɛlɔ nii katoo lalɛɛ Saate nwu diɛta ni nyaami ɔnya.<verse eid="PSA 142:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 142:2" />Lediki sɛlaa nii lɛtɛ nwɔ di anu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:2">anu nɔɔ lɛtɔkɔ nwɔ dibuo nii.<verse eid="PSA 142:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 142:3" />Nse ɔnyɛɛ koloo mi kaamɛ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:3">afɔ ninle nnwɔ nin-ye ni osuku nii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 142:3">Di nkpaa osuku wɔ ninfe ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:3">batii lɛkyɔɔ mi dikyĩ di lewofa kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 142:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 142:4" />Nyu oletanɛɛkyɛ nii faanya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:4">otii kuonwii diɛyɔ nwu ole di suoto nii.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 142:4">Nnaa katanikokɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:4">kuonwii dieklesĩ di nkpa nii suoto.<verse eid="PSA 142:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 142:5" />O Saate, kowi nlɛɛ fɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:5">kobuɛ nlɛ, "Afɔ ninle katanikokɔ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:5">kalekɔ nii di nkpa batii kasɔ suoto.”<verse eid="PSA 142:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 142:6" />Kyɔɔ kaku nii atoko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:6">diekye diefĩ mi osie kanya;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 142:6">diki mi di mba nintikanko mi ni nnɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:6">diekye beesii mi osie.<verse eid="PSA 142:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 142:7" />Diki mi di leyo katenkɔ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:7">alɛ katansa leyooto lɛfɔ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 142:7" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 142:7">Ni batininitɛ mamana mi mankyi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 142:7">ta sifutulɛ lɛfɔ se feele mi ni oso.<verse eid="PSA 142:7" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 142" />
  <chapter number="143" style="c" sid="PSA 143" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 143</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔlaa Ɔpɛ Diɛta Ni Lɛkyakaako</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 143:1" />O Saate, nu ɔlaa ɔpɛ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:1">kyɔɔ atoko di kaku nii owi diɛta ni lɛkyakaako;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 143:1">di onukwale ku ɔsaabla tinini lɛfɔ kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:1">wa faabadiki mi.<verse eid="PSA 143:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 143:2" />Tankpaa kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ kakankɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:2">diekye kuonwii nnaa asi ni nkpa ate ni tinini di anu lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 143:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 143:3" />Lo nwu ntikanko mi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:3">ambibiɛ mi antɛ kaasɔ;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 143:3">antɛɛ nsiɛ di ditunu kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:3">fɛle mba nintookpi ni kofokofoko.<verse eid="PSA 143:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 143:4" />Nioso ɔnyɛɛ nloo mi kaamɛ nii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:4">otu nii kaamɛ nii kɔyɛkɛ.<verse eid="PSA 143:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 143:5" />Ntoonyuma saa ayi nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:5">mbu disi di sɛkpɛ lɛfɔ simuu suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:5">nnyu kafɔɔ nle di nnɛɛ lɛfɔ lɛbla nii.<verse eid="PSA 143:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 143:6" />Nfukuti nnɛɛ nii nkyɔɔ fɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:6">otukɔnsɔ nkle ɔkla nii fɛle kasɔ kosole. <char style="qs">Yila kɛɛkɛ </char><verse eid="PSA 143:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 143:7" />O Saate, tuna fatɛɛ wla;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:7">ɔnyɛɛ koloo mi.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 143:7">Tanwofasa anu lɛfɔ di suoto nii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:7">se diele nkpo kamate fɛle mba ninsifi ni dibiɔ kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 143:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 143:8" />Tɛɛ nnu lɛbɔmbɔ lɛfɔ le ninaa ni kaloo ɔlaa ku olesɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:8">diekye afɔ letika disi nii.<verse eid="PSA 143:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 143:9" />O Saate, diki mi fakyeko balo nii nnɛɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:9">diekye lewofasa suoto nii di kamɛ lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 143:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 143:10" />Tuo mi nimbla dibiesaa lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:10">diekye afɔ ninle Yaa nii;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 143:10">ta Ninwuna biene lɛfɔ nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:10">akpaa mi di ɔtaata kasɔ suoto.<verse eid="PSA 143:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 143:11" />O Saate, ta leyooto lɛfɔ oso, lolaa nkpa nii disi fanyu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:11">di ɔsaabla tinini lɛfɔ kanya, diki mi di dibuo kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 143:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 143:12" />Di lɛbɔmbɔ lɛfɔ le ninaa ni kaloo kamɛ, maasa balo nii kanya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:12">wɔɔsa bakyiditɛ nii bamuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 143:12">diekye kpɛmblatɛ lɛfɔ nle.<verse eid="PSA 143:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 143" />
  <chapter number="144" style="c" sid="PSA 144" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 144</para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔka Onwii Lapɛ Yaa Sɛfa Di Lelenkee Suoto</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 144:1" />Baatansa Saate nwu, Difuɔnkpaa nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:1">nnwɔ nintuo ni nnɛɛ nii kakpɛ ɔkpɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:1">annɛɛbi nii diɛta ni kakpɛ.<verse eid="PSA 144:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 144:2" />Ale Yaa nii bɔmbɔtɛ ku kɔba nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:2">kamaa kakpɛkɔ nii ku dikitɛ nii,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 144:2">kubidifunsaa nii, nnwɔ nintaniko ni,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:2">nnwɔ ninwakosa ni batii kasɔ ankpee ni kaalɔ nii.<verse eid="PSA 144:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 144:3" />O Saate, be di otii nle fiɛ fɛɛyɔ nwu ole di suoto nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:3">otii obi nwu alɛ foobu nwɔ disi nkpo?<verse eid="PSA 144:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 144:4" />Otii nte fɛle owiidi;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:4">ayi nɔɔ nte fɛle kunyii nimbudi kunfe ni.<verse eid="PSA 144:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 144:5" />O Saate, sɛkɛtɛ osi lɛfɔ nwu, faawa kasɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:5">kpanko abokote nwu alɛ kɔyɔ kadie.<verse eid="PSA 144:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 144:6" />Kyesee ɔplalaa amunaa aabasamiisa balo nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:6">taa ataa lɛfɔ faakpɔkpɔtɔsa ma.<verse eid="PSA 144:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 144:7" />Kyɔɔ kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ kuokye osi kuwa kasɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:7">diki mi faafũ mi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 144:7">fakyeko ntu kplɛ nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:7">fakyeko bafɔɔ nnɛɛ<verse eid="PSA 144:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 144:8" />mba nnya nieyii ni pɔ ku sɛlaa ku afunu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:8">mba nletanɛɛ ninle ni kakyɔnkyɔ.<verse eid="PSA 144:8" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 144:9" />O Yaa, kamasa onu fɔle nta fɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:9">kamapɛ sinu ku ekũ lefosi kyitaa nta fɔ,<verse eid="PSA 144:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 144:10" />nta Nnwɔ ninta ni baka lelenkee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:10">nnwɔ nindiki ni kpɛmblatɛ nɔɔ Dawid ankyeko ni kapamii blɛblɛ kanya.<verse eid="PSA 144:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 144:11" />Diki mi faafũ mi</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:11">fakyeko bafɔɔ nnɛɛ</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 144:11">mba nnya nieyii ni pɔ ku sɛlaa ku afunu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:11">mba nletanɛɛ ninle ni kakyɔnkyɔ.<verse eid="PSA 144:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 144:12" />Ni babisuɔtɔbi loo di sekosopo lɛma kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:12">kamate fɛle awoso ya niebe ni nwaa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 144:12">babisankobi loo kafɔɔ kamate fɛle akpaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:12">ya beewola bɛɛta ni ɔka ayo otofo.<verse eid="PSA 144:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 144:13" />Siwu loo kamayii</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:13">ku alesaa biala ateate.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 144:13">Bafoso loo kamakpɛ di nkpe, nkpe kanya,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:13">di nkpe afosi, afosi kanya di afe loo;<verse eid="PSA 144:13" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 144:14" />banankyue loo malofo kpinwu.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 144:14">Difutudie dilɔbawɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:14">blɔbasifi sɛlanle kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:14">nimiina kaku dilɔbawɛ di akpaka loo.<verse eid="PSA 144:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 144:15" />Suoto siyɔɔ batii ba suoto di nle mmle kamawa ni;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 144:15">suoto siyɔɔ batii ba Yaa ninle ni Saate nwu.<verse eid="PSA 144:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 144" />
  <chapter number="145" style="c" sid="PSA 145" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 145</para>
  <para style="s1">Katansa Onu</para>
  <para style="d">Dawid onu.</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 145:1" />Yaa, Ɔka nii nwu, kamatakatɛsa fɔ katoo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:1">kamatansa leyooto lɛfɔ dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="PSA 145:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 145:2" />Dii biala mapɛ fɔ sɛfa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:2">ntansa kafɔɔ leyooto lɛfɔ dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="PSA 145:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 145:3" />Saate nwu lemuɔ, ɛɛtɛ eesiɛko katansa kafɔɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:3">kuonwii dilaafuo nimuɔ nɔɔ kasɔ onu.<verse eid="PSA 145:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 145:4" />Kɔna kunwii mabuɛ sɛkpɛ lɛfɔ nwu antɔkɔ kɔna bamba;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:4">babadiki sɛsaabla kplɛ lɛfɔ nwu mambuɛ.<verse eid="PSA 145:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 145:5" />Babakakatɛ di dibu ku sɛka lɛfɔ sɛlɛ suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:5">mabu disi kafɔɔ di sɛkpɛ lɛfɔ se niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ suoto.<verse eid="PSA 145:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 145:6" />Bababuɛ kafɔɔ osie lɛfɔ sɛkpɛ yɛkɛle nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:6">kamayie lɛkya kafɔɔ di sɛsaabla kplɛ lɛfɔ suoto.<verse eid="PSA 145:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 145:7" />Babapɔ̀ di dibiene kpinwu lɛfɔ nwu suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:7">man-yɔ suoto lɛyɔɔ kafɔɔ mansa sinu di ɔsaabla tinini lɛfɔ nwu suoto.<verse eid="PSA 145:7" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 145:8" />Saate nwu nle sibualɛ, anya nyaami kafɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:8">ɔblɔ nɔɔ nte buɛɛ, lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ kafɔɔ mpɔ.<verse eid="PSA 145:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 145:9" />Saate nwu nlɛ ata bamuu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:9">annya asaa ya amuu ɛɛbla ni nyaami.<verse eid="PSA 145:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 145:10" />O Saate, asaa ya amuu fɛɛbla ni kamatansa fɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:10">baklekletɛ lɛfɔ bamuu matansa fɔ.<verse eid="PSA 145:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 145:11" />Bababuɛ sɛka kalekɔ lɛfɔ nwu dibu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:11">mankakatɛ kafɔɔ di osie lɛfɔ suoto,<verse eid="PSA 145:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 145:12" />alɛ batii bamuu katofo sɛsaabla kplɛ lɛfɔ nwu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:12">ku dibu akasaa di sɛka kalekɔ lɛfɔ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 145:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 145:13" />Sɛka kalekɔ lɛfɔ nle sɛka kalekɔ ka ninaa ni kaloo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:13">sɛka ole lɛfɔ kafɔɔ nte diefe ni di ana amuu suoto.<verse eid="PSA 145:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 145:14" />Saate nwu mmufũ mba bamuu ninnɔɔ ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:14">antakatɛsa mba bamuu bɛɛwakosa ni kasɔ.<verse eid="PSA 145:14" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 145:15" />Bamuu anu ntika di suoto lɛfɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:15">fanta ma alesaa lɛma kafɔɔ di obe nwaa kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 145:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 145:16" />Fanfukuti kɔnɛɛ lɛfɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:16">fanta asaa ya ninkpe ni nkpa biala mmiɛ di abiesaa lɛma kanya.<verse eid="PSA 145:16" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 145:17" />Saate nwu nte tinini di sisuku nɔɔ simuu suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:17">akpe lɛbɔmbɔ kafɔɔ ɛɛta asaa ya amuu ɛɛbla ni.<verse eid="PSA 145:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 145:18" />Saate nwu lɛtɛɛtɛɛ mba bamuu ninlɛɛ nwɔ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:18">ku mba bamuu ninlɛɛ nwɔ ni di onukwale kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 145:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 145:19" />Ambla mba nin-yɛkɛ nwɔ ni abiesaa anta ma di ntam nɔɔ kanya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:19">annu kaku lɛma andiki ma.<verse eid="PSA 145:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 145:20" />Saate nwu nnyu mba bamuu nimbɔmbɔ nwɔ nii,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:20">kafɔɔ abawɔɔsa bakpiletɛ bamuu.<verse eid="PSA 145:20" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="PSA 145:21" />Kanya nii makakatɛ di Saate nwu katansa suoto.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:21">Ta lɛsaa biala ɛɛbla ni atansa leyooto klekle nɔɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 145:21">dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="PSA 145:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 145" />
  <chapter number="146" style="c" sid="PSA 146" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 146</para>
  <para style="s1">Dikitɛ Yaa Nwu Katansa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 146:1" />Bitansa Saate nwu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 146:1" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 146:1">O ɔkla nii, tansa Saate nwu.<verse eid="PSA 146:1" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 146:2" />Kamatansa Saate nwu di nkpa nii mmuu kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:2">kamasa katansa sinu nta Yaa di obe wɔ lɛnya nsi ni nkpa.<verse eid="PSA 146:2" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 146:3" />Tan-yɔ disi lɛfɔ faatika di banɔɔfo suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:3">di batii-nyu ba ninamafuo ni batii odiki.<verse eid="PSA 146:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 146:4" />Nse anwuna lɛma ledie, mankple mansifi kasɔ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:4">di dii nwu nkpo suoto, asibu lɛma ninsindie lɛsalɛsaa.<verse eid="PSA 146:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 146:5" />Suoto siyɔɔ nnwɔ di lɛkyakaako nɔɔ ninle ni Yakob Yaa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:5">nnwɔ di osuku onyu nɔɔ nsi ni di Saate Yaa nɔɔ kamɛ,<verse eid="PSA 146:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 146:6" />osi ku kasɔ Blatɛ nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:6">lekpo ku lɛsaa biala ninsi ni niini kamɛ-</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:6">Saate nwu, nnwɔ ninkpe ni onukwale dinaa ni kaloo.<verse eid="PSA 146:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 146:7" />Anka anta mba boonyinka ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:7">anta kafɔɔ akabakleetɛ alesaa.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 146:7">Saate nwu kafɔɔ ndiki leyo batentɛ di ayo ntenkɔ,<verse eid="PSA 146:7" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 146:8" />Saate nta banumbiɛtɛ nnya,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 146:8">Saate nwu kafɔɔ ntakatɛsa mba bɛɛwakosa ni kasɔ katoo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:8">Saate nwu mbɔmbɔ batininitɛ.<verse eid="PSA 146:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 146:9" />Saate nwu nnyu bafɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:9">anklee kafɔɔ bakuɛbi ku bakpisɔfɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:9">kafɔɔ ankpɔkpɔtɔsa bakpiletɛ sisuku.<verse eid="PSA 146:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 146:10" />Saate nwu kole sɛka dinaa ni kaloo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 146:10">O Sion, Yaa lɛfɔ ale ata ana amuu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 146:10" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 146:10">Bitansa Saate nwu.<verse eid="PSA 146:10" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 146" />
  <chapter number="147" style="c" sid="PSA 147" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 147</para>
  <para style="s1">Yaa Wɔ Ninlenke Ni Katansa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 147:1" />Bitansa Saate nwu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 147:1" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 147:1">Nyu mmle dilɛ ni alɛ baasa ni katansa sinu manta ni Yaa loo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:1">mmle dikpeni ɔmɛnɛfɛ, diesiɛko ni kafɔɔ alɛ baatansa nwɔ ni!<verse eid="PSA 147:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 147:2" />Saate nwu kose Yerusalem letofo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:2">ansiisa Israel batii ba ninsi ni di sɛlanle kamɛ.<verse eid="PSA 147:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 147:3" />Anyɔɔsa mba situ niɛkpá ni</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:3">annii kafɔɔ nkɔ lɛma.<verse eid="PSA 147:3" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 147:4" />Nnwɔɔ nin-ye awɛntrɛbi nwu lɛpɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:4">anlɛɛ kafɔɔ dibiala ku leyooto nini.<verse eid="PSA 147:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 147:5" />Saate loo nwu lɛmuɔ, osie nɔɔ kafɔɔ nkpe onutũ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:5">lɛsɔnu nɔɔ nnaa kase.<verse eid="PSA 147:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 147:6" />Saate nwu mmufũ suoto kasɔ bawakosatɛ anklee,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:6">kafɔɔ anfuki bakpiletɛ antɛ kaasɔ.<verse eid="PSA 147:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 147:7" />Bisa sɛfa ɔpɛ sinu bita Saate nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:7">bifɛ sanku bita Yaa loo.<verse eid="PSA 147:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 147:8" />Antĩi kolo ku alokonkyɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:8">anta kanto nnɔɔ kaasɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:8">anta kafɔɔ sɛfa n-yie di akpenkpe suoto.<verse eid="PSA 147:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 147:9" />Anta banankyue</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:9">ku bakwakwalobi abi alesaa nse bɛɛlɛɛ nwɔ.<verse eid="PSA 147:9" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 147:10" />Suoto lɛyɔɔ nɔɔ diesi di bapɔnkɔ osie kamɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:10">ee atika otii nkpaa osie disi;<verse eid="PSA 147:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 147:11" />Saate nwu nnya suoto lɛyɔɔ di mba nin-yɛkɛ nwu ni suoto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:11">man-yɔ osuku onyu lɛma mantika ni di lɛbɔmbɔ nɔɔ le ninaa ni kaloo suoto.<verse eid="PSA 147:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 147:12" />O Yerusalem tansa Saate nwu;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:12">O Sion, tansa Yaa lɛfɔ,<verse eid="PSA 147:12" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 147:13" />diekye ansiensa n-yoko lɛfɔ abɔsaa sewoso</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:13">anwii kafɔɔ batii lɛfɔ lɛyɔɔ kaamɛ lɛfɔ.<verse eid="PSA 147:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 147:14" />Anta atoko ɔkyɛ ole di amɛ lɛfɔ suoto</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:14">anta fɔ fammiɛ ku alesaa biene biene.<verse eid="PSA 147:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="PSA 147:15" />Eekyesee kufiofa nɔɔ kaasɔ suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:15">ɔlaa nɔɔ kafɔɔ kotoso ku nkye.<verse eid="PSA 147:15" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="PSA 147:16" />Amblɛfɛsa atubakani fɛle foso sinwini</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:16">anwiwii kafɔɔ oblokyi fɛle ntɔ̀.<verse eid="PSA 147:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="PSA 147:17" />Anta atubakani nkpakpaa kaasɔ fɛle ofuɔwɛkyɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:17">Owe nikafuo oyila di lɛnyɛnɛnɛ nɔɔ nwu kanya?<verse eid="PSA 147:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="PSA 147:18" />Ankyesee ɔlaa nɔɔ kumanyinakĩisa nya;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:18">anta afɛɛfɔ nɔɔ nfɛ, ni di ntu mbiɛ ninfe nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 147:18" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="PSA 147:19" />Atoodiki sɛlaa nɔɔ kamɛ ɛɛta Yakob,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:19">afiofa nɔɔ ku ablasaa nɔɔ kafɔɔ ɛɛta Israel.<verse eid="PSA 147:19" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="PSA 147:20" />Atabla nle mmle aata kale bamba kukanwii;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 147:20">baaye afiofa nɔɔ nwu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 147:20" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 147:20">Bitansa Saate nwu.<verse eid="PSA 147:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 147" />
  <chapter number="148" style="c" sid="PSA 148" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 148</para>
  <para style="s1">Kayi Kamuu Lɛlɛɛ Diɛta Ni Yaa Katansa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 148:1" />Bitansa Saate nwu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 148:1" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 148:1">Bitansa Saate nwu di osi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:1">bitansa nwɔ di osi fanfa.<verse eid="PSA 148:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 148:2" />Batɔkyɛntɛ nɔɔ bamuu, bitansa nwɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:2">osi bakpɛtɛ nɔɔ bamuu, bitansa nwɔ.<verse eid="PSA 148:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 148:3" />Kufĩ ku kɔwɛntɛ, bitansa nwɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:3">awɛntrɛbi ya nikɔkpa ni amuu, bitansa nwɔ.<verse eid="PSA 148:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 148:4" />Aye osi katakalekɔ, bitansa nwɔ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:4">ku aye ntu be ninkpe ni di alokonkyɛ osi.<verse eid="PSA 148:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 148:5" />Bita ma batansa Saate nwu leyooto,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:5">diekye aadiki kanya ni baabla nya nɛ.<verse eid="PSA 148:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 148:6" />Ɛɛtɛ nya di aba nwu dinaa ni kaloo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:6">aata kufiofa ko ninɔmafe ni diidii.<verse eid="PSA 148:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 148:7" />Bitansa Saate nwu bikyeko kasɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:7">aye lekpo kplɛ bakɔkɛɛ ku sekle nkyofokɔ mmuu,<verse eid="PSA 148:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 148:8" />ɔplalaa amunaa ku atubakani ku alokonkyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:8">afɛɛfɔ siene ya ninnu nwɔ ni ɔlaa,<verse eid="PSA 148:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 148:9" />aye abokote ku akpenkpe amuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:9">awosobi awoso ku basida bamuu,<verse eid="PSA 148:9" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="PSA 148:10" />lepoo kamɛ babɔkɛɛ ku banankyue bamuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:10">bakɔkɛɛ biibii ku bakansiɛ ba ninflɛlɛtɛ ni<verse eid="PSA 148:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="PSA 148:11" />baka di kasɔ suoto ku nnle mmuu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:11">aye banɔɔfotii ku batunletɛ bamuu kaasɔ suoto,<verse eid="PSA 148:11" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="PSA 148:12" />bakosopo ku bakpeele,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:12">banɔɔfo ku babisɔ.<verse eid="PSA 148:12" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="PSA 148:13" />Bita ma batansa Saate nwu leyooto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:13">diekye leyooto nɔɔ lete niɛtaka katoo;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:13">sɛka nɔɔ ole lɛtaka katoo silenke osi ku kasɔ.<verse eid="PSA 148:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="PSA 148:14" />Ɛɛtakatɛsa lɛkya katoo ɛɛta batii nɔɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:14">baklekletɛ nɔɔ bamuu katansa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 148:14">Israel, batii ba ninsi nwɔ ni di otu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 148:14" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 148:14">Bitansa Saate nwu.<verse eid="PSA 148:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 148" />
  <chapter number="149" style="c" sid="PSA 149" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 149</para>
  <para style="s1">Katansa Onu</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 149:1" />Bitansa Saate nwu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 149:1" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 149:1">Bisa onu fɔle bita Saate nwu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:1">katansa nɔɔ onu di baklekletɛ kasiisakɔ.<verse eid="PSA 149:1" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 149:2" />Bita Israel anya suoto lɛyɔɔ di Blatɛ lɛma suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:2">bita Sion batii bapɔ di Ɔka lɛma suoto.<verse eid="PSA 149:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 149:3" />Bita ma batansa nwɔ leyooto ku katũ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:3">baasa sinu batɔɔ ku lɛkasa ku kyitaa.<verse eid="PSA 149:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 149:4" />Diekye Saate nwu nnya suoto lɛyɔɔ di batii nɔɔ suoto;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:4">antũkunsa suoto kasɔ bawakosatɛ ku didiki lɛkakoto.<verse eid="PSA 149:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 149:5" />Bita baklekletɛ banya suoto lɛyɔɔ di dibu le mmle kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:5">baasa suoto lɛyɔɔ sinu di atensaa lɛma suoto.<verse eid="PSA 149:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 149:6" />Bita Yaa katansa kasiɛ di nnya lɛma kamɛ</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:6">ku kapamii nfũ abe nfũ abe ninnɛɛ lɛma kamɛ,<verse eid="PSA 149:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="PSA 149:7" />alɛ ɔɔta nnle nwu letota ankyisa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:7">ku letoko nanfi di batii suoto,<verse eid="PSA 149:7" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="PSA 149:8" />ankpee baka lɛma ku sɛkpɛnkyɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:8">batii finle lɛma kafɔɔ ku abɔɔsaa sɛkpɛnkyɛ,<verse eid="PSA 149:8" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="PSA 149:9" />alɛ baananfi ma kootoko fɛ mmle bɛɛkpana ni di suoto lɛma bɛɛtɛ ni.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 149:9">Nle mmle ninle baklekletɛ bamuu dibu nɛ.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 149:9" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 149:9">Bitansa Saate nwu.<verse eid="PSA 149:9" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 149" />
  <chapter number="150" style="c" sid="PSA 150" />
  <para style="cl">Onu 150</para>
  <para style="s1">Bitansa Saate Nwu!</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="PSA 150:1" />Bitansa Saate nwu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 150:1" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 150:1">Bitansa Yaa di lɛkpaayo klekle nɔɔ kamɛ;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:1">bitansa nwɔ di osi kplɛ nɔɔ nwu.<verse eid="PSA 150:1" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="PSA 150:2" />Bitansa nwɔ ta osie nɔɔ ablasaa oso;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:2">bitansa nwɔ ta sɛsaabla kplɛ nɔɔ se niɛbla ni ɔkpɛ oso.<verse eid="PSA 150:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="PSA 150:3" />Bitansa nwɔ ku akyukyoo ɔfɛ sɛlɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:3">bitansa nwɔ ku kyitaa ku sanku,<verse eid="PSA 150:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="PSA 150:4" />bitansa nwɔ ku akasa ku katũ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:4">bitansa nwɔ ku sikũ sanku ku kakyukyoe,<verse eid="PSA 150:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="PSA 150:5" />bitansa nwɔ ku abi ɔsa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="PSA 150:5">bitansa nwɔ ku abi ya sɛlɔ nikodie ni.<verse eid="PSA 150:5" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="PSA 150:6" />Bita lɛsaa biala di ninwuna nsi ni atansa Saate nwu.</para>
  <para style="b" vid="PSA 150:6" />
  <para style="q1" vid="PSA 150:6">Bitansa Saate nwu.<verse eid="PSA 150:6" /></para>
  <chapter eid="PSA 150" />
</usx>